window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2101,"title":"Chapter 2101: Date Plan Execution 37","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I got home very late, so today's chapter is short.","When Eris heard from the staff that Kaito and his companions had arrived, she immediately put down her paperwork and left the room. She had no intention of keeping Kaito waiting, and in the first place, she only ever handled documents she could interrupt at any time, knowing she'd respond instantly if he visited. Therefore, there was no issue.","(......It’s fine. I’ve carefully considered various scenarios, and this time, I shouldn’t end up flustered or panicked.)","While she had managed to handle things well so far, responding on the fly wasn’t to her liking. This time, she had thoroughly gathered information and prepared herself mentally, which seemed to imbue her with confidence.","If, hypothetically, Lilia were to witness the current Eris...... she might have commented “No, Kaito-san always manages to go beyond any measures you prepare for, so it’s pointless to overthink it......”———— a precise piece of advice born from experience. However, such an exchange wasn’t going to happen today.","[Ah, Eris-san! Hello...... You’re here, I see.]","[Hello, Kaito-sama. Thank you for visiting. Yes, I had some work to process here at the store, but as soon as I heard you’d arrived......]","Exchanging greetings with Kaito, Eris discreetly moved her gaze toward his companions, starting with Kaori.","(......Someone I don't recognize...... Judging by her unique magic power though, she's definitely the otherworlder. From her demeanor and expression, she doesn’t strike me as someone leading a major company. Rather, she seemed a bit nervous, as though overwhelmed by the upscale nature of the store. If that’s the case...... it’s safe to assume she’s Mizuhara Kaori-sama.)","Eris, while conversing with Kaito, analyzed at high speed. Without a doubt, she was a brilliant young lady of noble birth, possessing knowledge and insight that would never embarrass her in any setting.","She swiftly deduced that the otherworlder with Kaito was indeed Kaori and noticed her tension in the high-class environment. Considering this, Eris concluded that it might be necessary to offer subtle support if needed. With that thought in mind, she turned her gaze to Kaito’s other companion.","(Now, for the other person...... The other...... per...","And the moment she laid eyes on Olivia, Eris’ mind went completely blank for a second.","(......Eh? Founder-sama? N- No, no way, that can’t possibly be...... S- Surely she just coincidentally resembles her...... N- No, but even though her attire is different from usual, this aura of sanctity is unmistakable...... W- W- W- Wait a moment!? This is far beyond unexpected! The very fact that the Founder is in a place outside Friendship City is an extraordinary event in itself!! I- I mean, yes, I did hear about her officiating at Viscount Neverlight’s wedding, but that was a once-in-a-lifetime exception because it was the wedding of an otherworlder deeply connected to Kaito-sama...... Eh? Ehhh? W- Wait a second!? Founder Olivia is someone with even less publicly available information than the Six Kings or the Supreme Gods...... H- How am I supposed to handle this......)","In the first place, Olivia, while fulfilling her duties as the representative of Friendship City Hikari and the Founder, rarely ever left the Cathedral. Her interactions with others were strictly minimal, limited to only what was necessary.","Faced with this utterly unexpected situation, Eris clung desperately to her waning consciousness, frantically trying to figure out how to proceed.","She could feel the ironclad smile of a noblewoman she had perfected begin to falter ever so slightly......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A sharp stomach blow immediately arrives.]"]},{"number":2102,"title":"Chapter 2102: Date Plan Execution 38","paragraphs":["In this world of Trinia, there exist beings of immense influence that the nobility regards as dangerous to engage with carelessly.","When are approachable ones among them, such as the mild-mannered ones like Kuromueina and Lillywood. On the other hand though, there are feared ones such as Isis and Megiddo, with whom contact itself is dreaded.","However, there are also beings of an entirely different nature———— beings who could lead to one’s ruin if approached recklessly...... Foremost among them is Shallow Vernal. Not only are nobles prohibited from speaking directly to Shallow Vernal, but even royalty is barred. A single misstep in engaging with this supreme existence could turn not just all Gods...... but quite literally, the entire world into enemies.","Next is the Phantasmal King, Alice, known to the public as No Face. As the one that's essentially the hidden ruler of the world, Alice controls all information and shows no mercy in eliminating anything that threatens the world's stability.","In noble society, Alice is far more feared than even Isis, to the point where her appearance before a noble is said to signify their imminent downfall.","A more recent addition to this list is the Otherworld God Eden...... This being has already issued warnings——— or threats———– to all the world’s nobles, with some trembling in fear at the mere mention of her name, as she is a dangerous God beyond reason.","And finally...... there’s Founder Olivia.","In this world, where Deities like Shallow Vernal and the Gods exist, faith is naturally strong, and Godism is the sole, absolute religion.","While there are several branches of the faith, the majority of the world belongs to it in some form. Olivia stands at the top of this religion, making her an exceedingly delicate presence to deal with.","Olivia rarely forms personal connections, avoids attending noble events entirely, and has no interactions with the nobility in general. However, her influence is immense, and even high-ranking nobles would face complete ruin if they incur her displeasure.","(The Founder almost never interacts with anyone outside the upper echelons of Friendship City's administration or the high-ranking priests of the Cathedral. At the very least, my father has likely never spoken with her even once. I should avoid addressing her recklessly and only do so if Kaito-sama introduces me directly......)","Concluding that it would be dangerous to approach Olivia carelessly, Eris decided to take no action herself, reasoning that Olivia likely had no interest in her anyway.","Of course, as if to sneer upon such calculations with his actions...... Kaito made his move.","[Ah, Eris-san, let me introduce you. This is Mizuhara Kaori, an Otherworlder like me. And this is Olivia-san.]","[Pleased to meet you. I am Eris Dia Hamilton.]","Introduced to Kaori and Olivia by Kaito, Eris gave a slight bow and returned the greeting. She deliberately avoided mentioning her title as the daughter of a marquis, conveying only her name to emphasize that her greeting was as an individual, not as a noble.","[Ah, h- hello, I’m Mizuhara Kaori.]","[......","Meanwhile, Olivia gazed at Eris with a calm, evaluative look.","(It’s a relief that Founder-sama has no interest in me or, by extension, the Hamilton Marquisdom. In this situation, it should appear that Kaito-sama is merely introducing me, without implying any connection between Founder-sama and our family...... She’s probably aware of this and is simply observing in silence.)","Feeling the encounter might end without incident, Eris secretly sighed in relief. But then, Olivia shifted her gaze to Kaito and spoke.","[Miyama Kaito-sama, may I confirm something? Is she an important person to you?]","[Important might not be the right word, but Eris-san is a dear friend of mine.]","As Olivia posed her question in a composed manner, Kaito replied with a wry smile, and in that instant, Eris felt an icy chill run down her spine.","(......Kaito-sama? Um, at this moment, that statement...... No, I mean, I’m honored! Truly honored, but......!? The fact that Founder-sama went out of her way to confirm this means...... A- Awawa......)","Sure enough, Eris’s ominous premonition came true. After hearing Kaito’s response, Olivia gave a small nod, then turned to face Eris again. This time, the cautious, appraising look in her eyes had vanished.","[If you are someone important to Miyama Kaito-sama, then you are equally significant to me......and, by extension, to Godism. Pleased to meet you, Eris Dia Hamilton. My name is Olivia. I pray that today’s encounter will lead to fruitful relations in the future.]","[......Ah...... Yes, it is the greatest of honors.]","She wanted nothing more than to look to the heavens and sigh, but knowing it would be inappropriate, she bowed deeply instead. That Olivia had introduced herself and mentioned future relations could only mean one thing...... at the very least, Olivia had judged Eris herself to be someone worthy of forming a connection with. Sensing that the other nobles in the shop would likely spread the news to the nobles throughout Archlesia Empire by the end of the day, Eris felt a pain that seemed to rip out her stomach, yet she desperately maintained an unshakable smile.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A blow that seemed to rip out her stomach...... That's quite the hard puncher.]"]},{"number":2103,"title":"Chapter 2103: Date Plan Execution 39","paragraphs":["One could undoubtedly say that Eris Dia Hamilton is a talented woman. From a young age, as the daughter of a marquis family, she studied a wide array of fields, including knowledge, manners, rhetoric, politics, and management, consistently meeting the high expectations placed upon her.","Her remarkable abilities were evident in the fact that she had firmly established herself as the next head of the Marquisdom at such a young age.","However, if talent and personal effort alone could resolve all matters, Lilia, the unparalleled genius in human history, would not be plagued by stomachaches. Indeed, when it came to Kaito, it was fair to say that the common sense and knowledge Eris had cultivated over the years were entirely ineffective.","(In terms of the situation, this is strictly personal...... an interaction with me as an individual, not with the Hamilton Marquisdom. However, from the public's perspective, it would undoubtedly be seen as the Hamilton Marquisdom having ties with Founder-sama. While our household hasn’t particularly focused on religious matters, as it falls under the domain of the other Four Great Noble Households...... given the current situation, we have no choice but to expand our involvement in religious affairs but...... N- No, my personal matters can come later! My stomach aches, but I cannot keep Kaito-sama and the others waiting.)","With a resilient spirit that could perhaps be described as unyielding, Eris managed to compose her chaotic thoughts. Or rather, it would be more accurate to say she decided to postpone dealing with the troublesome matters for now.","In any case, having forcibly regained her composure, Eris smiled and opened her mouth to speak.","[Kaito-sama, shall we prepare membership cards for the two ladies? If you give us about 5 minutes, we can have them ready.]","[Ah, that sounds great. Kaori-san, Olivia-san, what do you think? It’s not really needed for our shopping today, but if you plan to visit again, having a membership card might be helpful.]","As Kaito checked with his companions, Eris' mind continued to analyze the situation. While her information on both Olivia and Kaori was limited, she used the interactions so far and what she had heard about Olivia to predict the future developments.","(Founder-sama is unlikely to avail a membership card. At the very least, I can’t imagine her visiting a store like ours without Kaito-sama accompanying her, and in the first place, I also recall hearing that she doesn’t eat or drink. As for Mizuhara Kaori, she seems intimidated by the high-end nature of the shop, and based on her demeanor and behavior, I’d estimate her financial situation is at a standard citizen level...... However, she also appears to harbor a sense of longing for such luxurious establishments, so there’s a strong possibility she might create a membership card as a keepsake.)","Eris’ reasoning was spot on. Kaori was, indeed, an ordinary person and lacked the financial means to shop casually at Dia Royale Chocolates.","That said, she felt that since she's here, it might be nice to have a membership card for a high-end shop, having considered the possibility that she might visit again someday as a treat for herself.","[Ah, well then, since we're here, I’d like to have one made, if that’s okay? Though I’m not sure if I’ll be able to come buy anything in the future......]","[Yes, of course. There’s no annual fee or anything like that, so please feel free to have one.]","Kaori’s reaction was entirely as Eris had predicted, and preparing her membership card posed no issue. However, what deviated slightly from Eris’ expectations was Olivia, who had initially seemed likely to decline immediately, now wearing a contemplative expression.","[......Miyama Kaito-sama, may I ask a question before I respond? Do you enjoy eating chocolate?]","[Eh? Yes, I like chocolates.]","[I see. Then, would you say the chocolate from this store aligns with your tastes?]","[Yes, I really like the chocolate from Eris-san's shop. When I visited before, I bought several to take home.]","After asking a few questions, Olivia gave a slight nod and then turned toward Eris.","[In that case, I’ve decided that I will personally visit this store in the future as well. Please prepare a membership card for me.]","[......U- Understood.]","For a brief moment, Eris wondered if her hearing was failing her. From Olivia’s tone, it sounded as though she intended to visit the shop even without Kaito accompanying her, something she completely didn't expect.","It wasn’t unreasonable for Eris to be caught off guard. While Olivia wouldn’t have made such a choice in the past...... ever since meeting Kaito, she had been frequenting Kaori’s shop, deepening her knowledge of tea, and proactively learning about food in recent days.","As for Eris’ shop, Olivia had decided to take note of it as Kaito had mentioned its flavors suited his tastes. Olivia, especially after inviting Kaito to tea before, had been deeply impacted by his remark that the items she had prepared were “delicious”. Though she wasn’t fully conscious of it herself, hearing those words from Kaito brought her an immense sense of happiness.","With that in mind, she resolved to study sweets that paired well with tea for future occasions...... However, Eris was, of course, completely unaware of Olivia’s intentions. Left with a flurry of question marks in her mind, Eris’ stomach churned in discomfort. R","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Come to think of it, during that ship party, the rulers were competing over how close they were to Kaito. But putting Lilia aside, who among the nobles were actually the closest to him?]","? ? ? : [Other than Lilia-san, Eris-san is doing pretty well, but they haven’t known each other for very long...... Under those conditions, the clear winner would be Orchid-san.]","Serious-senpai : [That would be the prince who's Lilia's nephew, right?]","? ? ? : [Yes. Orchid-san is one of the few people Kaito-san speaks to casually, without formalities. Kaito-san even occasionally visits the royal castle to have tea with him or to share some of Nebula-san’s tea leaves...... They’re close enough that Orchid-san is also the first person Kaito-san contacts when he needs to consult someone among the royalty, like when his house was being built. Orchid-san has firmly secured the position of Kaito-san’s precious \"close friend of the same age and gender\".]"]},{"number":2104,"title":"Chapter 2104: Date Plan Execution 40","paragraphs":["Eris-san's chocolate shop certainly has a stylish vibe, and just looking around was enjoyable. Kaori-san also had a spark in her eyes and was happily looking at the products.","What was a bit unexpected was that Olivia-san seemed interested as well, examining the items quite seriously. Since becoming a regular at Kaori-san's shop, her taste buds seem to have become quite sharp, so her interest in food might have grown as well.","[Kaori-san, like I said earlier, don't hold back and buy whatever you like.]","[U- Unn, thank you. But, this place's amazing. For such a small assortment, this price...... it's overwhelming, like a high-end shop that exceeds my expectations. But at the same time, there are many things I wouldn’t usually see, so it's fun.]","[Fumu, Mizuhara Kaori, are the items here considered expensive?]","[Eh? Ah, I see, Olivia-sama might not be very familiar with chocolate. In terms of price, yes, it's geared toward nobles, so it's pricey. But I imagine the quality is really good too......]","For Olivia-san, chocolate itself was something fresh, and she nodded thoughtfully at Kaori-san's words. I had a feeling that since Olivia-san is very serious by nature, she might later buy regular chocolate and compare the tastes.","As I was thinking about that, Eris-san came over holding a beautiful silver tray. On the tray were bite-sized chocolates with skewers for easy eating.","[These are this month's new chocolates. Would you like to try them?]","[Thank you. Do you release new products every month?]","[Yes, our customers are mostly the wealthy, and they tend to prefer new things. While we do keep a regular menu, we also offer products that change each month. These chocolates are one of them. It has a citrus fruit essence added, giving it a refreshing taste.]","Eris-san feels very smart, so I imagined she must have a well-thought-out sales strategy. As I admired her explanation, I tasted the chocolate, and inside was a jelly with an orange-like flavor. The refreshing taste was wonderful.","[......I see, so it's set with a liquid that has a slight sourness from the fruit juice. This is my first time tasting chocolate like this, but given the sweetness of the contents, the chocolate itself has a more subdued sweetness...... is that correct?]","[Yes, that's right. As expected of Founder-sama, you have sharp taste buds. As you said, we used bitter chocolate for this.]","As Kaori-san mentioned, Olivia-san's sense of taste is quite sharp. She can easily detect the differences in miso soup's miso or guess secret ingredients.","It’s evident that her interest in food has deepened. Right now, she wasn’t just eating the chocolate but seemed to be studying and savoring it seriously. However, I couldn’t quite understand why she kept glancing over my way from time to time......","Kaito's guess was, in some ways, correct, and in some ways, wrong. Indeed, Olivia was seriously savoring the chocolate and considering the ingredients, making various reflections in her mind.","However, that wasn’t because she had a strong interest in food.","(Miyama Kaito-sama seemed to have a pleased expression when eating this chocolate. I can infer that the flavor was to his liking, but it’s still difficult to determine if he prefers chocolates with a more subdued sweetness or if he likes those with fruit juice. It would be ideal to prepare something that suits Miyama Kaito-sama's tastes and invite him to tea like I did before...... Uuu, w- what shameful thoughts, these are...... But, Miyama Kaito-sama did say he would love we have tea again if there was another opportunity, so I think I should prepare such a gathering once more. It would probably be good to pair the chocolate with the right drink as well...... When I return to the Cathedral, I should order some books to study. And then, I can receive Miyama Kaito-sama's prai——— W- What worldly thoughts are these!? Kuh, how shallow have I become, expecting something in return...... Uuu, these worldly thoughts just......) Ṟ","Yes, Olivia was completely absorbed in thinking about Kaito, and the reason she became interested in chocolate in the first place was because Kaito had mentioned he liked it.","Her small wish was simply to prepare chocolate and enjoy tea with Kaito again. Of course, Kaito would gladly accept an invitation to tea even without chocolate being involved, but perhaps due to her overly serious nature, Olivia found it difficult to take action without some pretext to justify it.","Thus, the current situation was, in a way, an opportunity for her, and she kept glancing at Kaito while thinking about how best to invite him.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Olivia is completely unaware because she believes it's all from her devotion, but the flags have already been set up perfectly, with her brimming with this \"I love Kaito\" aura.]"]},{"number":2105,"title":"Chapter 2105: Date Plan Execution 41","paragraphs":["The unexpected appearance of Founder Olivia had completely overturned her assumptions, but perhaps as to be expected from her, Eris had already regained her composure.","In the first place, Kaito and the others had only stopped by her store during their date and didn’t intend to stay long. Naturally, once their shopping was finished, they would leave.","Having already looked around the store to a certain extent and entered the purchasing phase, the likelihood of anything else happening was low.","(Thinking ahead, this situation has caused me a great deal of stress, but from the perspective of adding prestige to the store, it can be considered beneficial———— provided we disregard the effort required to handle it. That said, there are many points I should reflect on this time. The unique political structure of Friendship City Hikari makes gathering information from over there difficult...... but even so, if we had connections in that direction, we might have been able to obtain useful intelligence. This will have to be a future task.)","Despite this unusual situation, Eris resolved to strengthen her information network in the direction of the Friendship City, as similar incidents could not be ruled out in future interactions with Kaito.","Though this would have to wait until tomorrow or later, Eris was certain that numerous letters from nobles who heard of the Founder’s visit would arrive, ensuring they would be busy for a while...... Nonetheless, for now, she felt relieved...... but it seems she let her guard down.","Unaware of how careless it was to do so in front of the World's Singularity, Kaito...... Indeed, Kaito was nearing the end of his shopping, and neither Kaori nor Olivia were likely to take further action. However, with anything involving Kaito, unforeseen developments could arise from unexpected angles.","[Welcome——– Hyiihh!?]","Hearing the reflexive shriek of one of the clerks, Eris turned her gaze to the store entrance...... There stood a figure draped in a jet-black robe, carrying a massive coffin taller than themselves. The sight made even Eris herself nearly shriek.","(M- M- M- Martyr of Death, Rasal Marfik-sama!? W- W- Why is she here......?)","The visitor who suddenly entered was none other than Rasal...... a renowned necromancer in the Demon Realm, known as Martyr of Death and comparable to the Dark Forest's Monster.","Though Rasal’s name was famous, few had seen her actual appearance. Eris identified her based on the rumored features and her overwhelmingly powerful magical energy. However, the clerk who had shrieked seemed simply shocked by the figure’s intimidating appearance, unaware she was facing the Martyr of Death.","[I apologize for startling you. I came to shop. While I do not possess a membership card, I have a referral letter from a member. Please use this to create a new membership card for me.]","[C- Certainly. May I see the referral letter?]","Rasal’s behavior was unexpectedly courteous, and although the clerk was somewhat intimidated by her appearance, she handled the situation without issue.","At that moment, Rasal glanced around the store and spotted Kaito, who had turned to look at the source of the clerk’s shriek.","[Oya? If it isn’t Miyama Kaito-sama...... What a coincidence.]","[Rasal-san? Hello, I’m surprised to see you here. Are you here to buy chocolates?]","[Yes. Isis-sama seemed to have taken a liking to the chocolates you kindly shared with us the other day. She mentioned wanting to serve them to the others during our tea parties. However, such trivial matters are not something a King should handle directly, so I came to purchase them in her stead.]","[I see......]","Last month, Kaito visited Eris’ store and bought some chocolates before leaving. Later, while having tea with Isis, they had eaten the chocolates together, and Isis had taken a liking to them.","However, due to the complications caused by her magic power of death, it was difficult for Isis to buy them directly, so in her place, Rasal had volunteered to handle the purchase.","Rasal, having done their research, knew a membership card was required and had arranged for a referral letter upon hearing that one of Sechs’ subordinates held a membership card...... This chain of events led to her visit today, coinciding perfectly, and quite by chance, with Kaito’s visit.","[Miyama Kaito-sama, are you also here to purchase chocolates?]","[Errr, I came here with Olivia-san and Kaori-san to explore this city, so we stopped by since we had the chance. This store is owned by a friend of mine......]","[My, a friend of Miyama Kaito-sama’s...... In that case, I’d like to extend my greetings as well.]","[Ah, she's right over here.]","Listening to the exchange between Kaito and Rasal, predicting how things would unfold next was all too easy. Eris, already overwhelmed to the point of deferring any thought about how to handle the fallout from today’s events, now found herself with an additional complication: dealings with the Martyr of Death...... and by extension, a subordinate of the Death King. As she stared into the distance, she couldn't help but wonder if the intense pain had whisked her stomach away.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [See that, because Serious-senpai said something about a three hit stomach blow earlier, Eris-san now had taken three hits......]","Serious-senpai : [N- No, I didn't mean that only she would take three hits to the stomach...... So this is the power of the New Gen Stomachache Warrior...... Her aside, Rasal sure is as competent as ever. She even researched the membership system in advance and prepared the referral letter. Her reason for going is also well-thought-out———— without mentioning anything about Isis being feared or her magic power of death, she had given a perfectly reasonable and considerate explanation for why she, as a subordinate, should go on the shopping trip, making sure not to hurt Isis' feelings.]"]},{"number":2106,"title":"Chapter 2106: Date Plan Execution 42","paragraphs":["Rasal Marfik...... Known as the Martyr of Death, she is feared even in the Demon Realm, standing alongside the Dark Forest's Monster, Tiamat.","However, unlike Tiamat, who possesses a peculiar fetish, Rasal is fundamentally an intellectual and composed individual....... Putting aside her frequent quarrels with Sirius, she interacts with others in a courteous manner.","So why is it that she's so feared...... Much of it stems from her appearance.","(......S-Scary...... W- What's with that giant coffin....... It's a coffin, right? Eh? What is she using it for? The only thing that comes to mind is putting corpses in it...... C- Could it be that she put the people she killed in there and took them back? Plus, her magic power is overwhelming. How is Kaito-kun able to talk to her so calmly......)","Watching Rasal converse with Kaito, Kaori couldn't help but think such things. Indeed, the first thing that draws attention to Rasal is the enormous coffin she carries on her back.","There is a reason she carries a coffin around though. As a necromancer, Rasal primarily uses the coffin as a medium to cast her magic. Items that evoke death make it easier to smoothly wield necromantic arts———- a practical justification.","Of course, given Rasal’s exceptional skill, she could easily perform magic without such a medium. However, as someone with a research-oriented mindset, she prioritizes efficiency.","Next comes the pitch-black robe she wears to conceal her face. This choice stems from personal taste and a desire to protect herself from contact with chemicals during her research...... Still, it just makes her look more dubious.","And above all, even though Kaito is unaffected and Rasal often forgets about it herself, her immense magical power, particularly her magic power of death, is enough to intimidate others.","The sheer pressure of magic power of a Peak Count-rank already overwhelms others...... but even among individuals, the pressure they exert differs. Many High-ranking Demons deliberately suppress their magic power to some degree.","For instance, beings like Lillywood and the Seven Princesses were subjects of worship in some regions, so they frequently interacted with weaker individuals and suppressed their magic power to avoid overwhelming them.","Similarly, the Ten Demons, who often engage in espionage or intelligence gathering, conceal their magic power to avoid detection.","On the other hand, most of the War King's Five Generals, except for Ozma, tend to exude significant magic power to assert their strength.","This line of thinking also goes with the Four Great Demon Dragons, as they often radiate tremendous magic power to establish authority among their subordinates.","As for Rasal, she does suppress her magic power to some extent but still maintain enough to ensure she is recognized as a powerful figure, so as not to undermine her King, Isis.","For ordinary people like Kaori or Eris, they could feel the overwhelming presence of her magic power...... but Kaori remained relatively composed.","(......Unn, but well...... It’s not as bad as War King-sama's...... No, maybe that’s a strange comparison but.........)","Yes, having encountered Megiddo several times, someone who emits her terrifying magic power energy without restraint, Kaori was somewhat accustomed to Rasal's presence. Though she still found her appearance unsettling, she didn’t cower in fear.","When it came to Megiddo though, the overwhelming pressure had left her on the verge of tears during their initial encounter......","As Kaori was thinking about such things, Kaito glanced in her direction. Realizing that his look conveyed a question, whether he should introduce her to Rasal, to which Kaori quickly shook her head.","There might be opportunities for that later, but for now, Rasal had specifically requested to greet Eris, and Kaori hoped the interaction would remain limited to that...","[Oya? And those ladies over there? One of them is the Founder, yes. As for the otherworlder, I believe I caught a glimpse of her at the ship party?]",".......Of course, her hope was in vain. Rasal, noticing Kaito’s gaze, spoke up, and the conversation naturally shifted towards introductions. Resigned, Kaori let out a wry smile.","[Ah, she was a Hero Actor in the past......]","[I- I'm Mizuhara Kaori.]","[I see...... Thank you for the introduction. I am Rasal Marfik...... one of Death King Isis-sama’s subordinates. If you are a friend of Miyama Kaito-sama, I imagine we will meet again. It's a pleasure to meet you.]","[Ah, yes. It’s a pleasure to meet you.]","Though Rasal’s appearance was somewhat intimidating, her mannerisms were polite, allowing Kaori to return the greeting without issue, despite her nervousness.","As she reflected on how her circle of extraordinary acquaintances had grown ever since meeting Kaito, she gently rubbed her slightly aching stomach.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [If, hypothetically, they were to spend up to around 50 at Eris' shop, then change the subtitle and they continue the date from there...... It feels like there's still room for Eris to have at least one more stomachache......]"]},{"number":2107,"title":"Chapter 2107: Date Plan Execution 43","paragraphs":["Since Eris happened to be a little away from Kaito and the others, Kaito introduced Kaori to Rasal first, giving Eris a brief respite.","Given the flow of events, Kaito would next introduce Eris——— or possibly Olivia, though since neither Olivia nor Rasal seemed particularly interested in each other, it was highly likely Eris would be introduced next.","(......This is troubling. There’s very little information about Rasal Marfik, so I have no idea what the correct approach is. I know she’s famous as the greatest necromancer in the Demon Realm, but I’m not well-versed in necromancy. Trying to expand the conversation in that direction would be a mistake. If an amateur like me tries to talk about it with my shallow knowledge, I’ll just end up being snickered at.)","As a noble, Eris understood the importance of connections and relationships with others. Even though the development was sudden, if it came to self-introductions, it would be best to leave a good impression on Rasal, who was a Peak Count-rank, one of the most powerful beings in the Demon Realm.","However, Rasal had only recently joined the Death King’s faction and had rarely appeared in formal settings. While it was somewhat known that she is the Death King's subordinate, almost no other information was available.","This was not surprising, Rasal had secluded herself deep in the Dark Forest for thousands of years, dedicating herself to research. While her name was known due to the notoriety of the Dark Forest as a dangerous area and Tiamat’s fame, Eris’ information network had failed to yield any further details.","(Earlier, I refrained from mentioning my status as a marquis’ daughter when dealing with Founder-sama, due to her position and the religious implications. But how should I approach Rasal Marfik-sama...... Generally, the Death King faction doesn’t interact with others except for some mining-related matters. However, I’ve heard their faction has grown significantly recently, so it might be better to establish some degree of rapport early on. That said, even if I were to establish a connection with them, I couldn’t handle the oppressive magic power of death, so direct interaction with Death King-sama is impossible...... Perhaps, like with Founder-sama, I should aim for a personal connection with Rasal rather than involving my family or the Death King’s faction.)","Eris quickly worked out her approach and decided on a general strategy. At that moment, Kaito finished his conversation with Kaori and turned to face Eris.","[Ah, so, once again...... This is the owner of the shop.]","[I am Eris Dia Hamilton. Thank you very much for visiting our establishment today.]","[I am Rasal Marfik, a subordinate of Death King Isis-sama. Pleased to meet you.]","[The pleasure is mine. Thank you.]","Though the progression was as Eris had anticipated, she remained vigilant. Unexpected developments had occurred several times already, so she was prepared for the possibility of unforeseen complications.","Though her limited information about Rasal made it difficult for Eris to initiate and sustain the conversation, she was confident she could respond adeptly to any topics Rasal raised.","(I must have confidence. I’ve undergone the ladies' rigorous education and should have the knowledge and conversational skills to leave a good impression. Rasal-sama seems like a highly intelligent person, so it’s likely she’ll bring up probing or evaluative topics. At the very least, she’s unlikely to let her guard down easily, so I should anticipate and navigate accordingly.)","Eris’s assumptions weren’t wrong. Rasal was highly intelligent and cautious, often probing to discern the nature of those he met for the first time.","After some probing exchanges, Rasal would likely gauge Eris’s character and end the conversation at an appropriate point...... Yes, that would be the case———- if only Kaito weren’t here......","[......Miyama Kaito-sama, may I ask you a question? You mentioned she is your friend, but in your view, is she someone worthy of trust?]","[Eh? Yes, I think Eris-san is a truly wonderful person, and I trust her wholeheartedly.]","[I see...... Thank you for your answer.]","Although Eris was unaware of it, much like Tre at the ship party, many people held great trust in Kaito's ability to judge others, and Rasal was one of them.","Having heard various stories from Isis and witnessed Kaito’s remarkable fortune, bolstered by numerous blessings...... and having evaluated Kaito’s character through their interactions, Rasal had come to highly value him. For Rasal, anyone Kaito trusted was, by extension, worthy of trust.","[Eris Dia Hamilton...... I believe you are affiliated with the Hamilton Marquidom of Archlesia Empire, am I correct?]","[Y- Yes. I am the heir to the Hamilton Marquisdom.]","[I see...... If possible, I would like to have some of your time later. Our Death King faction has been considering establishing more external connections in the future. As part of that effort, we’re exploring ways to expand the export destinations for the minerals mined in the Land of Death. If you are someone Miyama Kaito-sama trusts, then that’s more than satisfactory. It would be helpful if we could discuss this further.]","[......Y- Yes. I would be honored.]","Hearing Rasal's proposal, Eris felt her consciousness momentarily go blank. This was a monumental matter. Up until now, the minerals mined in the Land of Death had been exclusively handled by the Demon Realm's merchant associations.","While Rasal had only expressed preliminary thoughts about increasing trading partners and wasn’t suggesting an immediate deal with the Hamilton Marquisdom...... the implications of such a discussion were staggering.","(......W- Why? Kaito-sama is just too amazing, and nothing is going the way I expected......)","Even as her inner thoughts devolved into disarray, Eris maintained a strained smile.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Honestly, the fact that Kaito, the Singularity beloved by the world, trusts someone makes them pretty safe. As a result, the the information that Kaito trusts her dramatically raises her favorability from others, making the higher-ups more amicable toward Eris, and in turn...... Eris' stomach takes the brunt of the damage......]"]},{"number":2108,"title":"Chapter 2108: Extra - : God, Chicken, and Christmas","paragraphs":["By the time I realized it, I was standing in the middle of falling snow. That said, it was a strange kind of snow———– it felt like a hologram, passing right through my body without getting me wet.","Before me stood a giant Christmas tree glittering with lights. But...... what exactly is going on here?","[Merry Christmas! My beloved child, it’s Mother!]","[......A- Ahh, that explains it......]","Seeing Makina-san suddenly appear in high spirits, dressed in a Santa costume, I realized this was one of those dreams where I occasionally meet her.","No wonder I was in a completely unfamiliar place.","[Makina-san, I kind of already guessed this is one of those usual dreams, and judging by the situation and your outfit, I think I understand the purpose...... but can I confirm something?]","[Unn. This time, as a Christmas present for my beloved child who works so hard every day, I’m giving you a private Christmas party, just the two of us! Fufu, isn’t it wonderful? I can feel my beloved child's delight, and it makes me so happy too!]","Makina-san genuinely believed that celebrating Christmas alone with her would be the ultimate present...... Her overflowing confidence was as impressive as ever......","H- Hmm, is this okay? She’s clearly more excited than usual, which makes me think there’s a high risk of things getting out of control. After all, she’s so hyped that she’s wearing a Santa costume......","[Oh, my beloved child, there’s no need to worry! Today’s Mother is a special edition! Ah, I don’t just mean my outfit. Well, okay, my outfit is special too, but...... haven’t you noticed? Even in this situation, spending Christmas just the two of us, I’ve managed to stay calm and composed without letting my love for you explode. I’ve maintained the atmosphere of a mother full of maternal love......]","[There’s a lot of stuff I'd like to retort, but you’re right, there doesn’t seem to be any signs of you going out of control.]","It wasn’t exactly the calm and composed atmosphere I knew, but putting that aside, as she said, Makina-san didn’t seem to exude the overwhelming, suffocating love she usually did. Despite her high spirits, she didn’t seem on the verge of losing control.","[At the ship party, I applied the same technique———— when my love exceeds a certain threshold, the excess emotions are transferred to another terminal, and that terminal goes out of control instead. In other words, today’s Mother is the perfect version, free from the flaw of going berserk!]","Honestly, I was more surprised that she actually acknowledged her tendency to go berserk as a flaw. Errr, does that mean Makina-san is currently in the same non-berserk state as Eden-san was during the ship party?","[That’s certainly reassuring...... but if you can do that, doesn’t it mean you don’t have to worry about going berserk anymore?]","[Well, it’s not that simple. First, the recipient of my excess emotions needs to be strong enough to handle them. At least among the Paradise Edens, no one can endure it. During the ship party, it was Deus Ex Machina II who played the role of the berserk outlet. And even though the transfer itself is fine, the recipient inevitably goes berserk, so someone has to stop them, but the terminals who can handle my emotions are usually so strong that restraining them becomes a challenge...... At the ship party, Alice, who understands me well, acted as a stopper to control things.]","[I see...... So, what about now?]","[In this case, it’s a dream...... which means it’s only mental energy. Since I temporarily bring your consciousness into my world when we meet in these dreams, it’s easier to manage compared to when we're at Shallow Vernal's world. That's why, well, this countermeasure only works either when Alice agrees to act as a stopper or within a dream.]","By the sound of it, the conditions for this arrangement seem pretty strict...... Still, being able to meet in a dream without the risk of Makina-san losing control is an incredible relief for me...... When she's not at risk of going berserk, Makina-san is actually just cheerful, fun, and charmingly quirky. You could even say all the usual concerns vanish.","[......Well, in that case, it’s safe to enjoy a Christmas party together.]","[Unn, unn! Let’s create lots of wonderful memories! Oh, and of course, what’s a party without a feast? And Christmas means chicken, right?]","At the moment when I was finally able to relax and enjoy the Christmas party, Makina-san conjured a large table in front of me.","It was empty for now, but she would probably start bringing out food soon. However, chicken huh...... Considering Makina-san is a goddess, I wondered if she might present some ridiculously extravagant turkey or something. R","[Tadah~~! A 10-piece bucket!!!]","But what she proudly revealed was a bucket marked with the logo of a famous fried chicken chain.","Right, this is Makina-san we’re talking about———– someone with a fondness for hamburgers and the like. Not that I minded, though. I’d much prefer fried chicken to some overly fancy dish.","[I’ve got bottled cola too! It has to be bottles for occasions like this.]","[True, bottles fit the mood much better than cans or plastic bottles.]","[Unn, unn! Oh, and I’ve prepared lots of other stuff too, so eat as much as you like! No need to worry about how much you eat here; it won’t affect your body back in reality.]","Makina-san smiled warmly as she spoke. Despite being someone who’s lived for billions, if not trillions of years, there was an endearing youthfulness about her, further accentuated by her Santa costume.","[Right, right, my beloved child, it’s just the two of us today, so feel free to fawn upon Mother as much as you want! Should I give you a big hug? Mother's warmth will fill you with happiness!]","[......F- For the time being, since we have food here, shouldn’t we eat first?]","[Ah, that’s right! Let’s dig in together!]","She spread her arms wide with an inviting smile, clearly ready for a hug. Feeling a bit bashful, I changed the topic.","After all, normally I’d be on edge, wary of her going out of control...... But now, with no risk of that happening...... Makina-san just looked normally cute, and the thought of hugging her makes my heart race.","It was a strange, ticklish feeling...... Just as Makina-san herself claimed, when she’s not on the verge of losing control, she’s practically flawless.","She’s kind and gentle toward me, her beloved child. Her cheerful, down-to-earth tastes make her fun to talk to, and her slight airheadedness adds a cute, endearing touch...... H- Hmm, if she came on strong in her current state, I might even find myself flustered, even strangely aware of her presence.","Lost in these thoughts, I raised a bottle of cola and clinked it with Makina’s in a toast.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Arehh? If she can really just manage to control her berserk state...... maybe her being a heroine could actually work......]"]},{"number":2109,"title":"Chapter 2109: Date Plan Execution 44","paragraphs":["Rasal-san, who seemed to be looking for a noble in the Human Realm to negotiate with, had a brief discussion with Eris-san. They agreed to arrange a formal meeting at a later date, concluding the matter for now.","After giving me a brief greeting, Rasal-san began browsing the shop to select chocolates to take home. Since our shopping was already done, we received the neatly wrapped goods from Eris-san and stored them in our respective magic boxes.","[Kaito-sama, where do you plan to go after this?]","[It's about lunchtime, so we plan to have lunch after this. It’s a restaurant that’s new to all of us, but I believe the name is......]","I told Eris-san the name of the restaurant, which I had heard beforehand from Olivia-san and Kaori-san. Since Olivia-san had already made reservations for both lunch and dinner, I didn’t need to take the lead, unlike during our window shopping earlier.","According to Kuro’s eating guide, the restaurant seemed to focus on dishes prepared with carefully selected ingredients, including local vegetables. Kuro's rating of the place was quite high.","However, one thing that stood out was an intriguing note in the guide———— it hinted at a “secret menu”, but no details were provided.","[That restaurant is popular, and the food is excellent. A very good choice. Since you're going there...... Please wait a moment.]","[Eh? Ah, yes.]","After hearing the restaurant’s name, Eris-san smiled and said it was a great choice. She then instructed a staff member to bring her a small message card. She quickly wrote something on it, then placed it into a small envelope.","[The restaurant has a fruit juice that isn’t on the menu and is only recommended to regulars. It’s made with the finest ingredients and is absolutely exquisite. I’d love for Kaito-sama to try it. I happen to have a connection with the restaurant, so I included a message card of introduction. Please feel free to order it if you’d like.]","[Thank you very much. I’ll definitely try it.]","I see, so the secret menu mentioned in Kuro's guide was something offered exclusively to regulars......","I thanked Eris-san for her thoughtfulness, took the envelope, and expressed my gratitude again as she saw us off outside the shop before we left.","Her new chocolates were delicious, and despite having bought quite a lot previously, I ended up buying more this time. That chocolate shop really is incredible.","Now that I think about it, Nifty sells chocolates made with a small amount of cacao grown by Nebula. It might be fun to see a collaborative product related to chocolate.","Well, it’s not really something I can decide, but maybe I’ll suggest it to Canalis-san or Eris-san if the opportunity arises and they’re interested? Just a random thought, but I’ll keep it in mind.","[By the way, I’ve been wondering for a while...... Is Olivia-sama’s income mainly from donations or something?]","As we walked hand-in-hand toward the restaurant, Kaori-san suddenly asked Olivia-san a question that seemed to have just occurred to her. Unlike Kaori-san, Olivia-san didn’t seem overwhelmed by the prices at Eris-san's shop. Instead, she casually purchased a wide variety of items that caught her eye.","[That is not incorrect. Income sources for those associated with the Cathedral include donations to Godism, fees for dispatching Cathedral personnel to festivals or ceremonies, and payments for blessings performed by priests. Since donations are included, we refer to it as \"distributions\" rather than \"salary\", but it is effectively a paycheck. In my case, I also receive additional compensation for my duties as the city’s representative.] �","[I see. Considering that Olivia-san is both the leader of Godism and the representative of a city, this might sound strange, but you must have a pretty high income.]","Now that she mentioned it, it made sense. Given her positions, it was inevitable that Olivia-san would have more than just a modest amount of money. She didn’t give the impression of someone who spent lavishly, so I hadn’t thought of her as wealthy...... However, being the head of a city and the sole leader of the world’s one and only absolute religion, it would actually be strange if she weren’t well-off.","[Indeed, as Miyama Kaito-sama says, my income is relatively high. However, before I was guided by Miyama Kaito-sama, I hardly used money at all. Nearly 1,000 years' worth of distributions and salaries have remained untouched in storage, so, embarrassing it may be, I don’t have a precise grasp of how much money I actually possess.]","[......1,000 years' worth of pay, completely untouched...... Olivia-sama, doesn’t that make you, like, ridiculously wealthy......]","As Kaori-san murmured, it was undeniable that Olivia-san must be in possession of a vast fortune. Yet, judging from our interactions thus far, she seemed to have very little interest in money itself.","No, if she truly hadn’t touched her income for almost 1,000 years, it must mean she only spends money when absolutely necessary. While she has recently started using it more———— going to Kaori-san’s restaurant for meals or buying books that interest her...... it’s still hard to imagine her being the type to splurge. It doesn’t feel like she’d even use up her monthly paycheck, let alone her accumulated wealth.","<Afterword>>","Serious-senpai : [Eris might genuinely be the toughest among the Stomachache Warriors when it comes to enduring stomachache...... Despite her gut taking so many smackings, she always manages to recover. She might panic internally, but she hardly ever shows it on the surface, which is honestly impressive...... Well, the Stomachache Demon seems to have no heart though, considering he's already planning his next attack......]"]},{"number":2110,"title":"Chapter 2110: Intermission: Meanwhile, At the Conference Room","paragraphs":["In the conference room of the Imperial Palace in Archlesia Empire's Imperial Capital, nobles part of the reformist faction had gathered.","Under the lead of Emperor Chris, these were individuals dedicated to transforming the Archlesia Empire, which was steeped in old aristocratic customs. They stood in opposition to the conservatives, who wished to maintain the status quo.","Recently, however, the reformist faction had become overwhelmingly dominant due to the shifting tides of the times, the fruition of various policies, and the influence of the World's Singularity, Kaito. Consequently, Archlesia Empire was gradually undergoing change.","This led to a cheerful and optimistic atmosphere in the faction's gatherings, with a sense of forward-looking progress prevailing.","[Even so, Marquis Hamilton's daughter, Eris-sama, is quite remarkable. I've heard rumors even from my side, and lately, her momentum has been astonishing.]","[Indeed. Even setting aside a parent's bias, she possesses the qualities befitting the heir of a marquisdom. That said, much of the recent developments owe to his influence......]","[That's true. It's genuinely surprising how he built connections in completely unexpected places.]","Exchanging words with Emperor Chris, Marquis Hamilton couldn't help but smile wryly. His daughter, Eris, had become the center of attention in the social circles of late, making her one of the most talked-about nobles in Archlesia Empire.","And it was no wonder. Until recently, Kaito had interacted with few beyond the royal family, the Albert Duchy, and the Neverlight Viscountcy, whose lord came from the same homeworld as him. That someone as significant as Eris had formed a friendship with Kaito naturally became a hot topic.","[While I do feel apologetic having her dragged into political predictions, personally, I'm grateful that an Archlesia Empire noble is building a good relationship with Miyama-sama.]","[Eris is also a noble lady. She understands the political implications and can navigate them deftly without causing trouble for Miyama-sama. Fortunately, since her fiancé hasn't been decided, the conservatives couldn't accuse us of neglecting strategic alliances.]","[Indeed. It's truly surprising, but even when considering all the noble heirs or even household heads in Archlesia Empire, Eris stands out as the most suitable to interact with Miyama-sama. If Miyama-sama asked me to be introduced to an Archlesia noble, I would probably have suggested Hamilton Marquisdom...... Thinking about it, Miyama-sama seems to have an extraordinary knack for drawing the best connections out of countless options. Good gracious, should I say it's to be expected of him or not......]","When Chris first heard the report that Eris and Kaito had become friends, she was astonished. Still, if one were to look for the best match among Archlesia Empire's nobles, even Chris would have chosen Eris.","The fact that Kaito, starting with no ties to the Archlesia nobles, managed to form such a connection immediately was a testament to his uncanny ability to attract favorable relationships.","[......Still, please be careful. Miyama-sama is someone who defies conventional wisdom. Even though it might not be his own intentions, he could influence situations from unexpected angles, so you never know what might happen if you're off guard. I myself was caught off guard during the Founding Festival......]","[Yes, we've experienced that firsthand in a short time. Seriously, it's like we're being blindsided......]","As Chris exchanged wry smiles with Marquis Hamilton, the door to the conference room suddenly opened, and one of Chris’ subordinates rushed in, looking flustered.","[Your Majesty! There is something urgent I must report......]","[What is it?]","[A report has come in that Miyama Kaito-sama and...... um...... the Founder Olivia-sama have been sighted at Dia Royale Chocolate in the Trade City of Lufan......]","[................................]","Hearing the report, Chris looked up at the ceiling with an indescribable expression, while Marquis Hamilton, known for his usual stern demeanor, was left dumbfounded, his mouth agape in disbelief.","It turned out that a reformist noble had happened to be inside Dia Royale Chocolate at the time, allowing the information to reach Chris swiftly. Even so, the news that Olivia, of all people, was visiting the establishment was a shocking revelation.","Of course, they had no intention of interfering with Kaito and Olivia’s activities. However, the fact that Olivia had visited a store frequented by Archlesian nobles was bound to spark numerous rumors in the days to come.","This made it imperative to devise countermeasures in advance...... The previously harmonious meeting quickly transformed into an emergency session.","As for developments regarding Rasal, those reports had yet to arrive, meaning the group was in for even more surprises. On top of that, Eris would later bring news concerning negotiations with the Death King faction, leaving Marquis Hamilton with no small amount of stomachache. But of course, that was but a story for another time.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The daughter he sent off with trust comes back not only having her name remembered by the Founder, who even hinted at a future visit, but also carrying news of negotiations with the Death King faction...... The way he brought even her parents stomachaches, truly a masterstroke of skill.]"]},{"number":2111,"title":"Chapter 2111: Date with Kaori and Olivia 1","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I got home pretty late, so today's chapter is short.","The restaurant Olivia-san had reserved was, as Eris-san mentioned, a highly popular establishment, exuding a chic atmosphere from its exterior alone.","Rather than giving off the vibe of an ultra-luxury establishment, it seemed to prioritize aesthetics, blending well with the red-brick townscape. Its slightly retro yet warm ambiance was something I found quite appealing.","However, one thing caught my attention. A staff member, presumably a waiter, stood at the restaurant’s entrance, bowing deeply upon seeing us. Is this the kind of place where guests are greeted like this?","But then, as we got closer, I noticed something strange———– despite it being lunchtime, there didn’t seem to be any other customers inside.","[I’m Olivia, who made the reservation.]","[We’ve been expecting you. Please allow me to show you to your table.]","The tension and sense of humility radiating from the supposed waiter were palpable...... Ah, I see now. Since Olivia-san made the reservation, it’s only natural that the staff knew she was a high-ranking figure.","This likely wasn’t Olivia-san renting out the place, but rather the restaurant deciding to ensure no mishaps occurred by creating a private setting for her.","[......Kaito-kun, do you think they see us as some kind of super VIPs?]","[I’m almost certain they do. My Sympathy Magic is picking up on a lot of nervousness from them......]","Kaori-san, likely having reached the same conclusion as me, whispered her thoughts, and I responded in kind.","Well, while it was a bit surprising, I can see the logic behind it. Besides, for us, it was actually convenient not to have to worry about Olivia-san being recognized and causing a commotion. The private setting might be for the best.","As I mused about this, I released Olivia-san’s hand to enter the restaurant...... and saw her briefly display a look of deep loneliness. How should I say this...... She really looks like a cute puppy at times like this.","Well, it lasted only a moment before she returned to her usual demeanor. Following the staff’s guidance, we entered the restaurant. But it was at that moment that I noticed something.","The waiter guiding us was visibly tense, but what struck me more was the overwhelming nervousness and resolute determination radiating from Olivia-san.","......What is this feeling? Considering Olivia-san’s personality and her behavior up to now...... Ah, could it be that?","She’s probably thinking something along the lines of “If the food at the restaurant I chose doesn’t suit his taste, it would be an unforgivable failure.”","It felt as though her emotions carried the weight of a samurai ready to commit seppuku in the event of failure...... Before we start eating, let's give them some reassurance first.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Honestly, it really feels like she's prepared to accept any kind of punishment, no matter what.]"]},{"number":2112,"title":"Chapter 2112: Date with Kaori and Olivia 2","paragraphs":["Olivia felt her own growing tension as they were guided to their seats at the restaurant.","(I knew this would happen, but I’m still so inexperienced. I can’t keep my composure as well as I would like.)","This restaurant was one that Olivia had chosen and reserved. Due to her position, it was difficult for her to visit the place in advance, but she gathered information from various magazines and other sources, carefully selecting a restaurant from multiple options.","Olivia understood that Kaito simply wasn't fond of luxury restaurants, so she tried to choose a place based on information she had gathered, including from Kaori, aiming to select a place that Kaito might enjoy.","(I am confident. The only regret I have is not being able to visit the restaurant beforehand, but I gathered as much information as possible, and I even researched the dishes they serve and tried to make similar ones myself to taste. I’ve also confirmed that there are no dishes containing ingredients that Miyama Kaito-sama dislikes.)","As a side note, Kaito had told Olivia and Kaori that he disliked bell peppers. He felt embarrassed about this dislike and wasn’t eager to share it with others, but when Olivia informed him that she would be making the restaurant reservation, he mentioned it.","The reason was simple———– if Olivia unknowingly chose a dish with bell peppers and Kaito, who is quick to show his discomfort, made a displeased expression, Olivia would likely feel a tremendous amount of responsibility. To avoid that, he told her in advance that he disliked bell peppers, considering that his own embarrassment was a minor issue in comparison.","The seat she was shown to was likely the best in the restaurant...... a spot near the window on the second floor with a beautiful view of the red brick townscape. Olivia’s tension was evident on her face as she sat down.","The dishes had already been reserved in advance, so the server only came to take drink orders. During this time, Kaito handed over a card from Eris and ordered their special juice.","[......The atmosphere here is nice. Olivia-san, you chose this place, didn’t you?]","[Y- Yes.]","[Olivia-sama did a lot of research. She also asked me for my opinion several times.]","Kaito smiled gently to ease Olivia’s nervousness, and Olivia responded, still somewhat tense. When Kaori mentioned how much Olivia had worked hard to research, Kaito gave a kind smile and then gently reached out to lightly pat Olivia’s head.","[I see. It must have been a lot of work, right? Thank you.]","[ ! ? ]","Kaito hadn’t done this intentionally. His action was a result of trying to ease Olivia’s clear tension. The distance was such that his hand naturally reached her head, and after interacting with her until now, he couldn't help thinking of Olivia as someone like a puppy, so he ended up unconsciously patting her head to show appreciation for all her hard work.","(Eh? Ah? Miyama Kaito-sama patted my head...... W- What was that just now...... My thoughts are melting away, and a warm sense of happiness is descending on my head, making my body feel like it’s going to melt...... I- I can’t gather my thoughts!? C- C- C- Calm down......)","Naturally, Olivia had never been patted on the head before. The shock of being patted by Kaito, whom she could truly say she deeply respected, was overwhelming. It felt incredibly pleasant and happy deep down...... but the intensity of the happiness was so great that her mind was in complete chaos.","[Ah, sorry, I couldn’t help myself.]","[N- No, it’s fine! It’s just...... I’m so happy——— no, I mean, please don’t mind me!!!]","As a result, Olivia was more flustered than ever before, but in a way, it may have been effective in resetting her overly tense thoughts.","Having now experienced the comfort of being patted on the head by Kaito, she might find herself expecting it in the future, which could make her heart waver, but for now, it was a good trigger to help her regain her composure.","After a while, as the confusion in her thoughts began to subside, she found that her mind became a little more stable and clear than before.","(......It’s alright. I’ve read all the reference materials, and even while being distracted by worldly thoughts, I’ve mentally rehearsed what might happen. I’m sure I can complete the dinner part of the date smoothly.)","There was, however, one big misunderstanding. Olivia had indeed been extremely nervous since arriving at the restaurant, and Kaito had mistakenly assumed that her nervousness was due to worrying about whether the food would suit his taste.","But that assumption was wrong. While Olivia certainly had some anxiety about whether the food would suit Kaito, she had spent enough time with him by now and exchanged letters up to the day of the date to understand his preferences. She was fairly confident in her choice.","Additionally, based on Kaito’s personality, she understood that even if the food didn’t suit him, he wouldn’t want to punish her. If it came to that, Olivia would privately reflect on it and make sure she didn’t repeat the mistake...... but her current nervousness was coming from somewhere else entirely.","The key point here was that Olivia had consulted romance novels and magazines while preparing for the date.","Yes, the reason Olivia was so intensely nervous...... was that she had planned to create a situation where she would feed Kaito during the date...... However, as of now, Kaito had no idea that Olivia had such a thought in mind.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I- I see, since Kaito can only understand general emotions...... He can sense that she was feeling tense, but there's a possibility the reason behind it could be something different...... Kuh, what heroine power...... It's getting stronger......?]","? ? ? : [Heroine Power? Is that some kind of combat power that you can increase or decrease?]"]},{"number":2113,"title":"Chapter 2113: Date with Kaori and Olivia 3","paragraphs":["When I moved my hand off her head, Olivia-san looked a bit lonely. Coupled with her petite build, which gave off a somewhat puppy-like vibe, I couldn’t help but pat her on the head, surprising her. Still, it seemed to help ease the tension I sensed from her, so I think it worked.","[......Hmm, this kind of atmosphere is nice. It’s different from my diner’s style, but I really admire how much thought has gone into things like the view.]","[Kaori-san’s place has a purely Japanese style...... It might feel closer to an izakaya in terms of atmosphere.]","[Come to think of it, Mizuhara Kaori’s diner doesn’t have large windows like this place. Is there a reason for that?]","As Olivia-san pointed out, Kaori-san’s diner didn’t have large windows. There were ventilation windows, but none that offered the kind of scenic view this restaurant had.","Well, many Japanese-style diners are designed like that, so I never really thought about it. But I could understand why Olivia-san was curious.","[Ah, about that, like Kaito-kun mentioned, my diner’s atmosphere is modeled after Japanese izakayas...... diners from the world where Kaito-kun and I lived. While I’ve made adjustments here and there to make it feel more like local diners, I really like the Japanese vibe. And while I’m not entirely sure, izakayas often have small, high-positioned ventilation windows to prevent drunk customers from breaking the windows or climbing out of them. I think that’s why mine is designed that way too.]","[I see, there’s a lot of thought put into it.]","[Well, that’s just my guess; I’m not entirely sure if that’s the real reason. Also, my diner’s location isn’t great for scenic views, so even if it had big windows, there wouldn’t be much to see.]","As we chatted about such things, the fruit juice we had ordered arrived. Large wine glass-like containers were placed in front of us. Drinking from these fancy glasses felt quite stylish.","While I was thinking about that, the server spoke to Olivia-san.","[We have several types of juice available. If you’d like, you may sample them......]","[It was our lack of explanation, so I won’t hold it against you...... But the gentleman seated here, Miyama Kaito-sama, is the highest-ranking individual in this setting. The choice is his, not mine, so please keep this in mind going forward.]","[My deepest apologies.]","Oops, things seem to be taking an odd turn...... This place is probably a famous restaurant, but it’s not like it’s run by a noble or anything. It’s understandable that they don’t know who I am, and Olivia-san doesn’t seem to hold it against them either.","That said, if the Founder suddenly introduces me as someone above her, it’s no wonder they’d look at me with a look that seemed to ask \"Just who is this guy?\", filled with dread.","But explaining everything from scratch would take too much time, so I just smiled awkwardly and ended up being the one to choose the juice.","I checked with Olivia-san and Kaori-san, and based on my preferences, I went with a drink that primarily used citrus fruits.","While I liked the juice made with ripple, it felt a bit too sweet to pair with a meal. So I opted for a refreshing citrus fruit mix that tasted somewhat like orange juice.","[I see, with all your incredible connections, I thought Kaito-kun was super famous, but now that I think about it, I’d never heard of you before we met. I guess you’re not really well-known among the general public.]","[Yeah, it seems like I’m pretty well-known among nobles, but not at regular places. I don’t participate in state ceremonies or events with important people, after all.]","[......Personally, I believe Miyama Kaito-sama’s illustrious presence should be more widely recognized...... However, if Miyama Kaito-sama does not desire that, then perhaps things are best as they are.]","[That's right. Honestly, even now, it feels like it’s a bit too much for me personally...... But as long as I can walk around town without it affecting my daily life, this level is comfortable.]","For that, I’m really grateful to Alice for managing the flow of information so well. Seriously, if every town I went to ended up like Rigforeshia, I’d have to wear the glasses Shiro-san gave me all the time, and that would be a hassle.","Rigforeshia is, of course, an extreme example...... but still, I really don’t want to become any more famous than I already am.","[A hidden fixer known only to those in the know?]","[You’re kinda mixing things up with my identity here now. Also, I’m not a fixer.]","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [In reality, the fact that he's almost completely unknown to the general public is a perfect balance. For someone like Kaito who avoids actively interacting with nobles, being around them must be pretty comfortable.]","? ? ? : [For a noble to associate with Kaito-san, they'd need a certain level of aptitude as a Stomachache Warrior.]","Serious-senpai : [The fact that I can’t completely deny that...... is just pitiful.]"]},{"number":2114,"title":"Chapter 2114: Date with Kaori and Olivia 4","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I'm going to take a short holiday at the end of the year because it's the busiest period back at work. So, this will be the last update for this year, and the next chapter will be on January 1.","As the drinks were prepared and the food was soon to arrive, Olivia quietly reflected. She was the one who had made the reservation at this restaurant and was fully aware of the dishes that would be served.","Among them, she had carefully selected dishes suited for what she deemed an essential act during a date meal...... feeding her date.","(The appetizer will be canapés with semi-dried tomatoes and cheese...... According to what I’ve learned about this restaurant, they serve these on thinly sliced baguette pieces with tomato and cheese on top. The portions are thoughtfully made small so that women can easily eat them in one bite...... Since it’s a dish eaten by hand, even someone like me, who isn’t fully confident in handling knives and forks, can ensure it reaches Miyama Kaito-sama’s mouth accurately. Yes, it’s best to act during the appetizer.)","Olivia was extraordinarily meticulous by nature. Though she hadn’t visited the restaurant herself, she had researched every detail about the dishes, down to their ingredients.","She had selected a menu that she believed would align with Kaito's preferences while allowing her to achieve her goal. Among these, the appetizer stood out as her top choice.","(I’ve rehearsed this scenario in my mind. As proper etiquette when feeding food to one’s date, it’s customary to take at least one bite oneself before offering it to the other person. Considering this, the appetizer is the best choice. For other dishes, since I’d need to use the same utensils I’ve already put in my mouth to serve Miyama Kaito-sama...... Miyama Kaito-sama...... No, that won’t do! I can’t maintain composure if I let such intrusive thoughts creep in! Yes, the appetizer...... it has to be the appetizer!)","Olivia had conducted thorough mental simulations in preparation for the date. Despite this, she concluded that an indirect kiss scenario with Kaito was unbearably embarrassing and should be avoided.","Yet, even after reaching this conclusion, she couldn’t help but repeatedly imagine the scene during her rehearsals. Deep down, she might have harbored a secret wish to try it.","In any case, due to these circumstances, Olivia had set her sights on the appetizer as the focus of her plan...... Yes, she had underestimated the challenge of feeding someone by hand.","[Here comes the appetizer huh. Is this tomato and cheese?]","[Yes. These are canapés with semi-dried tomatoes and cheese. You can eat them directly by hand. There’s a place to wash your fingers, and we’ve also provided wet wipes for your convenience.]","As the waiter explained the dish to Kaito, Olivia’s nervousness reached its peak. Her heart was pounding, and she felt as though her body temperature had risen slightly.","(It’s fine; this is perfectly normal. This is a classic act during a date———— something that all couples experience...... Ah, not that Miyama Kaito-sama and I are a couple, but this is an essential step to complete the date. Timing is crucial, I mustn’t make a mistake......)","Naturally, Kaito could sense Olivia’s heightened tension, but he interpreted it as her worrying about whether the food would suit his tastes. As such, Kaito remained oblivious to Olivia’s true intentions.","Olivia followed her plan, taking one canapé and tasting it first to confirm its flavor. She then noticed that Kaito had also eaten one, prompting her to speak up.","[Miyama Kaito-sama, I made sure to study the proper etiquette for this date. I will absolutely see this dining act through to completion.]","[......Eh? Ah, yes. Errr, please do your best.]","[Yes!]","Kaito couldn’t help but feel a bit puzzled. After all, they were just having lunch———- why was she putting so much effort into it? However, Olivia’s next move made him somewhat understand what was going on.","Olivia picked up a canapé, carefully holding it with one hand while supporting it with the other, and blushing deeply, she extended it toward Kaito.","[P- P- P- Please...... P- Please enjoy!]","[......","For a moment, Kaito was unsure how to react. Based on his past experiences with Olivia, he suspected she might be slightly misunderstanding something, perhaps believing that feeding her date was an essential part of the process.","Had she asked him about this beforehand, he would have gently corrected her misunderstanding. But now, seeing her embarrassed yet determined action, he realized that pointing out her mistake would only amplify her embarrassment to an unbearable degree.","Thus, he decided the best approach was to go along with her for now and address the misunderstanding subtly later. Smiling warmly, he nodded at Olivia.","[Thank you. In that case, I’ll enjoy it.]","[Y- Yes———– ! ? ! ? ! ? ]","Kaito proceeded to act as Olivia had hoped, but her carefully laid plan soon faced an unexpected twist.","Given that it was a bite-sized dish being fed by hand, it was inevitable that Olivia’s fingers would briefly enter Kaito’s mouth.","Though it lasted only an instant, the warmth of his breath on her fingertips and the faint touch of his lips sent a tingling sensation through Olivia, piercing her senses and leaving her mind completely blank.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Unlike Alice, she takes action even when blushing, which makes her extremely troublesome......]","T/N: See ya next year. Happy New Year."]},{"number":2115,"title":"Chapter 2115: Extra - : The Otherworlders’ New Year’s Party","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","Happy New Year. I hope you enjoy both this year and my novel.","In the usually underutilized, spacious garden, lively voices echoed.","[Hina-chan, listen here, okay? Gently, gently now......]","[Leave it to me! EI!!!]","[Too fast and strong!? Tone it down more......]","With an energetic voice, Hina-chan brought the pestle down, creating a loud sound with a speed and power unimaginable from her youth.","Specializing in Body Strengthening Magic, Hina-chan's physical abilities, even when restrained, were far beyond those of an average adult male...... Aoi-chan, who was in charge of mixing the mochi, was pale from the overwhelming speed of the mallet.","[Hou~~ As expected of a pro, you're so skilled. If I helped, I'd just get in the way. Maybe I should leave the zouni-making to Kaori.]","[I don't mind. After all, I'm technically a professional chef. I'm used to cooking for large groups, so this number of people is no problem for me alone...... Wait, Akane-san, what are you taking out there?]","[Well, I thought I'd leave the zouni to you and make some takoyaki......]","[Takoyaki for New Year's!?]","[Why not? Takoyaki is delicious anytime...... Alright, let's add mochi in......]","Elsewhere, Kaori-san was making zouni while Akane-san, who had pulled out the takoyaki maker she'd received from Eden-san, began making takoyaki.","Since it was New Year's, it was decided that we’d take the opportunity to hold a New Year's gathering with fellow folks from the same homeworld. All the Otherworlders living in Trinia were gathered in the garden of my home, the venue for today.","[Seigi-kun, what are you preparing over there?]","[Eh? Ahh, I'm slicing toasted mochi into smaller pieces and putting them on bread with pizza sauce, cheese, and salami to make a kind of mock pizza......]","......Is this guy a genius? I never thought of combining mochi with pizza sauce, but the idea of a mochi pizza sounded really delicious.","While marveling at Seigi-kun's creativity, I mashed sweet potatoes to make kurikinton. We aren't making a full-fledged osechi meal, but I was preparing various dishes with a New Year's feel.","(T/N: Kurikinton (Candied Chestnuts and Mashed Potatoes) is a staple in osechi ryori, a box filled with a variety of traditional Japanese New Year's dishes.)","Of course, not everyone was cooking. If everyone joined in, as expected, there’d be too many hands. Shigenobu-san and my parents were taking it easy.","Incidentally, Shigenobu-san and Dad were currently playing shogi, while Mom and Hannah-san watched.","[......Guh, w- wait.]","[Fufu, alright. How many moves back?]","[......Eight, please. Man, Kazuya-san, you're strong at shogi......]","Unlike me, Dad was generally skilled at board games, and apparently, he had even won a small shogi tournament in the past. Though not at a professional level, he claimed to be significantly better than the average person. �","[Hmm, maybe I should help out after all......]","[......Akari-san, I’m not familiar with the rules of shogi, so if you could explain them......]","[Oh, right. I can’t just leave Hannah-san behind, either.]","By the way, one of the reasons why my mom wasn’t involved in the cooking was that she had a unique problem with it. She wasn’t bad in the sense of making terrible-tasting dishes or adding strange tweaks, and she followed the measurements correctly but...... when it came to things like grilling or mixing, her sense was catastrophically off. The result was that she always ended up making dishes that were, in some inexplicable way, just not very tasty.","Hannah-san, who had probably heard about this from Dad, was skillfully stopping Mom from getting involved in the cooking.","On a different note, my mom was terribly bad at board games. It wasn’t like me, where I had no sense for it at all, but rather that she just wasn’t good at games that require thinking.","She had been in sports clubs throughout middle and high school, and despite her small build, she preferred active sports over anything that involved using her head.","[......Alright, I think the kurikinton is done. Seigi-kun, do you need any help?]","[No, I’m almost done here too.]","[Okay, then I’ll go help Neunn-san.]","[Got it.]","After speaking to Seigi-kun, I moved to help Neun-san, who was cooking elsewhere. Naturally, Neun-san was part of the all-Otherworlders gathering.","When I first brought Neun-san along, Akane-san and the Shigenobu couple were quite shocked, but I got told \"......I get why you couldn’t tell us before, but can I punch you once anyway?\" by Akane-san.","Neun-san was grilling a whole sea bream and cooking a little apart due to the cooking equipment. When I approached, I found her in a kappōgi apron.","[Neun-san, we’re almost done over here. Do you need help?]","[Help? I’m just about to finish things up here, so not really...... But since you're here, how about helping me taste-test...... How is it?]","[It’s great. The flesh is tender and delicious.]","[Glad you like it. Then it seems we’re all set.]","[By the way, Mom mentioned something about not eating sea bream on the first day......]","[Not eating sea bream? Oh, perhaps she was referring to nirami-tai?]","As I helped Neun-san clean up the cookware after taste-testing, I recalled what Mom had said and asked about it.","[Nirami-tai?]","[Yes, isn't Kaito-san's mother from Western Japan? I wouldn't say that this is the case everywhere there, but in Western Japan, there's a custom called nirami-tai, where a salted grilled sea bream is placed on the dining table and not touched during the first three days of the New Year, only to be reheated and eaten on the fourth day.]","[Heehhh, that's an interesting custom.]","[The way people spend New Year's can vary a lot by region, so there are probably many customs I'm not aware of. Now, let's bring the food.]","[Got it. I'll carry this...... Ah, no, sorry. I just realized there’s something else I need to take care of......]","[Oh, I see. If it's her, if it's not Kaito-san...... Just leave this side to me.]","I was about to carry the food with Neun-san, but as soon as I felt a presence and turned my gaze...... I saw Makina-san, looking like she wanted to join, gazing at us from a bit further away.","Now, what should I do...... As someone who loves her children, Makina-san must want to be part of this gathering where her children are all together. Still, maybe she’s trying to be considerate by not suddenly jumping right into the center?","[......No, it's not like that. After having a discussion with Shallow Vernal-sama, it was decided that neither Shallow Vernal-sama nor Makina would participate on their own. However, if invited by Kaito-san, then that's a different matter. It looks like she's giving you a hint that she wants to be invited.]","[......Ah, I see. So that’s how it is......]","Alice explained to me, and I fully understood. It seemed like Makina-san was trying to follow the agreement with Shiro-san, but she couldn’t quite let go of the desire to participate. I gave a wry smile while looking at her and spoke to Alice.","[Alice, sorry but......]","[Hahh...... fine, I get it. Just treat me to something later, okay?]","[Thanks, I appreciate it.]","It would be too cruel to exclude Makina-san from participating, but at the same time, if she joined in this situation, she’d definitely go wild.","So, I decided to handle it the same way we did at the previous ship party, telling Makina-san that it would be fine for her to join as Eden-san, but she’d need to follow the same precautions we used back then.","I do feel a bit apologetic to Alice, who would be the one to keep Makina-san in check if she started to go off the rails...... but it seemed like she genuinely wanted to fulfill her best friend's wish, so despite her wry smile, she agreed.","Well, like Akane-san and Kaori-san, the other Otherworlders seemed to have some admiration for Eden-san, so even if Eden-san joined, there would likely be no complaints.","Seeing Makina-san jump with excitement at my suggestion, I exchanged a glance with Alice and couldn’t help but smile wryly again.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [W- What!? Seigi-san got lines in such a short time...... So this must be the New Year's Miracle......]"]},{"number":2116,"title":"Chapter 2116: Date with Kaori and Olivia 5","paragraphs":["A beautiful flower field bathed in sunlight. Vibrant flowers bloom in abundance, and the pleasant fragrance wafting through the air gently tickles the senses, bringing peace to the heart.","With the shimmering sunlight, music akin to a divine hymn resonates through the flower field, as if inviting those who hear it to ascend to the heavens.","Olivia had never visited the Sanctuary. However, she wondered if the Sanctuary she had only heard about might be as magnificent as this. Truly, it seemed like the beautiful realm where the world's God resides, a blessed place. This vision reflected in Olivia’s eyes, sparkling brightly.","Olivia was certain———– the happiness filling her heart, it was faith found in devotion.","......In about one second, Olivia’s thoughts had wandered to another world. However, given the situation of having Kaito before her, she couldn’t afford to remain dazed forever. With determination and willpower, Olivia brought her thoughts back.","(——-Hah!? T- The overwhelming happiness made my consciousness drift away. T- This is far too dangerous! Just the act of offering food to Miyama Kaito-sama and having him accept it fills my heart with the joy of serving him. Moreover, feeling Miyama Kaito-sama’s warmth, even just through my fingertips, is so overwhelming———– so dangerous that if this continues, my mind might truly melt away!)","Olivia’s faith was, to put it plainly, maxed out———— no, it had broken through the ceiling and continued to rise limitlessly. Her unwavering devotion to Shallow Vernal and Kaito, which she constantly praised in her heart, left no room to doubt her faith.","For Olivia, the act of doing something for Kaito and having him accept it brought an indescribably immense sense of happiness.","[......Olivia-san? Are you okay?]","[Y- Yes, my deepest apologies. What I just did was something I had set as a goal beforehand, so now that I’ve completed it, I feel a sense of accomplishment.]","She wasn’t lying. She had indeed set this as a goal in advance, researched cuisine, and conducted thorough image training. There was a sense of accomplishment from executing her plan. It was simply that the happiness far exceeded what she had expected.","(But I’m truly relieved. Thanks to suppressing my distractions again and again while refining my mental image beforehand, I managed to get through this without making a fool of myself. While this doesn’t mark the completion of the date’s objectives, I should consider this one of its pivotal moments. As expected, thorough preparation is key to success.)","As Olivia was calming herself with such thoughts, Kaito picked up a canapé from his plate. Just as Olivia had done earlier, he extended it toward her, holding it gently with one hand.","[Then, since we're at it, let me return the favor. Here you go.]","For Kaito, this was a completely natural course of action. He had perfectly anticipated that the earnest Olivia, in her research about dates, might mistakenly believe that couples feeding each other food was a requirement and would go so far as to carry it out. Thus, his action was a supportive gesture to ensure the completion of her perceived goal.","However, there was one miscalculation———– Olivia herself had already declared the task \"complete\", meaning that her objective was, in her mind, already accomplished......","(......Eh? T- This is...... not part...... of the plan.)","Yes, while Olivia meticulously envisioned scenarios where she could devote herself to Kaito or do something for him...... the very idea of \"Kaito doing something for her\" was nearly absent from her thoughts.","After all, Kaito was the object of Olivia’s faith, someone to whom she dedicated her devotion entirely. She firmly believed that giving her all in service to him was her role.","(W- Why? H- Have I achieved some monumental feat? Not only am I receiving food meant for Miyama Kaito-sama, but I’m being directly fed by him? I- I can’t recall performing any deeds worthy of such a great reward...... C- Could this be a reward for organizing today’s date? But if that’s the case, isn’t the reward far too generous!? N- No, but with Miyama Kaito-sama already offering the food, I can’t afford to hesitate...... I can’t keep him waiting...... Ah, errr...... s- should I eat it?)","From Olivia’s perspective, it was an extraordinary reward that had seemingly appeared from an entirely unexpected direction. She nervously darted her gaze between the canapé and Kaito several times. Yet, seeing Kaito patiently holding out the food, she realized she couldn’t make him wait any longer. With great tension, she finally opened her mouth and accepted the offering. R","[Was it too much food at once?]","[N- Not at all. The taste is...... entirely different from when I ate it myself earlier. I can only marvel at how Miyama Kaito-sama’s touch elevates even food to a higher plane. Even the act of offering the food is so divine that I feel it deserves a sculpture in the Cathedral......]","[Ahaha, that’s quite an exaggeration, but I’m glad you enjoyed it.]","As Olivia descended into a state of overwhelmed praise, a mode she often shifted into when flustered, Kaito couldn’t help but smile wryly, finding the situation endearing.","(Ah...... He’s so radiant...... Is this...... happiness?)","Having just been fed and with their bodies now so close, Olivia couldn’t help but be captivated by Kaito’s gentle smile. Needless to say, for a few seconds, her mind once again drifted to another world.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Guh, t- that's quite the impact. Even though she herself doesn't recognize it as romantic feelings, Olivia is completely smitten with Kaito. From her perspective, you can feel how her overflowing affection is practically radiating.]"]},{"number":2117,"title":"Chapter 2117: Date with Kaori and Olivia 6","paragraphs":["While smiling fondly at Olivia, who was blushing and showing her joy so clearly that even from a distance it was easy to tell, Kaori was enjoying her own meal.","(Olivia-sama only gets flustered like that when she's with Kaito-kun. He really is amazing. But, well, Olivia-sama did manage to accomplish one of her goals, so that's good...... Ah, this canapé is delicious.)","Kaori had been a significant help in creating Olivia's date plans, so she was celebrating Olivia's success in reaching one of her goals. She also knew that there were still several goals Olivia had set beforehand.","For Olivia, who was experiencing her first date, Kaori was worried and cheering her on, knowing it would be difficult...... but at this point, Kaori thinks of this as someone else's issue. While she was participating in the date, her intention was to observe as a bystander.","However, that assumption was shattered by Olivia's words, which she spoke after recovering from her initial fluster.","[......Well then, next it's Mizuhara Kaori's turn.]","[Haeh!?]","Those words, which seemed completely natural to Olivia, were a complete surprise to Kaori.","[......Eh? Uh, Olivia-sama? Me...... too?]","[Yes, Mizuhara Kaori is also on a date with Miyama Kaito-sama after all.]","The important thing here is that Kaito plans to clear up the misunderstanding later, but at this moment, Olivia still hasn't realized the truth. She believes that feeding the other person during a date meal is a must.","Naturally, Olivia thinks that Kaori, who is also on a date, must do the same.","(W- What should I do? Me too? T- This would be that, isn't it? We'd be doing that \"ahhn\" thing, right? No, no, that's way too embarrassing...... B- But, well...... it's not like I don't have some desire to try something like that at least once, so maybe this situation is a chance?)","Kaori, who had been transported to another world during her prime years, had no experience in romance, having prioritized traveling and exploring the world over romantic matters.","But she does have a yearning for romance. She often reads romance magazines and watches plays...... And now, Olivia had already done it, so it was an easier situation for Kaori to follow.","And the person involved was Kaito, who, despite everything, was the one she was most interested in at the moment...... She didn’t feel any aversion to the idea of feeding each other during the date.","[W- Well then, since we're at it, if Kaito-kun is okay with it, may I...... do it too?]","[Yes, it's fine. Actually, I'm really happy about it.]","[Fghh, y- you really are......]","Although Kaori was internally feeling nervous and excited, she was desperately trying to maintain her composure as an older person, speaking calmly. Kaito, however, responded with a gentle smile, agreeing.","(Kuh, he’s so relaxed. This guy is really used to situations like this. Also, his face is closer than I thought...... U- Uuuu...... D*mn it, he's so cool.)","Kaori, who thought she was hiding her embarrassment, was the only one who believed she was managing it well. Her cheeks were red, and her gaze darted restlessly, but she still picked up a canapé and fed it to Kaito.","Though she didn’t lose herself like Olivia did, the close proximity of feeding him made her feel awkward and self-conscious.","[Thank you. Now, Kaori-san too, here you go.]","[Uuu, ah...... D- Don't mind if I do.]","Following the same pattern as with Olivia, Kaito offered her food, and Kaori, blushing even more, ate it.","(......I can’t taste it at all! Also, the way he's gently holding my chin so I don’t spill it is making me so nervous...... I mean, isn't this embarrassing!? But, well, it's also kind of making my heart skip a beat...... I want to act like the older one, but being led like this is kind of nice in its own way......)","She was surprised by the sudden development, and although it was embarrassing to do something she wasn’t used to, she was so nervous that she couldn’t even really taste the food.","Still, despite that, she didn’t mind the act itself. It was surprisingly pleasant...... almost making her feel a giddy sense of happiness.","(Hahh, seriously...... If he keeps doing things like this...... I’m gonna fall for him. No, maybe it's actually a bit too late for that already......)","With a mix of embarrassment and happiness, Kaori couldn’t help but smile wryly.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She had no romantic experience, and she feels more like a virgin with lots of knowledge about those kinds of stuff, but she's not as twisted as Alice. So this is an older girl who's a bit weak when it comes to romance huh...... Fuuu...... This is too much...... They're more affectionate than I expected......]"]},{"number":2118,"title":"Chapter 2118: Date with Kaori and Olivia 7","paragraphs":["At first, there was a small incident, though it was undoubtedly due to Olivia-san's misunderstanding, that led to us feeding each other bites of food. Other than that, the meal proceeded without issue.","Being a popular restaurant, all the dishes were delicious. The menu was vegetable-centric, giving it a healthy vibe that likely appeals to women. Just in case, I endured the embarrassment of informing her in advance that I disliked bell peppers, so no dishes containing them were served. I was able to enjoy the meal without any problems.","[So, by the way, what's the plan for after lunch?]","I don’t know much about today’s date plan. I’d heard we were going to enjoy some window shopping in the morning, but I don’t know the details for the afternoon.","I don’t think we’ll just continue shopping, so I’m guessing it’ll be something like watching a play or listening to music.","Olivia-san took the lead in planning this date, with Kaori-san giving her various pieces of advice. Naturally, Olivia-san has no prior dating experience, and from the way things have been so far, it doesn’t seem like Kaori-san has much experience in this area either.","With that in mind, I’m guessing we'll be sticking to some classic activities. Perhaps a play or music performance...... If there’s a notable sightseeing spot unique to this town, that could also be an option.","This town, with its red-brick architecture, would look great at sunset, so I imagine we’ll visit a scenic spot in the evening. Then, just as night falls, we’ll have dinner———— something like that?","[As for the plan, we’ll be watching a play in the afternoon.]","[I see, a play huh...... Is there something particularly notable showing right now?]","[Unn. A very popular theater troupe is performing in this town. There have been feature articles about them in magazines and such.]","[Hehh, that sounds exciting. It’s been a while since I’ve seen a play, so I’m looking forward to it. Do you often watch plays, Olivia-san?]","In this world, there are no movies. Well, they might emerge if image reflection magic tools become more widespread, but at the moment, such things don’t exist.","Plays and music performances are standard date activities. As Kaori-san mentioned, popular theater troupes are often heavily featured in magazines.","[I have watched theatrical performances, like the Creation Story during the Festival of Heroes. That one is held at the ceremony venue leading to the Cathedral...... Other than that, I haven’t seen much. However, the reference materials I consulted stated that appreciating a play is a classic date activity. When I consulted Mizuhara Kaori-san, she strongly recommended a romantic-themed play, so I decided on that.]","[Ah, no, I don’t think...... I recommended it that strongly...... Uh, well...... I do really like that kind of thing, so maybe I got a bit carried away in recommending it......]","Somehow, it feels like Kaori-san, much like Alice, seems to have a longing for classic romantic situations.","Unlike Alice, who makes it very obvious, there was a subtle happiness in Kaori-san's demeanor earlier when we fed each other food, as if she was thrilled to experience a scenario she had idealized.","Maybe that’s why she’s so fond of romantic plays and the like. As for me, when it comes to romantic plays...... the last one I saw was with Dr. Vier, wasn’t it? If it’s adventure-themed plays, I remember watching one with Shiro-san during Hydra Kingdom's Founding Festival.","[How about you, Kaori-san, do you often go to see plays?]","[H- Hmm...... That’s a tough question. I really love them, but going to those kinds of things alone feels a little awkward, so it’s only occasionally...... I once invited Akane-san to go with me, but she said, \"No way, I can’t stand romantic stuff, it makes me all itchy and uncomfortable\"......]","[Ah, that does sound like something she’d say.]","Akane-san is definitely that type. Even if she were on a date, it feels like she’d prefer a straightforward outing, like shopping or sightseeing, rather than the typical romantic scenarios.","As we continued talking about plays with Olivia-san and Kaori-san, I took a bite of the dessert that marked the end of our lunch.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Watching a play, that's certainly a classic but...... what kind of development are they aiming for? Normally, in this kind of situation, the cliché is for their hands to accidentally touch, causing a moment of heart-pounding tension. But they're already holding hands while walking around the city, so...... H- Hmm, I don't get it. Olivia gets flustered and embarrassed easily, but her boldness is incredible, so I feel like she might try something unexpected.] 𐍂�"]},{"number":2119,"title":"Chapter 2119: Date with Kaori and Olivia 8","paragraphs":["As they left the restaurant and moved toward the theater where the play would take place, Olivia was deep in thought.","(Though there were unexpected developments, I managed to fulfill the essential requirements for a date meal. Riding this momentum, I want to ensure I achieve the objectives during the upcoming play as well. However, the reference materials don’t mention what actions are necessary during a play. That said, there is this ambiguous expression, “creating a good atmosphere”, which indicates I need to make some kind of change. It seems this will test my insight. Surely, the all-seeing Shallow Vernal-sama foresaw that I would grow by overcoming this trial and instructed me to invite Miyama Kaito-sama on this date.)","Of course, none of this was true, but for Olivia, it was undeniable that this play was particularly challenging to simulate in advance.","Given the structure of watching a play, Olivia’s ability to take proactive actions was limited. She was focused on finding a way to create a good atmosphere without disrupting Kaito’s enjoyment of the performance.","(The reference materials mentioned holding hands during the play, but Miyama Kaito-sama and I are already holding hands. Therefore, that action is excluded...... But if so, what else can I do without interfering with Miyama Kaito-sama’s enjoyment of the play......? Ah! Could it be? Yes, that must be it......! The reference materials should have mentioned that there are stages to holding hands. Beyond the current way we’re holding hands, there’s the interlocked fingers style...... I- I see! This play is the perfect opportunity to move to that stage!)","If Kaito or Kaori could read minds, they might have thought “So this is what happens when you take earnestness to the extreme”.","However, no one could read Olivia’s thoughts, and while Kaito, who could sense emotions, noticed that Olivia’s concerns seemed resolved, he had no idea what she was planning to do.","(Mizuhara Kaori, can you hear me? You just need to think in your head to respond.)","(......Eh? W- What’s this? Suddenly Olivia-sama’s voice is echoing in my head...... Is this some kind of magic?)","(No, I can hardly use magic outside Friendship City, so this isn’t a magical conversation. It’s just that, as a gesture of gratitude for all you’ve done for me, I’ve given you something akin to the Gods' Blessing. By tracing that connection and resonating our magic wavelengths, I’m creating a state similar to how monsters communicate through magic wavelengths.)","(..................................Please wait right there, hold on. That’s a lot of information, and it’s all stuff about me that I didn’t even know! N- No, well, I’ll ask more about that later...... So, what’s the matter? If you’re talking to me this way, does it mean you don’t want Kaito-kun to overhear?)","Though there were countless points to retort, Kaori decided to put off verifying everything for now. Feeling a faint premonition of stomachache, she figured it was better to save it for later rather than suffer stomachache in the middle of the date.","(Yes, it’s about what actions we should take toward Miyama Kaito-sama during the upcoming play.)","(......I see?)","Kaori, with a somewhat indescribable expression at being included so naturally, decided to listen to Olivia’s story until the end. Olivia then explained the conclusion she had reached.","(......You're being too serious about this. Well, I suppose that's very much like Olivia-sama...... Errr, so basically, you’re talking about doing that, right? The so-called “lovers’ hand-holding”? That’s pretty embarrassing, though......)","(But it’s necessary for us to perfectly complete this date.)","(I- Is it? Do people usually go for lovers’ hand-holding so early on? Well, I mean, if you consider that dating an opposite gender implies a certain level of closeness, and if the scenario assumes a relationship they're more than friends but not yet lovers...... Maybe that’s plausible...... H- Hmmm. I curse my lack of romantic experience.)","While Kaori found several points in Olivia’s reasoning that could be questioned, she herself was not well-versed in matters of romance. Her knowledge was primarily based on romance fiction, many of which depicted bold advances in relationships. Thus, she concluded that lovers’ hand-holding wasn’t entirely out of the realm of possibility if they were already on a date.","Moreover, Kaori harbored a faint admiration for the idea of lovers’ hand-holding, which made her more receptive to the suggestion. With that, she and Olivia continued to discuss how they should act during the play.","However, the two had overlooked one major miscalculation. As Olivia had explained, their current method of communication resembled the wavelength-based telepathy used by monsters.","And so......","(......What do I do? I can hear everything they're saying......)","Yes, thanks to the effects of his Blessing, Kaito, who could perceive conversations carried through magic wavelengths, could hear their entire exchange. He was now stuck feeling an indescribable awkwardness.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [So, we’ve got two people with zero romance experience discussing their plans, while someone with plenty of romance experience is overhearing everything. But it feels awkward to butt into a conversation they think Kaito isn’t privy to......]","? ? ? : [Kaito-san can eavesdrop not only through magic wavelengths but also on telepathic conversations transmitted via magic, you know? But that’s only possible because of a combination of his Sympathy Magic and his Blessing. Unless someone’s within a close range, close enough to interact with the magic power Kaito-san unconsciously emits, he wouldn’t be able to overhear. Since they’re holding hands this time though, he can hear everything perfectly.]","Serious-senpai : [So does that mean Kaito could just turn off his Sympathy Magic and stop hearing them?]","? ? ? : [No, Kaito-san can adjust his Sympathy Magic to avoid reading emotions, but completely suppressing all external magic power, like Zwei-san does, is way too advanced for him. His magic power is still active around him. He’s just turned off the part that interprets emotions. But if there’s a sudden surge of strong emotions nearby, it’ll forcibly reactivate. So, while he can partially deactivate functions, Sympathy Magic itself would still be deployed. In this situation, it’s impossible for Kaito-san to consciously block them out.]"]},{"number":2120,"title":"Chapter 2120: Chapter 21ư0: Date with Kaori and Olivia 9","paragraphs":["Olivia, with her extremely serious personality, never neglects her preparations. For this play-appreciation outing, she has already looked up the performance time and secured the tickets, so there's no chance of arriving only to find that she cannot enter.","However, whether it's due to her personality or lack of experience, she hasn't adequately anticipated the changes in her mindset. In fact, she's been calm enough to have excluded the idea from her mind for now, but Olivia has spent the past 10 days strengthening her feelings of gratitude toward Kaito, which has made her feelings for him more intense than usual.","Up until now, Kaito has mostly taken the lead, and with the comfort of being guided by someone she considers above her, Olivia has regained her composure. However, the actions she plans to take during the play will be entirely led by Olivia, and since she only just arrived at this conclusion, she hasn't mentally simulated something like feeding each other.","(It's not difficult. While watching the play, I'll subtly intertwine my fingers with Kaito-sama's and.... intertwine fingers......press our skin together and intertwine our fingers? Isn't that no different from intercourse already?)","Olivia's thoughts freeze as she realizes this shocking truth. Of course, her thoughts have jumped to an extreme conclusion, but for someone as pure and innocent as Olivia, who is extremely shy about exposed skin, the idea of holding hands in such a way feels incredibly forward.","(- Isn't this incredibly shameless and rude? M- Miyama Kaito-sama might misunderstand me as a pervert... That would be a huge problem! But, the references I've consulted say that this kind of hand-holding is natural for couples..... natural.... but are Miyama Kaito-sama and I even a couple?)","Once Olivia's thoughts began to tilt in this direction, they quickly became more chaotic. As they walked toward the theater, she desperately tried to calm herself and regain composure.","(N- No, this is a trial given to me by the great Shallow Vernal-sama, and retreating now would be going against Shallow Vernal-sama's will. Fundamentally, since we're already holding hands and taking action together, I can assume that Miyama Kaito-sama is somewhat accepting of me. Of course, I'm still anxious...... but relying solely on Miyama Kaito-sama's guidance won't lead to growth! This is where I need to take the first step.... Surely, Shallow Vernal-sama anticipated this and gave me this trial.)","With her resolve burning inside, Olivia continued on, but Shallow Vernal, watching from the Sanctuary, just tilted her head in confusion. The thought \"Why that conclusion?\" came to her mind. It was a perfectly reasonable question, but since Shallow Vernal never addressed anyone other than Kaito, she merely overlooked the doubt and did not interfere with Olivia's decision.","As I walked toward the theater, holding hands with Olivia-san and Kaori-san, I was a little troubled about what to do. The reason was that I had overheard the private conversation between Olivia-san and Kaori-san earlier, which had been almost like the monsters' way of conversation through the magic wavelength, so I ended up hearing everything.","However, could I really interrupt their conversation, considering they were speaking under the premise that it was a secret from me? That would be difficult. If the content of their conversation had been problematic, I might have considered stepping in, but the content was actually rather endearing..... Olivia-san was trying hard to act like t was a date, and I found it a bit heartwarming.","As for holding hands in the way of lovers, we were already holding hands, so it wasn't that high of a hurdle. In fact, there was no problem with transitioning right away, but since Olivia-san was sending me such strong feelings of determination, it didn't feel right to make a move while she was trying her best.","So, the only thing I could do was pretend I didn't know, but.... I've always been told I wear my heart on my sleeves. Would I be able to hide it well enough?","At least, if we made it to the theater before the play started, the lights in the audience would dim, which would reduce the chance of my expressions being noticed.... but whether things would go smoothly until then was uncertain..... Maybe if I wore the Recognition Inhibition glasses that Shiro-san gave me, I could hide any changes in my expression?"]},{"number":2121,"title":"Chapter 2121: Date with Kaori and Olivia 10","paragraphs":["The theater we arrived at was another stylish red brick building, and the interior was spacious and clean. The décor had a retro feel to it, but I believe it was intentionally designed that way to give off that atmosphere.","There were also posters for the theater troupe performing this time, and there were quite a few people, so as Kaori-san said, it seemed like a popular troupe. I came here without knowing what performance we would be watching, but from the posters, it seemed like a story about the love between a Spirit and a human.","[This theater troupe is apparently making use of amazing magic effects.]","[Hehh, that sounds like something to look forward to then. I've seen a few performances with magic effects, and they always have so much more impact and presence compared to those without.]","[Unn, unn. They definitely has a different kind of intensity than in movies~~]","Receiving the tickets that Olivia-san had prepared in advance, we stood in line for entry while talking. At this point, I had let go of Kaori-san's hand and was holding the ticket with an open hand, while I was still holding hands with Olivia-san.","The reason for this is that, even in casual clothes that were different from her usual appearance, Olivia-san still had this sort of holy aura, like she had this unique presence that made people realize right away that she was the Founder. This had been the case even at Eris-san’s chocolate shop.","That’s when I remembered the Recognition Inhibition glasses that Shiro-san had given me a little while ago, thinking I might not be able to hide changes in my expression. If I wore them while holding hands, the magic would prevent Olivia-san from being recognized, so she wouldn't draw attention from the people around us.","[......My apologies. I didn’t consider the recognition inhibition until now.]","[No, I didn’t think of it either until just now. But if we keep holding hands like this, there’s no worry about Olivia-san getting noticed and attracting attention, so it's reassuring. Though, Olivia-san might find it a little inconvenient if we keep holding hands during entry......]","[N- No, that’s not the case at all! In fact, I feel that being able to feel the warmth of the great Miyama Kaito-sama’s hand is the greatest happiness, and if possible, I’d want to stay like this forever. There is no inconvenience at all.]","Olivia-san can’t use Recognition Inhibition Magic outside of Friendship City, and even though I thought of lending her the glasses, they were customized for my face size, so they’d be too big for Olivia-san. So, we decided to just continue holding hands.","(......Mizuhara Kaori, I’d like some advice...... When would be the appropriate time to carry out the thing we discussed?)","(Eh? Ehhh, you’re asking me? H- Hmm...... W- Well, I guess it should be when the atmosphere of the performance is really getting good, right?)","(I see...... And by \"atmosphere getting good\", what do you mean specifically?)","(S- Specifically!? E- Errr, maybe when the romance starts to progress......)","Kaori-san seemed a bit troubled by the question, but just like before, I could hear everything. I do plan to tell her later that I've been overhearing their conversation, but if I bring that up now, Olivia-san might panic, so I guess I’ll wait until we achieve Olivia-san’s goal first.","No, but come to think of it, maybe it’s a good thing I knew about this in advance. Transitioning from just holding hands to interlocking fingers might go smoothly if both parties are aware of it, but if only one person tries to initiate it, it could end up making things feel awkward......","Fortunately, it seems that neither Olivia-san nor Kaori-san have noticed from my expression that I can hear their conversation. They’re probably too nervous, focusing on timing and thinking about how to execute their plans.","With those thoughts in mind, we entered the theater and took our assigned seats. It looked like Olivia-san had managed to secure really great seats, offering a clear view of the stage.","We sat in the order of Olivia-san, me, and Kaori-san, and at this point, you could say everything was ready. From Olivia-san, I could sense an intense resolve that seemed to scream “This is the decisive battle” but...... isn’t she taking this a bit too seriously...... W- Well, for Olivia-san, initiating handholding with interlocked fingers might really feel like a battle of epic proportions.","W- Well, anyway, I hope I can respond in a way that supports her......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Now that he mentioned it, if she were to try transitioning from simply holding hands to interlocking fingers without Kaito realizing it, moving her hand might make him think she's trying to pull away. In that sense, maybe it's actually better that he knows about this......?] R̃"]},{"number":2122,"title":"Chapter 2122: Date with Kaori and Olivia 11","paragraphs":["As the play began, Kaori glanced sideways at Kaito, who was sitting next to her. Although the theater was dimly lit, the light from the stage illuminated his profile.","It seemed he was focused on the performance, showing no sign of noticing Kaori's gaze.","(......H- Hmm, w- why am I also gonna interlock fingers with him? No, I mean, I can’t deny that I’ve dreamed about it. I always wanted to try it at least once! I’ve been curious about how it feels———- if it’s different from holding hands normally. It’s just intellectual curiosity, really...... Yeah, definitely not about trying to relive some sweet, bittersweet high school experience I missed out on or anything...... Who am I even trying to convince......)","Before Kaori was transported to this world, her life had been weighed down by various misfortunes, leaving her unable to enjoy her youth. Even after arriving in this new world, she had been too preoccupied to think about romance.","However, now that she had found her footing emotionally and her restaurant was thriving, she found herself gradually turning her thoughts toward such matters.","At nearly 30, Kaori was growing increasingly conscious of her desire for romance, particularly longing for experiences she had missed————- those tinged with the sweet innocence of youth...... Holding hands with interlocked fingers fit perfectly into that category.","(Arehh? Thinking about it again, transitioning from holding hands like this to a lovers’ grip...... isn’t that a pretty big hurdle? Not because it’s embarrassing, but more like...... how do you communicate it? I mean, to go from just holding hands while sitting like this to a lovers’ hold would require moving my hand quite a bit, right? Wouldn’t I need Kaito-kun to cooperate for it to work? Sure, he’s experienced in romance...... but even so, would he just suddenly understand that I wanted to interlock fingers if I started fidgeting my hand?———- no, that’s impossible, right?)","Kaori’s concerns were entirely reasonable. However, given that Kaito had overheard her conversation with Olivia earlier, he might easily pick up on her intentions if she acted, but of course, Kaori had no way of knowing that.","(So, what should I do? ......Should I just use brute force to pry his fingers open? Or maybe, since Kaito-kun is such a popular guy, he’d pick up on my intentions through my hand movements? H- Hmm, I’ve never done this before, so I have no clue...... Ah, but I think I remember a friend with a boyfriend saying something back in school...... Errr, what was it again......)","As someone with hardly any experience in romance, Kaori struggled to figure out how to naturally transition to a lovers’ hold and tried to recall a conversation from long ago with her friends.","(Errr, I think it went something like...... “He suddenly tried to interlock fingers with me! It totally caught me off guard~~ His finger movements were a bit suggestive too~~ I mean, c’mon, couldn’t he have given me more of a heads-up? But, well, I guess being assertive is kind of attractive too!” ......Unn. That girl was definitely just bragging. She can explode for all I care...... Ugh, I dug up that memory with so much effort, and it’s totally useless now.)","In the end, all Kaori could recall was her friend’s endless gushing about her boyfriend, leaving her with no helpful insights for her current predicament.","(..........................Alright, whatever happens, happens! I’ll leave it to Kaito-kun! Please, somehow figure it out and make this work!!!)","In the end, Kaori abandoned any clever strategies and decided to go for it her own way. She trusted that Kaito, with his wealth of romantic experience...... would somehow manage to handle the situation smoothly. With a vague sense of “this should work”, she moved her hand, attempting to transition to a lovers’ hold.","To Kaori’s surprise, Kaito immediately responded, subtly parting his fingers to accommodate hers and effortlessly transitioning into the new hold.","(Did...... Did that work? I mean, it worked, right? That was so smooth...... I- Is this what it means to be a master at romance? ......That aside, wow...... t- this is, umm, a lot more intimate than I expected...... M- My heart’s pounding like crazy...... S- So, this is what it feels like huh. I- I think I kinda like it......)","With their fingers now interlocked, Kaori could feel Kaito’s warmth more intensely than before. Her face grew hot as she basked in the peculiar, floating sense of comfort the gesture brought.","(......Ah...... I told Olivia-sama we’d wait for a good moment, but I went and did it without thinking. B- But then again, if I’d waited, I probably would’ve chickened out, so it’s good I acted early...... Kaito-kun accepted it right away, didn’t he? Does that mean...... um...... at the very least, he doesn’t dislike holding hands with me like this? ......I can think of it that way, right? ......Ahaha...... Uwahh, I can feel the heat on my cheeks! I must be blushing like crazy right now. Thank goodness it’s dark in here.)","Relieved that the dim lighting of the audience seating likely concealed her flushed cheeks, Kaori stole another glance at Kaito’s side-profile, and with a hint of bashfulness in her face, she smiled.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [W- What!? It came from her...... Kuh, an unexpected attack from an unforeseen direction......]"]},{"number":2123,"title":"Chapter 2123: Date with Kaori and Olivia 12","paragraphs":["While Kaori took action early on, Olivia was deep in thought, watching the stage with an earnest expression on her face. It was true that Olivia had no experience with dating and was somewhat naive. However, she had an extremely earnest personality and had studied various reference materials about dating.","(Mizuhara Kaori said that scenes where the relationship progresses on stage are good moments described as having a nice atmosphere. The term \"nice atmosphere\" was too abstract and difficult to judge, but if we're talking about the progression of a relationship, even I, with my lack of experience, can understand it. Considering reference materials and so on, the progression in this kind of play can be understood as three stages: encounter, deepening friendship, and establishing a romantic relationship. In terms of encounter, it may be a bit forced to express it as \"relationship progression\", and in a story where romance is the focus, becoming a couple should be the climax...... but it would definitely be too late for that. So, it would seem that the stage of deepening friendship is the most appropriate timing. However, this stage has the broadest range......)","Due to her earnest nature, she was thoughtfully considering the right timing to transition to lovers' hold. Of course, while thinking this, she was still watching the play, and there was no issue with her understanding of the content.","The current play was still in the early stages, with a scene where the Tree Spirit, revered as the Guardian of a small village, meets a young man from the village.","(From the advice I got from Mizuhara Kaori and the reference materials...... When watching a romance story, what's important is empathy and emotional investment...... By looking for parts of the characters' situations that resonate with me, I can increase my empathy, and by considering the characters' emotions, I can invest myself emotionally and enjoy the story more deeply. In that case, in order to gauge the right timing, I need to first find the parts of this play that I can empathize with by comparing the story to my own circumstances.)","If Kaori, the person who gave this advice, were to hear this, she might think \"W-Wait, you're taking it too seriously!?\" but in any case, Olivia was completely earnest.","To find the most suitable timing for transitioning to lovers' hold, she was trying to understand the story more deeply.","(The young man takes the Spirit, who knows nothing about the outside world, out into the world, teaching her things she didn’t know...... This situation somewhat resembles mine. I was once ignorant of so many things, but Miyama Kaito-sama guided me, and thanks to him, my perspective has expanded far beyond what it was before. Now I realize just how narrow the world I lived in was...... How foolish I was to use faith and duty as excuses and be content with knowledge that lacked experience. I now understand that very well.)","Fortunately, the story being performed was one that Olivia could easily empathize with, and the comparison to her own situation was quickly successful.","The heroine, the Spirit, shared many similarities with Olivia’s own situation. The spirit, who also had a strong sense of duty to protect the village, had a rather stiff personality, making it easy for Olivia to emotionally invest in her.","(......I can see it now. The story, which began with their initial encounter, is now taking shape, and from here, the bond between them will gradually deepen. Afterward, some kind of trouble or difficulty will arise, and they will overcome it, ultimately becoming a couple. Of course, there’s the possibility of a tragic ending, but this play is from the theater company that Mizuhara Kaori strongly recommended, and I’ve heard that all of their performances end with a happy ending.)","Although Olivia was the one who ultimately decided which play to watch, Kaori, who loved romance stories, had a significant influence on the decision. Since Kaori was a staunch believer in happy endings, as Olivia had predicted, the story would ultimately have a happy conclusion where the young man and the spirit are united.","(So, the right timing for me to act would be...... after their bond has gradually deepened and they start to consciously think of each other as someone they care for. In that case, what's important is keenly observing the changes in the characters' emotions...... I’ll need to focus even more than before......)","Anyhow, Olivia seemed to have become earnestness itself, but whether she noticed it or not...... the heroine's situation, which was similar to her own, made it easy to emotionally invest in her...... Naturally, that made it so the thought \"What if I were in the same situation?\" arose.","If that were the case, as for who would she imagine as her romantic partner...... Because such imaginings popped in her mind, it was inevitable that the struggles she faced in her previous prayers might happen again.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Even though they're both noobs when it comes to love, her approach is just different from Alice...... Olivia feels like the type who would go straight to \"self-destruction\" with an earnest, determined look on her face......]","? ? ? : [She's the type who tends to put her own mental state aside, so only after she dives in would she probably realize what she's doing and feel embarrassed.]"]},{"number":2124,"title":"Chapter 2124: Date with Kaori and Olivia 13","paragraphs":["Olivia's analysis of the story was not mistaken, and the play was unfolding just as she had anticipated.","(As expected, the flow is just as I predicted. The two leave the village and head to the city, where they start to become conscious of each other. This is the scene where their relationship progresses, and it should be the best timing for me to act. Once I know the timing, all that's left is to intertwine fingers...... intertwine fingers...... with Miyama Kaito-sama......)","To begin with, Olivia found the idea of intertwining fingers and holding hands quite embarrassing up until this point. She had resolved to carry through with the date perfectly, strengthening her resolve, but that didn’t mean her embarrassment had disappeared.","When it came time to actually execute it, her embarrassment only grew stronger.","(W- When it comes time to act, I get flustered huh...... it’s just a slight change in the way we hold hands. Of course, the warmth of Miyama Kaito-sama’s hand, as radiant as the sun in the heavens as he is, is an overwhelming source of happiness for someone as inexperienced as I am, making it impossible to maintain my composure. Even now, as I try to remain as unaware as possible, the warmth from his hand seems to seep deep into my heart, and stray thoughts keep rising to the surface. This play scene feels almost like that...... like Miyama Kaito-sama and me——— w- wait, what am I thinking?!)","Perhaps feeling somewhat confused, Olivia found herself mentally superimposing herself and Kaito onto the play’s protagonist and heroine.","Once she started thinking that way, she couldn’t help but imagine herself and Kaito experiencing the same events as the characters in the story.","(I- Imagining something so impudent about Miyama Kaito-sama! How disgraceful of me to picture us as a couple! N- No, I admit that right now, Miyama Kaito-sama and I are on a date, and there are certain similarities. However, this date is nothing more than a trial decreed by the great Shallow Vernal-sama, and it’s not as if...... as if I harbor romantic feelings for Miyama Kaito-sama...... no, that's not something I can say definitively......)","Though she lacked experience, Olivia wasn’t completely oblivious to her own feelings. Her profound faith in Kaito often overshadowed her emotions, leaving her unable to fully recognize them.","Yet, even beyond that faith, she couldn’t entirely deny having feelings for Kaito, who had gently taken her hand and taught her so many things she hadn’t known before.","(A- Anyway, I mustn’t dwell on it. I need to focus solely on the goal of intertwining our fingers as planned. B- But, there’s the risk of surprising Miyama Kaito-sama with a sudden gesture, so maybe I should wait for a better moment...... N- No, I mustn’t hesitate here. Now is the best timing!)","For a brief moment, Olivia considered postponing her actions due to her embarrassment and hesitation. However, while she may have been shy, Olivia was also decisive when it came to taking action.","Suppressing the excuses bubbling up in her mind, she moved at what she deemed the optimal timing. Though her movements were clumsy and might not have conveyed her intentions clearly under normal circumstances...... Kaito, fortunately, was aware of her earlier conversation with Kaori and quickly understood her intent, adjusting their hands into a lover’s hold.","(......Ah, so this is...... this is...... what they call a lover’s hold...... W- What is this indescribable feeling welling up inside me...... My face is hot, and my cheeks are slacking? T- This won’t do. I must hold firm. I can’t show an unsightly appearance in front of Miyama Kaito-sama! Ah, but this...... this overwhelming happiness won’t subside. Calm down...... I have to calm down......)","Holding hands with intertwined fingers, as Olivia had imagined, allowed her to feel the warmth of Kaito's hand directly. This brought an indescribable sense of happiness, causing her cheeks to relax involuntarily.","While this feeling could be described as happiness, Olivia, inexperienced as she was, couldn’t fully grasp the emotions rising from deep within her heart. The rapid beating of her chest and the rising heat in her body left her bewildered.","She glanced at Kaito, and at that very moment, Kaito also turned to look at her, their eyes meeting. Though the audience seating was dimly lit, Olivia could still see Kaito’s gentle smile, and the pounding in her chest made her catch her breath.","(How divine and radiant...... That smile, with a brilliance capable of outshining the stage lights entirely, yet warm enough to envelop the hearts of those who see it, is truly worthy of being described as heavenly beauty. To be graced with such a smile from Miyama Kaito-sama, it’s only natural that my heart races. And the smooth movements of his fingers, every gesture Miyama Kaito-sama makes is so refined......)","And, as was typical when she became flustered, Olivia found herself endlessly praising Kaito in her mind while keeping her expression perfectly composed, all the while sinking deeper into a whirlpool of confusion.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Kuh, as expected, this one’s tough. She gets embarrassed, but still takes action. Just when you think she might hesitate and back off, she pushes through and goes for it......]"]},{"number":2125,"title":"Chapter 2125: Date with Kaori and Olivia 14","paragraphs":["As expected from a popular theater troupe's performance, it was truly magnificent. While the magical effects were quite flashy, the story was interesting, and the actors' performances were excellent.","Thanks to the preparation beforehand, the transition from holding hands normally to holding hands like a couple with Kaori-san and Olivia-san was smoothly accomplished, and I can confidently say the result was flawless.","[It was fun, wasn't it?]","[Unn! It was amazing! The ending was so happy, I’m really glad...... Well, let's talk more about that at the cafe we’re going to!]","As Kaori-san had mentioned earlier, we planned to discuss our impressions of the play at a cafe afterward. There was no issue with that; in fact, I was quite thirsty, so I fully supported going to the cafe.","The theater we went to had a stylish atmosphere, so it might have been expected...... but unlike a movie theater, they didn’t sell drinks or popcorn in the audience. The play was long, so while it was interesting, I felt thirsty and a little hungry.","......Well, even if drinks had been sold, it would have been difficult to drink with both of my hands held......","[B- But, you know, holding hands like this is kind of embarrassing. I mean, it feels nice....... like there's this sense of security, but once we go outside, it gets more embarrassing.]","[Do you want to go back to holding hands the way we did before?]","[Hmm...... Do you dislike it, Kaito-kun? If you're okay, I'd rather keep holding hands like this a little longer......]","[Yeah, I do feel a bit embarrassed, but more than that, I'm happy to be holding hands with Kaori-san, so there's no problem at all.]","[Fghh, y- you're being like that again......]","In fact, as Kaori-san said, holding hands like this feels a bit embarrassing, but more than that, I feel joy in walking alongside such wonderful women as Kaori-san and Olivia-san, holding their hands.","Well, there are some moments when it's a bit difficult to move around while holding hands, but with a little ingenuity, it’s manageable. If necessary, we can temporarily let go of hands, so there’s no problem at all.","However, there's one more issue. Olivia-san has been silent ever since we left the theater. We're holding hands and walking together, and she’s been gazing up at me, so it’s not like she was lost in thought but......","[......Errr, Olivia-san? Are you okay?]","[Yes...... Today, as always, Miyama Kaito-sama is so noble and divine. Just seeing you fills me with an overwhelming happiness that I can hardly contain. I am so fortunate to be walking by his side, holding your hand like this...... I feel immense gratitude and faith towards Miyama Kaito-sama. Miyama Kaito-sama's every step, even as we walk, is filled with celestial beauty, and the strength with which you walk, firmly stepping on the earth, is unmatched in its magnificence. To be spoken to by such a Miyama Kaito-sama...... I cannot express my gratitude enough...... After I return to the Cathedral, I will pray with boundless gratitude......]","[Olivia-san? Please calm down......]","[What is this...... Her expression is the same as usual, and her tone seems calm, but I can really feel how flustered Olivia-sama is. I’ve never seen her like this before.]","As Kaori-san said, Olivia-san is clearly flustered and has entered what I can only call a \"flattery overload mode\".","However, unlike the typical, more visibly flustered form of this mode, she’s gazing at my face as if entranced and speaking her compliments like she’s singing...... She could also be like this huh......","[......I wonder what's going on here? It's like she's listening to us but not really hearing anything, and she's just been praising Kaito-kun non-stop, like her mind is somewhere else.]","[Yeah, this is the first time I've seen her like this, so I don't really know what to do......]","[Fumu...... Oh, right! There was a scene like this in the play we just watched! Remember? The Spirit heroine was shouting about her worries and mission, and not listening to the protagonist at all...... Maybe we should try the solution from that scene?]","[......Wasn't that the scene where the protagonist hugged the heroine to calm her down?]","It seems like Kaori-san, still hyped up from the romance play, is suggesting that I hug Olivia-san to calm her down, just like in the scene we saw earlier.","H- Hmm? I'm not sure...... I think startling her to bring her back to reality might work, but hugging her might be a bit disrespectful to Olivia-san...... But at the same time, leaving things like this doesn't feel right either...... S- Should I just try it?","Though I feel a little carried away by the situation, guess I'll just try it...... if it doesn't work, we can figure something else out.","[Olivia-san, I'm sorry. Please excuse me for a moment.]","[Mighty and radiant Miyama Kaito-sama, there is no need for someone as diminutive and insignificant as me to be apologized to, you also need not to excuse yourself around me. For everything works as per Miyama Kaito-sama's will————- ! ? ! ? ! ? ! ? ! ? ! ?]","As I gently hugged Olivia-san, who had been murmuring calmly...... she froze completely, her eyes wide open as if time had stopped.","......Arehh? Did I make the situation worse?","<Afterword>","Makina : [You know, I really hold Olivia in high regard. She has this solid foundation of genuinely praising my beloved child, which gives me a sense of security when I watch her. With someone like her, I feel like I’d want to cheer for her relationship with my beloved child.]","Serious-senpai: [......So when she’s flustered, Olivia might be somewhat similar to when Makina goes into overdrive...... Well, with Olivia, I don’t sense any madness at all. It’s more like pure faith and affection, so the impression is pretty different from Makina’s rampages...... Also, in Olivia’s case, she’s at least listening to Kaito and responding. It’s just that while she’s responding, her mind seems to be somewhere else, so the conversation doesn’t really connect well......]"]},{"number":2126,"title":"Chapter 2126: Date with Kaori and Olivia 15","paragraphs":["The objective of stopping Olivia-san, who had been nervously showering me with praise like a broken speaker stuck on repeat, was certainly accomplished.","The mouth that had been endlessly pouring out words of admiration as if it knew no limits came to a complete halt. However, as a result, Olivia-san froze entirely, not even blinking.","[......Um, Kaori-san? She's stopped, yes, but...... she's too stopped———- she's frozen solid, isn't she?]","[Was the stimulus too strong...... Eh? I- Is a hug really that powerful? I just went with the mood from the play earlier and said it without thinking, but......]","[............................]","Olivia-san had stiffened as if time itself had stopped, and even waving a hand lightly in front of her face elicited no response. What do I do now? To make matters worse, we're in the middle of a street...... Thankfully, thanks to the Recognition Inhibition glasses, no one around seems to be paying attention to this bizarre situation. Still, I have to do something about Olivia-san......","[Olivia-san? I'm sorry about earlier...... A- Are you okay?]","[......I see a beautiful flower field. This place, wrapped in comforting warmth, must surely be a land of blessings...... I've never seen it in person, but yes, this must be my own Sanctuary.]","[Olivia-san!? Please snap out of it! There’s no flower field here!]","Apparently, the sudden hug had such a profound impact on Olivia-san that it sent her mind flying into an imaginary Sanctuary.","W- What do I do? This doesn't seem like something she'll recover from quickly......","Neither Kaito nor Kaori's desperate calls reached Olivia, whose mind remained adrift in a warm, blissful haze. At that moment, Olivia was certain...... \"This is a dream\"......","(Yes, there is no way that Miyama Kaito-sama would suddenly embrace me. Such a thing could only exist as a fleeting thought...... a shameful daydream that crossed my mind while watching the play...... No, such a notion is far too disgraceful. This must be a dream. Surely, I must have lost consciousness, overwhelmed by the joy of holding hands with Miyama Kaito-sama and watching the play together.)","The sudden hug from Kaito had entirely exceeded Olivia’s mental capacity, leading her to conclude that the entire sequence of events was merely a convenient dream she was having.","Although Olivia did not require sleep and never actually experienced it, she knew about dreams from books and other sources. Based on that knowledge, she decided this was one of those dreams.","(I am utterly ashamed of my immaturity, and I must sincerely apologize to Miyama Kaito-sama when I awaken. However, if this truly is the dream described in the texts, then no one will know what happens here, nor will I actually inconvenience Miyama Kaito-sama...... If that’s the case...... perhaps...... I can indulge in a few small, shameful desires?)","Lost in her airy, feverish thoughts, Olivia acted on impulse. She gently embraced Kaito and rubbed her cheek against him, seemingly fawning on him.","[Olivia-san!?]","Kaito’s startled voice reached her, but convinced she was dreaming, Olivia didn’t react. Instead, she closed her eyes and relaxed, a soft smile spreading across her face.","(......Miyama Kaito-sama’s scent, his warmth...... What happiness. Seriously, how foolish and shameless I am...... Ever since that time when Miyama Kaito-sama carried me on his back to the Hero’s Hill, I haven’t been able to let go of this absurd, indecent thought. I am meant to serve and dedicate myself to him, that is the proper way it should be...... And yet, foolishly, I harbor this utterly inappropriate desire to fawn upon Miyama Kaito-sama in this way.)","She had tried to forget by focusing on her prayers and overwriting her feelings with devotion, but she couldn’t erase the memory. It was from when they went to the Hero’s Hill, and Kaito had carried her on his back. She had felt a warmth that seemed to envelop her entirely...... a sense of security so comforting that she even found herself wishing it could last forever, a desire that Olivia, in her usual state, would deem something to reflect upon and discipline herself for.","(Such a shameless and irreverent act, devoid of any sense of shame...... something like this...... could only happen... in a dream...... wait? Can dreams...... really feel this vivid, with such clear warmth and sensations? Also, did I lose consciousness in the middle of the play? I’m certain I watched it until the very end...... A... rehh?)","Sadly, Olivia had merely been overwhelmed by the shock of the sudden hug, and as time passed, her dreamy, muddled thoughts began to clear.","[Olivia-san? Please, snap out of it!]","[......Eh? Ah...... Miyama Kaito-sama?]","As her thoughts gradually returned to normal, Olivia finally noticed Kaito looking at her with a worried expression. Her awareness fully returned at last.","(......Ahh...... I...... see...... so this wasn’t a dream...... and I...... just clung to Miyama Kaito-sama so suddenly......)","She swiftly pulled her hands away from Kaito’s back and stepped back. The exhilaration she had felt earlier vanished as if it had never existed, replaced by an icy realization. It felt as though all the blood in her body had drained away in an instant, leaving her cold and numb.","With her expression being one of utter despair, Olivia gazed at Kaito, feeling as though she was on the verge of losing consciousness again, but for an entirely different reason.","(......This...... This level of irreverence...... even if I were to undergo every existing method of execution one by one, would it even be enough to atone for such a transgression?)","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [W- What!? T- This guy actually went and did it...... Flirting even when her mind's all confused......]"]},{"number":2127,"title":"Chapter 2127: Date with Kaori and Olivia 16","paragraphs":["Now, what should I do in this situation...... To summarize what just happened: I called out to Olivia-san, who had frozen up, and suddenly, she unexpectedly hugged me. After a moment, she pulled away with a pale expression on her face.","I could understand that her actions were probably due to confusion in response to an unexpected situation. Maybe, with her mind still in disarray, she thought I hugged her, so she should return the gesture or something like that.","At the very least, it wasn't a calm, deliberate action. If it were, she wouldn’t have pulled away looking as if she’d lost all color.","I’m uncertain about how to address this, but there likely isn’t much time. Olivia-san could start apologizing in the next moment, or perhaps even go as far as prostrating herself. No, it would be better if it were just an apology, but considering Olivia-san's personality, it wouldn't be surprising if she tried to commit seppuku instead.","Hurry! I need to act before Olivia-san makes any move!","[U- Um, my apo————-]","[Olivia-san!]","[—–Hyihh!? W- What is it, Miyama Kaito-sama?]","It was close, but I managed to stop her from speaking by raising my voice. For now, I mustn’t give her any chance to speak.","At this point, Olivia-san must be feeling responsible for hugging me earlier, and she’s definitely thinking it was disrespectful or something along those lines.","[Thank you. You returned the hug the same way I did, didn't you?]","[Eh? N- No, I was......]","[Actually, I’m sorry for suddenly hugging you. I acted like that thinking it might help calm you down, since you seemed confused, but I ended up making things more confusing. Was it uncomfortable for you?]","[M- Miyama Kaito-sama hasn't done anything to apologize for! Besides, I would never find it uncomfortable to be hugged by you. On the contrary, I feel incredibly honored and happy......]","[Is that so? I’m glad to hear that...... I feel the same way. I was happy when you hugged me too, and although it was a bit of an impulsive act, maybe it turned out to be a good thing in the end.]","[......Eh? Ah, I- I see...... If that is what Miyama Kaito-sama says, then it must be true.]","Although I was being somewhat forceful, needing to rely on the influence my position seems to have in her mind, the fact that I hugged her first worked in my favor. We both hugged each other, and neither of us felt uncomfortable, so it was easy to conclude that there was no problem.","In any case, it’s better to keep things on my terms. Olivia-san tends to see my words as absolute, so if I firmly conclude that it was a positive experience for both of us, she likely won’t object.","[Also, we’re on a date right now, so it’s not unusual for us to hug each other. Didn’t you come across something like that in the books you’ve read?]","[I- Indeed, there were depictions of mutual embraces...... I always thought that sort of thing happened closer to the end of the story, but now that you mention it, there’s no reason it couldn’t happen at any other time......]","[Well, it was a bit of a spontaneous action, which was a bit of a mistake, but it doesn’t seem to have caused any problems...... How about we just say it was a good experience for both of us?]","[Ah, yes. If that's what Miyama Kaito-sama says, then I have no objections.]","......Alright, I pushed through. At least now that I’ve called it a \"good result\", she shouldn’t start saying it was disrespectful or a grave sin.","[......Miyama Kaito-sama also doesn't find it uncomfortable...... I’m so honored and happy...... T- These worldly thoughts again!?]","[Olivia-san?]","[M- My apologies. It’s nothing, really.]","[I see. Well, we’ve stopped walking, so let’s head to the café again.]","I called out to Olivia-san, who had a thoughtful expression, and she quickly reassured me, saying she was fine, then took my hand again, which I had let go of earlier.","She made sure to hold it properly, fingers intertwined, in a way that was almost too proper———– though she did have a faint blush on her cheeks, suggesting she was a bit embarrassed.","W- Well, in any case...... I’m really relieved that Olivia-san didn’t end up prostrating herself in public.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Umm, Kaito? That was practically like a pick-up line...... Honestly, if you’d added something like \"Let’s do it again\" at the end, Olivia would’ve probably nodded without a second thought...... Yep, the flag is fully set now......]"]},{"number":2128,"title":"Chapter 2128: Date with Kaori and Olivia 17","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","My colleague has been infected with the flu so my work schedule has been changed suddenly, so I'm sorry but there will be no updates tomorrow.","For the time being, Olivia-san seems to have regained a certain level of composure, so I thought we should resume moving toward the café we were headed to...... but Olivia-san had a contemplative look on her face.","[Olivia-san, is something the matter?]","[Ah, no, it wasn’t part of the plan but...... having the privilege of being embraced by Miyama Kaito-sama during a date was quite a significant event. However, in this case...... I thought that Mizuhara Kaori might also have the right to experience something similar. Of course, Miyama Kaito-sama’s will is the highest priority but......]","[Uehh!? Y- You're sparking things my way now!? Ehhh...... N- No, I mean, a hug is just too embarrassing...... I don't really have the courage...... Not that I'm saying I dislike it, but umm, it's really embarrassing......]","Kaori-san, suddenly being brought into the conversation, hurriedly responded with flustered words while glancing shyly in my direction.","Her actions were, to put it simply, adorable. From her reaction, it seemed like she didn’t dislike the idea of a hug but felt too embarrassed to go through with it.","If I had to guess, Olivia-san was suggesting that since Kaori-san was also part of the date, she should have a similar experience for fairness’ sake. It was likely a statement made out of consideration for Kaori-san’s feelings.","After all, she’d asked Kaori-san’s opinion even when it came to interlocking fingers earlier......","[Fumu...... I see. Indeed, this hug is clearly a higher-level act and something one would normally save for later. If done carelessly, there’s the risk of losing consciousness, as I nearly did. Perhaps we should save it for another opportunity? Miyama Kaito-sama, what do you think? If the occasion arises, would you embrace Mizuhara Kaori as well, just as you did for me?]","[Eh? Yes, if Kaori-san is okay with it......]","[......Arehh? It’s like we’ve already decided I’ll be hugged at some point later...... Uh, well, putting that aside...... Olivia-sama, was the hug really that amazing?]","Whether or not a hug is considered a high-level act aside, I suppose it does have a high level of physical closeness. Kaori-san, despite her embarrassment, seemed somewhat interested in the idea, possibly influenced by her love for romance stories.","[Yes, it truly is an entirely different experience from simply knowing about it intellectually. Mizuhara Kaori, I believe you also felt at least some impact when Miyama Kaito-sama interlocked fingers with you while holding hands. However, compared to that...... the warmth and all-encompassing sense of security of a hug were extraordinary.]","[Y- You're describing it to that extent...... H- Heehhh...... I see......]","Hearing Olivia-san passionately speak, Kaori-san looked at me with a deeply conflicted expression. She seemed intrigued by the idea of trying a hug after listening to Olivia-san, but at the same time, she was probably embarrassed about actually doing it.","[...Errr, would you like to try hugging?]","[......H- Hmm. I am interested. Honestly, I want to see what it feels like...... Besides, it’s even used as a greeting in the West, right? So, I kind of feel like trying it wouldn’t be a big deal, but...... i- it’s just too embarrassing to do it here!]","[Well, we are standing in the middle of a street.]","[Unn. That's why, umm...... I- I'll have that on reservation!]","[......Reservation?]","Tilting my head at Kaori-san’s sudden odd suggestion, I asked her for clarification, to which her slightly flushed face grew redder as she explained.","[Unn. I do want to try hugging, but it’s too embarrassing to do it here. So, maybe another time...... somewhere more private where there aren’t a lot of people watching...... Like, for instance, before I open my shop or someplace like that...... O- Of course, only if you’re okay with it, Kaito-kun. I’d just like to experience it for the sake of learning, that’s all......]","[Y- Yes, if Kaori-san's fine with that, I don’t mind. So, let’s save the hug for another opportunity and head to the café for now.]","[Yeah, let’s do that!]","I couldn’t help but let out a small laugh as I watched Kaori-san raise her energy and start walking, as if trying to cover up her embarrassment. Still, setting aside the awkwardness for now...... hugging Kaori-san in her shop before it opens sounds like it would paint quite the scenario...... W- Well, if she’s okay with it...... then I guess it’s fine?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A man and a woman hugging inside a shop before it opens...... Isn't that a tryst!!!?]"]},{"number":2129,"title":"Chapter 2129: Date with Kaori and Olivia 18","paragraphs":["I entered a stylish and calm café, sat at a table, and after confirming with the waiter, I placed a magic tool on the table and activated it.","[Kaito-kun, what’s that magical tool?]","[Oh, this is the portable version of the one used in Nifty. It creates a barrier within a certain range that obstructs recognition and prevents conversations from being overheard.]","[I see. Since Miyama Kaito-sama’s influence shines so brightly it could light up the heavens, it’s understandable that you would attract attention from the general public, so such countermeasures are necessary. By the way, I remember when we went out together before, we gathered quite a lot of attention...... it seems that Miyama Kaito-sama's greatness is something that can be felt just by walking around.]","......No, I’m pretty sure the attention was actually on Olivia-san, not me...... The reason I also took out the magic tool now was to ensure that the people around wouldn’t notice Olivia-san.","In the first place, Olivia-san does have this saint-like aura, but fundamentally, she’s an incredibly beautiful girl, and even without considering her status as the Founder or her sacred aura, she would draw people's attention.","[......Well, leaving that aside, were we supposed to talk about the impressions of the play?]","[Unn, unn! It was such a great play! The ending was just as expected, a happy one, and since the protagonist was a young man, it had that youthful feel to it...... How nice, I wonder where my youth went......]","When the topic of the play came up, Kaori-san’s eyes lit up as she began to speak. She really seems to love romance stories, and it must be exciting for her to talk about her impressions of it.","Talking about things you enjoy is really fun, and I totally get the feeling, as I often lose track of time talking with Sieg-san about pets.","[.....I’ve been wondering for a while now, but what exactly is this youth Mizuhara Kaori brings up so often?]","[Well, it’s kind of hard to explain...... but in the world where Kaori-san and I were, we used to call the period when you’re young, like in your teens, \"youth\". So in this case, I think it’s referring to youthful romantic feelings?]","[U- Unn. When I try to explain it again, it’s kind of difficult...... To Olivia-sama and others, I probably still seem like a child at my age, so it’s really hard to explain but...... I guess it's something like that?]","[I see. So couldn't you just experience that youth from now on?]","[H- Hmmm...... I guess my youth is still ahead of me? No, now that I think about it, that isn't necessarily impossible...... I think I just had this strong sense that youth is something for teens......]","This is a very tough question. After all, Olivia-san is over a thousand years old, and from her perspective, the difference between teens and people in their 20s is probably negligible.","It’s hard to explain youth in a way that Olivia-san can easily understand because, to be honest, even Kaori-san and I use the term somewhat loosely, so when asked \"What is the definition of youth?\", it’s hard to give a concrete answer.","[W- Well, um, I think it depends on your mindset, and I think it’s fine to interpret it in your own way. If I had to say, it’s like a time of youth, immaturity, and emotional sensitivity?]","[I see. I appreciate your teachings. So, it seems like the definition is somewhat vague. There are also sacred texts that leave certain things open to interpretation, so I understand.]","Unn, I think she’s misunderstanding a bit. Sacred texts would refer to holy scriptures, so there might be a small misconception, but explaining that accurately is difficult, and since Olivia-san seems to understand, I’ll leave it at that.","[By the way, holding hands like we did in the play felt pretty youthful too, don’t you think? But Kaito-kun, you’re really amazing. Honestly, I was wondering if we could smoothly transition from holding hands to that, but it went so smoothly...... I guess it’s probably just a matter of getting used to it?]","[Ah, well, about that, I was planning to mention it at some point but...... I’m sorry. I overheard your conversation on the way to the theater.]","The topic Kaori-san brought up was something I had planned to bring up at some point, so in a way, this would be a good time to do that.","[Eeehhhhh?! Kaito-kun, you were listening to that?!]","[Yes, thanks to Shiro-san's blessing, it seems I can pick up on magical wavelengths like that. I couldn’t find a good moment to bring it up, so I ended up eavesdropping, sorry about that.]","[K- Know you heard that makes it pretty embarrassing...... But I totally understand why it would be hard to bring it up in that situation! If you'd told me you could hear it back then, I probably would’ve panicked and messed it up...... So, in that sense, it might have been better? But, still, it's kind of embarrassing...... Wait, Olivia-sama, you're calm though?]","Hearing Kaori-san’s words, I turned to look at Olivia-san, and indeed, she seemed as calm as ever, with a faint smile on her face, showing no sign of being flustered.","[......Yes. In front of Miyama Kaito-sama, who possesses wisdom that sees through all things, it would be foolish to think that anything could remain hidden. I am ashamed of my own foolishness, but upon further reflection, there is nothing to hide from the great Miyama Kaito-sama. I should have explained everything from the beginning and hoped to receive your sun-like compassion. To witness the wisdom of Miyama Kaito-sama in person, how remarkable it is...... the brilliance of the intelligence reflected in your eyes seems to pierce through the three realms......]","[......I think my understanding of Olivia-sama has increased quite a lot today...... I mean, her face is as calm as usual, but she’s totally panicking and confused, right?]","[......I think so.]","While she looked calm on the surface, it was clear that Olivia-san had entered praise mode, and there was no doubt she was flustered.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It was repeatedly mentioned before how her expression doesn't change much, but I feel like Olivia's emotional shifts are actually pretty easy to read.]"]},{"number":2130,"title":"Chapter 2130: Date with Kaori and Olivia 19","paragraphs":["It took a little time for Olivia-san to regain her composure, but compared to the confusion from earlier, it was at a level where there was no problem at all, and the conversation about the play's impressions resumed quickly.","As expected, Kaori-san took the lead in the conversation, and it was easy for me to follow along with the topics she brought up.","[That confession scene was amazing too! \"Please sing only for me......\" That’s definitely the kind of confession you'd expect in a love story involving Spirits, something related to singing. It’s a classic, but that’s what gives it stability and makes it so great......]","[......A confession involving singing when it comes to Spirits? That’s the first time I’ve heard of such a thing. I’ve heard that Spirits give a golden fruit created with their own magic power when they marry but...... no, Godism handles marriage ceremonies, and I’m not involved in matters of courtship, so I may just not be familiar with it.]","[Eh? Really? Well, I don’t know any Spirit personally, and it’s just knowledge from books...... but in love stories involving Spirits, confessions involving singing seem to be a staple. It’s common for someone to sing a love song to express their feelings, or conversely, to ask a Spirit to sing for them. There are a lot of stories like that.]","This was quite timely———- just a little while ago, I heard a similar topic from Jutia-san. It seems that Kaori-san’s knowledge comes mostly from romance novels and plays. On the other hand, Olivia-san seems to have read up on various things for the date, but she probably thought that romance stories involving Spirits didn’t really apply to the kind of date they were having.","In fact, I’m sure Olivia-san studied romance stories about humans as reference materials, so it’s not surprising that she doesn’t know the typical themes in romance stories about Spirits.","[I actually just learned about this recently myself...... In reality, as Olivia-san said, there aren’t really any confessions involving singing from Spirits. In fact, it seems that love stories involving Spirits are pretty rare in general. But since singing is something special for them, it seems like confessions involving singing became a staple in creative works related to them.]","[Hehh~~ Really? Well, I can see how it would look great in a story, but if someone were to say \"sing for me~~\" in real life, it would seem kind of strange, right?]","[As expected of Miyama Kaito-sama, you're well-versed in such matters. Under the light of wisdom, my own understanding has expanded.]","Kaori-san spoke with admiration, and Olivia-san spoke with emotion...... It felt like their reactions were a clear reflection of their personalities.","We stepped out of the café and began walking through the streets again. Although we had been talking for quite a while, it was still far from evening, so I wonder where we would go next?","[Where are we going next?]","[We’ve already had lunch and gone to a café, so I thought food might be fine for now. From here on, we’re planning to focus more on sightseeing. We discussed a few options for places, and in the end, Olivia-sama should have made the final decision......]","[Yes. I did consider a few options, but since we seem to have some time, I’ve decided we’ll head toward the canal-themed tourist area to the southwest of the city. There, we can take a boat and view the buildings lined along the waterways, which focus on the scenery.]","That sounds really nice. The idea of viewing the city with its many red brick buildings while drifting along the waterway on a boat gives off a really pleasant vibe just from imagining it.","As Kaori-san said, we had been relatively active so far with shopping in the morning, followed by a play and a café in the afternoon. So, it seemed like a great idea to relax and enjoy the scenery while gently swaying on a boat.","[That sounds fun. By the way, back when I went out with Olivia-san before, we rode a boat together, didn’t we?]","[Yes. I apologize for the trouble I caused you back then, Miyama Kaito-sama...... This time, I’ve learned from that experience and made sure to book a boat with autopilot.]","[I see. Thank you for thinking of that.]","[Y- Yesh...... I- I’m not worthy of such kind words......]","[Olivia-san?]","[It’s nothing! J- Just having some worldly thoughts......]","For some reason, Olivia-san seemed a bit flustered, but since she said it wasn’t a problem, I didn’t press the matter.","But what was it? It felt like, just for a moment, the grip of Olivia-san’s hand holding mine had become a bit stronger.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Ohhh, what's going on here? Sweetness Meister Serious-senpai, explanations, please!]","Serious-senpai : [Well, this is a situation where, until just a little while ago, Olivia was really flustered, but now that she’s calmed down, she’s suddenly more aware of Kaito and is getting nervous about an unexpected smile. In the first place, Olivia’s gratitude toward Kaito has grown so much that she’s become even more of a mess when it comes to romantic feelings for him. This reaction is inevitable...... It’s just that up until now, due to the confusion of the situation, it hasn’t been showing up much...... But since the upcoming events will give us a bit of time before heading to a nice view in the evening, she’s probably a bit more relaxed now...... Wait, who the heck is the Sweetness Meister!?]"]},{"number":2131,"title":"Chapter 2131: Date with Kaori and Olivia 20","paragraphs":["As Olivia-san guided us through the city, I noticed the scenery gradually changing. Up until now, the area had the vibe of a stylish shopping district with red-brick buildings, but now canals were starting to appear here and there, and the architecture was becoming more distinctive in design.","[This part of the city really has a different atmosphere, doesn’t it?]","[The stylish aura here is incredible...... Oh, Olivia-sama, isn’t that the boat we’ll be riding?]","[It seems so.]","At Kaori-san’s words, I turned my attention to the canal. Sure enough, there were boats with a design that matched the kind you’d picture when imagining a city of water. They were lined up along the water, and there was a fair number of tourists around.","According to Olivia-san, the boats are apparently self-navigating, so there’s no need to worry about collisions despite their numbers. Or perhaps they set off at staggered intervals to avoid accidents. Thinking about it like that, it felt a bit like an amusement park attraction.","[There seem to be various types of boats. The sizes don’t look all that different, but the seating arrangements might vary?]","[From my research, it appears there are several courses available, and the boat designs differ depending on the course. For this trip, I selected the Date Course.]","[......The Date Course?]","[Yes. There were options like a sightseeing course and a tour course, but the Date Course seemed most suitable for our purpose, so I chose it.]","[......I see.]","This is just my assumption without any real evidence but...... if they’ve gone out of their way to call it a Date Course and even designed a special boat for it, I imagine it’s intended for couples or married pairs to ride together.","And since the boats are self-navigating, there’s no need to use oars or worry about steering. With that in mind, they probably have more freedom in designing the seating...... Could it be that the seating is designed for people to sit quite close together?","[Olivia-san, I have a question. About the Date Course...... Is there a specified number of passengers?]","[Yes. You’re required to specify the number of passengers and their species in advance, so I registered us three.]","In this world, going on a date with three people is perfectly normal. Plus, with magic, it’s no surprise if the boat’s size or seating arrangement adjusts based on the number of passengers. They even ask for species information......","No, well, even so, it’s probably just a side-by-side seating arrangement...... In that case, it’s not much different from the seating at the theater, so it shouldn’t be a problem. Right?","I found myself slightly exasperated with my earlier thoughts when I realized, upon reaching the docking area, that things weren’t quite as I had imagined.","Since we had made a reservation beforehand, the procedures didn’t take much time, and we were quickly guided to our boat. As expected, the boats departed at intervals to avoid collisions.","By chance, the group before us had also chosen the Date Course. Coincidentally, they consisted of one man and two women, just like us.","The boat for the Date Course had a single, long bench for seating...... Sitting three people meant we would be quite close to each other...... close enough that our shoulders would definitely touch.","......As I thought, this setup seems designed with a certain level of intimacy in mind. The group before us demonstrated this, with the man sitting in the middle and embracing the two women on either side as they set off.","[......A- Are we supposed to...... ride the boat like that?]","[I wonder? I don’t think it’s necessary to go as far as putting your hand around your partner, but the seat does seem just barely big enough for three people.]","[This is definitely designed with close contact in mind, isn’t it?]","[Well, it is a Date Course after all, so it’s probably aimed at lovers or married couples.]","In our case, since Olivia-san is petite, there might be a bit more room, but even so, it’s clear that three people sitting together would still be fairly close.","[M- M- M- My apologies. I- I- I- I didn’t anticipate they'd have this kind of arrangement...... I may have caused discomfort to Miyama Kaito-sama......]","[No, not at all. You don’t need to worry about that. Rather, are you and Kaori-san okay with this?]","[There’s no way I would find this unpleasant!]","[Then it’s fine. Don’t worry about it.]","Still, if I were to hesitate or back out here, Olivia-san might feel responsible and even suggest something drastic like standing for the entire ride. So, I decided to push forward and assure her that everything was fine.","I glanced at Kaori-san, who smiled wryly and gave a nod, indicating that she had no objections.","......Well, if there’s one issue, it’s the sign placed in a spot that’s directly in my line of sight when seated which reads \"We recommend sitting with an arm around your partner\"...... W- What do I do?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [If you act like you're fine, you'll end up self-destructing, Olivia......]"]},{"number":2132,"title":"Chapter 2132: Date with Kaori and Olivia 21","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I wanted to include Olivia's perspective as well, but there wasn't enough time, so I decided to postpone it for the next chapter.","Sitting on the gondola seat and gazing at the words in front of her, Kaori quietly let her thoughts wander.","(H- Hmmm, I- I see, so that's how it is. Wait, wait, wait! Isn't this kind of turning into a pretty intense situation?)","No, the peaceful part only lasted for a moment before her thoughts quickly descended into panic. Still, perhaps thanks to having a decent tolerance for panic situations, her thoughts didn’t become entirely incoherent, nor did her mind drift away completely. Instead, she continued to process the current situation.","(T-This is totally what couples or spouses do, right? Ah, well, it is a Date Course, so I guess that makes sense...... But then again, if a pair like a sweet \"more than friends, less than lovers\" kind of couple rode this gondola and saw a message like the one in front of me, could it maybe give them an excuse to progress their relationship? Like, \"It says it's recommended~~\" or something?)","Right in front of the seat, positioned subtly enough to catch the eye without being too pushy, were words suggesting they should embrace each other's shoulders...... Naturally, her thoughts focused on the act of putting an arm around the shoulders.","(I mean, this gondola really has an incredible level of closeness...... Compared to our seats during the play, which at least had armrests, this feels way closer. I can definitely see how it makes it easier to shift into a shoulder-hugging posture, but...... N- No! As expected, putting an arm around the shoulders is way too advanced and embarrassing!)","To begin with, Kaori wasn’t even dating Kaito. Their current date was the result of some inexplicable series of events, and they were nothing more than friends from the same homeworld. At most, he was someone she found slightly more appealing than other guys, someone whose personality and traits aligned with her tastes in many ways. He was also someone who made her heart race every now and then, someone with whom she felt comfortable enough to allow some minor, closer-than-friends actions. But still, he was just a friend.","They're not even in that sweet \"more than friends, less than lovers\" type of relationship. Just friends. Well, he's a friend she thought was \"a bit nice\". If Kaito were to confess to her now, she'd probably deliberate on it for a while before barely nodding in agreement. Perhaps, the same amount of deliberation she'd have when choosing between beef curry and chicken curry.","(......Well, I won’t deny that there’s something appealing about the scenario of enjoying a beautiful view while having an arm around my shoulders. It feels like it’d be easier than something like a hug. And since it’s Kaito-kun, I wouldn’t necessarily dislike it. So, hypothetically, if Kaito-kun followed the message in front of us and put his arm around my shoulders...... Well, it can’t be helped, right? I mean, it’s written there, so it wouldn’t be surprising if Kaito-kun ended up doing that. As the older one here, I should accept it with grace rather than scolding him.)","Kaori started justifying herself in her mind, though it wasn’t clear to whom. She didn’t dislike the idea of having an arm around her shoulders. The lingering excitement from the earlier conversation about hugs still lingered, and as long as she ignored the embarrassment, she realized she wasn’t entirely against it.","(But, if we actually talked about it, I’d probably refuse out of sheer embarrassment. So, if he really plans to follow the \"recommendation\", I’d prefer he'd just do it without any weird confirmations———- just boldly go for it. I usually like to act like the mature one, but once in a while, being led by someone assertive doesn’t sound so bad. Yeah. I’ll leave it to Kaito-kun’s judgment! If he puts his arm around me, well, it can’t be helped. Kaito-kun has way more experience in romance than me, so if he reads the recommendation and acts on it, that must mean it’s the best choice...... In that case, I’ll just enjoy the moment of having my shoulders embraced by a handsome younger guy. On the other hand, if Kaito-kun doesn’t move or asks \"What should we do?\", then I’ll just treat this as a chance to enjoy the scenery as is. Either way, it’s a win-win for me!)","Kaori ultimately decided to adopt a waiting stance. With her lack of romantic experience, she figured panicking and acting impulsively would only lead to bad outcomes, so she concluded that leaving the decision to Kaito was the best option.","In the first place, Kaori is quite fond of Kaito, finding him to be a highly appealing member of the opposite sex...... She wouldn’t mind something as simple as having her shoulders embraced.","The real issue was that proposing such an act to her or setting it up in advance was far too embarrassing...... So, after resolving to let things flow naturally, Kaori calmed her previously chaotic thoughts and began to enjoy the view.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She hadn't fallen yet? What are you talking about, hasn't he basically already completed this route already!?]"]},{"number":2133,"title":"Chapter 2133: Date with Kaori and Olivia 22","paragraphs":["At the moment when Kaori was deep in thought, Olivia was also struggling with the words before her.","(......What should I do about this? At the very least, this is an unexpected situation that I hadn't anticipated. Since we are taking a boat to enjoy the scenery, I had assumed it would be similar to the boat ride I had with Miyama Kaito-sama before, but this format is completely different. I realize how inexperienced I am.)","Olivia was the type to act after thoroughly planning in advance, which could be inferred from the heavy planning document she had shown Kaori.","She had also researched and made reservations for this sightseeing boat trip...... but the only miscalculation was that the boat for the date course was different from the usual ones.","(As for the act of putting an arm around the partner's shoulder, I have knowledge of it from reference materials...... but it wasn't included in the plan for this date. Physical contact like putting an arm around the shoulder or hugging is something that develops after several dates, and I judged it wouldn't be something to do on the first date. Even if I were to include it, it would likely be during the later part of the date when we watch the sunset at a scenic spot.)","The hand-holding from the play wasn't something she had originally planned for either, but she had considered it might be appropriate to do if the opportunity arose, and thus had somewhat prepared for it in her mind.","However, this situation was unexpected for Olivia, and she was unsure how to act.","(There's no meaning in ranking the actions, but if I were to focus only on physical contact, it seems putting an arm around the shoulder would be less than a hug...... right? However, it would still undoubtedly be too much of a stimulus for me, given my lack of experience. After all, I was embarrassed when I hugged, and if Miyama Kaito-sama were to pull me in by my shoulder again, I would undoubtedly make a fool of myself...... No, of course, I don't have an aversion to it. If Miyama Kaito-sama were to pull me in by the shoulder...... pull me in...... T- These worldly thoughts again...... Calm down, there's no reason to make a fool of myself just from imagining it.)","The issue itself of putting an arm around the shoulder was something Olivia would readily accept if Kaito desired it. She would undoubtedly feel happy if that were to happen. Of course, there was a possibility she could lose herself like when she was hugged, but refusal was out of the question.","(......No, wouldn't worrying about this perhaps a mistake in itself? The decision of what action to take lies with Miyama Kaito-sama. If he deems putting his arm around my shoulder to be appropriate, then that is the right choice, and if he decides that it’s not the time, then so it shall be. My opinion has no place in this matter. In that case, what I should do is accept the conclusion Kaito-sama reaches......)","Ironically, Olivia reached a similar conclusion to Kaori’s. The decision of whether to put his arm around her shoulder was up to Kaito, and she would just wait for that decision...... This was not a defensive retreat where she was simply passing the responsibility to Kaito. It was a stance of waiting based on her absolute faith in Kaito, a form of proactive defense.","With this in mind, Olivia decided to wait for Kaito’s decision.","(......No, that's not it. The decision ultimately belongs to Miyama Kaito-sama, and I’ve decided not to interject my own opinions. The faint feeling of anticipation in my heart is such a shameful and foolish thought. To even think of hoping in my heart to have my shoulder embraced...... to think of such a thing...... No matter how private my mind is to me, I cannot entertain falsehoods involving Miyama Kaito-sama. So, I won’t deny that such feelings exist, however faint. I’ll address this weakness through later self-discipline. For now, I’ll wait quietly for Miyama Kaito-sama’s decision.)","Thus, with both Kaori and Olivia adopting a waiting stance, the decision of whether or not to embrace their shoulders was inevitably left to Kaito.","And as for Kaito, who now carried the responsibility...... he was, unsurprisingly, a bit troubled himself.","(......Eh? W- What should I do? Honestly, I thought putting my arm around their shoulders just because it was written there was way too much, so I planned to ignore it...... But now, I’m getting these faint feelings of expectation from Olivia-san and Kaori-san....... Eh? Does this mean I should do it?)","Yes, when Kaito initially read the recommended suggestion written in the guide, he thought it was ridiculous. After all, he wasn’t even romantically involved with the two of them, and there was a good chance that Olivia might become flustered like earlier. So, he decided to simply enjoy the scenery as planned.","However, Kaito's Sympathy Magic...... picked up faint feelings of anticipation from Kaori and Olivia, leaving him uncertain about how to proceed.","If the emotions he sensed had been strong and unmistakable, the decision might have been easier to make. But the expectations he perceived were subtle——— small, yet undeniably present. As a result, Kaito found himself troubled, unsure of what course of action to take.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Wait, Kaito! That's way too soon! Stay, stay there, boy!!!]","? ? ? : [If Serious-senpai is saying that then......]","Serious-senpai : [Could you not make such terrible conjectures?!]"]},{"number":2134,"title":"Chapter 2134: Date with Kaori and Olivia 23","paragraphs":["Kaito is certainly more experienced in romance compared to Olivia or Kaori, having even embraced his lovers before. However, wrapping his arms around two women simultaneously, neither of whom is his lover, was a first for him. He hesitated over whether or not to act.","(H- Hmmm. Neither Olivia-san nor Kaori-san is saying anything. There’s no way they didn’t see those words, and I can feel their nervousness coming through...... so, probably, they’re leaving this up to me to decide? ......Doesn’t that basically mean they’re signaling me to just do it? No, but if I’m wrong, this is going to be beyond awkward, and the atmosphere will turn awful.)","Kaito could only sense emotions, not read the surface-level thoughts of others like Lillie could. Currently, both Olivia and Kaori emanate a mix of nervousness, hesitation, and anticipation. The jumble of emotions transmitted through Sympathy Magic made it difficult for Kaito to gauge the right course of action.","(Besides, hugging both of them at once like this, wouldn’t that make for a pretty bizarre sight? Like one of those suspicious stock photos you’d see in ads for shady self-help materials. N- No, but still, this silence is unbearable...... I’ll have to do something about it myself.)","Both Olivia and Kaori remained silent, waiting, as an uneasy tension hung in the air. It was clear that the situation wouldn’t resolve unless Kaito took the initiative.","After agonizing over the matter for a while, Kaito steeled himself.","(......Unn. There’s no other choice but to go for it. They’re probably expecting me to act, and asking “Can I hug you?” here would just ruin the moment. Let's do this...... If I misread the situation and they weren’t expecting this, I’ll apologize as sincerely as I can later.)","Resolving himself, Kaito slowly moved his hands and placed them gently on Olivia’s and Kaori’s shoulders. Both of them flinched slightly at the touch, but neither resisted nor said anything in protest.","Judging from their reactions, Kaito decided it was okay and applied a bit more pressure, pulling them closer. Olivia and Kaori leaned lightly against him, accepting the gesture.","(T- This is so nerve-wracking...... Our physical distance is only a bit closer than before, but it feels ridiculously intimate now. There’s a lovely scent coming from both sides, and the softness and warmth I can feel through my hands......)","Though he had braced himself to act, Kaito’s face turned faintly red at the sudden closeness. Had they been his lovers, he might have been able to justify the situation as natural, but since neither Olivia nor Kaori was his lover, the tension created by the embrace was intense.","Of course, Kaito wasn’t the only one feeling overwhelmed......","(H- Hwaahhh...... Y- You really did it, Kaito-kun. To be honest, I was kind of hoping for this but...... wow, this feels nice...... It’s making my heart race——— it’s so sweet and feels like such a youthful, romantic moment...... If I let my guard down, I might end up grinning like an idiot. It’s so embarrassing I can’t even bring myself to look at Kaito-kun’s face...... But still, I like this feeling. It’s comforting somehow...... W- Well, what’s done is done, so I might as well enjoy this for a little while.)","Kaori, though initially flustered by being pulled closer, quickly regained her composure thanks to her naturally adaptable personality. She decided to enjoy the situation of being embraced by Kaito.","Resting her body against Kaito's, she felt his warmth. While her cheeks were tinged with red, she gazed at the passing scenery with a soft, happy smile.","In contrast to Kaori, Olivia’s outward expression showed almost no change———- or rather, she was completely frozen. As usual, her mind was in a state of utter panic.","(......The sensation of Miyama Kaito-sama's strong, powerful hands on my shoulders, his firm embrace, it all evokes the image of a hero from legendary tales. The warmth he exudes feels like the sun's gentle embrace, and yet, as I bask in it, my heart burns as though consumed by flames. In the first place, do I even deserve such a reward? Everything today seems to be unfolding far too conveniently in my favor. The blessings bestowed upon me by Miyama Kaito-sama feel far too great compared to my own actions. While I feel a deep sense of unworthiness, I am also reminded once again of Miyama Kaito-sama's boundless compassion and grandeur. Even in this gesture of pulling me close, he first placed his hand on my shoulder, paused briefly to gauge my reaction, and only then embraced me. This thoughtfulness and kindness nearly bring me to tears of gratitude. In the first place, Miyama Kaito-sama is an existence far above me, so he does not need permission for anything he wishes to do to me...... I intend to accept everything about Miyama Kaito-sama, and if he were to ask something of me, it would be my please———- no, with utmost devotion, I would fulfill his every request without reservation. I would serve him with the same dedication as a lover, as a spouse, wholeheartedly devoted to Miyama Kaito-sama...... Me and Miyama Kaito-sama as lovers...... That would be quite the happiness. I am inexperienced, and I am sure there will be many times, like today, when Miyama Kaito-sama will guide me. Yet, Miyama Kaito-sama will gently smile and take my hand, and while I may feel ashamed of my own inadequacies, I would take his hand with even greater joy than shame———– ! ? ! ? What kind of shameless fantasies am I indulging in!? Even if it's only in my imagination, this is far too disrespectful! Not only have I conjured up my own desires, but I've also presumptuously decided Miyama Kaito-sama's actions in my mind——— such an unforgivable act requires deep self-reflection...... Ah, but even so, the supreme warmth of Miyama Kaito-sama’s exalted presence as I lean against him feels so overwhelmingly blissful that it threatens to melt all my thoughts...... N- No, first, I must properly reflect on myself......)","Though Olivia's expression remained relatively composed, her mind was in complete chaos———– a remarkably skillful form of confusion. Yet, despite everything, being held close by Kaito seemed to bring her happiness, as her slightly flushed face showed a faint, gentle smile.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ghaak!? W- What...... This should be a long, chaotic sentence that could be described as the lineage of that Mad God, but why does it have sweetness instead of madness......]","? ? ? : [Well, you could say there's no madness like Makina's, right?]"]},{"number":2135,"title":"Chapter 2135: Date with Kaori and Olivia 24","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I didn't have much time, so today's chapter is a bit short.","Since this is a sightseeing boat with autopilot, the speed was quite slow, probably to enjoy the scenery. At first, I couldn’t enjoy the view at all due to feeling confused and tense about the whole shoulder-hugging situation...... but after some time passed, my nervousness started to calm down.","[......The view is nice, isn’t it? There are quite a few places where you can look down from a high vantage point, but seeing it like this from the waterway gives a completely different vibe.]","[Yeah. I’ve never been, but I wonder if places like Venice, which are called the \"City of Water\", have a similar atmosphere? Well, I’m just imagining it though.]","[Ah, yeah, the image definitely feels like that, right?]","Kaori-san, being someone who quickly adapts, was initially tense right after the shoulder hug, but now she seemed pretty relaxed, leaning on me and enjoying the view at a leisurely pace.","On the other hand, Olivia-san still seemed to be transmitting a lot of nervous energy. Though she had calmed down a few times, it seemed like she would tense up again shortly afterward, repeating that cycle.","[How about you, Olivia-san? Are you enjoying the view?]","[Ah, yes. I’m thoroughly enjoying this beautiful scenery. I felt it before when I was on the boat with Miyama Kaito-sama, but just having Miyama Kaito-sama nearby makes the view feel even more beautiful and sacred. Perhaps it’s the immense influence of Miyama Kaito-sama’s overwhelming aura. Ah, not that I'm saying your presence is overpowering———— no, it’s more like the atmosphere Miyama Kaito-sama carries is as warm and pleasant as sunlight, and one can feel his compassion and kindness. I must be grateful to the world for allowing me to gaze upon this scenery beside Miyama Kaito-sama.]","[......Olivia-san, let’s calm down, okay? Try to relax a bit more......]","[I cannot speak falsehoods to Miyama Kaito-sama, so, though I am fully aware of my embarrassment, I must confess honestly...... I do feel apologetic about it, but that's impossible. No, not that I find the current state uncomfortable, but I would appreciate being held a little tighter——– m- my apologies! I misspoke! At any rate, for someone inexperienced like me, this situation is quite stimulating, and I have judged it impossible to become accustomed to it in such a short time, so I beg your leniency.]","[Ah, yes.]","She was quite flustered, responding \"It's impossible to calm down.\" in a polite tone that even seemed somewhat proud. But the fact that she stated it wasn’t uncomfortable to have her shoulder hugged made it seem like she actually desired the situation to continue. It felt like she was both nervous and embarrassed, but also happy...... That’s the kind of vibe I got from her.","Well, in any case, the way she hastily spoke with such politeness was very much like Olivia-san, and it was rather adorable.","[By the way, how long does it usually take to go around once?]","[They say it normally takes about 45 minutes, but on a date course, they drive slower than usual, so it takes about an hour.]","[I see. Well, we still have plenty of time, so it seems like we can relax.]","Although it's just a rough estimate, it's been about 10 to 15 minutes, so we still seem to have plenty of time.","An hour might sound long, but considering we’re moving through the waterway on a boat for sightseeing, it seems like just the right amount of time. Surprisingly, once you get used to it, the wide, long seats feel almost like sofas, and they’re quite comfortable, so I feel like I can relax.","Olivia-san is still feeling quite nervous, but I can also sense that she’s starting to enjoy herself to some extent. So, I think I’ll continue to enjoy the sightseeing while engaging in some light, casual conversation, with two flowers embraced in my arms.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......B- But the thing is...... Those two aren't even his lovers, yet they're holding hands, interlocking fingers, hugging, and even embracing them by the shoulders...... Isn't that a bit too fast? The sweetness level's rising, so maybe we should calm down a bit here......]"]},{"number":2136,"title":"Chapter 2136: Date with Kaori and Olivia 25","paragraphs":["After the leisurely boat tour of the canals, we once again held hands as we moved on. However, having spent a fair amount of time on lunch, theater, a café, and the boat tour, it was already approaching evening.","Since the date was scheduled to end with dinner, it felt like we were nearing the end.","[The sky’s still blue, but it's starting to feel like evening, isn't it? It seems like we won't have time to visit many more places, but where are we heading next, Olivia-san?]","[We're heading to a park on a hill. It's featured in tourist magazines, and apparently, you can get a panoramic view of the town bathed in the sunset.]","[Oh, that sounds nice. With so many red brick buildings, the sunset must look great against them. By the way, Olivia-san...... are you okay?]","[I can't lie to Miyama Kaito-sama, so I'll be honest...... My thoughts are a bit scattered, and I'm having trouble focusing. The act of putting your arm around me...... I think it was something I wasn't quite ready for yet.]","What kind of readiness is she talking about? Love? Anyway, Olivia-san, despite looking as calm as usual, clearly had red cheeks and seemed to still be embarrassed by the moment when I had put my arm around her earlier.","However, she wasn't in full-on praise mode, so it didn’t seem like she was panicking. It seemed like her thoughts had regained some composure.","Even though she was clearly embarrassed, the way she still held my hand tightly in a romantic hand-holding manner was endearing, almost like a little puppy, which I found cute.","[But I do understand Olivia-sama's feelings. Experiencing it yourself feels different from reading about it in romance novels and watching plays, right?]","[......Mizuhara Kaori-san, you seem to be pretty composed, don't you?]","[No, I'm still really embarrassed when I think about it. I'm just putting it off for now.]","[......Putting it off?]","[Yes, I definitely feel some embarrassment, but since it's such a special situation, it feels like it would be a waste not to enjoy it. So, I decided to put my shame aside for now and enjoy this precious opportunity. Later, when I get home and I'm alone, I'll remember it and wriggle around in embarrassment, so it's fine!]","[Can you really say that you're okay with that? Well, I do see some truth in your words, and maybe there’s something worth learning from your attitude.]","Indeed, Kaori-san didn’t seem to be too embarrassed and appeared rather composed...... But it seemed more like she had decided to deal with her embarrassment later and was simply being honest with herself.","Still, her quick mental shift seemed to show that Kaori-san was mentally tough. I think at this point, she might be the most composed person here, considering how embarrassing the shoulder-holding moment had been for me.","Well, if we’re to believe her words, she’ll be writhing in embarrassment later but......","[Well, there are probably many thoughts you have right now, but shall we hurry along? It seems like there’s not much time left if we want to catch the sunset......]","[Right. It seems like there are some fairly long stairs to the park, so we should probably hurry.]","......Stairs, stairs huh. Olivia-san mentioned earlier that it’s a \"hilltop park with a panoramic view of the town\", right? Looking around for anything that might fit that description...... I can see a small hill in the distance, so that's probably the place.","However, that hill...... seems pretty high. Considering it's supposed to offer a view of the whole town, I guess that height might be necessary, but climbing those stairs to that height......","[Um, Olivia-san, you mentioned there are long stairs...... Do you think you have enough stamina?]","[Miyama Kaito-sama, thank you for your concern. I can understand why you might worry about my lack of strength, but please, rest assured...... This hill is lower than the Hero’s Hill we visited before, and it’s a staircase, not a slope. Even though my strength outside the Friendship City is lacking, I believe it will be fine.]","[......Please don't push yourself too hard.]","What is this feeling? Yeah, it’s definitely lower than the Hero’s Hill, and it’s just a staircase with a handrail, so it might be easier than walking up a long slope.","But for some reason, just going with my gut feeling...... I think Olivia-san will probably get winded about halfway up.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Olivia does all her research thoroughly, but her self-assessment is a bit too optimistic, which would just end up with her self-destructing......]"]},{"number":2137,"title":"Chapter 2137: Date with Kaori and Olivia 26","paragraphs":["As planned, we began climbing the long staircase leading to the hilltop park. The steps themselves were shallow, and the landings were wide, making it a design that allowed you to enjoy the scenery as you ascended at a leisurely pace. However, since each step was shallow, the number of steps was inevitably high.","Since I regularly jog with Hina-chan, I get a fair amount of exercise, so the climb posed no problem for me. As I had anticipated though, Olivia-san was visibly fatigued before even reaching the halfway point.","[O- Olivia-sama? Are you alright?]","[......Hah...... N- No problem...... at all.]","[No, you don’t look alright at all! Arehh? Isn’t Olivia-sama supposed to be super strong......?]","Seeing Olivia-san looking completely worn out, Kaori-san called out to her in a flustered tone, and just like she did before, Olivia-san replied that she was fine.","Well, as Kaori-san pointed out, she didn’t look fine at all, but compared to when we climbed Hero’s Hill, it seemed like she was holding up a bit better this time.","[For now, we still have plenty of time, so let’s take breaks as we go. Honestly, I could use a little rest myself......]","[U- Understood. I- If Miyama Kaito-sama says so then, I- I shall comply......]","I proposed taking a break. Given Olivia-san's personality, she’d probably try to push herself so as not to inconvenience me. By framing it as my own need for a break, I managed to get her to agree.","Although there weren’t any benches around, the steps were wide and spacious enough, so we sat down in a spot where we wouldn’t obstruct others climbing behind us to take a short rest.","[Regarding Kaori Mizuhara’s earlier question, my abilities are severely restricted outside Friendship City. When outside the Friendship City, I only have abilities equivalent to that of an ordinary human. To put it simply, my abilities are sealed. In extremely urgent situations, I’m allowed to lift the seal, but under normal circumstances, you can assume I’m at an ordinary human level.]","[I- I see, so that’s how it works.]","[Olivia-san has power equivalent to a Supreme God within the Friendly City, right? So wouldn't that be your true strength?]","I had been wondering how it all worked, and it seemed that Olivia-san’s abilities were mostly sealed outside the Friendship City.","[Strictly speaking, I am more powerful than a Supreme God within the Friendship City. No, perhaps saying it that way might cause some misunderstandings. The powers granted to me by Shallow Vernal-sama, which can be categorized in the same vein as the Gods' Authority, include immense abilities within the Friendly City. Among these is the ability to \"nullify all abilities, including Authority\". So within Friendship City, I am unaffected by any Authority or ability. This stems from the fact that Shallow Vernal-sama created me with an emphasis on neutrality.]","[I see......]","In simpler terms, Olivia-san possesses the ability to nullify others’ abilities within Friendship City. Perhaps having the concept of preserving neutrality in mind, Shiro-san gave her the ability to negate influences like Brainwashing, Thought Manipulation, and other such powers. It’s a very OP-sounding ability.","Since it’s one of her many abilities, she must be absurdly strong within Friendship City. Considering the potential impact on the world, it made sense for her abilities to be restricted outside of Friendship City.","[That said, this power does not affect certain Quasi-Omnipotent beings, including Shallow Vernal-sama...... For example, Phantasmal King was able to create a subspace within the Hall of the Pope, my territory......]","[Ah, so that’s why you seemed so shocked back then.]","[T- The scale of this conversation somehow turned amazing......]","As Olivia-san spoke, Kaori-san had a somewhat indescribable expression on her face, her gaze distant. At that moment, Olivia-san suddenly seemed to think of something and called out to Kaori-san.","[Setting aside my lack of abilities outside Friendship City, Mizuhara Kaori, you don’t appear fatigued at all, do you?]","[Yes, well, before I opened my shop in Friendship City, I used to travel alone quite a bit, so I’m pretty used to walking. Plus, I have a high-ranking adventurer’s license and even got one of those silly titles attached to my name.]","[Eh? Really? So, Kaori-san, are you a top-tier adventurer?]","I’d heard from Akane-san that Kaori-san was strong, but I never imagined she was one of the top-tier adventurers with a title like Luna-san and the others.","However, hearing my question, Kaori-san looked rather troubled.","[Hmm, I wonder? It’s true that those with titles are considered top-tier adventurers, but I’ve never been that active as an adventurer. You probably know this since Aoi-chan and Hina-chan are adventurers, Kaito-kun, but when registering as an adventurer, you have to submit various documents, including proof of residence. The adventurer’s license also functions as a valid form of identification after all.]","I was aware of that, having learned about it from Alice when I was with Aoi-chan and Hina-chan. In fact, they had filled out a lot of paperwork and even gone through an interview to become adventurers, so it made sense that the license would serve as an ID.","[Having an adventurer’s license meant I could accept jobs in towns and cities with Guilds. It was great for earning travel expenses. By obtaining a higher rank, I could access additional support and take on short-term, well-paying jobs. I even contributed a little during a monster stampede once, and people started calling me with the embarrassing title \"Water Blade\"...... But since I was traveling around a lot, I never received any direct job requests. And even when I earned travel expenses, I didn’t always rely on adventurer work. Sometimes, I just took short-term gigs at restaurants or other places. So, I’m not sure if I can really call myself a top-tier adventurer.]","(T/N: Kaori's title is based on her surname Mizuhara. Mizu = Water, Ha = Blade.)","[That’s certainly something you could feel conflicted about.]","Right? Well, now I’m just a diner owner, so it’s all in the past.]","Kaori-san smiled wryly as she said this, clearly thinking it wasn’t a big deal. But still...... it might be the case that she’s far stronger than I initially assumed.","I’d heard from Akane-san that she was strong, so I’d vaguely thought she might be around Aoi-chan or Hina-chan’s level....... But maybe, she’s on par with Luna-san or Sieg-san instead.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Considering her modest demeanor and tendency to downplay herself, isn’t it possible that she’s actually pretty well-known in adventurer circles?]","? ? ? : [Yes, during a large-scale stampede in Hydra Kingdom a few years ago, she made quite a name for herself with her outstanding performance. She even received a personal commendation from Laguna-san. She also got recruitment offers from Knight Orders, but she turned them down without hesitation and resumed her travels. For her, being an adventurer was more like a short-term gig to cover travel expenses rather than something she devoted herself to.]"]},{"number":2138,"title":"Chapter 2138: Date with Kaori and Olivia 27","paragraphs":["For the time being, after taking a short break, we started climbing the stairs again. However, as expected, Olivia-san's steps were heavy. Considering her personality and other factors, I believe she would manage to climb all the way to the top, but by the time we reached the park, she'd likely be utterly exhausted.","[Olivia-san, like when we went to Hero's Hill before, I can give you a piggyback ride.]","[N- No...... I'm fine. I can't trouble Miyama Kaito-sama with something like this. There's only about a third of the way left, so I should be able to climb without issue.]","[Yeah, I'm sure you can climb it...... but when we get to the park, you'll be too tired to enjoy the view or the sunset, right......]","[I agree with him on this, Olivia-sama. The sky is starting to show a bit of red, and we don’t have a lot of time to spare either, so it might be better to let Kaito-kun...... Fumu......]","Just like earlier, Olivia-san refused my suggestion, saying she’d walk on her own. However, Kaori-san seemed to agree with me, judging that Olivia-san's current pace might be too difficult.","Then, as if an idea had suddenly struck her, Kaori-san's expression changed, and she gave me a mischievous smile.","[Kaito-kun, this is the moment! Forget a piggyback ride, go for the princess carry!!!]","[......Mizuhara Kaori, you...... what in the world......]","[......A princess carry?]","Both Olivia-san and I tilted our heads simultaneously at Kaori-san’s enthusiastic suggestion. A princess carry...... It wasn’t impossible for me to do that. From the time I gave her a piggyback ride before, I knew Olivia-san was very light, and with Body Strengthening Magic, carrying her in a princess carry would be no trouble at all.","The stairs had low steps and wide treads, so as long as I was careful, there shouldn’t be any risk of tripping.","[If we’re aiming for a date-like atmosphere, a princess carry beats a piggyback ride any day! It’s more picturesque, and honestly, I’d love to see that happening up close. Kaito-kun, you can use Body Strengthening Magic, right? Then you'd be fine...... Olivia-sama, this is a perfect opportunity to do something very date-like!]","[......Errr, well, I don’t particularly mind doing a princess carry, but what about you, Olivia-san?]","[Ah, no, Miyama Kaito-sama? Honestly, I don’t need to be carried, and I can’t possibly ask you to go to such lengths on my behalf.]","[Do you dislike the idea of a princess carry?]","[N- No, that’s not it at all. When I consider things like the hugs and the times you’ve held my shoulders, I realize my mental state might be somewhat at risk, but I don’t have any aversion to it. However, I can’t allow myself to impose on Miyama Kaito-sama in such a manner, and such a thing would be a tremendous discourtesy......]","[......I see.]","It didn’t seem like she was outright opposed to the idea of a princess carry, and with Kaori-san strongly insisting on it, I figured I might as well carry Olivia-san that way.","I already knew she would respond with reservation, not wanting to burden me, but I had learned from last time how to deal with that.","As I considered this, Olivia-san seemed to notice something. Her expression changed suddenly, and she turned pale before opening her mouth to speak.","[......M- Miyama Kaito-sama...... Please reconsider...... J- Just this once, please reconsider...... I can manage on my own......]","[Olivia-san, it's quite unfortunate...... but this is an order.]","[Uuuu...... M- Miyama Kaito-sama can be unexpectedly mean at times.]","Perhaps recalling our interaction at Hero’s Hill last time, Olivia-san desperately pleaded for me to reconsider. But when I mentioned the word \"order\", she looked resigned.","However, I noticed a faint trace of happiness on her face...... Maybe she had anticipated this outcome from the moment I first suggested it.","[Alright then, Olivia-san. If you'll excuse me.]","[Ah, yes——– hyaa!?]","I let go of her hand, gave her a quick warning, and lifted her into a princess carry. As I thought, Olivia-san was very light, and with Body Strengthening Magic, there was absolutely no issue carrying her.","Olivia-san’s expression shifted to one of surprise, and then her face turned bright red. This might actually be the reddest her face has been today.","[T- To lift me up so effortlessly...... what incredible strength. The stability of your unwavering core reminds me of the grand and majestic trunk of a colossal World Tree. Your benevolent heart, so considerate of my inadequacies, is as pure as the clear blue sky. I can’t help but feel deeply and profoundly moved by the greatness of Miyama Kaito-sama......]","[Olivia-san, let’s calm down.]","[I cannot bring myself to speak falsehoods to Miyama Kaito-sama, so please forgive me for contradicting your words...... but it’s impossible. My face feels unimaginably hot, my heartbeat and thoughts are in complete disarray, and the worldly thoughts keep surfacing endlessly. I even feel as though I’m feverish, and if I let my guard down, my consciousness might ascend to the Sanctuary.]","If she ends up wandering into the Sanctuary, I imagine even Shiro-san would be troubled. For now though, it seems she’s simply saying \"I’m too embarrassed to calm down\".","Still, it’s clear that she’s merely embarrassed and not opposed to the situation...... In fact, she’s subtly leaning her body against me, gently resting her cheek on my shoulder as if unconsciously seeking comfort.","It seemed like an instinctive action though, and if I pointed it out, she’d probably panic even more than she already was. Deciding not to make a fuss, I started walking while carrying her in a princess carry.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [What the heck is with that unnecessary help, Stomachache Warrior!!!? They're practically lovers now! Doing things couples do!!!]"]},{"number":2139,"title":"Chapter 2139: Date with Kaori and Olivia 28","paragraphs":["Olivia, now being princess-carried by Kaito, found herself flustered and unable to settle her thoughts.","(How should I even describe this......? M- Miyama Kaito-sama’s honorable countenance is so close, its radiance feels like it’s burning my eyes. This is entirely different from the time he carried me on his back during our visit to Hero’s Hill. Though the situation remains the same, Miyama Kaito-sama carrying me, the difference between being carried from the front and the back makes it feel worlds apart.)","When Kaito carried her on his back before, she had been flustered but managed to remain somewhat composed. Now, however, she was anything but calm. Her thoughts swirled in circles, unable to settle, and her body felt strangely feverish.","It wasn’t unreasonable for Olivia to feel this way. Being held like this, with Kaito’s face so close and their bodies pressed together, made it impossible for her to stay composed.","(Would it be disrespectful to gaze at Miyama Kaito-sama from this close? Of course, I understand that Miyama Kaito-sama would never accuse me of being disrespectful, but to be this close to someone I revere as if my God...... Could it not be a deviation from the proper way to uphold my faith? Yet, even so, I can’t look away....... How beautiful, how divine his presence is....... Lifting me so effortlessly while walking with such calm eyes fixed ahead...... Surely, this sacred visage should be immortalized in a painting and displayed in a grand cathedral.)","Incidentally, Olivia’s face, as she gazed up at Kaito with a heated expression, was the very image of a girl deeply in love. However, she herself insisted it was merely devotion, and she lacked the objectivity to recognize her feelings for what they truly were.","(First and foremost though, I must reflect on myself...... My inadequacy caused Miyama Kaito-sama unnecessary trouble...... No, that’s not right. Reflection, regret, self-admonishment———- those can all come later. What I should focus on now is......)","Her thoughts wandered as she turned her gaze toward Kaori, who was walking happily and enjoying the scenery. The perspective Kaori had shared earlier had been deeply enlightening for Olivia.","Though Olivia was exceedingly earnest, she wasn’t rigid in her thinking. Even if an idea or behavior differed from her current values, she was open-minded enough to adopt opinions she found truly valid, using them to better herself.","(To be carried by the great Miyama Kaito-sama is an honor far beyond what I deserve————- a miracle, a blessing so rare it must be cherished. In that case, instead of drowning my thoughts in shame and regret, shouldn’t I be expressing gratitude and embracing this unexpected happiness? But then...... this may...... b- be something that can't be allowed...... I- It might be unforgivable, terribly irreverent, but...... perhaps I could lean on Miyama Kaito-sama just a little more......)","Encouraged by Kaori’s way of thinking, Olivia decided to fully accept the happiness of the present moment. She let her body relax just slightly.","As a result, she became more acutely aware of Kaito’s hands beneath her knees and around her back, and her body...... her face ended up leaning more closely against his shoulder.","(......So warm. What a strange feeling. My heart should be a storm of unrest, yet at the same time, I feel a profound sense of peace and happiness. It’s as if two conflicting emotions coexist within me, yet it feels so right. Above all, simply being this close to Miyama Kaito-sama...... Being allowed to remain near him...... brings me such joy.)","Her entire body felt as though it was on the verge of boiling over, yet somehow, that heat carried a strange sense of comfort. For Olivia, this was an unfamiliar and uncharted emotion.","No, she had felt this way before, on some occasions. But those feelings...... the emotions she had always suppressed as mere worldly thoughts...... Now, as she allowed herself to accept them, brought an inexplicable ticklish sensation and an overwhelming sense of comfort.","She didn’t yet know what to call this feeling...... But it wasn’t unpleasant, and it didn’t seem like something unnecessary or something that ought to be rejected.","(......Truly, I am so disgraceful and irreverent today...... I must reflect on this thoroughly later. Even though I’m causing Miyama Kaito-sama trouble, even though I should be reprimanding myself for my inadequacy...... I still can’t help but wish to remain like this for much longer.)","As she entertained such thoughts in her mind, Olivia leaned gently against Kaito’s shoulder, her expression softening in a way that seemed almost dependent. A small smile graced her lips.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [T- This is bad...... Now that I think about it, Olivia is like a ticking time bomb, isn’t she......? I mean, she’s completely unaware that what she’s feeling is love, yet her affection for Kaito just keeps skyrocketing. What’s going to happen when she finally realizes it’s love......? Hyihh......]"]},{"number":2140,"title":"Chapter 2140: Date with Kaori and Olivia 29","paragraphs":["About two-thirds of the climb had already been completed, so it didn’t take much time for us to reach the park at the top of the hill. As a park designed with the concept of overlooking the city, it didn’t have any playground equipment, only several benches scattered around.","[We’ve arrived at just about the perfect time.]","[Yeah. Looks like we’ll be able to see the sunset soon. This spot really is the best———– you can see the sunset towering behind the city from here.]","[Indeed. It’s looking like it’ll be great in a little while...... Olivia-san, we’ve arrived.]","[......................]","Having reached the intended park, Kaito thought the princess carry ended here and was about to set Olivia-san down. With that in mind, he called out to her, but Olivia-san was still leaning against me with her eyes closed, unresponsive.","[Olivia-san? Errr, could it be that you’re sleeping?]","[......Isn’t Olivia-sama one of those who doesn’t require sleep?]","[Well, even if sleep isn’t necessary, there are some people I know who can sleep if they feel like it. So it’s possible......]","Among my acquaintances, Kuro, Isis-san, and Alice didn’t require sleep but could still do so if they chose.","Well, there should also be those like Kuro who wasn’t used to sleeping and was generally groggy when she woke up...... Perhaps Olivia was in a similar state. Just then, Olivia opened her eyes.","[......I can hear Miyama Kaito-sama’s voice.]","[Ah, Olivia-san, you’re awake? We’ve arrived, you know?]","[......Yes...... My entire being belongs to Miyama Kaito-sama.]","[......Olivia-san?]","It turned out Olivia hadn’t been asleep. Having decided to accept Kaito’s princess carry...... she had simply been overwhelmed by its comfort, her thoughts melting away into a dreamlike state.","In a way, it wasn’t much different from being groggy upon waking, and she wasn’t able to respond properly to Kaito’s questions.","[Fufu, being held by Miyama Kaito-sama like this...... My body enveloped in so much happiness...... happiness...... hap......]","Unfortunately, she couldn’t stay in that dazed state forever. As her mind gradually cleared and her sense of reality returned, Olivia’s face turned red———- so red it seemed as though her blood was boiling.","[ ————- ! ? ! ? ! ? ! ? ! ? ]","Olivia, completely immersed in the comfort of being held by Kaito, was so overwhelmed by bliss that she failed to notice his calls. On top of that, she had made the monumental mistake of responding to him in a sweet, affectionate tone, sending her thoughts into an unprecedented state of panic.","[M- M- M- My apologies, doing s- s- such an impolite act...... no, such impropriety, being such a burden...... That's why, umm......]","[P- Please calm down, Olivia-san. It’s okay...... F- For now, carrying up here is dangerous, so I'll set you down.]","[Y- Yesh......]","As Olivia flustered and stumbled over her words, Kaito gently lowered her, all while smiling in a way to reassure her as much as possible.","[There’s absolutely no need to worry about rudeness or disrespect. You weren’t a burden at all, and, of course, you’re not at fault for anything. So, please, try to relax...... alright?]","[......Y- Yes. I deeply apologize for showing you such an unsightly side of me.]","Hearing Kaito’s kind words, Olivia nodded while still blushing furiously. She silently vowed to atone for her perceived shortcomings through harsh self-discipline later.","As a result...... It would later be rumored within the Godism community that there existed a hidden, hellish ascetic practice so grueling that even the Founder would emerge battered and bruised———— but that is a story for another time.","[For now, why don’t we sit on a bench somewhere and watch the sunset? The timing is perfect, and the atmosphere feels just right.]","[Yes. How about that bench over there? It seems to be in a good position to view the city......]","[That looks great. Let’s go sit there...... Kaori-san, are you okay with that?]","[Eh? Ah, unn, that’s fine. All that feels so youthful and romantic, I almost feel like I’m watching a movie.]","Kaori, while hoping to experience love and youthful moments herself, also enjoyed watching others' romantic escapades. Part of her motivation for suggesting the princess carry to Kaito was to support Olivia, who was earnestly trying to make the date special. However, she couldn’t deny that she was also curious to witness a princess carry up close.","......Of course, she didn’t realize at this point that her curious suggestion...... would soon come back to her in an unexpected way.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The flow of things is taking a bad turn. A very bad turn...... Doesn't it feel like Kaori would be getting princess carried next......?]"]},{"number":2141,"title":"Chapter 2141: Date with Kaori and Olivia 30","paragraphs":["They sat side by side on a bench, watching the cityscape as the sunset descended. The red-brick buildings glowed in the evening sun, creating a scene that, while full of life, also exuded a mysterious charm. Although it wasn’t for a long time, Kaito and the others etched the beauty of the spectacular view into their memories.","As the sun set and darkness enveloped the surroundings, the Illumination Magic Tools installed in the park illuminated the area. Naturally, the conversation turned to heading back to the city and making their way to the restaurant, their final stop of the day.","[Do we still have quite a bit of time before the reservation?]","[Yes. Even if we take more time going back than we did coming up, it won’t be a problem. We should even have a little time to browse some shops along the way......]","[......Olivia-san?]","After responding to Kaito’s question, Olivia seemed to be deep in thought, occasionally glancing at Kaito’s face. She looked as though she wanted to say something but hesitated. Noticing her demeanor, Kaito spoke to her, prompting Olivia to make up her mind and open her mouth with a resolute expression.","[......Miyama Kaito-sama. I am fully aware that this is an extremely rude and irreverent request, but I have a wish that I hope you can grant. I am willing to accept any punishment afterward, so I humbly ask for your compassion......]","[Unn? No, there’s no need to make such a big deal out of it. If it’s something I can do, please feel free to ask.]","It was very rare for Olivia to ask Kaito for anything. Though Kaito tilted his head in slight surprise, being the inherently kind person he was, he would never dismiss a request from someone close to him.","Though startled at first, Kaito smiled, indicating that fulfilling Olivia’s wish wouldn’t be a problem, and urged her to share the details. Olivia bowed deeply before continuing.","[My heartfelt gratitude for your generosity...... To explain my request to Miyama Kaito-sama, I would like to ask for the honor of the act known as the princess carry that I received earlier...... Would you please also grant it to Mizuhara Kaori?]","[......Eh?]","[Uehhh!?]","Olivia’s words were completely unexpected. While Kaito looked surprised, Kaori was utterly shocked.","(Eehhh!? W- Why am I suddenly being brought into this!? There’s no way this conversation was heading in this direction, right? Olivia-sama also looked completely serious there...... Eh? Ehhh? Why?)","Kaori was bewildered as to why the conversation had taken this turn. Olivia, however, was entirely serious. Noticing Kaori’s astonishment, Olivia turned toward her and gave a small, gentle smile.","[......Mizuhara Kaori, I am deeply grateful for the kindness you showed earlier by suggesting that I be carried up. Even though you’ve mentioned before that you admired the act of a princess carry, rather than wanting it for yourself, you prioritized me instead. Your selflessness is something I deeply appreciate. That’s why I hope to assist in fulfilling the wish you set aside for my sake.]","[......Huh? Eh? Ah......]","Hearing Olivia’s words, spoken with a serene, almost saint-like smile, Kaori was left speechless...... A moment later, her expression shifted as if she’d remembered something.","(......A- Ahh, I did say that. I’m pretty sure I said something like, \"I long for princess carries\" or \"I’d like to experience it once\" when we were chatting about date ideas!)","At her core, Olivia was a pure-hearted person. She held no resentment or embarrassment about the suggestion Kaori made earlier regarding the princess carry.","Instead, she had interpreted it as Kaori’s thoughtful consideration of her physical limitations and sincere effort to create opportunities for a date-like experience.","Because of this, Olivia felt a deep sense of gratitude. It was this gratitude that drove her to take such a significant step————- asking Kaito for a favor, something she rarely did, all for Kaori’s sake.","[Going downhill shouldn’t be an issue. Even during the previous trip to Hero’s Hill, though I was fatigued, I managed to make it down without any problems. I believe I can do the same this time without Miyama Kaito-sama’s help. So, if Miyama Kaito-sama doesn’t mind, I humbly ask that you grant Mizuhara Kaori this kindness.]","[......Errr, I’m fine with that but...... what about you, Kaori-san?]","[.....................]","Kaito, clearly puzzled, turned to Kaori, who had a complicated expression on her face. If she were to be honest, Kaori did feel some longing for the idea of a princess carry, and she had always wanted to experience it at least once. However, the embarrassment she felt far outweighed those desires, so under normal circumstances, she would have declined.","However, right now, Kaori was wrestling with a slight pang of guilt in her heart. When she had suggested the princess carry during the climb, she had genuinely been thinking of Olivia’s well-being and trying to offer her support. That much was undeniable, and her primary motivation had indeed been out of care. But...... there had also been a small part of her that simply wanted to see a princess carry up close, to witness a scene straight out of a youthful romcom. That selfish, personal desire had played a minor role in her suggestion.","Yet Olivia had accepted Kaori’s proposal with pure and genuine intentions, completely free of malice. Driven by that same sincerity, Olivia had then asked Kaito to offer Kaori the same opportunity, out of sheer kindness.","Faced with such a pure request from Olivia, Kaori felt overwhelmed with guilt. It was impossible for her to disregard the kindness of someone who was so wholeheartedly considerate of her.","After a brief silence...... looking somewhat exasperated, Kaori finally sighed and nodded.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [In this way, she's kind of similar to Isis———– completely pure-hearted, 100% good intentions, and probably needing an enormous amount of courage just to make a request to Kaito...... With that much sincerity, Kaori can’t exactly refuse...... D*mn it! That means the princess carry is pretty much a done deal!!!]"]},{"number":2142,"title":"Chapter 2142: Date with Kaori and Olivia 31","paragraphs":["Mizuhara Kaori enjoys romance books and plays, which is why she likes observing other people's love lives. However, at the same time, she also harbors a considerable interest in her own romantic affairs.","The main reason for this is the series of events surrounding her summoning...... during her teenage years, which she considers her youth, particularly the latter half of her teenage years, the death of her mother, the disappearance of her father, and her summoning to another world all happened in succession, leaving her with no room for romance.","(N- No way...... I never expected things to turn out like this...... My youth is going crazy in just one day!? I thought it arrived super late, but now it's causing an uproar!)","It was true that she often expressed longing for youthful romance, worried about her marriage prospects, and stated her desire to experience love.","It was undeniable she had at least some longing for being princess carried...... but even so, embarrassing things were still embarrassing.","[......A- Ahh~~ but, is that okay? I- I mean, I’m taller than Olivia-sama, and my weight is, um...... j- just a little more than hers, you know? Wouldn’t this be a burden on Kaito-kun......?]","[I have Body Strengthening Magic, so I think it’ll be fine. I’m not ridiculously well-trained or anything, but I won’t drop you, so don’t worry.]","[H- Hoh~~ you’re making such a reliable statement huh...... Heehhh...... W- Well then, let’s see things for ourselves then......]","Kaori spoke with slight hesitation, embarrassed, while Kaito responded with a gentle smile. It was true that Kaori was taller than Olivia and likely weighed more...... but the difference wasn’t that significant.","In this world, due to differences in body composition and muscle structure, some races had weights that didn’t match their appearance. For example, beings like Megiddo, when she assumed her usual War King form, she was over 10 meters tall, yet due to magical constraints, her actual weight was only around 50 kg.","For beings on Megiddo’s level, weight could be adjusted at will, making it an unreliable reference, but such disparities between appearance and weight did exist...... However, in Kaori’s case, her weight was exactly as her appearance suggested.","[Well then, if you'll excuse me.]","[B- Bring it on......]","Kaito was often perceived as weak, but that was only because his comparison targets were unfair. In reality, he had the strength of an average adult male. He was slightly concerned about his low enhancement multiplier, but with body enhancement magic, carrying Kaori in a princess carry was no problem at all.","Kaito, noticing Kaori’s slight nervousness, chuckled softly before lifting her into a princess carry.","[......O- Oh...... I- I see. H- Hehh, so this is what it feels like. You don’t normally get carried like this, so it’s kind of a fresh experience.]","[Your face is red.]","[Of course, it’s red! This is seriously embarrassing! It’s embarrassing, no doubt...... but I really did want to experience it, so this is actually kinda nice......]","In ordinary life, there were hardly any opportunities to be carried in a princess carry, and this was Kaori’s first time experiencing it.","She wasn’t as shaken as Olivia had been, but internally, she was still quite flustered.","(K- Kinda nice......? No, this is more intense than I expected. Maybe it’s because my feet aren’t on the ground and I feel unstable, but Kaito-kun seems oddly dependable. I mean, he’s actually pretty well-built huh. He’s not super muscular, but he’s still firm. Being this close, I can really feel that he’s a guy...... Ah, wait, this is...... unn...... this is making my heart race quite a bit......)","Previously, when he had put an arm around her shoulders, there had been some physical contact, but being held in a princess carry was on another level. The feeling of being supported in an unsteady position by Kaito’s hands made her keenly aware of his masculinity, and she couldn’t ignore the excitement building in her chest.","(Looking up at Kaito-kun like this feels rather new...... Ugh, d*mn it, he looks so cool. It’s partly because he’s my type, but the situation itself is also making him seem ridiculously cool......)","There were probably various reasons for this. He had already been someone she found appealing and intriguing, but after spending the whole day on what was practically a date, where she ended up doing a lot of couple-like things alongside Olivia———— she had become even more conscious of him.","Whatever the case, Kaori realized that she was thinking about Kaito more than she had expected, and she felt her face growing even hotter.","[......Kaito-kun, am I heavy? Let me know if it’s too much.]","[You’re not heavy at all, actually, you feel really light. It’s not tiring or anything...... But still, being this close does make my heart race a bit. And since Kaori-san is so beautiful, I can’t help but feel a little nervous.]","Seeing Kaito’s gentle smile, Kaori’s expression turned slightly embarrassed but also pleased. Then, in a voice so soft that Kaito couldn’t hear it, she muttered———","[You always say things like that so casually...... Seriously...... If you make me fall for you any more than this...... I'll have you take responsibility, okay?]","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai: [Gwooooh...... She’s a different type from Olivia...... Olivia is the kind who doesn’t even realize she has a massive crush, while Kaori, on the other hand, is pretty aware of her own feelings. She also understands that Kaito is just acting normally and isn’t actually trying to flirt with her...... Aren't you...... living out your youth already......]"]},{"number":2143,"title":"Chapter 2143: Date with Kaori and Olivia 32","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I didn't have time to write, so today's chapter is short.","I carry Kaori-san down the stairs in a princess carry. To be honest, I thought it would be tough to go all the way down the stairs like this from start to finish, but surprisingly, it turned out manageable.","Today, I somehow felt like I had more strength than usual. Maybe my Body Strengthening Magic has become quite powerful...... Just as I was thinking that...... I suddenly caught sight of Alice in a spot that was out of Kaori-san and Olivia-san’s line of sight. Alice gave me a quick thumbs-up before disappearing.","......Ah, I see. It’s not that I’ve grown stronger or anything, but rather that Alice was secretly casting some kind of Support Magic on me from a distance...... In other words, even Alice thought it would be difficult for me to carry someone all the way down the stairs, or at the very least, I would have been completely exhausted by the end...... I owe her my thanks.","[Kaori-san, we’ve arrived, so I’ll set you down now.]","[Unn, thanks. Wow, Kaito-kun, you're actually pretty well-trained. You carried me without any issues, and it felt really secure. Being carried in a princess carry was a new experience for me, it was fun! ......Well, it was also super embarrassing, so when I get home, I’m probably gonna roll around on my bed in embarrassment.]","[A- Ahaha...... Errr, so, our last stop is dinner at the restaurant, right? Olivia-san, is the restaurant close by?]","Smiling wryly at Kaori-san’s typical reaction, I check the schedule with Olivia-san. She looks a little tired, but not as exhausted as she was on the way up.","Still, there's no doubt she’s fatigued. Depending on how things go, we could take a short break before moving on...... Wait a second. I just realized something———– if I had used Αναμνήσεις, I could have buffed Olivia-san, and she could have gone up and down the stairs easily. I hadn’t thought of that until now, but seeing Alice discreetly supporting me made me realize it.","It’s too late now, but if there’s a next time, I’ll give it a try.","[Yes. I’ve booked a highly rated restaurant that’s relatively close to the park where we planned to watch the sunset, so the travel time won’t be long.]","From Olivia-san’s response, it seems like there’s no issue. I double-check the reservation time just in case, and since we have a bit of leeway, we decide to take a short break before setting off again, hand in hand.","[Olivia-sama, which restaurant did you end up choosing for dinner?]","[I chose the one Mizuhara Kaori strongly recommended.]","[Eh? That’s amazing! How did you even get a reservation? I heard it’s incredibly popular, with bookings filled up months in advance......]","[Yes, I sent them an inquiry letter, and they responded that I could reserve a table at any time, so I made the booking.]","......With those words, I remembered what happened at the restaurant during lunch. Olivia-san had probably sent a letter under her own name from the Cathedral, and she must have done the same for the dinner reservation.","In other words, from the restaurant’s perspective, the Founder herself requested to dine there...... Of course, they would prioritize securing a table for her no matter what. rANöΒΕṦ","[......Hey, Kaito-kun. Isn’t this going to be another VIP treatment situation like at lunch?]","[I’m pretty sure it will be. But since the restaurant already knows the Founder is coming, they’ll probably make special arrangements, so in a way, that might actually be a good thing?]","[Oh, I see. If there’s no risk of a commotion, then maybe it’s better that way...... Hmmm, but as a commoner, getting VIP treatment just makes me weirdly nervous.]","[Ahaha, I understand how you feel.]","[No, you’re also among the VIPs though......]","Smiling wryly at Kaori-san’s exasperated murmur, I followed Olivia-san’s lead as we made our way to the restaurant.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The date is almost over, huh? There don’t seem to be any big events left......]","? ? ? : [Kaori-san's still gonna have her hug, remember?]","Serious-senpai : [.......................]"]},{"number":2144,"title":"Chapter 2144: Date with Kaori and Olivia 33","paragraphs":["Following Olivia's guidance, Kaito and Kaori arrived at the restaurant they had reserved. As expected, they were given VIP treatment, being escorted to a private dining area where they could enjoy their meal in peace.","The restaurant Olivia had chosen for dinner was even more high-end than the one for lunch. It was a prestigious establishment with nobles as their regulars, making Olivia’s presence a significant honor for the restaurant. In response, they prepared the best hospitality possible.","However, at that moment, Olivia dropped a bombshell on the staff member guiding them to their table.","[Among those seated today, the highest-ranking individual is Miyama Kaito-sama, so please take note of that.]","[ ! ? U- Understood!]","Olivia's intention was simply to prevent any issues by making it clear in advance, reflecting on the incident at lunch...... However, for the staff member receiving this information, it was a spine-chilling moment.","This restaurant catered to many noble customers, and while the owner was not a noble, they were a merchant closely connected to high society...... In short, they were well aware of Kaito’s existence and had made sure the staff understood his importance.","Kaito's name was primarily known among nobles, meaning that in terms of public recognition, Olivia was more famous among the general populace. However, for an establishment that catered to nobility, Kaito’s visit carried even more prestige than Olivia’s, ensuring an even higher level of VIP treatment behind the scenes.","[This place has a nice atmosphere.]","[If Miyama Kaito-sama finds it pleasing, then my choice was worth it...... So, um, Miyama Kaito-sama...... If possible, I would like to ask for your evaluation of today......]","[Evaluation?]","[Yes. By the command of Shallow Vernal-sama, I have been given the great honor of accompanying Miyama Kaito-sama on this date, and I planned everything with the help of Mizuhara Kaori. Due to my inexperience, there were some deviations from the original plan, but this restaurant marks the completion of today's itinerary. S- So, I- I would like you to render judgment on whether I was able to conduct the date properly......]","Regarding this restaurant, there were no planned activities like at lunch——– it was simply chosen as a place fitting for Kaito to visit with Olivia.","And now that they had reached the final destination of the day, Olivia was feeling a sense of uncertainty: \"Did I manage to carry out this date properly?\" With such thoughts brewing in her mind, she wanted to hear Kaito's evaluation.","[Ah, I see...... I had a great time. Thanks to all the effort you put into planning, I didn’t have to worry about where to go next and could simply enjoy myself. In terms of feeling like an actual date, I think it went really well. How about you, Olivia-san? Did you have fun today?]","[Yes. Just being by Miyama Kaito-sama’s side is already an honor beyond what I deserve, but today, I was also blessed with your kindness in many ways. I feel so happy that I almost feel guilty about experiencing such bliss. Of course, I didn’t just indulge in happiness———- I struggled with the planning process, consulted Mizuhara Kaori for advice many times, and learned a lot from the experience. I believe that the great Shallow Vernal-sama advised me to go on this date because he knew that by thinking, worrying, and experiencing unexpected situations, I would be able to grow.]","[......Perhaps.]","Hearing Olivia speak with eyes sparkling with devotion toward Shallow Vernal, Kaito swallowed the words \"No, I’m pretty sure Shiro-san didn’t think that far ahead\", and simply nodded in agreement.","[How about you, Kaori-san?]","[Well~~ it was amazing. It felt like my youth, which I had totally fallen behind on, came crashing down on me like a tsunami...... I experienced so much in just one day——— it was almost overwhelming, but in the end, I had a great time. But wow, Kaito-kun, you ended up holding me in your arms and even carrying me in a princess carry...... Well, I guess for Kaito-kun, carrying someone like me was no big deal......]","[No, Kaori-san, you're beautiful and charming, and to be honest, I was pretty nervous too.]","[......I see...... that...... makes me kinda happy.]","Kaori looked a little taken aback by Kaito’s straightforward words, but soon after, she let out a small laugh, her cheeks tinged with a faint blush. Just like that, the three of them continued reminiscing about the day’s events as they enjoyed their dinner together.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Speaking of which, regarding the slight exception we mentioned last time about weight, Isis-san also falls into that category. She's about 150 cm tall, but her weight is only around 30 kg. This is simply because she adjusts her weight to \"probably about that much\". When she moves by floating, her weight is almost zero, so she seems to adjust it rather arbitrarily. Since Isis-san is a ghost-type entity, a concept that has taken form, her actual weight is nearly nonexistent.]","Serious-senpai : [Well, when you reach Isis' level, adjusting something like weight seems like a given.]"]},{"number":2145,"title":"Chapter 2145: Date with Kaori and Olivia 34","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I had to work overtime and got home at 10 PM, so today's chapter is a short one.","Now that we've finished our meal at the restaurant, I can say that we've completed all of today's date itinerary. All that's left is to go home, but since Olivia-san can use Teleportation Magic, we can return instantly.","The discussion turned to where exactly we should teleport in the Friendship City. Initially, Olivia-san suggested dropping Kaori-san off at her shop first and then teleporting back to the Cathedral. However, Kaori-san said she wanted to take a leisurely walk back from the Cathedral to her shop, so we decided to teleport in front of the Cathedral and part ways there.","[Well then, Olivia-san, thank you so much for everything today.]","[No, I should be the one expressing my gratitude. It was the greatest honor to spend this precious day with you, Miyama Kaito-sama. If you would permit me, I would be delighted to have another opportunity like this in the future.]","[Yes, if the chance arises, let's definitely go out again.]","[Yes.]","The teleportation was instant, and we arrived in front of the Cathedral. I exchanged a brief farewell with Olivia-san, who nodded with a gentle yet somewhat pleased expression. She then placed her hands together in front of her and offered a short prayer for a few seconds.","After that, she turned to Kaori-san and spoke.","[Thank you as well for spending the day with us, Mizuhara Kaori. You still have an important duty ahead, so you may not be able to rest immediately, but please carry it out with deep gratitude for Miyama Kaito-sama’s kindness.]","[Thank you as well. I had a great time...... wait, huh? An important duty?]","[Yes, you are returning to your shop now, aren’t you?]","[Well, yes. I mean, my shop is also my home, so......]","[As had been mentioned earlier, I assume you will be receiving an embrace from Miyama Kaito-sama there. When that happens, please do not forget to express your deep gratitude toward him. However, based on my own experience, I must warn you———- there is a risk of losing consciousness from overwhelming happiness, so please be prepared and maintain a strong will.]","[..........................Haehh?]","Olivia-san spoke with a strangely serious expression, leaving Kaori-san utterly dumbfounded. This is just my guess, but she's probably talking about how Kaori-san mentioned receiving a hug at her shop before opening, she meant it in a \"maybe sometime in the future\" kind of way. But Olivia-san seems to have interpreted it as something that will happen immediately after we part ways.","[Well then, Miyama Kaito-sama, I leave Mizuhara Kaori in your care.]","[Eh? Ah, yes.]","[With that, I shall take my leave. Once again, I sincerely thank you for your company today.]","[U- Umm, wait, Olivia-sama......]","With a smile, Olivia-san gave a small bow and then entered the Cathedral, leaving Kaori-san and me behind...... in an atmosphere that was difficult to describe.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Umm, excuse me? Hugging alone at night in a home that doubles as a shop...... That's something couples do...... no, not just any couple, but ones who have been together for quite a while...... Umm......]"]},{"number":2146,"title":"Chapter 2146: Date with Kaori and Olivia 35","paragraphs":["Kaito and Kaori walked side by side through the streets of Friendship City at night. Since Friendship City Hikari was also a tourist city, many restaurants remained open even at night, and the streets were bright enough that walking around posed no difficulties. However, the atmosphere between the two was somewhat indescribable. In particular, Kaori was in a state of complete mental turmoil.","(A- Arehh? How did things end up like this...... This was completely unexpected, what do I do? Olivia-sama said something so unexpected that I got confused, and now the mood feels kind of awkward...... We couldn’t just stay in front of the Cathedral forever, so I somehow ended up walking with Kaito-kun towards my shop. A- Aren't things turning weird here? Instead of parting ways, we’re completely heading to my shop, aren’t we!?)","Yes, Olivia’s statement had been a misunderstanding. Originally, Kaori had mentioned that if there was ever an opportunity, they could do the hug at her shop before its opening. Kaito himself understood that correctly.","So, if after Olivia left, they had simply talked about it like “Olivia-sama seemed to have misunderstood something, huh?” and then parted ways in front of the Cathedral, there wouldn’t have been any problem at all.","However, both Kaito and Kaori were too bewildered by the sudden turn of events, and before they knew it, they had started walking together. Naturally, their destination became Kaori’s shop. Even though they hadn’t explicitly agreed on it, it now felt as if they were heading there to fulfill Olivia’s words and have their hug.","(Eh? Ehhh? W- What do I do? If we get to the shop like this, that means Kaito-kun is going to embrace me...... No, doesn't that sound wrong!? I mean, technically it’s correct, but phrased like that, it sounds completely indecent!!! It’s just a hug! Just a hug!! In the West, it’s a common greeting!!! ......This is another world though......)","So flustered that she found herself making excuses in her mind to an unknown audience, Kaori was completely lost on what to do.","Kaori’s shop was located near the plaza in front of the Cathedral, where the Festival of Heroes ceremony took place. She had chosen this location hoping that the Hero Actor children would visit her store. Even if they walked slowly from the Cathedral, it wouldn’t take more than 15 minutes to reach it.","(W- Wait, before even worrying about that....... my shop is basically my home...... Bringing a guy to my place, being alone in the shop, and hugging there...... That totally sounds like one of those scenarios where you end up spending the night together, doesn’t it!? No, no!!! That’s absolutely not happening!!! I- It would just be a hug, right? Just a hug is fine...... Kaito-kun, I’m trusting you! We’ll just hug and then part ways, okay!?)","Kaori had spent enough time with Kaito to understand that he was a sincere person. She also knew that while he viewed her as a woman he's close with, as both of them are from the same homeworld, and held some degree of fondness for her, he didn’t currently see her as a romantic interest.","(At the very least, I don’t think Kaito-kun sees me as a romantic interest yet. He’s willing to put an arm around my shoulder or carry me in a princess carry if the situation calls for it, but that’s probably just friendly affection rather than romantic feelings. I mean, I have zero experience in romantic relationships, so this is just my intuition, but since I feel that way, I think I’m right. Though, if I use my own feelings as a reference...... if there was a trigger, I could totally see this turning into romantic feelings...... A- Anyway, as of now, that’s how things should be!!!)","She wasn’t entirely confident, but she thought about it with some level of certainty. Kaito was sincere and kind...... At the very least, she felt that the chances of this turning into a regrettable one-night mistake were close to zero.","(Wait...... Um, why am I holding hands with Kaito-kun while walking? We’ve been holding hands all day, so I must have done it unconsciously...... But letting go now would feel weird...... Still, this totally looks like I’m being taken home after a date. Well, technically, we’re heading to my place...... B- But what should I do? Is the hug already a done deal? I feel so freaking embarrassed here...... N- No, but if we’re going to do it, I think I’ll need to go with the flow and act on impulse. And, even if it wasn’t intentional, the mood is already leaning in that direction...... So maybe...... this could be an opportunity?)","There wasn’t much distance left to her shop, meaning she had little time to think. Should she go through with the hug when they arrived, or should she just act like nothing happened and part ways in front of the shop...... While Kaori was lost in thought, her mind spinning in circles, Kaito spoke up.","[Umm, Kaori-san......]","[I- It’s just gonna be a hug, okay!?]","[Eh? Ah, errr......]","[It’s just a hug, nothing more! In the West, it’s a casual greeting, so we’ll just do a quick hug and say \"see you later\"! Anything beyond that is too soon, and absolutely not happening!!!]","[Eh? Ah, yes.]","Kaori, flustered by the sudden conversation, responded in a panic———— completely unaware that she had just blocked her own escape route.","Kaito had initially called out to her because with his Sympathy Magic, he had noticed her bewilderment and was about to suggest “Olivia-san said that, but we don’t have to worry about it. We can just part ways when we get to the shop.”...... However, before he could say that, Kaori cut him off with overwhelming vigor———– sealing the fate of them having the hug.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Going on a date, and within a good atmosphere, getting taken home by an older woman...... Normally, that would lead straight to a morning-after scenario. Well, with Kaito-san’s self-control, there’s no issue at all, but still......]","Makina : [How nice...... My children falling in love with each other...... This is exactly the kind of thing I love to see......]","Serious-senpai : [......Alright, I'll just lie down here for a bit......]"]},{"number":2147,"title":"Chapter 2147: Date with Kaori and Olivia 36","paragraphs":["Before long, the two of them arrived at Kaori’s shop and entered through the back door. Naturally, since the owner, Kaori, was out, the lights inside were off, leaving the store in complete darkness.","[Errr...... I guess I don't have to light up the whole place. I'll just turn on the counter lights.]","[Alright.]","Since all they had to do was hug and be done with it, it wouldn’t take long. Kaori figured there was no need to turn on all the lights and instead activated only the Illumination Magic Tool attached behind the counter.","She then returned to Kaito, standing in front of him in the dimly lit store with a slightly nervous expression.","[Errr...... Alright then, how about we have our hug?]","[B- Bring it on......]","Kaito figured that the more they dragged this out, the more embarrassed she would get, so he took the initiative to suggest the hug. Kaori, though nervous, nodded in agreement. Even though Kaito had hugged his lovers many times before, that didn’t mean he was immune to the tension of this particular situation.","That said, he was still far better off than Kaori, who had never hugged anyone like this before. Naturally, it fell on Kaito to take the lead.","He reached out toward the stiff, anxious Kaori and gently wrapped his arms around her, embracing her as softly as he could.","(H- Hwaaah...... S- So this is a hug huh...... The closeness of our bodies is intense...... I mean, this feels way more perverted than I expected...... W- Wow...... I can feel Kaito-kun so close......)","Feeling Kaito’s arms on her back———- and more than that, the way her body was pressed up against his——— made every sensation overwhelmingly vivid, especially since her nerves were heightened by tension.","Then, another misunderstanding between Kaito and Kaori occurred. Kaito had planned to keep the hug brief and light, considering how nervous Kaori was. Just as he was about to pull away......","(Ah, errr, I’m supposed to hug back too, right? Like this...... wrap my arms around his back———– whoa...... Now we’re even closer......This is kinda bad......)","Just as Kaito was about to let go, Kaori wrapped her arms around his back. This sudden reciprocation caught him off guard, missing the timing to let her go.","For Kaori, this was her first-ever hug, and her only knowledge of it came from romance books. Wanting to do it right, she tightly embraced Kaito, pressing herself even closer.","At that point, Kaito was unsure of how to proceed. Seeing Kaori earnestly clinging to him...... he figured pulling away now would go against her intentions. So, he tightened his hold slightly, embracing her more firmly.","(......W- Whoa, this is really, um...... intense...... I can feel Kaito-kun’s warmth so clearly, and my heart is racing like crazy...... I- Is this alright? Can he hear it? Ah~~ but wait! This kind of scene happens in romance manga too! The whole \"What if he hears my heartbeat?\" thing...... I see, so this is what that feels like...... But, it’s not just embarrassing———– it’s also really...... comforting...... It actually feels...... kind of nice.)","The warmth of the hug was soothing for Kaori. A small smile formed on her lips as she closed her eyes, savoring the embrace.","However, a question suddenly popped into her mind.","(......Arehh? How long are we supposed to do this? K- Kaito-kuuuun, um, are we still gonna continue hugging? My heart is pounding so hard, and if we stay like this too long, I feel like my brain is going to melt......)","While Kaori had been the one to prolong the hug, her lack of experience meant she had no idea when it should end. She waited for Kaito to make the next move.","Meanwhile, Kaito, feeling Kaori still holding on tightly, decided to let her determine the duration...... In other words, he figured he would keep hugging her until she loosened her grip.","(N- Now that I’ve calmed down a bit, the embarrassment is hitting me even harder...... Wait, isn’t this a huge deal?! W- When do I let go? Should I look up at Kaito-kun’s face to check? B- But if I do that now, wouldn't it totally look like I’m waiting for a kiss? W- W- W- What do I do......)","As time passed and her intense nervousness gradually subsided, Kaori's sense of embarrassment grew stronger and stronger, causing her face to turn an even deeper shade of red.","The hug continued for a while longer, as both of them failed to find the right moment to separate...... until eventually, Kaito, realizing that this had gone on long enough, loosened his arms.","[......Kaori-san?]","[Yesh!?]","[Ah, no, errr, should we let go now?]","[Y- Y- Y- Yeah! I, uh, couldn’t figure out the timing, so it ended up lasting too long!!!]","At Kaito’s suggestion, they finally pulled apart. Kaori, fully aware that her face was burning up, found herself unable to look Kaito in the eye and kept her head slightly lowered.","Fortunately, the dim lighting in the shop worked in her favor, making her face as red as boiled octopus less noticeable from Kaito’s perspective.","[T- Thank you! A- And sorry for dragging you into doing something weird!!!]","[No, I also missed the right moment to let go, so it ended up going longer than expected. But, well, thank you for today.]","[No, no, I should be thanking you! I had so much fun being with you today, Kaito-kun. I- I’d love to go out and do something again sometime.]","[Yes, let’s definitely go somewhere again...... Well then, I think it's about time I head home.]","[Unn! Thanks again, see you later!!!]","Sensing just how overwhelmed Kaori was, Kaito chose to end the conversation quickly. With a brief farewell, he activated his Teleportation Magic Tool and disappeared.","Once she confirmed that Kaito was completely gone, Kaori, still flushed bright red, locked up the shop, turned off the counter light, and hurried upstairs to her bedroom.","[Uwaaaaaah...... My mind totally went full maiden mode...... T- This is so embarrassing......]","Just like that, she dove under her blanket and rolled around, groaning from the overwhelming embarrassment.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [T- The sweetness is way too high...... Aren't you completely basking in youth there...... If they actually became a couple, then...... Hyiihh......]"]},{"number":2148,"title":"Chapter 2148: Founder’s Reflections - Part 1","paragraphs":["While Kaori was writhing in embarrassment over hugging Kaito and all the other moments of shame she had been putting off, Olivia was quietly offering prayers after changing into the robes of the High Priest in the grand cathedral’s chamber.","Bathed in the moonlight streaming through the high windows of the dimly lit sanctuary, she presented a truly mystical figure worthy of being called a saint.","(Thanks to Miyama Kaito-sama, today was a truly wonderful day, but there are also many points for reflection. There were moments where I was able to act according to my pre-planned course of action, but there were also many instances where I was caught off guard and ended up revealing my own incompetence. If it were merely a case of the difference between expectation and reality, that would still be acceptable. After all, I have learned through Miyama Kaito-sama’s guidance that knowing something in theory and experiencing it firsthand are two entirely different things. However, being completely thrown off by something I had not even considered beforehand can only be attributed to my own lack of foresight. I must acknowledge the immaturity of my imagination and work on reflecting and improving myself......)","Perhaps it was because of her extremely earnest nature————- Olivia, still in a posture of prayer, was reviewing the day’s events and analyzing her areas for improvement.","This was something she had originally scheduled for after the date: to thoroughly reflect on the day’s events and consider how to improve in the future before transitioning into a prayer of gratitude for Kaito.","(First, regarding the initial shopping trip, as per Mizuhara Kaori's suggestion, I had already decided to follow Miyama Kaito-sama’s guidance. In that regard, there were no notable issues. As expected of Miyama Kaito-sama———— his choice of stores was impeccable, and his reliability was so admirable that I couldn’t help but be captivated. I was even granted the honor of walking hand in hand with him. For such boundless kindness, as vast as the sky and as deep as the sea, I must offer my gratitude.)","When it came to the window shopping guided by Kaito in the morning, Olivia had absolutely no complaints. Even now, as she recalled it, her heart overflowed with admiration for him.","Well, considering Olivia’s devout faith and overwhelming affection for Kaito, it was never likely that she would have any dissatisfaction with his choice of stores in the first place......","(As for the lunch that followed, while I was able to carry out the planned actions, I also became painfully aware of my own lack of foresight. Given how kind Miyama Kaito-sama is, I should have anticipated that he would reciprocate by feeding me in return. My strong inclination to serve and devote myself to Miyama Kaito-sama led me to overlook the possibility of receiving something from him. That was a mistake. Of course, my duty is to serve, but Miyama Kaito-sama’s wishes must also be considered, and imposing my assumptions is incorrect...... However, when he accepted and ate the food I had offered, the happiness I felt was indescribable. I was truly fulfilled in the act of serving Miyama Kaito-sama...... I want to do it again——— Hah?! H- How disgraceful! This is not the time to be thinking about such things!!!)","As she recalled her exchange with Kaito in the restaurant, Olivia momentarily smiled blissfully———– only to quickly compose herself and refocus her thoughts.","(Regarding the theater afterward, I ended up interlocking our fingers while holding hands————- something that was not originally planned. Though it was a spontaneous decision, I was able to execute it relatively well...... or so I foolishly thought. In truth, it was entirely thanks to Miyama Kaito-sama, who saw through my and Mizuhara Kaori’s conversation and, in his boundless mercy, adapted his actions to accommodate ours. Any success was entirely due to him, and all credit belongs to Miyama Kaito-sama. No, in fact, I would not be exaggerating to say that the joy of today was entirely thanks to Miyama Kaito-sama.)","If Kaito himself were present, he would have undoubtedly called that an exaggeration, but since there was no one that would retort, Olivia continued her thoughts, her unwavering devotion pushing her ever forward.","(Interlocking our fingers while holding hands was a profound reminder of the difference between theoretical knowledge and actual experience. I had thought it was merely a different way of holding hands———– how foolish of me. I never imagined that intertwining our fingers would create such an intense sense of closeness. The warmth of being enveloped in Miyama Kaito-sama’s large hand was one thing, but more than that, the deep connection I felt with him brought me immense joy. And above all, how truly honored I was to have Miyama Kaito-sama permit such an act...... Not only did he accommodate my sudden whim, but he also, in his boundless mercy, allowed an action that, under different circumstances, could have been deemed disrespectful. His kindness echoes across the heavens, and when the theater lights illuminated his profile at that moment, I felt as though I had witnessed the essence of art itself. My heart’s understanding of beauty expanded in that instant.)","Ultimately, whether it was because of her overwhelming love for Kaito or not, Olivia’s original goal had been to reflect on the day and identify areas for improvement...... However, no matter how hard she tried, her heart quickly became flooded with adoration for Kaito.","And so, for a while longer, Olivia remained lost in her endless internal praises of him.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Well, when it comes to Olivia, she’s not even trying to hide her overwhelming \"I love Kaito\" aura...... or rather, she has no intention of hiding it at all. As always, her heart is overflowing with praises for him.]","Makina : [She really gets it. I wish the other lumps of flesh would take a page from Olivia’s book and always be filled with gratitude for my beloved child.]"]},{"number":2149,"title":"Chapter 2149: Founder’s Reflections - Part 2","paragraphs":["Olivia was reflecting on her day in a prayer posture, but when she recalled what happened after watching the play at the theater, her expression twisted. The events following the performance were, without a doubt, the biggest point of reflection for her this time.","(Even now, just remembering the disgrace I showed after the play makes me want to bury my head in my hands. I intertwined my fingers with Miyama Kaito-sama’s and held hands with him. Watching a play I could project myself onto filled me with so much happiness that I became completely dazed, responding vaguely to his calls, and...... and...... M- Miyama Kaito-sama...... H- H- H- He embraced me......)","At first, Olivia's face contorted with anger and regret over her own lack of composure. But as she recalled what happened next, her face grew redder and redder.","If she had only been embraced, she might have simply felt guilt over troubling Kaito due to her immaturity. However, in that moment, Olivia had mistaken the sudden situation for a dream and, before she knew it, had acted spoiled toward Kaito———— an unbearably mortifying disgrace in her eyes.","(Aaaahhh...... W- What foolishness have I done!? Just remembering it now fills me with despair over my own shamelessness! Making Miyama Kaito-sama go through all that was already an unforgivable crime, but on top of that, I clung to him myself and...... r- rubbed my cheek against him...... such a lewd and disgraceful act———– wouldn't that make me no better than a wanton woman!? Acting as if I were in heat, an utterly pathetic and foolish display...... I feel the urgent need to cleanse my folly through ascetic training, but...... b- but first, I must reflect. My punishment will come after I have reviewed everything.)","Of course, neither Kaito nor Kaori, who had been present at the time, thought of Olivia’s actions as disgraceful or inappropriate...... In fact, with Olivia’s usual earnestness and pure-hearted demeanor, no one would have found her behavior obscene.","However, for Olivia, who would blush even at the slightest exposure of skin, what she had done was so embarrassing that she felt like her face would burst into flames.","(A- Anyway, if I dwell on this too much, I might be crushed by my own shame and stupidity, so let’s move on. At the café we visited afterward, everything went as planned, and there were no major unexpected developments. If I think about it that way, I might think things were acceptable, but I do need to reflect on the fact that I underestimated the greatness of Miyama Kaito-sama. It should have been obvious that someone as wise as him, with a gaze that sees all, would easily see through my small-minded thoughts...... and yet I foolishly forgot something so fundamental.)","Had she voiced this thought directly to Kaito, he would have surely interjected to deny it. Unfortunately, she was alone in the prayer room, lost in thought, with no one to offer such a rebuttal.","As she continued reflecting, she recalled what had happened on the boat and on the way to the hilltop park...... and her face turned so red that it seemed steam might start rising from her head.","(......J- Just thinking about all that is making my face feel like it’s boiling. There are far too many things to reflect on. Indeed, this must be the trial bestowed upon me by the great Shallow Vernal-sama...... a test that teaches me that things do not go exactly as I wish. But now that I think about it...... in a way, I have fulfilled the trial given to me by Shallow Vernal-sama. Of course, it was far from perfect, and next time, I intend to invite Miyama Kaito-sama with a flawless plan and complete our date successfully...... but is there...... perhaps a next stage? No, I still lack the wisdom to fully comprehend the deep and noble will of Shallow Vernal-sama, but through this experience, I can feel my own growth. In that case, should I consider advancing to the next step? But what exactly is the next step......?)","The entire ordeal had begun as an order from Shallow Vernal. While Olivia did not feel she had achieved a perfect outcome, she believed she had at least carried out the command.","Recognizing this as a trial given to her for personal growth, she pondered what she should do to continue evolving.","And just at that moment, Shallow Vernal’s voice echoed in her mind.","(......Speaking of which, I hadn’t considered what comes next. So, I’ve decided just now.)","(S- Shallow Vernal-sama!? Ah! Please, command me as you wish. Though I am still inexperienced, I will surely overcome any trial you set before me!)","(Trial? No, this isn’t really a trial...... but let’s see. Next, at any time you set, go to the beach with Kaito-san and have a date with him. Just like I had done with him before.)","(W- What!? To be allowed to follow in Shallow Vernal-sama’s footsteps, even in a small way, is the greatest honor. I will most certainly carry out this command!)","(Good. Oh, and since it’s the beach, of course, make sure to wear a \"swimsuit\".)","(......P- Please forgive my rudeness in asking this question. Um, does this mean only Miyama Kaito-sama will wear a swimsuit while I assist him to ensure his comfort...... or...... um......)","(You will also wear a swimsuit and enjoy the beach together with Kaito-san. Just like I had done with him.)","(.....................................Y- Yesh.)","Once again, it must be emphasized————– Olivia was someone who found even the slightest exposure of skin to be unbearably embarrassing...... And so, a new ordeal was about to begin for her.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Airhead God!? What kind of outrageous killer pass are you making!?]","? ? ? : [Well, she did say \"at any time you set\", and knowing Olivia-san’s personality, it'll take her some time to make up her mind. So, that would still be a ways off, but it looks like the next date with Olivia-san has already been decided.]"]},{"number":2150,"title":"Chapter 2150: Special Product 1","paragraphs":["Beyond a door in the backyard of Kaito's house in the Kingdom of Symphonia...... within an extremely special space created by the Omnipotent God Canalis, three figures——— Nebula, Canalis, and Illness———- gazed at the item before them.","[......It's finished, isn't it?]","[Howeveeeer, I feel like we might haaaaaave overdone it a bit.]","[Even though we haven't used any components that don't exist in this world, this isn't something that can be made normally. If anyone in this world could replicate it, it would be either Shallow Vernal or Machine God...... Makina-san, I suppose. Tahaa~~ did I let too much of my God Power seep into this......?]","At Nebula’s murmured words, Illness looked unusually shaken, while Canalis, despite their usual lack of expression, her voice gave off an impression of having \"gone too far\".","[Still, considering that this item bears Master's name, there was no way we could afford to cut corners. No matter the path we took, I feel like this was always going to be the end result.]","[That’s true. However, just in case, I'll scan it once more to ensure there are no addictive properties.]","If something is too deliciouuuuus, its taste in itself could lead to addictioooooon. If that happeeeeens, the only way to counter it would be to lower the quality of the taaaaaste.]","The three of them were discussing the completion of a special tea blend named after Kaito———— <MK Royale>.","Having been meticulously crafted with the utmost care, it had reached a state of undeniable perfection...... to the point where it was too perfect. Even these three, who stood at the pinnacle of power, were beginning to think \"Isn't this too delicious that it's dangerous?\". It had become a divine treasure of such extraordinary quality that only those on the level of an omnipotent being could hope to recreate it.","However, intentionally lowering the quality or compromising on the taste of the highest-grade tea named after Kaito...... was that even an option? As Nebula had pointed out, regardless of the process, they would have inevitably arrived at this conclusion.","[......For now, let’s add a mental effect that prevents withdrawal symptoms from occurring due to excessive deliciousness. Tahaa~~ but still, how are we going to sell this?]","[We originally planned for it to be a luxury product, so let’s set the price high and strictly limit the quantity. Let’s say...... only enough for 10 cups of tea per month, available to just one person......]","[For this teeeea, we should make it available only through a lotteryyyyyy. Even Kaito-sama’s frieeeeeends should be treated the same waaaaay.]","To maintain the exclusivity of MK Royale, they decided to limit its availability to a mere handful each month through a lottery system.","They also planned to use a specially crafted, high-end container for the tea leaves, along with an exclusive design for the accompanying cup and teaspoon, as later discussions would confirm.","[......Well, for now, let’s have the Master taste it.]","With the general plan settled, Nebula suggested they let Kaito try it. Canalis went to call him and soon returned with him.","After listening to their explanation, Kaito took a sip of the tea they had brewed for him. His eyes widened in shock, and he froze on the spot. For several seconds, he remained completely still...... before finally opening his mouth.","[......Wait, this is too good...... I think I just blacked out for a second from how delicious it was......]","[Yes, to be honest, we also thought we might have gone a bit overboard. But in the end, unless we intentionally held back or compromised on the flavor, we believe we would have reached this outcome regardless.]","[We plan to market it as Nifty's highest-grade product, available only through limited special sales. From our initial discussion, the idea is to conduct a monthly lottery among customers who have purchased at least one item from Nifty that month. Buyers would either receive a lottery ticket with their purchase and enter manually, or since I can track all purchases, I could automatically select eligible customers, notify the winner, and if they decline to buy, redraw the winner.]","[I see...... but honestly, making it into some sort of phantom product gives it a special appeal, which I think is actually pretty nice.]","With Kaito joining the discussion, they continued deliberating and ultimately decided to go with the automatic entry system proposed by Canalis. The winner would be chosen once a month through a lottery, with Kaito drawing the winning ticket himself. ꭆANŏbĘs","Once they had settled on the general plan, Canalis retrieved a lottery box and placed it on the table.","[Alright, let's have Kaito-sama draw the first winner as a test...... The product doesn't take too long to prepare, after all. Well, there will still be some time before we make an official announcement and begin actual sales.]","[Understood. Well, this is just a test for now...... but there sure are a lot of entries.]","[Nifty has been doing quite well, and we've included both in-café purchases and orders made through tablets for friends.]","[I see...... Alright then, let's go with———- this one!]","At Canalis's prompting, Kaito drew a ticket, officially determining the first-ever winner of Nifty's special product, MK Royale.","<Afterword>","Maid : [Ohhh!?]","Great Tree Princess : [Ohhh!?]","Stomachache Warriors : [Hyiiihh......]"]},{"number":2151,"title":"Chapter 2151: Special Product 2","paragraphs":["I flip through the pamphlet in my hand, checking it. This pamphlet is distributed by Nifty once a month to those who wish to receive it, containing information about new products, campaign details, seasonal lineup changes, and recommended products, making it useful as a reference when shopping.","They also plan to announce information about MK Royale in this pamphlet.","[How’s it looking?]","[Unn. As always, the writing’s good and it’s fun to read. Well, I do think some of the introductions are a little exaggerated......]","[No, no, Kaito-san, for stuff like this, a little exaggeration is just right.]","[Is that how it is? Well, as far as I can see, there's no problem at all. I’ll have Canalis-san and the others do the final check.]","The person standing before me with a slight smug expression is Alyssa, who has materialized through Αναμνήσεις, and in fact, she has been making our pamphlet every month.","Originally, as part of the training for Αναμνήσεις, I had been materializing someone every day, and during that time, Alyssa expressed her desire to write books and newspapers. Alyssa, who aspires to be a journalist and enjoys writing articles, had this request, and I wanted to fulfill it for her. However, due to my current lack of skill, I am unable to materialize someone for extended periods.","After discussing various options, we decided to have Alyssa make the pamphlet for Nifty's PR information.","[Kaito-san, remember our promise———– when the new model of the Recorder Magic Tool comes out, you absolutely have to buy it right away.]","[I know, I know. But the one I have now is the latest model that just came out recently, so it seems like a new model won’t be coming for a while.]","[Hmmm, it’s still too big though......]","The pamphlet includes pictures taken with recording magic tools, and since Alyssa wants a camera, we agreed that as a reward for making the pamphlet, I would buy the new model of the Recorder Magic Tool as soon as it comes out.","I’ve also asked Kuro to let me know when a new model is released, so the Image Magic Tool Alyssa currently has is still a relatively new model that isn’t widely available yet.","However, compared to cameras in our world, it’s still quite large. It’s not impossible to carry, but it’s big enough to be quite a hassle.","[Well, Recorder Magic Tools are still a new technology in this world, so if they continue to develop, they should become smaller over time.]","[Yeah~~ Well, I also want to carry a camera and go on reporting assignments as a journalist soon...... but right now, there’s the issue of time limitations. For that, we’ll just have to count on your progress, Kaito-san.]","[Ahaha...... I’ve managed to extend it by 5 minutes...... but for now, my goal is to break an hour.]","Currently, the activation time for my Αναμνήσεις is about 20 minutes. It's a bit longer than before, but still quite short. However, just by using it daily without doing anything special, the time is gradually increasing. If I keep at it, I should eventually be able to have them materialize for longer periods.","[Oops, my body’s starting to fade. It’s almost time huh...... Well, Kaito-san, if you have any corrections, let me know tomorrow.]","[Yeah, got it. Thanks, Alyssa.]","[No problem, I enjoy writing the articles too. See you again~~]","I wave back at Alyssa as she smiles and waves, then deactivate Αναμνήσεις. While there’s a limit on the usage time, I’ve gotten quite used to using it, so I don’t feel any fatigue at all.","Well, on the other hand, that also means the duration isn’t tied to my stamina or energy, so the only way to extend it is by steadily improving my skill over time......","For now, the preparations for announcing MK Royale are nearly complete. That said, the announcement is mostly just an introduction explaining how the lottery will work, along with a showcase of the original-design cup and spoon that come as part of the set.","The winner for the first round has already been decided. If they choose not to purchase it, a redraw will take place, but considering their financial situation, I doubt that’ll be an issue———- they’ll probably go ahead and buy it. rΑNò𐌱ÊŚ","Still, when I first saw the result, I was a little surprised. For a moment, I wondered, When did they go shop in our store? But after thinking it over, I realized that purchases made using the tablet-type magic tools also count, so it’s not strange that they could have bought from us without me knowing.","With that in mind, I leave my room and head toward Canalis-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Hmm, so the winner's identity is still being kept a secret huh...... And this means Eris is out of the running, right? Since they're someone Kaito didn't know shops and eats Nifty's products, that also eliminates Kuro, Ein, Jutia, Camellia, Rosemary, Ariel, and Tirtania...... I was sure the first draw was gonna lead to a stomachache but......]","? ? ? : [This time, it's just a lottery for the \"right to purchase\", so even if Eris had won, she could just refuse to buy it and trigger a redraw———– meaning she’d have an escape route from getting hit with stomachache...... So wouldn't the stomachache find a different path her way instead?]","Serious-senpai : [......So the stomachache is inevitable huh......]"]},{"number":2152,"title":"Chapter 2152: Special Product 3","paragraphs":["In a room of the Hamilton Marquisdom's mansion, located in Archlesia Empire's Imperial Capital, the legitimate heir, Eris, was processing a large number of letters.","At present, she was not yet a marquis but a marquis' daughter, so she should have received fewer letters compared to a noble family's head...... However, as she had now become the talk of high society, she was receiving an overwhelming number of letters, enough to form literal piles.","(Letters that seem to be prying out of vulgar curiosity can be ignored. I don't believe anyone sending such letters will be of any benefit to the Hamilton Marquisdom or me in the future. As for those that seem addressed to the Hamilton Marquisdom rather than to me personally, I should reply asking them to resend their inquiries to Father...... The real issue, of course, is the questions related to Kaito-sama. How much should I answer? Will my response cause any trouble for him? I need to carefully assess these aspects, which means it will take some time.)","Eris was carefully composing her replies, discerning what she could and could not say, what should and should not be conveyed. Before long, a knock on the door was heard, and her father, Marquis Hamilton, entered the room holding two envelopes.","[Father?]","[I happened to run into the maid who was bringing these to you. Given the content, I thought it might also concern me, so I took the liberty of bringing them myself.]","[......I see, this is an envelope from Nifty. I can already guess the contents of one of them———– it's the monthly product catalog.]","[Ah, that one. I must say, offering a catalog filled with photographs taken using Recorder Magic Tool for free to interested parties really shows their overwhelming financial power.]","[Indeed. The fact is, Kaito-sama's wealth is on a level that even ordinary nobles can't compare to. Moreover, Nifty itself has solidified its position as a high-end tea brand in an incredibly short time due to its outstanding quality. It has also gained a significant following among nobles, so their profits must be extraordinary.]","Answering her father, Eris opened the first envelope and took out the product catalog. She casually flipped through its pages...... until her eyes widened, and she froze.","[......F- Father...... This is......]","[The pinnacle of tea leaves, limited to only one person per month...... Now that is quite something.]","[It seems the first draw has already been conducted. Naturally, the winner's name is not disclosed. Well, if a lower-ranking noble were to win, there might be individuals who would try to exert pressure on them. Keeping their identity a secret is only reasonable to ensure their safety.]","[......Wait, Eris...... What about the other envelope?]","[..........................]","As Eris and Marquis Hamilton were stunned by MK Royale's introduction in the catalog, they quickly realized something. The marquis had brought \"two envelopes\"...... one of which Eris had no recollection of.","[......N- No, that can't be it. The prize is merely the right to purchase, and this envelope is far too large. It’s the size of a book...... If anything, if I had won, I would have declined the purchase.]","[Ah, true. Our household has gained far too much in a short period. Any more, and we might invite unnecessary resentment. Even if you won, declining would be the best course of action.]","[But in that case, I truly have no idea what this could be. Just what is inside......]","Thinking it was unlikely to be a letter notifying her of a prize, Eris opened the envelope. Inside, she found a large, thin book, something resembling a catalog...... and a letter.","[......Ah, I see. So that's what this is...... Father, this concerns the right to order porcelain with our family crest, which Kaito-sama previously granted us. It seems the official launch is approaching, so they sent me this catalog as I have priority ordering rights. It looks like we can have the family crest added to the porcelain items listed in this catalog.]","[I see...... Nifty's porcelain is in extremely high demand. This will add prestige to our household. Hmm, judging by the catalog, there are quite a variety of options. Not just tableware, but also vases and interior decorations......]","[I suppose we should discuss what to order with Mother as...... well...... Eh?]","[Unn? What's the matter?]","The conversation had been progressing smoothly, but as Eris continued reading the letter, her expression visibly shifted to one of bewilderment. Seeing this, Marquis Hamilton asked her with a questioning look.","After a brief silence, Eris, now pale-faced, read aloud the latter part of the letter.","[......I- I’ll read it as is...... \"Furthermore, regarding the order placed by Lady Eris Dia Hamilton, considering her connection with Nifty’s representative, Miyama Kaito, the porcelains will be personally crafted by the very artisan who produced Nifty’s initial lot.\"......] ŗâNΟʙΕ§","[..............................]","Hearing Eris' words, which carried a slight tremble, Marquis Hamilton looked up at the ceiling with an indescribable expression on his face. Nifty’s porcelains were already highly sought after, but the so-called \"initial lot\" held an almost legendary status, considered to be of unparalleled value.","The porcelains sold at Nifty’s stores were already of exceptional quality, but those from the initial lot were on another level entirely———— anyone with a discerning eye could immediately recognize that they were crafted by an artisan possessing world-class expertise. There were even those willing to spend a fortune just to obtain a cup from that lot.","However, what made this even more mysterious was the fact that the identity of this initial lot’s creator remained entirely unknown. Despite possessing what was likely the highest level of craftsmanship in the world, no one could identify the artisan, and the only way to obtain their work was through Nifty’s limited re-releases.","And now, from the wording of this letter...... it was clear that while this artisan did not normally take part in the production of family-crest-adorned porcelains, they would make a personal exception for Eris’ order. Realizing the significance of this, Eris unconsciously clutched her stomach.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Even though she had perfectly evaded the lottery result that's practically the main event, she's getting gut-punched by something totally unrelated...... So this is the new generation of Stomachache Warrior huh......]","? ? ? : [In Lilia-san’s case, the main result hits her directly, so it's a whole different experience. Well, as for this lottery announcement, Lilia-san doesn’t actually need to buy anything from the store. She can negotiate directly with Illness, Nebula-san, Kaito-san, or Canalis-san. In the first place, she already receives samples of new products as gifts, so she hasn’t made any additional purchases, meaning she wasn’t even eligible for the lottery.]","Serious-senpai : [......I see. So Lilia is out of the running as well then.]"]},{"number":2153,"title":"Chapter 2153: Special Product 4","paragraphs":["At Kuromueina's Castle, Demon Realm, Kuromueina watched Ein, who was hanging her head with an indescribable expression. A short while ago, a Nifty promotional pamphlet had arrived, and upon reading it, Ein learned of the existence of MK Royale. At the same time, she realized that she had not won the lottery for it, plunging her into deep despair.","[......The pinnacle of tea leaves bearing Kaito-sama’s name...... They must be absolutely amazing tea leaves. And yet...... only one person per month? T- Then, even knowing of its existence...... I can’t even reach for it......? I- Is there no way to find out who won......?]","[Uh, and what would you do if you found out? If you went barging into the winner’s place and made a fuss, I’d seriously get mad, you know?]","[......Uuuu......]","Ein had a deep passion for tea and was also a fan of Nifty's...... no, Nebula's tea leaves. She was desperate to try MK Royale.","However, even if she thinks so...... Even still...... Ein had a clear sense of priorities. She truly loved tea and had a strong attachment to it...... but Kaito ranked far, far above it.","She understood the extreme exclusivity of MK Royale and knew that coveting it too much would cause trouble for Kaito. So, while she desperately wanted to drink it, she refrained from rushing to Kaito and instead wallowed in her despair.","[Well, you’ll just have to wait for the next lottery and hope for the best.]","[But it’s only one winner per month...... Who knows when I’ll ever get to drink it......]","[I guess that kind of exclusivity is part of its appeal, so there’s no helping...... Unn?]","Kuromueina, who had been gently patting Ein’s head to comfort her, noticed a hummingbird arriving just at that moment, and she checked the message.","[......Errr, there’s no one around here with weak magical power, so this spot should be fine.]","[What is it?]","[Isis wants to come over for something...... I’ll send her this room’s world coordinates.]","[Isis? It’s rare for her to visit your castle, Kuromu-sama.]","Kuromueina’s castle was protected by a powerful Teleportation Obstruction Barrier, but that meant nothing to Isis, whose Teleportation Magic was among the best in the world. Kuromueina sent the coordinates of the room they were in.","Moments later, ice appeared within the room. It shattered and vanished, revealing Isis.","[......Hello...... Kuromueina...... Ah...... Ein’s here too...... That's perfect.]","[Welcome, Isis.]","[Glad to see you, Isis. What do you mean by \"That's perfect\"?]","[......I had...... business with both of you...... I was going to meet Kuromueina first...... then ask her to call for Ein......]","Apparently, Isis had business with both Kuromueina and Ein, and she smiled happily that they were already together.","[Business with the two of us?]","[......Unn...... Well, more like...... an invitation? ......Errr...... Ah...... That thing...... Ein, what you’re holding...... Kaito’s tea brand...... That MK Royale...... I won the lottery for it......]","[ [ ! ? ] ]","At Isis’ casually spoken words, Kuromueina and Ein’s eyes widened in shock. Neither of them had expected that the very person they had been talking about, the first lottery winner, would be Isis. RaNộ𐌱Ёș","[Eh? Then, you’re the first winner, Isis!?]","[......Unn...... When I ordered through their magic tool...... I didn’t have to go to the store...... And it’s Kaito’s shop, so I wanted to try it...... So I bought some of their products...... And I won 10 servings of MK Royale...... There are seven of us, including my subordinates...... so I have three servings left...... And since Ein likes tea...... I thought I’d invite you and Kuromueina...... so I came.]","[Isis!]","Hearing Isis' words, Ein grasped both of Isis' hands with her own, her eyes welling with tears as she spoke with deep emotion.","[I am truly proud from the bottom of my heart to have such a kind and considerate person like you as my family! Thank you so much!!!]","[......U- Unn...... Errr...... if you’re happy, then...... I’m glad.]","[Ahaha, Ein was just feeling down because she desperately wanted to try MK Royale. But I was interested too, so I’m really happy that you invited us, Isis. By the way, with me and Ein joining, what about the last remaining cup?]","[......Errr...... I invited Lillywood...... but...... Lillywood said she hardly drinks anything other than water...... so she wanted Jutia, who loves tea, to have it instead...... so I plan to invite Jutia.]","[I see. Jutia loves tea just as much as Ein, so I’m sure she’s curious about MK Royale too.]","After seeing Kuromueina nod in understanding, Isis suddenly turned to Ein as if she had just thought of something.","[......That's right...... I think Ein's probably better at brewing tea...... so if it’s okay with you...... would you make it for us?]","[Of course! I’d be honored to do it!!]","[......U- Unn...... I’ll leave it to you then.]","Ein responded with a volume even Isis, who had known her for a long time, had never heard before...... Seeing Ein’s excitement at its peak, Isis seemed slightly bewildered, while Kuromueina watched with a wry smile.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, so the winner was Isis...... It makes sense that Kaito was briefly surprised at first, considering that going to the store in person would be difficult for her. And in the end, both Ein and Jutia get to drink MK Royale, while Isis gets to have a tea party with her subordinates and Kuromueina...... In a way, Isis winning might have been the best possible outcome.]","? ? ? : [Kaito-san's luck stat is insane, so he probably just picked at random and ended up with the perfect winner.]"]},{"number":2154,"title":"Chapter 2154: Special Product 5","paragraphs":["In one corner of the Great Central Forest of the Demon Realm, at the home of the Great Tree Princess Jutia, Tirtania, who had come over for a visit, was nibbling on the mini cookies Jutia had prepared while speaking to Jutia, who was slumped over the table with her head down.","[Jutia, cheer up, okay?]","[......You know, you know...... The pamphlet says the lottery has already been drawn, but like...... even though the draw is done, they haven’t notified the winners yet, right? So, isn’t there still a chance that it could be redrawn?]","[Normally, I think they’d tell the winners before the pamphlet comes out. Even if they didn’t, wouldn’t they at least tell them at the same time?]","[......Yeah, you’re right...... Uuuu...... MK Royale...... I want to try it so, so badly......]","Just like Ein, Jutia had also taken great interest in the MK Royale article featured in Nifty’s pamphlet. However, at the same time, she was devastated to learn that she wasn’t among the initial winners.","Of course, she understood the intent behind the product, so she wasn’t about to storm off to Kaito. Still, the fact that she wouldn’t be able to drink MK Royal had left her in deep despair, her face buried in the table.","[Tir didn’t win either, but since one person gets chosen every month, wouldn’t you end up winning at least once in, like, a hundred years? I think you should just relax and wait~~]","[Ughhh...... The fact that there’s a tea out there that I’ve never tasted before, it’s just so, so painful......]","Tirtania, who had a very relaxed sense of time, didn’t think missing out on the lottery was a big deal at all. Just as she said, she figured \"I’ll probably win sometime within the next hundred years\" and left it at that.","Well, it also helped that she wasn’t as much of a tea lover as Jutia. She wasn’t particularly invested in MK Royale; rather, she was more interested in the fruit tart from Nifty’s café, which was featured later in the pamphlet.","As they were talking, Jutia suddenly lifted her head from the table, and at the same time, Tirtania’s face lit up as she turned toward the entrance.","[It’s Lillywood-sama!]","[Yeah, yeah. I wonder if she needs something? Or maybe she just came to check on me?]","Muttering to herself, Jutia walked towards the entrance, and just as they had sensed, a knock echoed through the house and Lillywood had arrived.","\"Hello, Jutia...... Oya, I see Tirtania is here as well.\"","[Welcome, Lillywood-sama. Please, come in......]","[Hello there, Lillywood-sama~~]","Jutia and Tirtania greeted Lillywood with smiles...... Lillywood valued communication with her subordinates and kin, so she would occasionally visit their homes for casual chats.","If there were an urgent matter requiring the action of the Seven Princesses, she would use special magic to inform them rather than coming in person. From the atmosphere of her visit, Jutia judged that there wasn’t anything urgent this time, so she invited Lillywood inside. She then took a high-quality bottle of water from her magic box, poured it into a cup, and placed it in front of Lillywood.","Since Lillywood only drank water and didn’t partake in tea, her kin, including the Seven Princesses, always made sure to have fine water stored in their magic boxes to serve her when she visited.","[Here you go, Lillywood-sama...... Did you come to check on me today?]","\"Thank you. Yes, that’s part of it...... but I also came to confirm your schedule regarding another matter. Have you heard that Kaito’s tea brand is holding a lottery, selling MK Royale tea leaves to just one winner?\"","[Eh? Ah, yes. We were actually, actually just talking about that.]","Lillywood, having confirmed that Jutia knew about MK Royale, gave a nod before getting to the main point.","\"Actually, Isis won the first MK Royale lottery.\"","[Eh!? I- Isis-sama is the first winner!?]","\"Yes. And it seems she has an extra serving to spare. She invited me to join her, but...... as you know, I hardly drink anything other than water. So, I asked her if she would be willing to let you, a tea lover, have it instead. She gladly agreed, so I came to check your availability.\"","[L- Lillywood-sama...... T- Thank you so much!!! Any time works for me!!!]","[Jutia, congratulations~~ That’s great!]","\"Fufufu, be sure to thank Isis. Ever since she gained subordinates, she seems to have found more emotional stability, and just like this time, she’s even started actively engaging with other factions...... Things have been truly delightful.\"","The despair that had gripped Jutia moments ago vanished completely, replaced by a face that radiated pure joy. Seeing this, Tirtania also happily congratulated her.","As Lillywood watched the heartwarming scene with a smile, she genuinely felt pleased at Isis’ gradual change————- how she was becoming more open and willing to interact with people beyond the Six Kings.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The fact that Tir isn't envious of Jutia and is instead genuinely happy for her really shows her good nature. Well, it probably helps that she’s not as obsessed with tea as Jutia is......]"]},{"number":2155,"title":"Chapter 2155: Special Product 6","paragraphs":["With MK Royale and the long-planned family crest service, Nifty are both going extremely well. I’ve even seen magazine features on them, which, honestly, makes me feel a little proud.","Well, the management is mainly handled by Canalis-san, while promotion and other tasks are taken care of by Anima and Caraway...... I haven’t really done anything. The most I did was handle the lottery for MK Royale.","The first winner of MK Royale’s lottery, Isis-san, has already received her prize. Since she’s my lover, I delivered it to her personally. It seems she’s planning to invite Ein-san and Jutia-san over for a tea party.","The fact that Ein-san and Jutia-san, who are very obsessive about tea, can now enjoy it is, in a way, a great result. Isis-san also seemed extremely happy...... Inspired by this tea party, she’s been discussing with her subordinates about hosting an even larger tea gathering soon, and I’ve promised to participate when that happens.","There’s a beautiful field of Blue Crystal Flowers created by Spica-san, and they’re planning to build a terrace overlooking it as a venue for the tea party.","[Well, I really haven’t done anything, but seeing magazine features like this makes me happy.]","[Wouldn’t it have been nice if you did an interview too, Human-san?]","[N- No, that would honestly be a little embarrassing...... Oh, right, Elise-san, you went shopping at Nifty too, didn’t you? How was it?]","[I was impressed by how well the location and customer base were thought out. The product quality was good as well, but personally, I’d like them to serve some coffee.]","Elise-san is a devoted coffee drinker and rarely drinks tea. Well, she did try all the Nifty samples I gave her, so it’s not that she dislikes tea. She just really loves coffee......","That said, coffee huh...... Hmm, originally, Nifty’s tea leaves were something Nebula made as a hobby. If Nebula decides to make coffee, then that could work...... but does it make sense to insert a new coffee product to a tea brand? If anything, it might be better to create a separate coffee brand instead...... Not that I have any plans for that right now......","[I really appreciate your advice when opening Nifty, Elise-san. Thanks again.]","[No, I didn’t give any major advice. I just told you to stay put as the owner instead of running around restlessly. You’re way too impulsive———— like a walking explosive, always causing something to happen.]","[A- Ahaha......]","Elise-san spoke with a slightly exasperated expression, but her tone was gentle. It felt more like casual conversation than criticism.","As we continued chatting, Elise-san pulled out and spread some original cards that felt like tarot cards, flipping them over one by one.","[......Unn? That’s strange. A reversed \"World\" card here?]","[That’s different from tarot cards, right? What are you trying to read?]","[It’s similar. It’s based on tarot, but with additional custom cards. As for what I’m reading———– it’s about Human-san. This particular card should indicate a location, but with a reversed \"World\", it suggests somewhere outside of this world.] ꭆἁNo͍฿ËS","[Hmmm...... Oh, could it be about the otherworld? I have a special tool from Shiro-san that lets me travel over there...... so maybe something’s going to happen over there?]","[Ahh, that makes sense. But seriously, you can just casually travel between worlds...... You really do live outside the bounds of common sense.]","She was probably just killing time, but it seemed like Elise-san was reading my fortune.","[A right-side-up \"Banquet\" card...... Is there some kind of party or event in the otherworld?]","[Eh? I wonder? As of now, I don’t have any plans to go there soon......]","[Then maybe it’ll happen later. The next card...... suggests it’ll happen within the next six months. And these next two...... Hmm, this is another weird result. Well, Human-san is pretty unusual yourself......]","[Errr, what did it say?]","[In short, somewhere outside of this world, within the next 6 months, there will be some kind of event, where Human-san will face trouble or difficulty, but in the end, it’ll become a happy memory...... or something like that. Well, I just read it casually, so it might not be accurate......]","[Fumu......]","An event happening somewhere outside this world within the next six months...... Ah, could it be that? I promised Aoi-chan that we’d try using the gaming console Shiro-san gave me to see if we could play that MMO together. We’re planning to do that soon.","I don’t know if it’ll actually work, but if it does, the MMO takes place online...... From the perspective of this world, it’s essentially another world, a digital one. Even if I don’t physically go to another world, it still meets the condition of being \"somewhere outside this world\".","And MMOs usually have seasonal events. If I end up participating in one of those, that could be it. Unlike Aoi-chan, I’ve had a long break from the game, and all my equipment is outdated, so I’ll definitely struggle. Thinking about it that way, it does seem to fit the conditions.","[......Do you have an idea what it might be? Well, whatever it is, just don’t drag me into it...... Want a refill on your coffee?]","[Ah, thank you. I’ll have some.]","As always, Elise-san maintained her aloof demeanor, but in the end, she was still kind enough to pour me another cup of coffee. Just like that, we continued to chat idly for a while, enjoying our conversation.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As expected, this guy has completely forgotten about his own birthday again...... Last time too, it was only after Alice mentioned it that he remembered......]","? ? ? : [Looks like a solid stomachache flag is being set up for Kaito-san. Well, that aside, next arc would be about the tea party at Isis-san's castle then.]"]},{"number":2156,"title":"Chapter 2156: Special Product 7","paragraphs":["The castle of the Death King, Isis Remnant, Land of Death, Demon Realm...... While it is well known that Isis' castle exists in the Land of Death, few have actually visited it.","This is partly because the Land of Death itself is an extremely cold and harsh environment, a place where even monsters and animals avoid due to their fear of the magic power of death. However, another significant reason is that, in the past, Isis unconsciously exuded an intimidating presence, making it rare for even high-ranking noble demons or the Six Kings' executives to visit her castle.","Being one of the World King's Executives, Jutia had spoken with Isis several times before, but this was her first time visiting the castle.","[......Welcome...... Jutia.]","[Thank you for inviting me today, Isis-sama. I must say, I’m a bit surprised that you came to greet me in person.]","[......Everyone has been preparing for the tea party...... and since the only ones I invited this time are Ein, Kuromueina, and you...... so I decided to come greet you myself.]","[I see. Ah, I also brought some Fruits of the Spirit Tree as a gift. Please feel free to share it with your subordinates.]","[......Thank you...... This makes me happy.]","Jutia smiled as she spoke with Isis, who had come to welcome her, and handed over the gift she had brought. After giving her the Fruits of the Spirit Tree, Jutia used Space-Time Magic to retrieve something else.","It was a basket filled with colorful flowers, an arrangement made as interior decor.","[Oh, and also, and also, this is something my Claire and Bella insisted I bring for you, Isis-sama. They made it as an interior decoration. Apparently, they were really grateful for how kind you were to them during the celebration after the Harmonic Symphony.]","[......Those two? ......I see...... What beautiful flowers...... I had a great time back then too...... I should find a way to thank them......]","[If that’s the case, please feel free to reach out to them anytime. They both said they’d love to talk with you again......]","[......Then maybe next time...... I could invite them...... to a tea party?]","[Yes, I’m sure they’d be delighted.]","[......I see...... Unn...... I’m looking forward to it.]","Isis remembered Claire and Bella well. They were two of the World King's subordinates who had approached her during the tea party celebrating the Harmonic Symphony, and she recalled having a pleasant conversation with them.","Now that she no longer exuded an intimidating presence as she once did, her naturally kind-hearted personality had come to the forefront. For Claire and Bella, their conversation with Isis had been a truly enjoyable memory. When they heard that Jutia was visiting Isis’ castle, they had looked envious and entrusted her with a gift for Isis. If Isis were to invite them to a tea party, they would surely accept with joy.","After smiling happily at Jutia's words, Isis guided her to the terrace where the tea party was to be held.","[Oh my, oh my...... I’ve heard rumors, but I see a whole field of Blue Crystal Flowers. Hmmm, they match so, so well with the snowy landscape of the Land of Death.]","[I’m glad you think so~~ Nice to meet you! I’m the Spirit of the Blue Crystal Flowers, Spica.]","[Nice to meet you. I’m Jutia, the Great Spirit of the Spirit Tree and dependent of the World King Lillywood-sama. Pleased to meet you. I’ve heard about you, I’ve heard about you, from Lillywood-sama. I’m really happy to finally meet you.]","[Yup~~ I'm happy to meet you too!]","The terrace was not the same location as the future tea party venue, but from here, one could still see the Blue Crystal Flower field. As Jutia admired the flowers, Spica approached her and gave a brief introduction.","[......Spica...... can I ask you...... to guide Jutia? ......I need to...... go welcome Kuromueina.]","[Yup~~ Leave it to me.]","[......Thank you...... I’m counting on you.]","Among the invited guests for the tea party, Ein had arrived earlier since she was in charge of brewing tea. At the moment, she was assisting Iris with making teacakes. ŔANObËS","Kuromueina, on the other hand, had some tasks to complete before coming, making her the last of the invited members expected to arrive.","Since it was about time for Kuromueina to arrive, Isis entrusted Jutia's guidance to Spica and made her way toward the castle entrance.","On the way, she stopped by a room where she kept her treasured mementos, casting State Preservation Magic on the interior decoration made by Claire and Bella and displaying it in a visible spot. Then, with a joyful smile still on her face, she continued on to welcome Kuromueina.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Things are so peaceful over here...... but there's a marquis's daughter suffering from stomachache, you know!?]"]},{"number":2157,"title":"Chapter 2157: Special Product 8","paragraphs":["On the terrace of Isis’s castle, all the participants gathered, and the tea party began. Naturally, the main attraction was MK Royale. Ein skillfully placed a perfectly brewed cup of MK Royale before each person and then took a seat herself.","Normally, Ein would stand behind Kuromueina rather than sitting at the table, but this time, she had received prior permission from Kuromueina to join them.","Of course, Kuromueina thought there was no need for such permission, she could simply sit at the same table. However, it seemed that Ein’s dedication as a maid made her insist on following proper etiquette.","[......The color and aroma are both exquisite.]","[......Completely agree, completely agree. This is without a doubt a first-class tea......]","Ein and Jutia, who had been eagerly anticipating the MK Royale, stared at it as if trying to etch its color and appearance into their minds.","As Isis chuckled at the sight, she picked up her cup, and the others followed suit, taking a sip of MK Royale..... and in that instant, as if time had stopped, everyone froze for a brief moment.","[......Wow, this is amazing. I haven't had much tea before, but I had no idea something could taste this good.]","[......You're right. Same here———- I've never tried many kinds of tea, but even I can tell this is absolutely delicious.]","Eulpecula, her eyes sparkling with excitement, was deeply moved, and Spica, agreeing with her, nodded in amazement. Since Eulpecula was still young and Spica had only recently manifested in physical form, neither had much experience with tea.","Even so, they could tell that MK Royale was overwhelmingly delicious.","[This flavor is truly astounding. The depth and fragrance are remarkable, but more than anything, the sheer taste is overwhelming. It was so good that my mind momentarily stopped working.]","[Ahh, this is on a completely different level. No wonder they only select one winner per month———— it’s so overwhelmingly delicious that even the word \"exquisite\" doesn’t feel adequate.]","Sirius and Rasal were just as stunned by the incredible taste of MK Royale as everyone else.","[Wow, I drink tea often and enjoy it...... but I've never had anything like this before.]","[Indeed, this might be one of the ultimate forms for teas. Of course, there are many different types of tea, so it's impossible to say which one is definitively the best. However, this tea has undeniably reached the pinnacle of its particular flavor profile.]","Even Polaris, who frequently drank tea, and Iris, who was skilled in cooking and often brewed tea, were left astonished. Iris even described this tea as one of the ultimate forms of tea.","Kuromueina, equally impressed, turned to Isis beside her and spoke.","[This is incredible. Until now, I thought Glorious Tea was the best purely in flavor...... but this is clearly beyond that. Well, I hear Shiro made Glorious Tea rather casually, so if she really tried, she might be able to create something on this level too...... but still, this is a taste worthy of being called a divine miracle.]","[......Unn...... It's really...... delicious...... As expected...... of something that has Kaito’s name attached to it......]","As everyone voiced their admiration, Ein and Jutia, who had longed for this MK Royale, closed their eyes and shed tears.","[......Amazing, amazing...... I’m truly moved from the bottom of my heart. For flavors of tea that I had never even imagined to still exist, just realizing that makes me so happy...... Don’t you feel the same, Ein-sama?] ⱤÂNŏBÈS","[Yes, I wholeheartedly agree. I had studied tea with great dedication, refining my craft to what I thought was the utmost level...... Yet, this tea has shown me new possibilities beyond what I believed was the limit. Just as there is no limit to being a maid, there is no limit to tea. The journey of perfecting tea still continues. This was an indescribably wonderful experience that makes me excited for the future of tea.]","Ein and Jutia possessed a level of knowledge and skill that could be described as having mastered tea to its fullest extent. They had studied every existing variety of tea, leaving no stone unturned.","However, the tea leaves created by Nebula introduced them to a whole new realm of possibilities. The initial leaves that added a touch of astringency were one thing, but her other tea leaves were also unconventional and groundbreaking. It was as if the possibilities of tea were expanding before their very eyes. For the two tea enthusiasts, realizing that there was still more to explore was truly a joyous revelation.","[......But, but! This isn’t the ultimate form of tea. As a single flavor, it’s at the pinnacle of perfection right now, but tea has so many different varieties of aromas and tastes. There are still countless possibilities waiting to be discovered in other tea leaves.]","[Indeed. Tea will continue to evolve in the future. And we must also strive to refine our skills and knowledge, ensuring that we are always worthy of that progress.]","Their eyes gleamed as if looking toward the future. Whether or not the others could fully understand their sentiments was uncertain, but one thing was clear————- being able to taste MK Royale had been an extraordinary experience for both of them.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [While everyone else is just sharing their thoughts on the taste, these two are out here discussing the future of the tea world...... These two really are quite the hardcores.]"]},{"number":2158,"title":"Chapter 2158: Extra - : A Moment in Valentine’s Day","paragraphs":["The kitchen in Kaito’s house...... Since Kaito usually eats at Lilia’s mansion’s dining hall, meals are rarely prepared here.","However, sweets for tea time are made here, so the kitchen is better stocked with baking tools than cooking equipment. In this kitchen, surrounded by various ingredients, Illness had a slightly troubled expression.","Tomorrow was Valentine’s Day, and Illness was planning to give her beloved Kaito a chocolate filled with love. With cacao cultivated by Nebula among the ingredients, the preparations for making chocolate were perfect.","The question was———— what exactly should she make?","(......If one were to think about it normallyyyy, Kaito-sama’s preference leans toward slightly sweet truffles or chocolates with berry saaaauce, so going in that direction would be ideaaaaal. Buuuut, is it really fine to keep it that simpleeeeee? Kaito-sama will surely receive many chocolaaaaaates. Naturallyyyyyy, many of them will be flavors he liiiiiikes, so I’m worried he might get bored of having only the same type of chocolaaaaaate.)","Indeed, many people would be giving chocolates to Kaito. And naturally, many of them understood his preferences...... That meant there would be plenty of sweet truffles and chocolates with fruit sauce.","However, giving him a type of chocolate he didn’t like would defeat the purpose. She also considered making something other than chocolate, but it was likely that others had the same idea. As a result, there was a risk that too many people would avoid chocolate, leading to an abundance of non-chocolate sweets instead.","(For nooooow, since I have the ingredients, let's make some chocolaaaaaates. Buuuuut, I should keep the quantity in check. Even though they can be stored in a magic box without spoiliiiiiing, there’s a limit to how much Kaito-sama can eat at oooooonce. A small amount, juuuuuust enough for tea time, would be ideaaaaaal.)","Illness had one major advantage in this situation. As Kaito’s personal maid, she was responsible for all household chores, including preparing his tea and snacks.","That meant she could naturally serve her chocolate alongside tea without making a big deal out of it.","As she skillfully proceeded with the preparations, Illness continued to think.","(Of course, it should be a flavor Kaito-sama enjoooooys, but I think it would be nice to include something that reflects my personality toooooo. Before, I thought such a thing was unnecessaryyyyyy...... but I believe Kaito-sama would be happier if it had something unique to meeeeee.)","When she considered something that represented her, the first thing that came to mind was roses. Using rose ingredients might overlap with Rosemary, so instead, she decided to incorporate roses into the chocolate’s appearance.","She crafted a chocolate mold featuring a rose motif. Thanks to her experiences creating various things with Nebula, she quickly produced an exquisite mold.","She then mixed cacao butter with edible coloring to create a red chocolate shell. Using magic, she turned the mixture into fine particles and coated the surface of the mold before letting it harden. By pouring chocolate into this mold and letting it set, she could create chocolates with a red exterior.","(Kuhihi, maaaaaaaking sweets while thinking of my beloved is quite enjoyableeeeee.)","With that thought in mind, Illness continued crafting the chocolates she would give to Kaito.","The next day arrived, Valentine’s Day......","Due to the intense competition among those, including Shallow Vernal, who sought to be the first to give their chocolates the moment the date changed, Kaito was already somewhat exhausted. After finishing his breakfast and returning to his room, Illness prepared his post-meal tea with a wry smile.","[Kaito-samaaaaa, it seems today will be quite a busy one for youuuu.]","[A- Ahaha...... Well, it’s something to be grateful for. But at least I’ve already gotten through Shiro-san and Makina-san, so I can relax a little now.]","[Kuhihi, I see~~ In that caaaaaase, I shall take this opportunity to give mine noooooow. I thought it might be overwhelming if I prepared too muuuuuuch, so I made just three pieces for youuuuu.] ṙaΝÓᛒƐS","[Thank you, I really appreciate it...... Oh, these chocolates are shaped like roses. That’s so fitting for you, Illness-san. They’re beautiful and look delicious.]","Illness had prepared three chocolates modeled after the three roses she often used as a symbol of her love for Kaito. They were bite-sized, making them easy to eat.","Seeing them, Kaito happily expressed his gratitude, then picked up one chocolate and popped it into his mouth, his face lighting up with a smile.","[It’s delicious. The flavor is rich and sweet, yet the aftertaste is refreshingly light, making it really easy to eat.]","[Kuhihi, if it suits your taste, then nothing could make me happieeeeer. I poured all my love for you into it, Kaito-samaaaaaa.]","[Ahaha, hearing you say it like that is a bit embarrassing...... but it makes me really happy.]","Watching Kaito smile as he spoke, an indescribable sense of happiness welled up in Illness’s heart. Having the chocolates she carefully prepared be praised as delicious, and above all, being able to witness Kaito’s joyful smile up close...... there was no greater happiness for her. Mirroring Kaito's own radiant smile...... Illness’s expression was filled with warmth and contentment.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Fuah!? I just got sucker-punched by a sudden blast of pure, refreshing lovey dovey moment!?]"]},{"number":2159,"title":"Chapter 2159: Special Product 9","paragraphs":["While a peaceful tea party was being held on the Land of Death, Demon Realm, in the subspace located in Kaito’s backyard, Nebula was nodding in satisfaction as she gazed at the freshly fired items.","[It's become quite intricate thanks to all the effort we put in, but it fired beautifully, didn't it?]","[Yes. Tahaa~~ As expected of Nebula-san. Well, aside from the ones for Marquis Eris's daughter, we'll be preparing the family crest service ourselves, but with this method, it seems we can imprint the crests far more cleanly than before.]","[It was worth the effort. That said, being able to fire such large ceramics so beautifully was thanks to Canalis-san modifying the kiln. Since my abilities are currently limited, I always appreciate Canalis-san’s help. Thank you, as always.]","After saying that with a smile, Nebula approached Canalis and gently patted her head. Though Canalis remained expressionless, tears streamed from her eyes as she was moved to the core.","For Canalis, who proudly proclaimed herself a true loyal devotee, being able to assist Nebula was the ultimate joy. And now, not only had the Nebula she so revered praised her, telling her she was \"useful\", but she had even patted her head and personally expressed her gratitude. Words could not describe the sheer happiness she felt.","......Meanwhile, at that exact moment, a God from another world and a friend of Canalis, abruptly stood up and began shadowboxing toward the void. However, Canalis, basking in the peak of happiness...... would only come to learn of this after that fist, honed through countless shadowboxing, was delivered upon her.","After finishing most of her work for the day in the estate’s office, Lilia found herself with some free time and was considering training when Nebula came to visit her.","[Good afternoon, Lilia-san. Sorry to bother you while you're working.]","[Good afternoon. I had just finished a major portion of my work, so it’s no problem. Is something the matter?]","[Yes, the prototype for the family crest service we discussed with Nifty is ready, so I thought I’d show it to you......]","[Ah, right. You used our family crest as a sample, didn't you?]","Lilia had already heard about Nifty’s plan to offer a service that imprints family crests onto ceramics. During the discussions, she had been asked for permission to use the Albert Duchy's crest as a test case, and she had readily agreed.","After confirming Lilia’s nod, Nebula retrieved a massive plate, over a meter in diameter, from her magic box and placed it on the table.","[It's this one.]","[T- This is quite a large piece, isn't it?]","[Larger pieces have more visual impact, so I decided to make a large plate as a prototype.]","[I see, that aside, this is...... truly remarkable...... Not just our family crest, but is that Sky Castle and the Royal Capital?]","[Yes. I wanted to incorporate elements related to the Albert Duchy, so I chose the Sky Castle and the Royal Capital. The crest fits nicely in the center for balance.]","The plate Nebula had fired featured the Albert Duchy's crest prominently in the center, with a beautifully rendered Sky Castle and the royal capital of Symphonia depicted in the background.","As Lilia admired the craftsmanship, her expression gradually turned pale......","[......U- Um...... Nebula-san, d- don’t tell me...... this artwork wasn’t painted on after firing, but rather, the design was already completed at the time of firing?]","[Yes. No additional coloring was applied afterward. This is how it looked straight out of the kiln.]","Lilia wasn’t particularly interested in collecting ceramics, nor did she have a strong personal passion for them. However, as the head of a Duchy...... she had many opportunities to see fine porcelain at noble gatherings, so she had cultivated a refined aesthetic sense and a solid understanding of ceramics.","That was precisely why she understood. The plate Nebula had fired...... this was something that should be impossible with existing techniques......","[I- It feels somewhat similar to Symphonia Kingdom’s Five-Color Ceramics, but this clearly isn’t just five colors, is it?]","[Yes. I based the method on Five-Color Ceramics but developed a new technique and a unique glaze of my own. Currently, I can fire up to ten colors separately while maintaining vivid hues. This prototype was made using all ten colors, but since ten is quite difficult, Nifty’s service will be limited to a maximum of seven colors.]","[......I- I- I- I see...... This will revolutionize Symphonia Kingdom’s ceramic industry. A- And, that glaze...... Is it something that can’t be made through normal means?]","[No, it's actually quite easy to make with a few modifications to existing materials. I have no intention of monopolizing the technique, so if you need it, I can give you a written document detailing the method and the materials for the glaze. You may use it as you wish, Lilia-san.]","[......Yesh.]","Incidentally, the prototype pieces were originally promised to be given to Lilia. Naturally, since they featured the Albert Duchy’s crest so prominently, they couldn’t be given to anyone else. It was only logical that she would manage them. However...... This plate incorporated a new technique capable of revolutionizing the ceramics industry...... And the document that Nebula handed over so casually contained the method for this groundbreaking technique and the glaze that allowed more than five colors to be fired simultaneously...... At that moment, Lilia felt as though she had just been handed an enormous bomb.","[......Nebula-san, may I ask why you even attempted such a difficult...... or rather, such an entirely new method in the first place?]","[While discussing about Nifty's earthenware, Milord mentioned that something with more colors than Five-Color Ceramics would be beautiful. Since it was Milord's wish, fulfilling it is a given for this Absolute! So, after consulting with Canalis-san, we decided to develop this method.]","[......I...... see.]","Hearing Nebula’s response, Lilia had a complicated look on her face and swallowed the words \"That person probably just said that offhandedly without giving it much thought.\" that she was about to retort back.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Just when I thought I was suddenly punched, the Stomachache Warrior got hit too. I was impressed by Eris, but the stomachache power of the strongest Stomachache Warrior really is just on a different level......]"]},{"number":2160,"title":"Chapter 2160: Special Product 10","paragraphs":["The MK Royale is, of course, already highly anticipated, but once the family crest custom service for ceramics begins next month, there's no doubt it will attract even more attention.","And now, I was being shown a vividly colored ceramic piece made with a new technique by Nebula, who had been working on a sample.","[Ceramics can bring out colors this beautifully huh.]","[We've put a lot of effort into it. But, well, it's not just about using more colors. When the service officially launches, we'll need to adjust the designs based on the orders. This time, since it's a prototype, we used all ten colors but......]","[Even with ten colors, it doesn't feel too flashy; it still makes for a beautiful design. As expected of Nebula.]","[I'm Absolute after all!]","As Nebula puffed up her small chest with pride, I gently patted her head and turned my attention to the vase in front of me. This one didn't have a family crest; instead, the ten colors formed a vibrant pattern purely for aesthetic appeal.","[The technique isn't something that needs to be kept secret, so I shared it with Lilia-san. Since she has connections among the nobility, I thought it might be useful. Lilia-san herself doesn't seem particularly interested, but it looks like one of the merchant groups funding her handles ceramics.]","[I see......]","Was it just my imagination, or did I just get a fleeting vision of Lilia-san scolding me? N- No, but when I saw her not too long ago, she didn't seem particularly upset...... Ah~~ wait, now that I think about it, she did look as if she was holding something back.","I can't say for sure that it's my fault, but since I'm involved, I wouldn't be surprised if she has some complaints.","......She does like beef skewers, right? I'll bring her some as a peace offering next time.","W- Well, anyway, setting thoughts about Lilia aside for now and refocused on the ceramic piece in front of me. Since Nebula had put in a lot of effort, there was no doubt it was a magnificent work.","Even as an amateur, I could tell the craftsmanship was outstanding, and anyone knowledgeable would surely be impressed...... Ah, speaking of which......","[Now that I think about it, Cento-san, someone from Kuro's place, is really into ceramics. When we talked about the magic kiln before, she mentioned wanting to see Nebula's work. Would it be okay to show her this?]","[Yes! Of course, I don’t mind. If I recall correctly, her twin, Cien-san, prefers glassware, doesn't she?]","[Unn, she's more into interior decor pieces rather than tableware.]","[In that case, I have some glassworks that might be a good fit. Would you like to bring those along as well?]","[Ah, that sounds great. Then, I guess I'll take both the ceramics and the glass pieces and go visit Tre-san.]","According to Nebula, this piece was made using a new technique and a special glaze different from anything before. Given Cento-san's knowledge of ceramics, she would likely appreciate it. ṘÃΝoBΕŝ","When I asked if it would be okay to give the pieces to Cento or Sien if they liked them, Nebula had no objections at all.","The ceramics were just prototypes, and as for the glassworks, it seemed she had been making a lot of them with Illness-san, so they had plenty to spare.","For now, I decided to check with Tre-san later via hummingbird, and in the meantime, I gently patted Nebula, who was sitting cutely on my lap.","[I know Nebula is amazing, but you've been working really hard lately, so I'm just a little worried. I hope you're not too tired...... If there's anything I can do for you, I'd like to help.]","[It's not a problem. The store operations and product planning are handled by Canalis-san and Anima-san, so I'm simply creating things as part of my hobby and enjoying myself. However, I can't just ignore Milord's kindness in wanting to reward me. So, in that case, as a token of appreciation for my efforts, you may pet me! It's quite pleasant after all......]","[Calling it a reward sounds a bit much, but if it makes you happy, then I'm glad.]","[This is special, you know? As Absolute as I am, I'm normally the one who grants rewards, not the one receiving them. But for Milord, I'll make an exception.]","[Ahaha, I see. Well, that's an honor.]","Following Nebula's request, I gently patted her head as softly as possible, to which her eyes narrowed in contentment, clearly enjoying it. With her small frame, she looked incredibly adorable, and somehow, petting her felt soothing for me as well.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......So we're even dragging characters who just exist there into the stomachache chaos huh......]"]},{"number":2161,"title":"Chapter 2161: Special Product 11","paragraphs":["I arrived at Kuro's castle, carrying the ceramics and glassworks made by Nebula. I had already contacted Tre-san and the others in advance.","After giving a simple greeting to Funf-san, who was at the entrance, I stepped inside. There, as if she had been waiting for me———- in fact, she probably had been———— stood Tre-san.","When Tre-san saw me, she gave a somewhat nihilistic smile. Since she had the appearance of a tall, cool beauty, that kind of smile suited her quite well.","[......Heh, your excitement is obvious. Looks like you're happy to be welcomed by this beautiful Onee-chan!]","[......Hmmm, there's no doubt that you're beautiful.]","[Arehh? That's strange? That kind of phrasing is usually used when someone looks good but has personality issues, right?]","As always, Tre-san had a fun way with words, slipping in a little joke as part of her usual style.","[Well, setting that aside, welcome, Kaito!]","[Hello, Tre-san...... Arehh? Where are Cento-san and Cien-san?]","[They're waiting in the room. Since we're heading there anyway, there was no need for all three of us to come. Besides, even I wouldn’t get lost in this castle.]","[Ahh, I see.]","[Alright then, I'll guide you to our room~~]","Following behind Tre-san as she started walking, I walked as well. I've been to Kuro's castle many times, so I'm fairly used to it, but this was my first time going to Tre-san’s room, so I had no idea where it was.","Even from the outside, the castle looked massive, but since Kuro had expanded the interior with Spatial Magic, it was even larger and more complex than it appeared. Well, this time, Tre-san was guiding me, but if I ever visited unexpectedly, Ein-san would usually come to greet me, so I’d never gotten lost before......","[By the way, do you and the others live in this castle, Tre-san?]","[Hmmm. We do have rooms here, so technically we live here, but we also have several other homes...... Depending on the season and our work, we might live elsewhere...... I'd say I spend about half the year here. You see, I’m quite important! Ehhen!]","[I see. It makes sense that your work would require you to be based in different locations.]","[Unn. Right now, I’m also involved in the project Kuromu-sama is running in the Human Realm, so I often go there. I even bought a house in Archlesia Empire, where the magic crystal mines are.]","The project Kuro was advancing aimed to increase the number of magic tool engineers in the Human Realm. Mom and Dad had taken part in an internship as part of this initiative.","Speaking of my parents, they successfully obtained their magic tool engineer qualifications and are now working at the Seditch Magic Tool Company’s branch in Symphonia’s Royal Capital.","Thinking back, even during the shipboard party, Tre-san had been looking for partners for magic crystal mining. It seemed like she was quite deeply involved in this project.","[Ah, by the way, Kaito, thanks for introducing me to Anne-san~~]","[Oh, no problem...... Did everything work out smoothly?]","[Unn, we signed an exclusive contract with Anne-san’s guild. Just as you said, they have a lot of skilled workers, and mining is progressing even better than expected.]","[That’s great to hear.]","During the shipboard party, Anne-san and Tre-san had aligned interests and both seemed positive about the contract, so it was good to see that things had come together smoothly.","Anne-san’s guild hadn’t been receiving compensation or treatment that matched their abilities until now, so if that situation had improved, I would be happy for them as a friend. RАΝȎᛒĚs","[By the way, this isn’t related to magic crystals but...... it looks like Isis-sama...... no, more accurately, Isis-sama’s faction is expanding its trading partners.]","[Ahh, I heard something about that a while ago...... Up until now, they had almost complete exclusivity, right?]","[Unn. First of all, just reaching Isis-sama’s castle in the Land of Death was difficult. Even if you managed to get there, mining in the Land of Death was extremely harsh, and Isis-sama was feared by many, so it was a tough situation. But now that she has subordinates and more negotiation channels, things are changing. Plus, her subordinates are putting a lot of effort into improving the environment of the Land of Death, so it’s become easier to expand operations.]","[Ahh, I see. Since the Land of Death itself is a frozen wasteland, the harsh environment was a major issue too.]","Thanks to Shiro-san’s blessing, I often forgot about it, but the Land of Death was a place covered in ice and snow all year round, making mining even more challenging.","[Remember Rasal-san, the one you introduced me to for negotiations? Recently, she has been placing even more orders. Apparently, they’re planning to experimentally deploy a permanent Barrier Magic in some of the mining areas. I’m guessing they have someone skilled in Barrier Magic among their ranks?]","[If I'm not mistaken, that one named Polaris-san specializes in Barrier Magic.]","[I see...... Well, in any case, it looks like gradual reforms are underway. Who knows? Maybe in the future, a town might even form in the Land of Death. That’d be exciting.]","[Yeah, that would be great if it happened.]","If a town were to actually form in the Land of Death and more people started living there, Isis-san would surely be happy. Of course, there were many challenges to overcome, and it would take time, but I hoped that someday, it would become a reality.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai: [This may seem heartwarming, but let’s not forget that there’s a marquis's daughter getting her stomach punched behind the scenes......]"]},{"number":2162,"title":"Chapter 2162: Special Product 12","paragraphs":["When I opened the door to the room that Tre-san guided me to and stepped inside, I was met with an expansive space that felt more like a hotel lobby.","It was quite a large area, but it didn’t have any furniture that suggested someone was living there. Upon closer inspection, I noticed multiple doors.","[This place is ridiculously spacious. Is this really a room......]","[Unn. Well, we connected three rooms together and expanded it using Spatial Magic, so it's pretty big...... By the way, this is the entrance. I can't use Spatial Magic though, so Cento and Cien handled that part!]","[I wouldn’t be surprised if you told me this was the entrance to a noble’s mansion.]","[......I feel like Kaito’s house has a bigger entrance though...... Well, anyway, there are a bunch of different rooms here. Cento and Cien each have their own workshops for their hobbies, and there’s even a kitchen so we can cook in this space too.]","Come to think of it, Cento-san and Cien-san mentioned before that they had made ceramics and glasswork themselves...... If they have dedicated workshops, then it makes sense for the place to be this spacious.","[The door over there leads to the reception room. Cento and Cien are already there preparing tea, so let’s go!]","[Got it. By the way, just like Cento-san and Cien-san have their workshops, do you have a room for your hobbies too, Tre-san?]","[Good question. I keep my antenna sharp for changing trends, so my hobbies are dynamic, diversified, and innovative. I don’t really have one main hobby. I just go with the flow depending on the moment......]","[......That kind of sounds like you just jump into whatever catches your interest but don’t stick with anything for long.]","[Is that how it sounded? Then Kaito, your ears are working just fine. How about that, impressed?]","[No, no!? Why are you saying that so proudly!?]","Tre-san had tried to phrase it in a cool way, but ultimately, it just sounded like she dabbled in trendy things but quickly lost interest. Not only did she not deny it when I pointed it out, but she actually seemed proud of it.","[Being someone who can take an interest in all sorts of things makes me an experienced and cool person, right?]","[Your self-evaluation is way too high......]","As I gave a wry smile at Tre-san’s smug expression, we entered the reception room, where Cento-san and Cien-san were waiting. They greeted me with warm smiles and a nod.","[Hello, Kaito-san.]","[Welcome, we’re glad to have you.]","[Hello, Cento-san, Cien-san. Sorry for dropping by so suddenly today.]","The reception room was also quite spacious and had a stylish atmosphere. I didn’t think Tre-san had the sense to coordinate a room this nicely, so it was probably Cento-san or Cien-san who arranged it. ℞aŊОbΕS̈","Then again, when Tre-san is in work mode, she’s actually quite reliable. Since this is a reception room, it’s likely used for business purposes as well, so it wouldn’t be strange for it to be kept tidy.","[......Unn? What is it, Kaito? You’re staring at me with such an intense gaze——– Hah! I see! So my Afexion Meter has finally maxed out!!!]","[Even though you do have impressive qualities, for some reason, my trust in you is still strangely shaky......]","[How strange? That sounded like an out-of-nowhere insult? I do feel like my Afexion Meter has increased, but it seems like your respect for this Onee-chan is still scraping the ground...... is that just my imagination?]","[No comment......]","I've seen her being competent at work, and despite her playful demeanor, she has keen insight and takes the right actions when it matters. There's no doubt that she's a good, impressive person.","But at the same time, there's something oddly endearing about her...... or maybe it's her peculiar clumsiness...... Well, I suppose that's part of Tre-san's charm.","As we continued our comedic back-and-forth, I took my seat as prompted. Cento-san and Cien-san quickly prepared tea and some sweets.","[So, what brings you here today?]","[You know, remember how, during Symphonia Kingdom's Founding Festival, I promised to show you the ceramics Nebula made? I'm a little late, but I brought them. Oh, and she also started making glassware, so I brought some of those pieces too.]","[Ah, thank you for going out of your way. If I recall, Nebula-san crafted the first batch of Nifty's cups, right? I never saw the initial lot myself, only the ones that were available for sale in stores. Even though they were slightly adjusted for mass production, I was still impressed by their high quality. I'm looking forward to seeing her work firsthand.]","[......She started making glassware too? She must be quite the multi-talented individual.]","It seemed Cento-san had visited a Nifty store and seen the mass-produced cups.","Meanwhile, Cien-san appeared a bit surprised to hear that Nebula had also taken up glassmaking. Well, to be fair, before Canalis-san arrived, Nebula had refrained from making glass due to concerns about toxic substances in the production process. It was only possible now thanks to Canalis-san's abilities......","As for Tre-san, she was nodding as if she understood everything but...... she probably didn't understand a thing.","[Alright, let me bring out the ceramics first. She based them on Symphonia’s Five-Color Ceramics but developed a new technique and glaze for them.]","[......Unn? Eh? A new technique and glaze...... Eh? No, hold on, that's not something you can just develop so easily...... the Five-Color Ceramics is already an extremely refined craft, and countless artisans in the past have tried and failed to create a six-color version......]","[Ah, apparently, these pieces use ten colors.]","[..............................Huh?]","Cento-san's reaction upon hearing my explanation, which I had quickly confirmed with Nebula before arriving, was memorable————- her expression like that of a pigeon caught off guard by a peashooter.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The contrast between the two who look like they're about to get stomachaches...... and the strong-minded older sister who probably won't...... I can just picture her standing there, completely unfazed, with a clueless expression while the other two were surprised and flustered.]"]},{"number":2163,"title":"Chapter 2163: Special Product 13","paragraphs":["Cento-san seemed somewhat bewildered, but the moment I took out the porcelain Nebula had made, her eyes widened, and she began staring at it intently.","Incidentally, what I brought this time was a jar, designed with a landscape resembling my garden.","[......U- Unbelievable...... T- There's no doubt that the colors weren't added later but were applied with glaze before firing————- otherwise, this kind of color depth wouldn't be possible. But, eh? T- Ten colors? No way, not even six colors have ever been perfectly achieved...... But, this firing technique is undeniably the same as Symphonia's Five-Color Ceramics...... N- No, even if a new method or glaze made this possible, to apply glaze in ten different colors and achieve such perfect hues...... W- What incredible craftsmanship......]","[Hmmm, my impression is just that it's a really pretty jar, but if Cento-san is that surprised, it must be amazing, right?]","[A- Amazing doesn't even begin to describe it! This is something that could significantly change the history of ceramics!!!]","It seemed that the new method and glazes Nebula had developed were even more remarkable than I had thought. Cento-san was giving off the same kind of energy as Ein-san and Jutia-san when they talked about the tea revolution.","[This is a masterpiece that must have taken an extremely long time, refined through relentless research and experimentation...... U- Unn? Now that I think about it, Kaito-san? Didn't you say you were planning to buy a kiln during Symphonia Kingdom's last Founding Festival?]","[Eh? Oh, yeah, we bought the kiln after Symphonia Kingdom's Founding Festival...... As for that ten-color piece, judging from what she said, I think she only started working on it about a month ago.]","[Ehhhhh...... A- A month...... You mean, this was done in just a month? T- True, revolutionary ideas don't always require long periods of time, but still, this is unbelievable. For the foreseeable future, Nebula-san will have a monopoly on this groundbreaking technique. Once word gets out, other potters will likely attempt it, but it will take them a considerable amount of time to reach this level...... Right now, you could say Nebula-san is at the very forefront of pottery innovation.]","[Ah, but it seems Nebula doesn’t really care much about keeping it to herself. She plans to spread the method and glaze formula through Lilia-san.]","[Ehhhh...... N- No, no, this is definitely the kind of achievement that will leave a huge mark on pottery history......]","In reality, Nebula had absolutely no interest in going down in history as a potter. To her, pottery was just another hobby, and she had no intention of using it to gain wealth or fame. She seemed more than willing to spread the new technique as soon as possible.","As the corners of Cento-san's lips twitched in disbelief, Tre-san, nonchalant with what's going on, opened her mouth to speak.","[Well, how they handle their developments is up to the creator. Some people want to monopolize their techniques for wealth and fame, while others don’t mind spreading them. If Cento-san’s words are correct, then the spread of this technique will bring significant advancements in the field of ceramics. Plus, if the new method is refined in different ways, it might lead to even more varieties of pottery being created.]","[T- That is indeed wonderful. In particular, Symphonia Kingdom's pottery has perfected the Five-Color Ceramics to such an extent that even reducing it to Four-Color Ceramics has been too difficult and has fallen out of use. If a new technique can push the field forward, that is something to celebrate. I, too, would love to learn about this method myself.]","[I'll have to check with Nebula first, but I believe I can share the details with you. In fact, it seems that the new technique will also be used in a new service launching under Nifty's brand...... According to Nebula, while ten colors are difficult, achieving seven colors is relatively easy.]","[T- That’s still astonishing...... I- I can’t quite hide my bewilderment at how my common sense is being shattered in an instant...... But if it’s truly possible to fire pottery with seven colors, then I’m excited to see the results.]","I was fairly certain there wouldn’t be any major issues, but to begin with, even if I were to learn about this new technique from Nebula and try to explain it to Cento-san, I didn’t feel confident that I could convey it properly.","So, I figured I’d have Nebula write down a memo or something to pass the information along.","[Oh, and as for that jar, I’ve already gotten permission from Nebula, so if you’d like, Cento-san can have it.]","[Fueeeh...... W- Wouldn’t displaying it in a museum be the right answer......? I- I feel like I understand a little of what Lilia-san goes through now......]","As Cento-san gazed off into the distance, her expression...... somehow resembled the one Lilia-san often had.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A new victim has arrived...... And next up, it's Cien's turn......]"]},{"number":2164,"title":"Chapter 2164: Special Product 14","paragraphs":["Now that the ceramics showcase is over, I plan to display the glass interior pieces next. When I glance at Cien-san, she has a complex expression on her face, a mix of anticipation and anxiety.","[......Errr, Cien-san. I was thinking of bringing out the glasswork next......]","[I’m struggling to put my feelings into words. Watching Cento clutch her stomach in distress is terrifying, yet at the same time, I have a strong desire to see the piece...... I- I may need to brace myself considerably.]","[Ah, errr, it looks like the glasswork is something Nebula only recently started making. It doesn’t seem to incorporate any new manufacturing methods or special techniques. According to Nebula, they plan to take on new challenges only after solidifying their fundamentals.]","[I see...... That’s reassuring. If they’ve just started, it makes sense to begin by crafting basic glass items. Glass is quite delicate, making intricate designs difficult. In that case, I’ll simply enjoy these as works by an emerging artist.]","Nebula has been making ceramics for quite some time, experimenting and refining their skills alongside Illness-san. That’s likely why they were able to develop new techniques and glazes based on my offhand comments.","In contrast, their glasswork only began after Canaris arrived, meaning they don’t have as much experience yet. Even Nebula doesn’t seem fully satisfied with their current progress.","From my perspective, Nebula’s creations are already stunning, but perhaps someone knowledgeable about glasswork, like Cien-san, might see them differently.","With that thought in mind, I take out a glass interior piece modeled after the World Tree Nebula resides in.","Nebula has created several glass interiors; I have ones featuring Bell and Lynn motifs displayed on my desk.","The World Tree interior piece I brought today looks highly refined to me, with an incredible level of detail down to each individual leaf.","[..................]","[C- Cien? Are you okay? To my eyes, this looks like an incredible piece......]","Seeing Cien-san freeze at the sight of the piece on the table, Cento-san speaks up with concern. Cien-san remains unresponsive for a few seconds before bringing her face closer to the interior piece and murmuring,","[......U- Unbelievable. You’re telling me this incredibly clear and intricate glass interior was made with such limited experience? I- I can't even see any hint of joints anywhere!? This wasn’t created by assembling separate parts, but from a single piece of glass......?]","[Hmm, I don’t know much about glasswork, but if Cien is this shocked, does that mean it’s amazing?]","[It’s beyond amazing! Indeed, there aren’t any special techniques used. The craftsmanship focuses on fundamental glassmaking skills, and it doesn’t use any rare materials. There are artisans capable of creating similar pieces, but they are among the top-tier glassmakers in the world...... Frankly speaking, Nebula-san’s glassmaking skills far surpass my own. Especially the way these leaves are crafted, it’s pure artistry. This could be displayed at a glass exhibition without looking out of place. While some techniques from ceramics can be adapted, achieving this level of mastery in such a short time..... Nebula-san’s talent is absolutely overwhelming.]","It seems that even to Cien-san, who is well-versed in glasswork, Nebula’s creations are astonishing. She was both surprised and full of praise. That makes me feel proud, Nebula really is incredible.","[Nebula is still in the stage of refining the basics, but once they get accustomed to making them, she said they’d likely try making larger pieces.]","[Large-scale glasswork is quite challenging, but with Nebula-san’s level of skill, I’m sure they’ll create something spectacular. I’d love to see it when the time comes.] Ȑ₳NɵВËȿ","[Of course, I’ll show you then. Oh, speaking of which, this might not align perfectly with your tastes since it’s not an interior piece, but Nebula also made some cups. I brought them along as well. That said, Nebula called them failures......]","[My collection is mostly artistic glass pieces, but I do like simple glassware too...... Eh, what? This cup, this engraving...... what intricate and beautiful patterns...... Eh? This is a failure? W- Which part exactly?]","[Well, Nebula said she went overboard with the decoration, making it impractical for everyday use. The embossed design makes it bumpy and hard to hold......]","[N- No, if anything, this feels like something meant for display...... W- Well, I suppose it might be inconvenient as a regular cup but...... How should I say this...... I think I understand now how Cento felt earlier.]","I wonder why? For some reason, Cien-san’s expression resembles the one Cento-san had when she was looking at the ceramics earlier. Maybe it’s because they’re twins, but their reactions are eerily similar.","Meanwhile, Tre-san is nodding at the glass engravings with an expression that suggests understanding and admiration...... but her exaggerated movements make me suspect she’s just pretending to get it.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [They're still budding seeds, but the twins are beginning to show signs of becoming Stomachache Warriors...... And as usual, there's Tre who's as clueless as ever......]"]},{"number":2165,"title":"Chapter 2165: Special Product 15","paragraphs":["For now, I decided to give the glass interior decorations and cups to Cien-san as a gift. With the main objective accomplished, we leisurely enjoyed some tea while chatting.","[But still, that Nebula at your place is amazing, Kaito. Not just with ceramics and glassware, but wasn't her tea incredible too? I remember Sis Ei was raving about it.]","[Yes. Actually, it started with tea leaves and decorative sugar. Then, she moved on to woodworking and ceramics, and now it's glasswork...... I think she just enjoys making things. She says it's just a way to kill time when she has nothing to do, but she has quite the perfectionist streak......]","Recently, both Nebula and Illness-san seemed to have taken up crafting as a hobby. Given their personalities, they both tend to be quite meticulous, and they seemed to approach their creations with a deep level of expertise.","Or rather, the only times they fail are usually when they get too fixated on perfecting something and end up making it impractical. Once they start, they seem to be the type who won't stop until they've created the best possible version.","Lately, thanks to the overwhelming support of Canalis-san, the scope of things they're capable of has expanded exponentially. In the end, Nebula and Illness-san seemed to be enjoying themselves. Just a while ago, they were using World Tree wood to smoke food, so rather than just crafting, they might simply enjoy experimenting with various things.","[By the way, it seems like Kuromu-sama has been up to something lately. Do you know anything about it, Kaito?]","[Kuro? What exactly do you mean?]","[Who knows?]","[Wait, isn't it weird for you to tilt your head in confusion after bringing it up, Tre-san?]","Tre-san mentioned that Kuro seemed to be doing something, but when asked for details, she just tilted her head. It felt like she was just saying it on a whim, without any real basis. And honestly, that seemed entirely possible coming from her.","As I was thinking about that, Cento-san and Cien-san, looking puzzled, spoke up.","[Esteemed Sister Tre has been saying that a lot lately, but is Kuromu-sama really doing something?]","[Even when Cento and I look, we haven't noticed anything strange. There's no sign of a new product or business venture either.]","[Hmmm, now that you mention it, I'm not entirely confident. It’s just a hunch, like I kinda feel like Kuromu-sama is up to something. But my intuition is usually spot on, you know?]","[Eh? Is that so?]","Apparently, Tre-san had no real evidence and was simply speaking based on a vague feeling that Kuro was up to something.","Unlike my Sympathy Magic, which allows me to \"somehow\" pick up on things, Tre-san was relying 100% on intuition. Yet, she seemed quite confident.","[Unn. My accuracy rate is about 20%!]","[......That’s pretty low.]","[Well, it’s just intuition after all~~ But hey, 20% isn't bad, right? Anyway, if Kaito doesn’t know anything, it might just be my imagination. Unless, of course, Kuromu-sama is deliberately hiding something. Otherwise, Kaito would probably notice if she was up to something.]","[That’s true. I haven't noticed anything unnatural about Kuro lately.]","[Then, I guess it’s just my imagination~~]","Just like Tre-san said, I hadn’t noticed anything unusual about Kuro, who regularly came by at night to hang out. Well, since she admitted it was just a hunch...... Oh, but now that I think about it, Lilia-san did seem oddly exhausted a little while ago. rᴀNƟВĚS","Knowing Lilia-san, it’s probably something troublesome. But is it related to Kuro?","(....................)","Hmmm...... No, Lilia-san’s situation probably has nothing to do with Kuro. Actually, thinking back, her exhaustion didn’t seem all that strange either.","Unn, no point overthinking it. I'll just enjoy the conversation with Tre-san and the others.","Sanctuary, Divine realm, behind Shallow Vernal, Makina had a somewhat indescribable expression on her face.","[......Hmm, I do have a few complaints about meddling with my beloved child’s mind, but I suppose this can’t be helped......]","[Yes, I’m not particularly happy about it either...... but if he realizes it at this point, it’ll ruin the element of surprise.]","[The way my beloved child quickly connected that statement to Lilia’s condition———- such sharp intuition, as expected of my beloved child~~ Hmm, I suppose it would be best to make it so that no one in the world can question this matter.]","[Yes, let’s do that. With how sharp his intuition is, if he was reminded of Lilia’s condition just from that statement, there’s no telling where his thoughts could lead him......]","Kaito’s earlier doubt had been somewhat inconvenient for Shallow Vernal and Makina. Kuromeina had skillfully deceived him, including countermeasures against his sensory magic, and there shouldn’t be any issues with Kanaris or Alice. However, when it came to Lilia, if Kaito were to directly ask her about it, there was a high chance that, even if she tried to deceive him, his sharp intuition would see through it.","Moreover, Lilia was naturally bad at lying in the first place, so it was more reliable for Shallow Vernal and the others to handle the matter themselves.","[Well, of course, we’ll eventually tell my beloved child, but that’ll have to wait until everything is fully prepared.]","[Yes. The creation of the world that will serve as the venue is complete, so it’s about time we inform the other relevant parties, aside from Lilia and Human Realm's rulers, and proceed with the full-scale preparations. The next issue is...... dealing with those from other worlds who wish to participate.]","[My beloved child is incredibly popular...... But if we let World Creators and Gods of their level join freely, it could be problematic...... But I do think their desire to celebrate my beloved child is a good thing....... Maybe we should just allow them to send gifts?]","As they conversed, preparations for Kaito’s birthday party continued to progress steadily in a place beyond his knowledge.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Not only are they increasing the number of people suffering from stomachaches, but they’re also thoroughly preparing one for Kaito...... I’m honestly impressed......]"]},{"number":2166,"title":"Chapter 2166: Intermission: Dealing with the Otherworld Gods","paragraphs":["In an interdimensional space between worlds, Alice placed chicken meat on a cutting board and skillfully sliced it. Watching her from behind, Makina murmured.","[Are you sure it's okay not to use high-quality meat?]","[It's not always best to use only the finest ingredients. What’s the point of using ultra-premium meat for yakitori...... Well, I'm sure it would taste great, but there's a certain charm to a flavor that feels a bit cheap.]","[Ahh~~ I get that! High-quality meat is delicious, but there's also something great about eating slightly firmer meat with an extra-rich sauce or salt. Ah, Alice! I want some karaage too!]","[......Why don’t you make it yourself?]","[Tsk, tsk, tsk...... I want to eat Alice’s homemade food. If I just wanted the dish, I could create a finished product, but this is different———— it’s about the heart, the love that goes into it......]","[If it were for Kaito-san, maybe, but do you really think I'd put love into food made for you?]","[Aw, come on...... Just a little bit, at least? Not as much as for my beloved child, but still...... Look, I’m providing the place and the ingredients, so...... please?]","With a deadpan stare at the demanding Makina, Alice sighed in exasperation and started skewering the cut chicken for grilling.","As the sound of charcoal crackling filled the air and the chicken slowly took on a golden hue, Alice spoke to Makina.","[For now, get a pot with oil heated to the right temperature. You want karaage, right?]","[Got it......How’s this?]","[Cooking for someone who can create anything out of thin air feels like such a pointless effort......]","[Ow!? Why'd you flick my forehead all of a sudden!?]","[No reason.]","[You're so unreasonable!]","Despite Alice’s sharp remarks, there was an easygoing atmosphere between them, a sign of their close friendship.","[......So, why did you suddenly suggest eating together this time?]","[Partly because I wanted to eat with you, but also because I wanted your opinion on my beloved child's birthday party.]","[.....Ah, I see. Since the venue is ready, you’re starting to inform those he's connected with and moving forward with the preparations. That makes sense. Even aside from setting up the venue and entertainment, we need to prepare Kaito-san’s birthday present, so it’s best to notify people early. I just hope Kaito-san doesn’t catch on...... No, actually, knowing him, he might pick up on it from something weird. If he hasn’t yet, that means either you or Shallow Vernal-sama have taken countermeasures.] Rά𐌽ÖꞖΕS","[You always get ahead of the conversation and predict everything, so I never have anything to explain...... Well, if Alice says it's fine, I’ll proceed with this plan. Mmm, it smells so good~~]","Alice, as sharp as ever, had understood almost everything just from Makina’s brief explanation and agreed with the birthday party plans.","Satisfied, Makina nodded and, out of nowhere, produced a bottle of sake and two small cups, placing them on the table. At the same time, Alice finished cooking and set the yakitori and karaage on the table.","[Sake huh? That brings back memories.]","[We drank together at the inn, right? We had sashimi back then, but sake also goes well with karaage and yakitori. Here you go.]","[Thanks...... That aside, what worries me is whether anything strange will come from other worlds...... The last shipboard party had some issues......]","[Munch, munch...... Mmm, Alice's cooking really is the best! ......Oh, about your concern...... well, you’re right to worry. The number of requests from outside is through the roof...... My beloved child is ridiculously popular.]","[Seriously, why does he manage to set the brains of Gods on fire even when they've never met him......]","While watching Makina eat yakitori seasoned simply with tare and salt, Alice tilted her cup and sipped her sake, looking somewhat exasperated.","[The fact that he defeated Shallow Vernal is already a huge deal, but even more significant is that it led to Nebula’s revival. Her being known as the Ultimate God, the pinnacle of all Gods, isn't just for show———– there are an absurd number of Gods who admire Nebula. From what I heard from Vicissitude God...... Canalis, there's already something like a fan club for my beloved child among the World Creators. Well, as his mother, I take pride in my beloved child's growing reputation, but that doesn’t mean there aren't problems. There are simply too many of them, and we can’t let everyone participate. Even if we only accept gifts, their sheer number would still be overwhelming...... Got any good ideas?]","[Hmmm...... What if we let Kaito-san decide with a lottery or something? Set a number, like 5 or 10, and have Kaito-san draw lots to determine who can send gifts. As for the presents, we establish some rules to make sure they don’t get too outrageous...... Given Kaito-san's cheat-tier luck, he'll probably end up drawing convenient candidates anyway.]","[I see, that actually sounds like a great idea...... If my beloved child is the one picking, the World Creators won't be able to complain. Alright, I’ll propose that to Shallow Vernal.]","With the matter of handling the Otherworld Gods somewhat settled, reducing one of their concerns, Makina relaxed and began to enjoy the meal.","[Alice! I want some karaage!]","[Just take it yourself......]","[Ahhn.]","[..............]","[Ahhhhhhhhn.]","[......Good grief.]","Letting out another sigh at Makina's antics, Alice wryly smiled before picking up a piece of karaage with her chopsticks and feeding it to Makina.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Makina acts all motherly and wants to spoil Kaito, but when it comes to Alice, she just throws tantrums and acts spoiled herself.]"]},{"number":2167,"title":"Chapter 2167: A Nostalgic MMO 1","paragraphs":["One afternoon, I decided to see if I could play the online game I used to play using the game console I received from Shiro-san, together with Aoi-chan, whom I had invited to my room.","By the way, Hina-chan wasn’t interested in online games, so she had gone to play at Sky-san’s place.","[Let's first check if it appears normally...... Ah, there it is, the game name...... It looks like we can play it.]","[The flow of time should be different here and there, but what happens to time progression if we play an online game? I mean, the fact that Hina-chan and I returned to the moment we first teleported to this world...... H- Hmmm, well, since it’s something an Omnipotent God did, I doubt we can figure it out by thinking about it.]","[Unn, I feel like it's better not to overthink it....... Errr, selecting the game...... Oh, I can choose between a keyboard and a controller. This thing is really high-performance...... Arehh? But isn't it impossible to play together? There's only one console......]","The black, box-shaped game console I received from Shiro-san displays a list of playable games when touched. It also has a search function, a genre sorting function, and even generates controllers suited for each game. It’s an incredibly advanced device.","However, while multiplayer games are one thing, isn't it impossible to play a single-player online game together with Aoi-chan?","(No problem. If you touch the main unit and imagine it, another console will appear. However, the additional console will automatically disappear after one day.)","Ah, so it has that kind of function too? That’s really helpful.","[......Aoi-chan, Shiro-san just told me that there's a time-limited function to duplicate the console, so we can actually play together.]","[Really!? That’s amazing. Honestly, I thought the best we could do was take turns, so this is great!]","Seeing Aoi-chan clearly overjoyed made me smile. Following Shiro-san’s instructions, I focused my thoughts, and another console appeared, to which I handed to Aoi-chan.","Now that I think about it, this online game required downloading a client...... an application to launch the game, and installing patches. What about that part?","[......Do we not need to install the client or anything?]","[Give me a moment...... Oh, looks like we just need to enter our ID and password. The patches are already up to date.]","[I see, then we can start playing right away...... Errr, my ID and password should be......]","It had been a while, so I was a bit unsure, but I hadn’t forgotten. I managed to log into my online game account.","[Oh, this brings back memories. Ah, my character is still here.]","[It really does. Ciel-san’s character...... I never forgot about it, but seeing it again after so long is quite nostalgic. Well, naturally, it's still in the Tier-2 Class.]","[When I was playing, the Tier-3 Class hadn’t been implemented yet.]","[There are Tier-4 Classes now though.]","[Eh? Seriously!? Whoa, I’m completely out of the loop......]","Seeing my old character again filled me with nostalgia, but more than that, Aoi-chan’s excitement was incredible.","She usually gives off a pretty cool and composed impression, but right now, she was beaming with a huge smile. Just from looking at her, I could tell how happy she was to be able to play this game with me again.","Maybe because of her excitement, she wasn’t paying much attention to her actions...... Just now, when she leaned in to peek at my monitor, it seems she didn't notice it, but she got so close that our faces were almost touching.","[Kaito-san! Hurry, hurry, let’s play!]","[Ahaha, got it...... Errr, the last place I logged out was......]","[Ah, that town. I’ll head there right away!]","Seeing Aoi-chan laughing with such childlike joy was really endearing. It made me feel kind of bad for completely quitting the game.","Well, back then, I hadn’t realized how much she had regretted our parting. Though it's too late to think about this now, maybe I should have made time to come back after starting university. ℟ÀNȫ฿Ěṡ","Well, since I have the chance now, I’ll play with Aoi-chan for as long as time allows today.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......She doesn’t get much screen time, so she tends to be overlooked, but Aoi's specs as a heroine are seriously top-tier...... The rare younger-girl slot, kouhai attribute, long black hair, and she's kept her first love tucked away in her heart all this time...... She's strong.]"]},{"number":2168,"title":"Chapter 2168: A Nostalgic MMO 2","paragraphs":["I don't really understand how it works. Well, being a game console made by a God, it's beyond common sense, but when I got it for my birthday, I was told it connected to a dedicated cyberspace. However, from what I can see, it's just connected to Earth's internet like normal.","Ever since Shiro-san and Eden-san revised the contract a while back, there's been a clear increase in mobile game-like additions, so maybe they adjusted it during that process.","In the online game I started playing with Aoi-chan, I returned the equipment I had been holding onto for her, and in exchange, she gave back the set of gear I had used before.","Of course, in an online game where inflation progresses over the years, top-tier equipment from a few years ago is completely outdated. That said, it doesn’t mean their performance has declined.","As gear for getting back into the game after a long time, it's more than sufficient.","[Whoa, that's insane. Modern equipment now has this many effects stacked onto a single piece......]","[Inflation is inevitable in online games. My equipment has a high-performance restriction that only Tier-4 Classes and above can use, so to someone like Kaito-san, who quit years ago, it must look ridiculously powerful. But even so, my equipment isn't top-tier or anything. It's more like mid-tier.]","[If that's mid-tier, then the level of inflation is really something...... I guess the items in my storage must seem like nostalgic relics to you, Aoi-chan.]","[Yeah, pretty much. Also, there's a lot in here.]","[I gave you all the equipment, but I left the other items in my storage———- things with high rarity but subpar performance. Selling them was a hassle, so I just quit with them still in my storage.]","[Hehh...... Eh? Ah, Kaito-san! That item!]","As I was looking through my storage, feeling nostalgic, Aoi-chan, who had been peeking in, suddenly raised her voice in alarm.","The item she pointed at was a rare drop from a certain Field Boss. It had no particular use, aside from selling for a high price to NPCs. Since it was technically a rare drop, I had kept it as a collection piece in my storage.","[That item is selling for an insanely high price right now!]","[Eh? Seriously? Back when I played, it was rare but had no real use...... Did they implement some new way to use it?]","[Yes! A few months ago, they introduced these insanely powerful weapons called \"Sacred Artifacts\". To craft them, you need tons of rare boss drops. Among them, the one you have, Kaito-san, is especially hard to obtain, and top players are scrambling to buy it for absurd prices.]","[......That was just an early-game Field Boss, so farming it should be easy, right?]","[No, actually, two years ago they adjusted the drop rates. That item no longer drops from early-game Field Bosses, it only drops from a time-spawned boss in a high-difficulty dungeon now. Because of that, the price has been skyrocketing.]","I see...... Back when I played, and even when the drop adjustments were made, it was just a meaningless rare item. But a recently added feature suddenly made it a crucial material, causing its price to soar...... Since it had no use before, many players probably just sold it to NPCs for the high base price, making it even rarer......","Of course, there must be others like me who kept it as a collector's item. But if they realize how valuable it is now, they'll try to sell it for the highest price possible, driving up the cost even further.","If Aoi-chan says these Sacred Artifacts are incredibly strong, then they must be in high demand among top-tier players. And those kinds of players have massive funds, so naturally, they'll buy them up at outrageous prices......","[And you have about 20 of them......]","[I used to farm Bosses a lot back then.]","[If you sell them, you won't quite reach top-tier gear, but you'll be able to get some really solid equipment.]","[Fumu, I’m completely out of touch with the item market and everything, so I'd really appreciate it if you could teach me, Aoi-chan.]","[Leave it to me! I'll teach you everything! ......Fufu, things are the opposite now from back then, aren't they?]","[Yeah, it really is......]","Back when we used to play together, I was the one teaching Aoi-chan everything. But now, it's the other way around, she’s the one teaching me.","She seemed happy about it, smiling brightly, which was both endearing and cute.","[Alright, let’s head to the market and find a buyer. Then, we’ll get you some decent gear...... Since you're still in your Tier-2 Class, your hunting spots will be...... Oh! It'll be easier to explain if I can see your screen, too, so I'll move my chair over and sit next to you!] ŗaɴȪβËᶊ","[......U- Unn. If that makes things easier for you, Aoi-chan......]","Getting all excited, she moved her chair next to mine, closing the distance until our shoulders were almost touching. She smelled nice, like oranges.","Was it her perfume? I remember she said she liked citrus scents, so maybe she chose something like that for her perfume...... Arehh? I don’t recall her wearing perfume before though?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [So, does this perfume thing have some kind of romantic meaning behind it?]","Makina: [Just as my beloved child suspects, Aoi normally doesn’t wear perfume. She seems to think it’s not really suitable when she’s out adventuring. But, well, she is a girl in love. When she goes out with my beloved child, or when she gets to spend time alone together like today, she puts on perfume. She also takes extra time doing her makeup and styling her hair more than usual.]"]},{"number":2169,"title":"Chapter 2169: A Nostalgic MMO 3","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I didn't have much time, so today's chapter is a bit short.","As we were heading to the market to prepare my gear with Aoi-chan's guidance, I suddenly remembered something and decided to ask her.","[By the way, what time period is it in the game? Is it based on this world’s timeline or on the Otherworld's?]","[......Errr...... I see! So that's how it is!]","[Hm?]","[Ah, no, it's just...... it looks like the game is currently running a June event, so it's aligned with the season in this world. But in my case, that means it's slightly in the past. And now that I take a closer look, some items are missing...... So it feels like we’re logged into the version of this game from June in our original world.]","Ah, maybe this cyberspace of the online game functions like a kind of parallel world. Originally, Aoi-chan and I were summoned around early summer, so she should have already played this June event.","So, just like with the Founding Festival, there might be a split in the timeline...... one where Aoi-chan was playing alone in June in our original world, and another where she’s playing alongside me here.","[......I think your guess is correct, Kaito-san. If that's the case, then if I log in from my original world, I’ll connect to my solo-play data, following the normal timeline. But when logging in from this world, I enter a timeline synced with this world. Well...... there are a lot of questions about time discrepancies, but if we start nitpicking, it’ll never end. Let's just chalk it up to godly powers that don’t conform to common sense.]","[Yeah, it's probably best to not overthink it and just go with the flow. But that means you’ve already played this event before, right, Aoi-chan?]","[......Ah, no, about that...... This June event is a bridal event, and the main content is a limited dungeon that can only be entered in pairs. There were some solo events too, but the biggest part of it couldn't be done alone...... And since I was playing solo, I didn’t really get to experience it properly.]","Ah, since it's a bridal event in June, I guess that restriction makes sense...... Back when I played online games, I was mostly a solo player too, so I never really participated in pair-based events.","[So, it's not like you have to be married in-game to enter?]","[No, it’s not that restrictive. But if a married couple enters the dungeon, they get various buffs and access to special powerful skills that can only be used inside, so it was strongly recommended. There were even chat rooms dedicated to finding temporary in-game spouses just for the event.]","[Ahaha, that must have been quite the sight.]","[Yeah. Well, even if it’s just in-game, I’m not the type to get married that easily......]","[......Aoi-chan?]","[......Kaito-san, since it’s a special event, we should experience it together. Your character’s level is lower than mine, so it might be tough, but if we make full use of the system’s support, I think we can manage!]","[......Errr, so you mean——–?]","[Let’s get married in-game and go to the event dungeon together!]","Aoi-chan clenched her fist tightly and spoke with conviction...... and well, she had a point. I didn’t know exactly what kind of event-limited skills would be available, but if there were buffs inside the dungeon, then my weaker character might be able to manage compared to Aoi-chan’s much stronger one.","......However, there was one serious problem. Aoi-chan’s character was, of course, the same Hibis she used back when we played together. And until she explained it to me in detail, I had always assumed Hibis-kun was a guy.","......Unnn...... Aoi-chan’s character is...... a male character. And my character is also male...... Is this really going to be okay?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [This isn't good...... You know what's bad? The fact that it's explicitly stated as June...... Isn't their conversation gonna lead to them talking about Aoi's birthday?] ʀàŊỔꞖĘs"]},{"number":2170,"title":"Chapter 2170: A Nostalgic MMO 4","paragraphs":["Aoi-chan suggested that we get our characters married to participate in a bridal event, but...... can male characters even marry each other?","Back when I played, there was indeed a marriage system for characters. However, it was strictly limited to male-female pairings, and the benefits of marriage were virtually nonexistent, making it feel like just another element of online game romance.","[Aoi-chan, both my character and yours are male. Can we even get married?]","[Eh? Ah, yeah, it's fine. About 2 years ago, due to the recent emphasis on diversity, they updated the marriage system, so now male characters can marry each other. The same goes for female characters.]","[Ahh, I see. Man, I really feel like a relic of the past when it comes to system changes like these.]","Thinking about it, it made sense. In this day and age, people would definitely complain if same-sex marriage wasn’t possible. Besides, there are players like Aoi-chan who pick a character of a different gender than their own, so it’s only natural that same-sex marriage should be allowed.","As I pondered that, something suddenly came to mind.","[Speaking of which, since the game is currently in its June event...... doesn't that mean your birthday is coming up soon, Aoi-chan?]","Aoi-chan’s birthday should be June 23rd, which means it’s about two weeks away.","[Eh? Ahh...... Y- Yeah, now that you mention it? W- Wait, hold on! That’s kind of weird, though...... Based on when I was summoned here, I always had the impression that my birthday had just passed before I arrived. I mean, sure, from a subjective perspective, more than a year has passed for me...... but since I reset a year’s worth of growth, I feel like I should just consider it as having gone back to how it was.]","[U- Unn? Well, yeah, back in our world, you were summoned right before summer, but here, it was at the end of the year, so the timing is a bit off.]","Honestly, I just wanted to have a casual conversation and maybe get an idea of what Aoi-chan wanted so I could get her a birthday present. But as soon as I mentioned it, Aoi-chan suddenly looked flustered.","It’s true that time flows differently between our original world and this one. Even during my own birthday, it didn’t quite feel like my birthday.","Aoi-chan and Hina-chan returned to this world at a different time than I did, so of course, their sense of time would be out of sync.","[That’s why, in this world, I’m not considered 18 yet!]","[18? ......Ah, oh...... I see, that’s why you’re panicking......]","Back at the Flying Board Tournament after-party, Aoi-chan told me that I was her first love and said something along the lines of \"Once I turn 18......\", which almost sounded like a confession.","It’s been a few months since the tournament, but in Aoi-chan’s mind, her birthday was still a while away. But now, she suddenly realized it was coming up sooner than expected, which is probably why she's panicking.","[......Ahem. Now listen here, Kaito-san. There’s a saying: \"A person truly falls in love only once in their life. That is their first love.\" First love is incredibly important, and it must be nurtured carefully and patiently.]","[......O- Okay?]","[Besides, I don’t want my birthday to come before Christmas or Valentine’s! I had plans for those...... So, I’ll consider this year’s birthday as overtime for my 17th birthday, and my real 18th birthday will be next year.]","[......I’ve never heard of birthday overtime before. But, well...... if that’s what you want, Aoi-chan, then sure......]","Aoi-chan had just come up with a mind-blowing theory, but if I read between the lines...... Ever since that conversation at the Flying Board after-party, she’d been thinking about things she wanted to do on events like Christmas...... In this case, that likely meant making a move. And since she didn’t want to turn 18 before actually carrying it out, she decided to extend the time until her birthday. ᚱἈƝꝊ₿Е𐌔","......Given the discrepancies in our timelines upon summoning, it’s a complicated situation. But ultimately, what matters most is what makes Aoi-chan feel comfortable. So, I decided to respect her wishes.","[That said, we didn’t get to celebrate your 17th birthday properly, so I’d like to do something for it. Is there anything you want, Aoi-chan?]","[Hmmm, that’s a tough one. It’s not that I don’t want anything, but most of the things I need are for adventuring or books, so they’re not exactly appealing......]","[Then how about we go shopping together and look for something? If we check out different stores, you might find something you’d like......]","[Ah, that sounds great! Let’s do that!]","It seemed like nothing immediately came to mind, so I suggested that we go look together. As soon as I did, Aoi-chan’s face lit up with a bright, happy smile and she eagerly nodded in agreement.","With that settled, we resumed the game...... but just then, Aoi-chan suddenly leaned in, resting her head lightly against my shoulder.","[......Honestly, I do feel a little relieved. After all, I’ve already more or less confessed my feelings, and knowing Kaito-san, if you didn’t feel the same way, you wouldn’t let me get my hopes up only to hurt me later. You’d tell me straight. That’s why...... I feel at ease...... and I can properly...... look forward to that time.]","Her soft voice, almost like a whisper, made it feel more like a monologue than something meant for me to hear. At the very least, it wasn’t something I should respond to right now. That answer would have to wait until Aoi-chan fully accepted turning 18.","Still, just a little———- no, quite a lot, actually——— I felt like my shoulder, where Aoi-chan was leaning, was getting unusually warm.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [T- This guy, what a heroine move...... No, I get it. Knowing Kaito’s personality, if he was going to reject her, he would have said so in the months since the Flying Board event. The fact that he hasn’t means...... the confession has practically been accepted already. They just want to enjoy Christmas and Valentine’s Day while still in that \"not-quite-lovers-yet\" stage...... D*mn it!]"]},{"number":2171,"title":"Chapter 2171: A Nostalgic MMO 5","paragraphs":["The steps required for marriage in the game aren't too many. As long as two players form a party and talk to a designated NPC, the marriage is completed after paying the required fee.","Right now, due to the ongoing bridal event, the marriage fee is waived, so the procedure was completed instantly.","When players get married, they receive a wedding ring accessory. However, it has no special effects, it's more of a commemorative item, with the names of both characters inscribed in the item description.","[Come to think of it, this is the first time I've actually seen this wedding ring item.]","[Ah, Kaito-san, you usually play solo, right? Have you ever joined a guild?]","[I was in one for a while and even participated in siege battles, but PVP content is just too exhausting. In the end, I settled on playing solo.]","[Ah, yeah~~ siege battle guilds tend to be full of hardcore players.]","Guilds in this game aren't like adventurer guilds; they're more like player-made teams. I was once part of one as well.","However, the guild I was in was heavily involved in siege battles...... essentially guild-versus-guild warfare. These battles took place once a week, but they lasted a long time, and the preparation was tough. It was incredibly draining.","Of course, the rewards were significant. Some items could only be obtained through siege battles, and the top-tier players were heavily invested in PVP combat.","[Anyway, now that the marriage is done, are we heading straight to the limited-time dungeon?]","[......Before that, how about we get Kaito-san’s character to Tier-3 Class first?]","[Ahh, right...... Thanks to selling the item Aoi-chan told me about, I got a decent amount of money. Even if we go dungeon crawling, it might be best to handle the Class Change first...... By the way, what’s the Tier-3 version for my Class?]","Just as Aoi-chan had mentioned, there were buy requests in chat for the rare items I had stored in my warehouse. After selling them, I earned a significant amount of in-game currency.","With this, I could upgrade my equipment, but before that, I needed to decide on my build. My character's Class was Knight, a frontline class with high durability and decent attack power.","Since I mostly played solo, I hadn't built my stats or skills for tanking, but in party play, tanks were in high demand. In that sense, I was practically a tank.","[Kaito-san is a Knight, right? There are three Tier-3 Class options. There's the Royal Knight, which is a reasonable upgrade with enhanced durability; the Dragon Knight, which has a more aggressive skill set; and the Magic Swordsman, which shifts your character towards a mid-range playstyle and gains access to magic.]","[That’s quite the variety. Hmmm, since Aoi-chan is a mage class, if we're playing together, it’s better if I stay as a frontline fighter...... In that case, Royal Knight sounds like the best choice.]","[Yeah. The Royal Knight is basically a straight-up upgrade from Knight, so it should be easy for you to adjust, Kaito-san. If you advance to Tier-4, you can become a Royal Guard, which specializes in tanking, or a Holy Knight, which can use Healing Magic. It’s a very stable Class.]","[Alright, then I'll go with Royal Knight...... Does the Tier-3 Class Change take a long time?]","Since Class Changes in this game required completing quests, I was a little concerned that it might take too long and make Aoi-chan wait. When I asked, she responded with a gentle smile.","[No, all Tier-3 Class Change quests are simple, you just need to go through some dialogue. Tier-4, on the other hand, can take quite some time and may require specific items.]","[In that case, it sounds good since I won’t have to keep you waiting too long, Aoi-chan.]","[Fufu, well, even if I do have to wait, we can talk like this, so I doubt I'll get bored. Playing side by side like this is easier than I expected.]","[Yeah, communication is smoother, and it's definitely easier to play together this way.]","Obviously, talking face-to-face like this makes communication much smoother than typing in chat. It also makes it easier to understand each other’s in-game situation.","It must also be more convenient for Aoi-chan when explaining things to me. Well, if I had to point out a downside, it's that Aoi-chan is in an unusually high-spirited mood today and staying very close. Sometimes, I suddenly find her face right near mine, catching me off guard.","......Well, I guess I'll cope with that by just focusing on the game.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [By the way, here's a little trivia———– the MMO that Kaito and Hina are playing is modeled after Ragnarok Online. Of course, it's only used as a reference, so there are plenty of differences, but apparently, that's what the author had in mind while writing.] ṙÀ₦ΟᛒÊS̩"]},{"number":2172,"title":"Chapter 2172: A Nostalgic MMO 6","paragraphs":["Just as Aoi-chan said, the Tier-3 Class Change quest was simple, requiring only sequential conversations with designated NPCs, and I was able to complete my Class Change to a Tier-3 Class.","Then, as planned, we headed to the pair dungeon exclusive to the bridal event.","[By the way, what’s the pair dungeon like?]","[I haven’t entered it myself, but based on online information, it’s a dungeon with 50 floors.]","[50!? That sounds like it’s going to be a pretty long ordeal......]","[Ah, no, despite being called a dungeon, its format is more like a Monster House. A small map fills with monsters, and once you defeat them all, you advance to the next floor. It’s a simple setup. According to online sources, the monsters up to around the 30th floor are weak, and if you’ve got a well-equipped Tier-4 Class, you can reach that point in about 15 minutes...... However, the difficulty ramps up significantly from there. The floors above the 40th floor are said to be as tough as the latest dungeons, and anything past the 45th floor is on the level of frontline content. You need to be a fully geared Tier-4 Class and understand your roles well to make it through.]","[I see, so beginners and intermediate players can make some progress, but full completion requires a really high level huh......]","Since I had just changed to a Tier-3 Class, I had no chance of clearing those higher floors. If I could at least reach the 30th floor, that would already be a decent achievement.","[Well, even so, the rewards are really good, so a lot of players have been running it. There are two main rewards. One is the bonus EXP you get for clearing floors. Since you just reached Tier-3, Kaito-san, if you make it to the 30th floor, you’ll probably gain around 10 to 20 levels.]","[That much? Then, if I keep running this dungeon, I could reach Tier-4 pretty quickly?]","No, the pair dungeon has a limit———– you can only enter it once per day per character. So you can’t just grind it repeatedly with the same character. However, since the restriction is per character, some players run it multiple times using different characters. Hardcore players even create multiple game accounts and do dozens of runs daily.]","[......That means the other reward must be really valuable huh?]","In this game, you could create up to 10 characters per account. Owning multiple accounts wasn’t prohibited either...... so the top-tier hardcore players would undoubtedly have several accounts with dozens of characters.","However, since this game had a monthly subscription fee per account, running multiple accounts also meant spending more money...... That said, if hardcore players were going to such lengths, the rewards must have been worth it.","[Yes, for top players, the main draw is that reward. Every time you clear a floor, both players in the pair receive an event-exclusive box. Of course, the higher the floor, the more boxes you get.]","[An event-exclusive box?]","[Ah, errr, to put it simply for Kaito-san, think of it like an old treasure chest.]","[Ah, I see...... So you get random items from it huh......]","Old treasure chests were rare drops from various monsters, and when used, they granted random items.","Most of the time, you’d get junk that sold for pocket change or cheap consumables. However, there was a small chance of obtaining valuable gear or high-priced tradeable items, making them highly gamble-oriented.","[Basically, most of the rewards from the bridal event quests come in the form of those event-exclusive boxes. You can earn them not just from this dungeon but also by completing daily quests. However, this dungeon is the most efficient way to farm them.]","[So, does that mean some really amazing items can drop from these boxes?]","[Yes. Most of the time, you’ll get tradeable items that can make you some pocket money or fairly useful consumables. But at low drop rates, you can obtain event-exclusive gear or costume equipment. And then there’s an even rarer drop...... so rare that it’s said to be one in a million or even one in ten million, a ridiculously powerful accessory. It’s the kind of item that top-tier players would kill to get their hands on.]","[I see. So that’s why the top players are grinding this dungeon like crazy...... But since it’s all based on probability, even beginners or intermediate players who can only clear the lower floors still have a chance of getting it, right?] ɽΑꞐOВЁṩ","[Ye. Plus, the event-exclusive boxes can be bought and sold, so you can always take them to the marketplace and sell them for a good price.]","In the end, it all came down to luck. For beginners and intermediate players, this event was a great way to make stable income or strike it rich, while for advanced players, it offered the slim possibility of obtaining insanely powerful equipment.","[Well, don’t worry too much about all that, Kaito-san. Just enjoy the combat. it’s been a while, hasn’t it? And believe it or not, I’m actually pretty strong. I can handle a fair number of monsters on my own.]","[Got it. It’s been a long time since I last played, so I’ll just focus on getting back into the rhythm.]","With that, we exchanged smiles and stepped into the event-exclusive dungeon.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Whoa there, throwing a probability-based event in front of someone whose luck stat is completely broken sounds like a total flag......]"]},{"number":2173,"title":"Chapter 2173: A Nostalgic MMO 7","paragraphs":["The event dungeon I challenged together with Aoi-chan was, as she said, extremely easy at first, allowing us to progress through the floors smoothly.","However, as expected, things started getting rough around the 20th floor. Aoi-chan mentioned that reaching the 30th floor was doable for a well-equipped Tier-4 Class, so for a Tier-3 Class like mine with just decent gear, even getting to the 30th floor was quite a struggle.","That said, Aoi-chan was a Tier-4 Class with a high level and solid equipment, and from the 20th floor onward, it felt like she was just mowing down everything.","Even though my character was Tier-3, its high durability allowed me to group up enemies while Aoi-chan wiped them out with high-powered AOE magic. The strategy worked really well.","However, after passing the 30th floor, enemies that could withstand Aoi-chan's magic began to appear, and even I started having trouble enduring their attacks.","[......It seems like going any further would be difficult. Shall we head back after clearing this 35th floor?]","[Yeah, at this point, it’s just taking more and more time. My character also leveled up by about 25 levels, and the EXP gain was really nice. The limited box...... is this the last one?]","[Yes, it seems we receive them based on the highest cleared floor when we exit the dungeon.]","As she answered my question, Aoi-chan spoke to the NPC inside the pair dungeon and selected the option to end the dungeon run at this floor.","Thereupon, instead of a door leading to the next floor, a different door appeared, and stepping through it brought us to a small results-confirmation room. Talking to the NPC there rewarded us with items based on the cleared floor, granting us 50 limited boxes each along with some premium items.","[Fifty per person huh? That’s quite a lot.]","[Even completing all the event daily quests only gives about 20, so this dungeon is clearly the most efficient.]","[Since we have them, should we go ahead and open the limited boxes?]","[That sounds good. I was thinking of selling them to upgrade Kaito-san’s equipment, but since we already got a good amount of money from storage items, it seems better to open them and experience the event.]","Selling them would fetch a decent sum, but not enough to upgrade both my and Aoi-chan’s equipment, so we decided to just open them normally.","Selecting the limited box from my inventory and using it......","<C○○-san has obtained the Heavenly God’s Accessory from the Limited Box>","......Unn? Just now, a World Announcement, which broadcasts rare item drops to the entire online game, suddenly appeared. The character name was censored except for the first letter, and on my game screen, I saw the message \"Heavenly God’s Accessory obtained\"...... Eh?","[K- Kaito-san!? T- That’s one of the accessories I was just talking about!!!]","[Eh? For real? W- Well, I thought that might be the case when the World Announcement popped up but...... Ehhhh!?]","[......Kaito-san’s luck also carries over into online games huh.]","[A- Ahh, I see, could this be thanks to Shiro-san’s Blessing?]","I had just pulled an insanely rare item in a single try, which made me realize, this might be due to Shiro-san’s Blessing.","(No, strictly speaking, that game world is considered a separate realm, so I have adjusted it so that my Blessing does not affect it.)","Eh? Ah, I see.","[......I just got a message from Shiro-san. Apparently, her Blessing’s luck boost doesn’t apply to this online game.]","[So, you got it with your own luck? That’s incredible. That accessory comes in several types, and they’re all ridiculously strong...... What kind of effect does the Heavenly God one have?] ŕAΝóbЕʂ","[Errr...... whoa, this is insane...... +20 to all stats, HP doubled, 30% reduction in both physical and magical damage, and a 5% chance to nullify damage on hit...... For a single accessory slot, that’s...... Yeah, no wonder the top-tier players are desperate to get this.]","For an incredibly rare item obtainable at an absurdly low probability, its performance was truly astonishing. Each one of its four effects was powerful on its own, and for tank roles in particular, it was the kind of gear you'd do anything to get your hands on.","[This is amazing. If we were to sell this, I think we'd probably get enough money to buy frontline-tier equipment.]","[Yeah, there's nothing written here that doesn't scream OP. Well, the effects also synergize well with my Class, so I might be better off just using it myself.]","[Agreed. Equipping it should make you significantly stronger...... Actually, with that kind of gear, it might even be worth adjusting your stats and skills toward a tank build.]","[That’s true, that could work too. Well, I’ll think about that later. For now, let's deal with the rest......]","When I advanced to a Tier-3 Class, I was given a one-time opportunity to reset and reallocate my stats and skills. So, as Aoi-chan suggested, shifting to a tank build was a real possibility. Judging from our dungeon runs, Aoi-chan's firepower was overwhelmingly high, so it would probably be best if I focused on tanking while she handled the offense.","For now, I was just happy to have obtained such an incredible item through sheer luck. It wasn't exactly a rare drop, but getting high-rarity gear like this was always exciting.","As I reminisced about the fun I used to have playing, I opened another Limited Box.","<C○○-san has obtained the Demon God’s Accessory from the Limited Box>","And then, another World Announcement popped up...... Huh?","<Afterword>","~ ~ Luck Modifiers Affecting Kaito When Opening Limited Boxes ~ ~","God of Creation's Affection (Adjusted to avoid influence)","God of Fate's Affection (Adjusted to avoid influence)","Great Evil God's Love (Slightly influencing)","Machine God's Mad Love (Heavily influencing, everything is almost this thing's fault)","Ultimate God's Divine Blessing (Slightly influencing)","NEW: Vicissitude God’s Blessing (Influencing)","NEW: Virtual God’s Blessing (Greatly influencing)","NEW: Bipolar God’s Blessing (Influencing)","NEW: Multiple Other Gods’ Blessings \"In Massive Quantities\" (Since Canalis also did this before revealing her real name, it was deemed safe to grant Blessings as long as they’re only Blessings. So, many of Kaito's God fans who haven't greeted him yet have given their Blessings.)","Serious-senpai : [......He's getting a ridiculous amount of buffs from all sorts of strange sources again. Feels like Alice is gonna be holding her head in frustration in the future.....]"]},{"number":2174,"title":"Chapter 2174: A Nostalgic MMO 8","paragraphs":["Seeing the second World Announcement, and the unmistakable text displayed on the screen “Acquired Demon God's Accessory”...... Aoi-chan and I exchanged bewildered looks.","Frankly, this is bizarre. Even pulling something with a one-in-ten-million chance once is absurdly lucky, but doing it twice in a row? That’s basically an astronomical probability.","If it had only happened once, it could still be brushed off as something like winning the lottery...... a stroke of extreme luck, but not entirely impossible.","However, this consecutive streak makes me suspect that there's more at play than just luck. Shiro-san mentioned adjusting her Blessing so it wouldn't affect things, but there could still be another factor at work.","For example, this is purely speculation but...... Eden-san...... or rather, Makina-san, might have granted me something akin to a Blessing.","That explanation would actually make the most sense. This online game is connected to a parallel world, but it's still part of Earth's cyberspace. If Makina-san's blessing were exerting a powerful influence, granting me extreme luck, it would be a reasonable conclusion.","I mean, it's Makina-san we're talking about. There's no way she wouldn’t do for me what Shiro-san and Fate-san have done. Saying something like “It’s a mother’s duty to bless her child”, and secretly doing it? That wouldn’t be surprising at all.","Though, maybe out of consideration for Shiro-san, she usually ensures that the Blessing doesn’t take effect in Trinia or something like that. That could be possible...... Well, this is just complete speculation on my part......","[......Aoi-chan, I’m thinking of selling the remaining boxes. What do you think?]","[......I think that’s a good idea. If we keep going, we might actually get suspected of cheating or something......]","Honestly, I think we're still safe for now. Sure, we pulled two ultra-rare drops in a row, but we took some time to check the Heavenly God's Accessory’s effects and discuss how to use it. So, there was a reasonable gap between the two World Announcements.","From the perspective of other players, they might see it as someone extraordinarily lucky pulling two ultra-rare accessories in a short period, but they likely haven't realized that they were obtained consecutively.","If there’s a forum somewhere, this might already be causing a stir. But even then, it’s probably just along the lines of “Wow, some guy hit the jackpot twice”. At this stage, it’s still within the realm of insanely lucky but not outright impossible.","However, as Aoi-chan said, if I open another box and get a third one, then people will absolutely suspect a bug or cheating, and it’ll cause a huge commotion...... And honestly, I have an almost certain feeling...... if I open another box, I’ll definitely get another accessory.","That’s why selling the remaining boxes is the best choice. There are tons of players with four-letter names starting with “C”, so there’s no risk of me being singled out, envied, and harassed.","[W- Well, for now, let’s check the Demon God's Accessory’s effects.]","[Yeah.]","[It looks like an accessory for magic users. The +20 to all stats and 100% HP increase seem to be standard for this series. Its unique ability lets the user ignore 100% of the enemy’s Magic Defense and gives a 5% chance for magic damage to double...... I see, Aoi-chan, as a magic user, what do you think?]","[It’s ridiculously strong. Normally, even with specialized skills and equipment, you can only manage about a 90% Magic Defense Ignore at best. My character has a lot of passive skills that boost Magic Defense Ignore, but even then, it only totals 67%. An accessory that alone grants 100% Magic Defense Ignore is already insane. With that equipped, I could focus the rest of my gear purely on boosting firepower. And the magic damage doubling effect is amazing. If it applies to multi-hit spells, the overall damage output would skyrocket.]","Since I’m a physical fighter, I wasn’t too familiar with skills or equipment that ignored Magic Defense———– none existed before I retired. But from what Aoi-chan was saying, this seemed to be the ultimate piece of gear for magic users.","[......Then I’ll give this accessory to you, Aoi-chan.]","[Ehh!? N- No way! I can’t accept it! This is so valuable you could sell it and get a full set of top-tier frontline gear!]","[Yeah, that might be true, but selling it would basically be like announcing to the world that I pulled both the Heavenly God’s and Demon God’s accessories...... And honestly, it’s wasted on me as a physical fighter. If you equip this and I use the Heavenly God’s Accessory to strengthen myself, we’ll be able to take on even more difficult areas together.] RÅƝՕᛒƐṣ","[U- Uuuu...... When you put it like that...... Yeah, I do want to challenge high-difficulty dungeons with you...... A- Alright. But I’ll definitely find a way to repay you for this someday!]","In the end, Aoi-chan accepted the Demon God’s Accessory, seemingly convinced by my reasoning. With this, she gained a massive power boost, and with my new tank-oriented gear, we’d be able to take on even tougher dungeons without issue.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [High-difficulty dungeon...... 5% chance to nullify damage...... Ah.]"]},{"number":2175,"title":"Chapter 2175: Intermission: The (Late) Digital Monster","paragraphs":["How should one describe its existence? A bug in cyberspace, a malicious lingering thought...... One thing is certain: its presence could be considered a type of irregularity.","Originally, it was a feeble, minuscule entity, lacking even thought or will. However, at some point, an immense power unexpectedly flowed into the space where it drifted.","Like a God, this unfathomable force created a world out of nothing...... a space that deviated from its original phase, a kind of parallel world.","What proved fortunate for it was the sheer overwhelming nature of that power...... it was too immense, too vast to be precise. Even after forming a world, an excess of power still remained in the space. By absorbing the remnants of this surplus, it rapidly evolved into a being with both will and strength.","(Ahh, I see, I was chosen. Yes, to erase those foolish humans with my own hands...... Yes, I have ascended to become the God of the digital realm!)","Originally a mere fragment of malicious data, it transformed under an absurdly immense power, becoming a malevolent entity within cyberspace.","Its power in the digital world was immense. And in today's world, controlling cyberspace was practically equivalent to ruling the entire world.","It understood that the place it inhabited was akin to a parallel world, but that was a trivial matter. If this was the world it now resided in, then it would simply follow its own malevolence and plunge it into chaos......","The digital monster prepared to move and bring destruction upon the world...... when suddenly, it sensed an unusual access within the cyber realm. A connection from nowhere within this world, yet undeniably linked to it. As it traced this connection, it saw a pair of individuals...... a man and a woman.","(What is this? Are they accessing my domain from another world? Foolish...... To extend a hand toward the God of this digital realm...... Fine, as the first step in erasing this world, I shall begin by eliminating you. If you can access this space, then I can interfere from here as well...... Fufufu, now, let me invite you to he——–?!)","As the digital monster reached out to the beings from another world, it suddenly froze.","It was as if a single drop of water had fallen into a completely silent space.","Drawn by an unknown force, it turned around———— and there stood \"something whose nature was unknown\".","Long hair shifting through multiple hues, a futuristic outfit adorned with cybernetic embellishments, red eyes reminiscent of a camera lens...... Though its form resembled that of a human, its presence was far too alien. If one were to describe it, it felt akin to a robot imitating the shape of a human woman.","『隴ヲ蜻翫?ゅ>縺セ逹?讒倥′諢壹°縺励¥繧ょケイ貂峨@繧医≧縺ィ縺励◆縺ョ縺ッ縲∝ー翫′′縺頑婿縲よが諢上r謖√▲縺ヲ謇九r莨ク縺ー縺吶↑縺ゥ險ア縺輔l縺悶k陋ョ陦後〒縺ゅk』","The enigmatic entity spoke, yet the digital monster could not comprehend the words. No, it could hear them, but it could not recognize them as language.","(What is this thing......? No...... It’s too different...... The power it holds...... its very existence......)","Even without understanding the words, it immediately recognized the being before it as something possessing unfathomable strength. Though it was merely a collection of malignant data, it instinctively trembled and dropped to its knees, without even realizing that what it felt was fear...... ṜaΝƟʙËṥ","『......Adjusting language to a level that an inferior existence can comprehend...... <Not that it actually matters, but a pathetic scrap of digital garbage like you trying to meddle with Miyama Kaito-sama? Die!> ......Message transmission, complete. Conducting erasure.』","After speaking in words that could now be understood, the being lightly raised a hand.","That was all it took, before the digital monster, an entity with enough power to destroy the world, vanished without leaving behind even a fragment of data.","Having erased the digital monster, the being shifted its gaze...... towards Kaito and Aoi, who were playing their online game.","『......Emotion output...... <Since my turn comes after Bipolar God, I can’t meet him yet. I'm so envious of Canalis.> ......Personal impression output...... <But since you accessed a cyberspace, I got to see Miyama Kaito-sama’s face, so I’m super happy!> ......Confirming future plans...... <This isn’t Shallow Vernal's world, so it should be fine if I stay and admire Miyama Kaito-sama for a while. Ehehe, lucky me.> ......Finalizing future actions...... Continuing to observe Miyama Kaito-sama.』","After speaking in a strange manner, both mechanical and emotional, the being...... the one known as \"Virtual God\" began swaying from side to side, watching Kaito with amusement.","<Afterword>","~~Contents of the First Garbled Line~~","[Warning. The one you are foolishly attempting to meddle with is a revered being. To reach out with malicious intent is an unforgivable act of barbarism.]"]},{"number":2176,"title":"Chapter 2176: A Nostalgic MMO 9","paragraphs":["Aoi-chan and I, having significantly powered up after obtaining powerful accessories, decided to take on a high-difficulty dungeon since we had the opportunity.","That said, many of the high-difficulty dungeons in this online game have entry restrictions, such as requiring \"Tier-4 Class or higher\", and since I'm only at a Tier-3 Class, I'm limited to dungeons I can actually enter. So, it's not quite the highest difficulty level in the game.","Besides, those kinds of ultra-high-difficulty dungeons require carefully tailored resistances to match the dungeon, and since I just returned from gaming and don't have the necessary sub-equipment or resistance gear, I wouldn't be able to go there anyway.","[......There weren't even Tier-3 Classes back when I was playing, so I obviously don't know, but this dungeon is pretty tough, right?]","[Yes, before Tier-4 Classes were introduced, this was the dungeon with the highest difficulty. Even a Tier-4 party can get wiped out easily if they're not properly equipped. I did think it might be too hard for just the two of us, but in terms of resistances, this dungeon seemed like a good choice..... It doesn't use special status effects or hard-to-counter poison and Holy-type Magic, so your equipment should be fine here.]","[I see. Well, obviously, even dungeons that Tier-3 Classes can enter still require specialized equipment builds. But if the difficulty is high despite the resistance requirements being lax...... that means the enemies are just really strong huh.]","[Yes, the monsters have extremely high stats, and even the frontline will take massive damage in a single hit if their equipment is lacking. But most of them are just high-damage monsters without complicated mechanics, so considering your Class, gear, and that accessory we just got, I think we have a good shot at this.]","On a side note, my current equipment is defense-oriented. Not because of the Heavenly God's Accessory I acquired, but because I had already chosen my gear based on Aoi-chan’s advice earlier.","Since Aoi-chan, a Tier-4 rearguard, has overwhelming firepower, I figured it would be best for me to take on more of a tank role. Plus, my Tier-3 Class leans toward defense-oriented skills.","[Well, let's give it a try, and if it seems too tough, we can find another dungeon.]","[Got it. Let's do our best.]","After briefly discussing our strategy, Aoi-chan and I challenged the high-difficulty dungeon.","About 30 minutes had passed since we started challenging the high-difficulty dungeon, and my impression was...... we were holding up better than expected.","As Aoi-chan had said, the enemies' attack power was quite high. Even with my defense-focused equipment and skill setup, I still took a considerable amount of damage...... but honestly, my recovery rate could easily keep up.","Or rather, the Heavenly God's Accessory was just too strong. The 30% damage reduction for both physical and magical attacks was already powerful, but more than that, the 5% chance to completely negate damage...... this effect was triggering far more often than I expected.","There were a few moments when a large number of monsters spawned at once, putting us in danger, but thanks to this effect repeatedly activating, we managed to pull through.","......Maybe there’s a hidden effect not mentioned in the item description, something like an increased activation rate when the wearer’s HP drops.","And on top of that, Aoi-chan, who was already a high-damage dealer as a Tier-4 Class, had equipped the Demon God's Accessory, boosting her firepower to insane levels. Thanks to that, we were making smooth progress.","[......We’re advancing incredibly well. Do you think we can take on the Boss?]","[Hard to say. At the very least, it feels like we can make it to the Boss Room.]","In this game, dungeons work by having each party generate their own instance through an NPC before entering, so there’s no risk of encountering other parties or competing for Boss fights.","On the other hand, fields outside of dungeons are shared across the server, meaning other players are present, and Boss fights often turn into competition. But with dungeons, as long as we reach the deepest area, we’re guaranteed a Boss battle.","Well, once the Boss is defeated, the dungeon is considered cleared, and after receiving the additional rewards, we’re automatically sent outside. After that, we won’t be able to re-enter the same dungeon for 24 hours. So, if someone’s farming EXP, it’s sometimes better to avoid defeating the Boss and just keep grinding.","For us, this was more of a test run, so if we reached the deepest area, we planned to take on the Boss.","[Alright, let’s give the Boss a shot once we reach the deepest area.]","[Sounds good. Even with these powerful accessories, I doubt we can win as a pair...... but let’s give it our best shot.]","And so, we reached the dungeon Boss and engaged in battle...... but somehow, we actually won.","[......We won.]","[......We really did. Or rather, Kaito-san, aren’t you way too OP? I even brought resurrection items, but you never died once, right?]","[The accessory effect just kept activating at the perfect times.]","[Kaito-san’s luck even shows up in things like this huh. It triggered exactly when the Boss used its strongest skills...... Well, putting that aside...... Kaito-san...... what color does the treasure chest look like to you?] ᚱÅNỖBËṣ","[......Gold.]","When a dungeon Boss is defeated, a treasure chest appears as a dungeon-clear reward. Naturally, its contents are random, and the rarer the item, the lower the drop rate. That’s why top players grind dungeons repeatedly.","However, on very rare occasions, the dungeon-clear reward chest turns gold. And when that happens, it guarantees the \"rarest possible item from that dungeon’s reward pool\".","This system had been around for a long time, but getting the highest rarity item wasn’t exclusive to gold chests. Plus, the appearance rate of gold chests was so absurdly low that I’d never seen one before.","......Unn, errr...... I really feel like my luck has some weird modifier on it.","<Afterword>","Bugged Luck Stat : [I figured if the activation rate was 100% all the time, people would suspect cheating, so I made it trigger at 100% only in clutch moments! Oh, and that ultra-low chance of a gold treasure chest? You’d be happier getting good stuff, right? Let’s make that guaranteed!]","Serious-senpai : [......That’s one considerate luck modifier you’ve got there......]"]},{"number":2177,"title":"Chapter 2177: A Nostalgic MMO 10","paragraphs":["Of course, from the golden treasure chest, we obtained the most valuable item available in that dungeon. As Aoi-chan had mentioned that the difficulty might have been a bit high, the dungeon we were challenging was one of the highest-tier dungeons accessible to Tier-3 Classes, so naturally, the ultra-rare drops from it were also incredibly valuable.","[This isn’t an item that either Aoi-chan or I can use, so selling it is the best option, right?]","[That’s right. If we use the money to get resistance equipment, we’ll be able to access more places.]","[Yeah. Also...... I’m thinking of reallocating my stats and skills more toward a tank role. Aoi-chan’s firepower is overwhelming, and in this dungeon, our strategy of me holding the enemies while Aoi-chan attacked worked really well.]","[The Heavenly God's Accessory turned out to be even stronger than its description suggested. I think the 30% damage reduction it provides is applied at the very end of the damage calculation. Considering that, Kaito-san’s durability with that equipment was practically on par with a Tier-4 Class.]","Just as Aoi-chan said, while the accessory’s chance-based damage nullification was strong, the sheer durability it provided while equipped was incredible.","With all stats +20 and HP doubled, my survivability was already significantly boosted. On top of that, the fixed damage reduction further reinforced it...... making it possible to withstand attacks in a dungeon where enemy firepower was supposed to be high.","Moreover, since I had only recently advanced to Tier-3 Class and hadn’t leveled up much yet, by the time I reached Tier-4 Class, I would become even more solid. If I adjusted my stats and skills further toward a tank role, I might even be able to challenge even higher-difficulty dungeons.","[......Well, putting that aside, we’ve been playing for quite a while. Let’s take a break.]","[Yeah. We’ve been going nonstop since the event dungeon, so I’m feeling a bit tired too.]","[We’ve been sitting the whole time, so why don’t we stretch a bit and have some tea on the garden terrace? I’ll ask Illness-san to prepare some tea and snacks.]","[Sounds good.]","Having been absorbed in the game after such a long time, we had played intensely. Taking a break now felt like a good idea, so I moved with Aoi-chan to have some tea together.","By the time Kaito and Aoi headed for their break, Canalis had arrived at the parallel world cybernetic space. Her reason for being there was simple: to meet with the Virtual God, an acquaintance of hers.","The first time she appeared in this space, it was to eliminate an entity that had been acting suspiciously in the digital realm. Since that matter had already been dealt with, there were no further issues regarding it. If Virtual God hadn’t shown up, Canalis would have erased the anomaly herself.","The problem was that even after the threat was removed, Virtual God remained in the parallel world cybernetic space. Curious about what she were doing here, Canalis visited...... and with her usual blank expression, she tilted her head slightly.","[......What are you doing, \"Electrone\"?]","『I would like to preemptively clarify any misunderstandings. At this moment, this unit has not violated any agreements or restrictions. In accordance to the regulations of Miyama Kaito-sama’s fan club, should a disturbance occur in a non-Trinia location that is closely linked to cybernetic space, this unit has the right to act as Kaito-sama’s guardian. Therefore, this unit’s presence here is not out of personal desire but as a legitimate execution of rights...... Proceeding with further clarification...... <I am strictly following Nebula-sama’s instructions as well as all fan club agreements and contracts, and I swear I have not attempted any direct contact with Kaito-sama, nor have I entered Shallow Vernal’s world>...... Hence, there is no need for concern.』 ⱤΆNöꞖÈṠ","[Ah, no, I know you’re always careful about such matters, so I’m not really worried about that...... What I do want to ask about is...... your outfit.]","Electrone had responded that she was here because of an agreement established by the various World Creators...... more specifically, the fan club regulations concerning Kaito. Within the cybernetic spaces of worlds outside of Trinia, Electrone was granted the right to protect Kaito against malicious entities.","Canalis had no issue with that. She was already aware that among the World Creators...... among those who had once pledged loyalty to Nebula, a fan club for Kaito had formed, and she also knew that various agreements had been made regarding it.","That said...... she couldn’t ignore the bizarre sight before her————- Electrone, dressed in a pink happi coat emblazoned with \"KAITO-SAMA SUPER LOVE\", wearing a headband that read \"VICTORY ONLY FOR KAITO-SAMA\", and holding seven-colored penlights in both hands.","『......Providing response...... <Even if this is by coincidence, this is a rare opportunity to support my oshi, Kaito-sama! Attending in proper attire is only appropriate!>...... Therefore, this outfit is the formal dress code for supporting my oshi, Kaito-sama.』","[......Well, I can’t really talk since my own facial expressions are basically dead, but...... seeing you wave those penlights with such high energy only to immediately return to a blank expression is quite the emotional whiplash.]","Watching Electrone rapidly shift from a calm and composed machine-like demeanor to that of an enthusiastic fan, only to abruptly revert back to an expressionless state, a wry smile was formed in Canalis' expressionless face.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [T- This God has...... quite the intense character......]","Makina : [She's like that, and yet, this Electrone apparently started as an AI that underwent abnormal evolution, reached the domain of Gods, destroyed the world it was originally born in, and then went on to create a new one......]","Serious-senpai : [That backstory is way too intense......]"]},{"number":2178,"title":"Chapter 2178: A Nostalgic MMO 11","paragraphs":["Canalis, having listened to Electrone’s story, more or less accepted the situation. In the first place, the reason for the visit seemed to be nothing more than saying hello since an acquaintance was nearby, but after meeting her here, what really caught Canalis’s attention was Electrone’s full-on enthusiasm for cheering her oshi.","Well, whether or not there was a satisfying answer regarding that outfit, Canalis tilted her head in doubt. However, bringing it up any further seemed troublesome, so she decided to drop the topic.","[But still, having Electrone, who is called the Virtual God, in charge of cyberspace is reassuring. Tahaa~~ though honestly, there are so many factions wanting to protect Kaito-sama that it seems like anyone could handle it.]","『......Requesting correction...... <Canalis! I’ve told you over and over, don’t call me something uncute like Virtual God! If you’re going to call me something, call me Virtual Angel Electrone-chan!> ......End of request. Improvement expected.』","[The shift in energy is so extreme I might catch a cold from the temperature difference...... Anyway, changing the subject, Electrone, you’re the next one after the next, right?]","The order Canalis referred to was the sequence in which individuals would visit Trinia to meet Nepura and Kaito. Since the first acquaintance to whom Canalis conveyed Nebula's message was the World Creator known as the Bipolar God, who acted swiftly, she had secured the earliest position.","After that, others began receiving Nebula’s messages and instructions...... leading to an intense battle over the next available slot after the Bipolar God.","Well, the decision itself was made through an agreed-upon game of rock-paper-scissors, but considering that the participants were World Creators with overwhelming power, the match became so intense that, had they not taken precautions, the collateral damage would have erased over ten thousand worlds. After this extraordinary match, Electrone won the slot immediately following the Bipolar God.","Many of the World Creators who revere Nebula have formed a fan club for Kaito, where they establish various agreements and contracts. They also meticulously set limitations and guidelines regarding their visits to Trinia and their interactions with Kaito.","Because of this, even though Electrone was nearby, she refrained from greeting Kaito and instead focused solely on cheering for her oshi.","Incidentally, the fan club itself is divided into multiple factions based on preferences and allegiances, and they even negotiate terms among themselves, making it a highly organized entity.","『Affirmative. This unit’s turn is immediately after Bipolar God. Continuing...... outputting small talk...... <∇∮◆£ said that the current waiting time feels the longest ever. Since Kaito-sama’s vocal cords can’t pronounce that kid’s name, they came up with a separate name for greetings.> ......Additionally, I shall note that said individual has been practicing punches while declaring their intention to unleash a Dimensional Collapse Combo on Canalis.』","[......Hyihh...... I’d really appreciate it if that didn’t happen. If I forget to repair my body, Kaito-sama will worry. Tahaa~~ just a while ago, I got hit by a Multiversal Rift Chop and forgot to heal myself, which ended up causing Kaito-sama a lot of concern. Well, I mean, I’m a God, so that level of damage isn’t even an injury, but still, Kaito-sama’s kindness really gets to me...... Not that I forgot to heal on purpose or anything, but I kinda felt like I got something out of it.]","『.....................』","[Well, in the end, after I fixed my body, it turned into a situation where I had tea with Kaito-sama, listened to his recent stories, and enjoyed some quality alone time with him. Tahaa~~ that was the kind of happiness I could really get used to.]","Electrone listened silently until the end of Canalis's words, which, though spoken in a monotone, carried a certain air of enjoyment, before finally opening her mouth.","『......Issuing a warning......<Canalis? If you plan to keep bragging like that in front of me, a die-hard Kaito-sama devotee, then you better be prepared for the consequences. Yeah, to put it simply in one word...... It's just way too enviable, so...... I'm gonna beat you up!!!>...... Execution commencing』","[Wha!? You’re calling it a warning, but you’re already acting on it!? C- Calm dow———-]","Though she had pointed out Electrone's outfit, Canalis herself also considered herself a fan of Kaito, and naturally, she had plenty of stories when it came to him. ⱤΑꞐổᛒЁś","And as the inevitable result of carelessly sharing one of her recent happy moments...... Canalis's screams echoed through the digital space.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Come to think of it, they're gonna have Kaito do a lottery and select a few World Creators to allow birthday presents, right? I sense a headache coming for Kaito......]"]},{"number":2179,"title":"Chapter 2179: Birthday Gift Draw","paragraphs":["It was, if anything, quite abrupt. At least, for Kaito, who was directly involved, that is...... After finishing his daily routine of brushing and taking care of his pets, Kaito was relaxing in his room, reading a book, when Canalis came to visit.","[Kaito-sama, I apologize for the sudden request. Do you have a moment?]","[Eh? Ah, yeah, I’m free...... Did something happen?]","[No, it's nothing like trouble. I just have a small request...... Could you do a little lottery draw for me? Tahaa~~ I have a garapon lottery machine ready right here, so please give it a spin!]","[......Errr, what exactly am I drawing for?]","Kaito tilted his head in confusion as he looked at the garapon machine Canalis placed on the desk. It was the kind typically used in bingo games. His reaction was only natural, if someone suddenly pulled out a lottery machine, it was reasonable to wonder \"What exactly am I drawing for?\"","[Tahaa~~ Well, at the moment, I can't really tell you that, Kaito-sama...... I'll explain later, so for now, could you just set your questions aside and go ahead with the draw?]","[......Y- Yeah, alright.]","Although he found it suspicious, Kaito agreed, likely because of the trust he had in Canalis. If, for example, it had been Alice or Shallow Vernal making the request, he might have been more wary, thinking they were up to something strange. But since it was Canalis, he judged that this wasn't some kind of prank or joke.","With curiosity still lingering, Kaito spun the garapon. A white ball, completely blank, rolled out.","[......Errr...... 178432 huh. Sorry, but could you do this four more times?]","[......Uh, I think I just heard something about 170,000...... Does this thing actually hold way more than it looks?]","[Yes, it may look slim, but it's packed to the brim. We've made sure the draws are fair, though. Now, please continue, four more times!]","[O- Okay.]","[......Alright, next one...... 2 huh.]","The first draw was 178432, and the second was 2...... The sheer contrast between the numbers left Kaito with a strange impression. As he went for the third draw, another blank white ball rolled out.","However, Canalis seemed to know the number, as she picked up the ball and read it aloud.","[Let's see...... 17,680,000,015......]","[......Uh, Canalis-san? This is starting to get a little scary. Just how many numbers are in there......]","[A lot.]","[I- I see......]","Kaito had no idea what was going on, but he was at least certain that he was drawing from an absurdly huge set of numbers. Feeling a little bewildered, he nevertheless completed the requested five draws as instructed.","As Kaito was being urged by Canalis to conduct the lottery, in a space created in another world separated by multiple dimensions, Virtual God, Electrone, was triumphantly raising both her hands to the sky.","[......Outputting emotions......<Let's gooooo!!! Now I can send a present to Kaito-sama!! Ehehe, unlike ∇∮◆£ who cheated at the start dash, I actually competed properly and secured the number 2 slot! And now, I’ve even won the lottery to give Kaito-sama a birthday present! At this point, I think it’s fair to say that Kaito-sama and I are bound by the \"red string of fate\", as they call it in his world’s culture!!!>...... Savoring the joy of victory. Additionally, I also feel an immense amount of killing intent directed at me, which, at the same time, brings me a sense of delight.]","Yes, the lottery Kaito had been conducting was to determine who would have the privilege of gifting him presents for his birthday party. After discussions, it had been decided that among the World Creators who wished to participate, five individuals would be selected by Kaito through a lottery to be granted the right to give him a birthday present.","Electrone, having won that right and basking in her triumph, was met with an overwhelming wave of jealousy and murderous intent from those around her, enough to threaten the collapse of several dimensions. However, she nonchalantly brushed it all off.","Gathered here were members of various fan clubs dedicated to Kaito, established by the World Creators. Specifically, this particular club consisted of those who held romantic feelings for him...... or as Electrone described them, the \"Die-Hard Devotees\". The jealousy toward Electrone, who had just secured the right to give Kaito a birthday gift, was intense.","Even so, because prior agreements had been strictly established, no actual battles broke out......","Incidentally, other factions existed as well, such as a fan club that worshiped Kaito as an entity on par with Nebula, as he was an entity she referred to as Milord, and another that viewed Kaito as their child, watching over his growth with warm affection. There were many different groups even within the broader fan club.","Since Nebula herself was an entity reigning at the pinnacle of an overwhelming number of World Creators, the sheer number of World Creators who became fans of Kaito was extraordinary.","Amidst this boisterous atmosphere, the lottery continued, and as Kaito completed his final, fifth draw, cheers erupted once again from the surrounding deities, with one of them even shedding tears of overwhelming emotion.","[......Outputting astonishment...... <Ohhh, amazing! Two slots won by the Die-Hard Devotee Fan Club, proving once again that true love prevails!>...... Continuing, outputting a warning...... <Well, I’m sure you all understand but...... I don’t mind if it’s directed at me, but don’t aim any killing intent at that one, okay? They’re too weak.>...... As someone who reveres Nebula-sama and a fellow fan of Kaito-sama, I expect everyone to act with proper decency.]","The newly selected World Creator specialized in creative abilities and could indeed create worlds, but in terms of raw strength, she was quite weak———— far from being Quasi-Omnipotent, and even against beings on the level of the Six Kings, she would be utterly crushed. If she was subjected to the same pressure that had been directed at Electrone, she might have been completely obliterated from existence.","(T/N: Gender actually still unknown, but given what kind of novel this is, most probably female.)","That said, the World Creators present here were devoted followers of Nebula and had inherited her teachings well. They did not needlessly intimidate those weaker than them.","The previous outpouring of jealousy and killing intent had been directed at Electrone because she was at an Omnipotent and Omniscient level like them, and for beings of that level, it was no more than playful banter. None of that hostility was aimed at the newly chosen winner, and instead, everyone wholeheartedly celebrated her selection.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [This is just a guess, but Electrone's number is \"2\", right? That would mean...... the lottery numbers correspond to the order in which they're scheduled to come greet him...... If that's the case, their numbers are quite insane......]"]},{"number":2180,"title":"Chapter 2180: A Small Celebration 1","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I didn't have much time today, so today's chapter is a short one.","While playing an online game, I was reminded that Aoi-chan’s birthday was coming up. Since it was a special occasion, I thought it would be nice to celebrate it in some way.","It seemed Aoi-chan intended to extend being 17 for another year, but that aside, I still wanted to do something for her birthday.","[......That’s what I was thinking. What do you think?]","[That sounds great! It's gonna be a surprise party, right?! I’m sure Aoi-senpai would be happy.]","So, I decided to consult with Hina-chan about celebrating Aoi-chan’s birthday. She was enthusiastic about the idea, and we agreed to secretly prepare something to celebrate.","Incidentally, Aoi-chan was currently attending a lecture on Golem-related magic at the Magic Academy, so she wasn’t around. This made it the perfect time to plan.","[......But how big of a celebration are we talking about? If Kaito-senpai really wanted to, he could make it incredibly extravagant......]","[Hmmm, that’s true but...... If we go overboard, Aoi-chan might feel too self-conscious. Since she plans to skip this birthday and just continue being 17, I don’t think we need to throw a full-scale birthday party.]","[Ahh, yeah, that part is a bit tricky. My birthday is on December 23rd, so with the time we were transferred...... it feels like my birthday got pushed back by about half a year. I kind of get that feeling of being out of sync with that world’s time.]","As Hina-chan said, if we wanted to, we could throw a proper birthday party. I could handle the arrangements myself, or I could ask Lilia-san to take care of it, and she’d probably organize something really nice.","But since Aoi-chan seemed intent on skipping her birthday this time, I figured it would be best for just me and Hina-chan to celebrate in a simple way.","[......For now, I think it’s fine if just you and I prepare something simple to celebrate. Nothing flashy, just a cake and a present should be enough......]","[That sounds good. We could have a small celebration in Kaito-senpai’s room or something like that.]","[Ah, what about Seigi-kun?]","[Hmm...... Coming here from the city where Seigi lives would take quite a bit of time. Plus, he’s a noble and a lord of his territory, so calling him out of the blue might make it tough for him to adjust his schedule. Well, if Kaito-senpai calls him, he’d probably prioritize coming here over anything else but......]","[Hmm, it certainly might end up being a hassle for him...... Since we’re just planning a small celebration, maybe it’s best if it’s just the two of us this time.]","[Right. If we invite Seigi, or if we ask someone like Lilia-san or Luna-san to join, it’ll probably turn into something bigger than we intended. Kaito-senpai, let’s just celebrate her birthday ourselves!]","Since we had already decided on a modest celebration, and as Hina-chan pointed out, inviting more people would quickly turn it into a larger gathering, so we chose to keep it just the two of us.","[Alright, should we head out now to buy a cake and do it tonight?]","[Agreed! Let’s go get a delicious cake!!]","[Aoi-chan is coming back in the evening, right?]","[She said around 5 PM.]","[Then we don’t have that much time to spare. Let’s head out right away.]","[Got it!]","Smiling at Hina-chan as she enthusiastically saluted in response to my words, I quickly got ready to go out. Then, together with Hina-chan, I headed into town to buy the cake and other things we needed.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Meanwhile, here's Kaito, having completely forgotten about his own birthday......]"]},{"number":2181,"title":"Chapter 2181: A Small Celebration 2","paragraphs":["We went out to buy a cake for Aoi-chan’s birthday celebration, quickly getting ready separately before meeting at the entrance.","[Sorry for the wait, Kaito-senpai.]","[No, I wasn’t waiting long at all...... By the way, I don’t think I’ve seen that hoodie before.]","[Ehehe, I bought it recently...... What do you think?]","[Unn. The slightly oversized, baggy look is nice, and the hoodie’s design really suits you, Hina-chan. It’s cute. Just changing your outerwear gives off a surprisingly fresh vibe.]","Hina-chan’s outfit was, as usual, something that looked easy to move around in. However, today she was wearing an oversized hoodie, with the loose sleeves giving off an undeniably cute impression.","In the first place, Hina-chan, being as energetic as she is, looks great in casual clothing like hoodies. It felt new but also gave off an incredibly adorable atmosphere.","[I saw it in a clothing store before and thought \"A hoodie like this feels very Kaito-senpai-ish!\" So I bought it on impulse. I’m glad it suits me.]","[Yeah, I do wear hoodies with hoods a lot. I never had a particular preference, but after wearing them for so long, I feel a bit off when I wear something without one.]","[Ahaha, I get you. When you have clothes you’re used to wearing, other clothes can feel weird. Like, I feel pretty out of place when I wear skirts......]","Hina-chan usually wears half-pants...... or are they called capri pants? She often wears knee-length trousers, and now that I think about it, I’ve only ever seen her in a skirt at formal events, like Seigi-kun’s wedding.","[But the way you pull off an oversized hoodie like this gives off a stylish vibe.]","Since Hina-chan is petite, wearing oversized clothes makes her look even more like a small, adorable animal. When I pointed that out, she gave me a somewhat wry smile.","[Ah, well, this time, I intentionally bought an oversized one...... or rather, a men’s hoodie. But to be honest, I tend to buy slightly bigger clothes anyway.]","[Really?]","[Yeah. How should I put it......? If I wear my exact size, it feels tight around my chest. So I usually go for something a bit larger.]","[I see.]","Despite her small frame, Hina-chan is quite well-endowed. She has that \"transistor glamour\" kind of look. If she chooses clothes based on her height, I guess the chest area might feel constricting.","(T/N: a slang that refers to a petite woman with a sexy body)","Still, even though I had no ulterior motives, when the topic came up, I found myself struggling to keep my gaze from wandering toward her chest. I had to consciously make sure I didn’t lower my eyes.","The last thing I wanted was for my affectionate kouhai to look at me with disgust, so I exercised the strongest self-control possible.","Just as I was thinking that I had successfully nodded along without letting my gaze drop, Hina-chan puffed up her cheeks in dissatisfaction.","[......Muu, Kaito-senpai. Would it really hurt to at least glance at my chest a little?]","[Ehhh...... Isn’t it better if I don’t look randomly......?]","[I mean, yeah, I wouldn’t like it if someone just stared at my chest for no reason but...... how should I put it...... When I'm bringing them up like this on purpose, I kind of want to feel like you’re at least a little aware of them. It’s a complicated maiden’s heart, you know? Well, that said, if you suddenly went \"Okay, I’ll look at them now\", that’d be weird too.]","[......T- This is hard.]","Apparently, from Hina-chan’s perspective, her earlier comment about tight-fitting clothes was meant to make me more conscious of her. So the fact that I wasn’t reacting at all made her feel a bit dissatisfied. The heart of a maiden is truly a complex thing.","That said, Hina-chan wasn’t actually upset, her tone was playful, like she was joking around. It felt like she was simply enjoying the back-and-forth banter.","[That's right! A maiden's heart is complicated. Kaito-senpai, you get two points deducted. Your outing score is now 118 points.]","[......Wait, isn't that over 100?]","[I gave you a starting score of 120 because you noticed my outfit and complimented me. If you compliment me again, it'll go back up to 120.]","It seemed like the grading system was pretty lenient. Seeing Hina-chan laughing happily, I couldn't help but smile as well. After some lighthearted chatting, we set off, leaving the house and walking side by side down the street.","[......But you know, when it comes to being petite with a large chest, Fate-sama is probably the one who comes to mind more than me, right?]","[Ah~~ yeah, Fate-san is more petite than Hina-chan.]","[I feel like our appeal points overlap, and since she's a Goddess, there's no way I can compete......]","[Appeal points......?]","[Personally, it's kind of a hassle when I run, but guys do tend to like big breasts, don't they?]","[......H- Hmmm, that's a really tough question to answer...... A- Anyway! Let's change the subject! Errr, what kind of cake should we get?]","[Aoi-senpai likes rare cheesecake but...... it doesn’t really feel birthday-like, does it?]","Extending the topic of breasts any further seemed like a surefire way to say something I’d regret, and it was just plain awkward, so I forcefully steered the conversation elsewhere. Hina-chan didn't press the matter and simply moved on to the new topic, flashing a bright and friendly smile.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Hina...... rather than acting spoiled on Kaito, it's more like she has this little sister vibe to her...... In that sense, isn’t she actually in a pretty unique position compared to the others?]"]},{"number":2182,"title":"Chapter 2182: A Small Celebration 3","paragraphs":["As I walk down the road with Hina-chan, I ask her about cakes. If either of us were good at cooking, we could have made one ourselves, but unfortunately, neither of us has the skills to bake a cake.","Well, since we’re planning to celebrate tonight, making a cake ourselves wouldn’t have been an option anyway. Not that we have to do it today, and it’s not even Aoi-chan’s birthday or anything, but we’ve already settled on doing it today, so rescheduling feels out of the question now.","[If it’s just the three of us, a whole cake would be too big, right? It’d be better to buy a few different slices and let Aoi-chan pick what she wants. Anything leftover can go into the magic box and be eaten later, so we can just get whatever catches our eye.]","[That sounds great! Also, magic boxes are so convenient, aren’t they? Being able to store things without them spoiling is a lifesaver in situations like this.]","[Yeah...... but since we can store them, sometimes we end up buying too much, and then it takes forever to finish everything.]","[That does happen. Especially in Kaito-senpai’s case, since, well, you’ve got plenty of money......]","Honestly, I’ve done that before, just throwing a bunch of stuff into the magic box and forgetting about it. I still have a lot of uneaten sweets stored away.","Sometimes, they come in handy unexpectedly, but if it were a lower-quality magic box, it probably would’ve gotten stuffed full by now. Luckily, the one I have was made by Kuro, so it has an absurd amount of storage space and I've got no issues with it but......","[I wonder where’s the best cake shop around here?]","[......That guidebook from Kuromu-sama is amazing, isn’t it? It has details on every single restaurant in the Royal Capital, and the explanations are so easy to understand. I’d love to have one too~~]","[I’m sure Kuro would give you one if you ask. She just writes it for fun, not to sell, so she gives copies to family and friends. I can ask her for you next time.]","[Thank you so much!]","This food guide really is useful, I use it all the time...... Even just as a read, it’s pretty entertaining. If it were published as a book, I bet it would sell like crazy, but Kuro doesn’t seem interested in that.","Since Kuro runs multiple business companies, she’s naturally involved in various product developments, but food touring is just a personal hobby for her. That’s why she keeps it separate from her business ventures, so I doubt she’ll ever sell the guide publicly.","[Ah, how about this place? Looks like they have a lot of fruit cakes. Aoi-senpai likes fruit, and the atmosphere seems nice...... Arehh? Did this food guide always have pictures?]","[Ahhh, Kuro updates it regularly, so the latest version now includes photos of the shop exteriors. She mentioned wanting to add food pictures too, but she’s still figuring that out since it would make the book too thick......]","Since Kuro frequently visits, my copy of the food guide is always up to date.","Closed shops are removed, and new ones are added. Incidentally, this latest edition includes Nifty’s shop, which Kuro gave a perfect 10-star rating. The store description? Completely filled with her thoughts on baby castellas.","[The place is pretty close, so it seems like a good choice. Well, it looks like a popular shop, so if everything good is already sold out, we can check out another place......]","[Right...... Ah!? Kaito-senpai, look! The page next to it! It says their parfaits are recommended!!!]","[It does say that...... But we're just buying cake and looking for a small gift, so we have plenty of time. Are you really going to eat a parfait now when we’ll be having cake later tonight?]","[Parfaits go into a separate stomach! ......I wish calories did too...... Ah, by the way, Kaito-senpai, I heard that your Blessing has an amazing effect that all girls...... or rather , I would be envious of...... Is that true?]","[Eh? A- Ahh, that...... Yeah, apparently Life-san’s Blessing prevents weight gain, so Shiro-san’s Blessing has a similar effect.]","To be precise, Life-san’s Blessing allows a person to attain and naturally maintain their ideal body. During the Six Kings Festival, many people who received the Provisional Blessing ended up looking younger because their bodies transformed into the ideal age they envisioned.","Unlike the Provisional Blessing, the True Blessing is always in effect, meaning the body is constantly in its optimal state. Since Shiro-san’s Blessing is an upper-tier version of all Divine Blessings, it grants the same effect, ensuring that no matter how many calories I consume, I won’t gain weight or become ill.","[That means you can eat parfaits endlessly...... I’m so envious......]","[The fact that you’re judging this based on parfaits is very much like you, Hina-chan...... Well, if you want to go, we can stop by that shop and have parfaits after buying the cake.]","[Yes!!!]","Hina-chan nodded happily with a bright smile, looking so adorable that, even though I'm an only child, I found myself wondering if having a little sister would feel like this.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Shiro's Blessing alone is already a massive cheat, but this guy has a ton of other Blessings on top of that......]","? ? ? : [When you put it that way, it's like Kaito-san is basically a cheat himself. Especially in terms of defense, he's practically an impenetrable fortress in every sense......]"]},{"number":2183,"title":"Chapter 2183: A Small Celebration 4","paragraphs":["At the cake shop where I came with Hina-chan, both of us stood in front of the display case, wearing troubled expressions.","Fortunately, the situation I had worried about, where there wouldn’t be many cakes left, wasn’t the case. While some cakes were sold out, there was still a good variety and quantity available, making it easy to choose from.","So then, why were Hina-chan and I struggling to decide......?","[......The whole cakes definitely have that special look to them.]","[Right? They’re stylish and cute, and the candles and message plate would definitely look better on a whole cake.]","That’s right. Originally, we had planned to go with an assortment of cut cakes. But now that we were at the cake shop, we saw that they also had whole cakes. One of them, decorated with plenty of fruit, had a stylish appearance that seemed just like something Aoi-chan would love. We started to think that maybe this would be the better choice.","A whole cake would definitely stand out more as a birthday cake, but an assortment of cut cakes would be more convenient. Since it was going to be just the three of us, Hina-chan, Aoi-chan, and me, having the option to pick different flavors might be nice.","But then again, the special feeling that comes with a whole cake...... The way it embodies the spirit of a birthday celebration was a big advantage. If we added a message plate and candles, it would feel even more like a proper birthday cake.","[......It’s different from what we originally planned, but I think a whole cake might be the better choice.]","[I agree. This big, grand presence gives it a special feel. Excuse me! Can we get a message plate for celebrations added to this?]","[If it’s just the plate, we can do that as a complimentary service. If you’d like a message written directly on the cake in chocolate or additional sugar decorations, there will be an extra charge.]","The store clerk responded to Hina-chan’s question with a smile while showing us some samples of the sugar decorations.","[......Hina-chan, doesn’t this one kind of look like a Golem?]","[Ah, I thought the same thing. It’s cute in a chibi style, and since Aoi-senpai is all about Golems, let’s add this one!]","We added the Golem-like sugar decoration, got a chocolate message plate that said \"Happy Birthday\", purchased the whole cake, stored it in my magic box, and left the store.","[With this, the cake is all set. We’ve got plenty of time left, so before we go buy the present, how about stopping by that café you were curious about, Hina-chan?]","[Yes! Let’s go!!]","I had already promised to go shopping for a present with Aoi-chan but...... there wasn’t a rule saying I could only give her one gift. So I planned to prepare something separately as well.","Something small and not too bulky would be ideal. After visiting the café, I figured we could check out a general store or something.","As I watched Hina-chan’s eyes sparkle, probably thinking about parfaits, I found it adorable and headed toward the café we found in the food guide.","Since the café was already close to the cake shop, we arrived quickly. However...... an unexpected situation arose once again.","As I watched Hina-chan excitedly looking at the menu, I was thinking of just getting a coffee when———–","[K- Kaito-senpai! Look at this!!]","[Unn? What is it......? \"Couples-Only Deluxe Parfait\"? Eh? You want to eat this?]","[Yes. Because you can’t order it alone! This is definitely something I want to take the chance to try. It's just, since it’s a parfait meant for couples...... it’s probably pretty big, right? So, I was hoping you could help me eat it......]","[It does seem big, but considering it’s a couple’s menu item, meant for dates and such, I doubt the size is anything too crazy...... Well, if that’s what you want, Hina-chan, let’s share it.]","[Yes! Ehehe, that means while we’re here, I’m Kaito-senpai's girlfriend.]","Beaming with a bright, cheerful smile, Hina-chan looked like she was having a great time. She might not even be aware of it, but when a cute girl suddenly says something like that, it’s enough to make any guy’s heart skip a beat.","Well, Hina-chan may seem sociable, but she actually has a bit of a shy side. She probably wouldn’t say something like this to someone she wasn’t close with. The fact that she lets her guard down around me like this, I suppose it means she trusts me that much.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Rather than just trusting him, I think it’s pretty clear that she has romantic feelings for him...... The real question is how aware Hina actually is of those feelings. It’s not like she’s completely oblivious, but compared to Aoi, for example, her approach feels less like romantic affection and more like fawning on a kind senpai. I’d say her self-awareness is still pretty low.]","? ? ? : [That’s a pretty sharp analysis...... Like you’ve been studying this a lot...... as if you're a love expert.]","Serious-senpai : [......When something has the potential to threaten your own well-being, you can’t help but learn about it in detail......]"]},{"number":2184,"title":"Chapter 2184: A Small Celebration 5","paragraphs":["The parfait that was brought out after we ordered was, as expected, on the smaller side. If anything, I feel like the parfait Hina-chan had when the three of us, Aoi-chan, Hina-chan, and I, went out together before was even bigger.","[Ohh, so this is the couples-only parfait...... What exactly makes it a couples' parfait?]","[It looks like a strawberry chocolate parfait, but I guess it’s because there are heart-shaped chocolates in key spots, and the strawberries are cut to resemble hearts.]","[I see! But it looks really delicious...... W- Would it be okay if I took the first bite?]","[Unn. Actually, if you can finish it, you can eat the whole thing yourself, Hina-chan.]","[......N- No, that won’t do. Since this is a couples-only parfait, we should eat it together...... I’ll, errr...... take half...... No, maybe two-thirds......]","It seemed like she was torn between wanting to eat the whole thing herself and wanting to share it with me, but after some internal struggle, Hina-chan chose to eat it together.","Well, I really only needed a bite or two, so I decided to just take a small amount at the right moment and let Hina-chan eat as much as she wanted first.","[Mmm~~ It’s delicious! Parfaits really do taste like happiness!]","[Ahaha, you really look like you’re enjoying it.]","Seeing Hina-chan take a bite and smile happily was adorable. Just watching her eat so cheerfully made me smile as well.","[By the way, after this, we’re planning to buy a present for Aoi-chan, right? I was thinking a general store with small accessories might be a good place. Do you have any other ideas, Hina-chan?]","[Hmmm, I think that’s a good idea too...... but I just thought of something, I’d like to visit Alice-sama’s miscellaneous goods store.]","[Alice’s shop? Arehh? Haven’t you been there before? There’s a door that leads straight to it from the back of Iris-san’s bar......]","[Yes. I’ve been to the weapon shop, but not her miscellaneous goods store. I went to Iris-san’s bar with Aoi-senpai once and had juice and some snacks, but it seems that door in the back doesn’t let Aoi-senpai or me through, so I’ve never been inside.]","[......Ahh, so that door actually has restrictions huh......]","[Yes. Rather than being unable to go through, it feels like passing through that door just leads straight outside from the bar’s entrance. According to Iris-san, it only connects to the miscellaneous goods store when Kaito-senpai is around......]","[I see......]","Since I could pass through it normally and had also taken Amel-san there before without any issues, I had assumed anyone could go through.","But from what Hina-chan just said, it seems like when I’m not there, the door functions as an exit, and only when I’m present does it connect directly to the general store. Well, knowing how cautious Alice is, that explanation makes perfect sense.","[Alright, then, let’s go check out Alice’s miscellaneous goods store. She does make some joke items just for fun, but a lot of her stuff is high quality too......]","[Yes! I’m looking forward to it.]","Alice’s craftsmanship is top-tier, so her shop has plenty of amazing products. That said, it does seem like she runs the store purely as a hobby, so there are also some bizarre items made on a whim and an oddly strong push for her mysterious mascot.","Still, I buy most of my accessories from Alice’s store...... No, even my clothes and shoes, too...... Honestly, most of my daily necessities probably come from her. Well, in any case, there’s no doubt that she has a lot of great items, so it should be a good place to find a birthday present.","After leaving the café, we arrived at Alice’s miscellaneous goods store as per Hina-chan’s request...... but as soon as we stepped inside, a certain sign caught my eye.","[......Alice, you...... couldn't you at least be a bit......]","[That section is a great deal right now.]","[......A “great deal” or not, you literally set this up just now while we were on our way here, didn’t you......?]","Right in front of Hina-chan and me was a shelf labeled \"Perfect Small Items for Birthday Presents\", displaying a variety of products.","She must have seen a sales opportunity and put it together. It was the same when I brought Amel-san here...... Well, that’s fine...... But the real issue was how the shelf was divided into sections labeled \"Recommended for Kaito-san\" and \"Recommended for Hina-san\".","[......Why did you go out of your way to separate recommendations for me and Hina-chan? And why is there such a huge price difference between the items in my section and Hina-chan’s......?]","[......Tehee~~]","......This girl. She’s blatantly trying to sell Hina-chan inexpensive, casual items while attempting to push expensive stuff onto me without even trying to hide it. Her shamelessness is almost admirable.","W- Well, I guess it’s fine since the quality is at least guaranteed......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Arehh? Iris can’t get through that door herself?]","? ? ? : [Back when I first built the house, I had Iris practice Teleportation Magic by having her teleport over, so she still uses teleportation to come here...... Well, not that it matters much, since Iris is pretty indifferent and rarely comes to the miscellaneous goods store anyway......]","Serious-senpai : [......Hey, what do you do when Kaito’s asleep?]","? ? ? : [I’m usually at Iris’ bar.]","Serious-senpai : [......Wait, doesn't that mean she doesn’t need to come to the store because she basically sees you almost every day anyway......?]"]},{"number":2185,"title":"Chapter 2185: A Small Celebration 6","paragraphs":["The shelves undoubtedly prepared with clear intent by Alice...... The section meant for Hina-chan is easy to understand. There are many items with adorable designs, practical-looking pens, and other things whose purposes are obvious at a glance.","However, when it comes to my section, many of the items are difficult to identify just by looking at them. For example, a gauntlet...... No, I understand what a gauntlet is used for, but what meaning does it have as a birthday present? Even if it’s meant for use in an Adventurer’s line of work, wouldn’t it be more suited for Hina-chan, who fights unarmed, rather than Aoi-chan?","[......Alice, what is this gauntlet used for?]","[Ahh, that’s a magical tool. It has an effect similar to a magic box, but with this gauntlet, you can store up to four pre-constructed Golems inside. It’s an excellent item that lets you summon Golems instantly in battle without having to deploy complicated magic circles.]","[Whoa...... Wait, huh? Alice-sama, isn’t that something a normal magic box can do?]","After listening to Alice’s explanation, I could see why it was chosen as a gift for Aoi-chan, it’s certainly useful. However, at the same time, I had the same question as Hina-chan just now.","Magic boxes can store anything that isn’t a living being, so in theory, there shouldn’t be anything stopping them from holding Golems. But since I’ve never seen Aoi-chan use one like that...... does that mean it’s actually impossible?","[It’s not as simple as that. Golem Magic fundamentally works by maintaining a magical link between the caster and the summoned Golem. If that link is severed, the Golem collapses. Depending on the skill of the caster, if the Golem moves too far away, the link can break. Well, I say \"fundamentally\" because there are ways to get around this, such as embedding a special magic core inside the Golem to sustain it, but that’s an advanced technique that Aoi-san isn’t capable of yet.]","[So, putting it inside a magic box would cut that magic link?]","[Exactly. The inside of a magic box functions like a separate dimension, so as soon as you store a Golem in it, the link is severed. The magic box’s preservation ability will keep it intact for a while, but the moment you take it out, it will collapse immediately. In theory, if you can re-establish the link in the short time between removing it and collapse, it would work, but doing that requires magic control on the level of someone like Isis-san...... In short, you can basically consider it impossible.]","Summoning a powerful Golem requires complex magic circles, which naturally take time. Since Aoi-chan is a rearguard fighter, she likely relies on Hina-chan to protect her while creating Golems, but even then, she probably has to make some compromises.","In contrast, with this gauntlet, she could take all the time and magic she needs beforehand to craft strong Golems, then summon them instantly during battle. That could be considered revolutionary.","From the way Alice is talking, it sounds like someone with exceptional magical skill could achieve the same result without the gauntlet. But considering that the example she gave was Isis-san, one of the strongest magic users in the world, the difficulty level is clearly off the charts.","[......Eh? Then isn’t this an incredibly good item?]","[Right? Aoi-senpai would definitely want this.]","[Well, originally, I made this thinking I’d sell it in Kaito-san’s underground weapon shop. But as I just explained, storing and deploying Golems requires extremely advanced magic. This magic tool itself also uses a ton of special techniques and spares no expense in rare materials...... To be honest, if Aoi-san or Hina-san tried to earn enough from their Adventurer work to buy it, who knows how many years it would take them.]","Hearing that, I checked the price tag, and it read \"100 white gold coins\"———— a staggering 10 billion yen in Japanese currency.","The items sold in this shop were priced quite reasonably since Alice personally gathered the materials, but even with that taken into account, this price meant that if this were sold anywhere else, the cost would likely be several times higher.","But...... well, I can easily afford it...... Honestly, Nifty and everything else are doing so well that my money grows faster than I can spend it, and I’m at the point where I don’t even know what to do with it all.","Alice was probably aware of that and intentionally placed this in my section.","[......Alright, I’ll buy this.]","[Thanks for your patronage~~]","[......U- Umm, I always thought Kaito-senpai was rich, but just how much money do you actually have......?]","[H- Hmmm, I leave most of it to Anima to manage, but even then, I still have about 3,000 white gold coins in my magic box.]","[T- Three thousand......]","Hina-chan was beyond shocked, she was completely speechless. To be fair, even I was struggling to use all the money I had. In the first place, Anima was already incredibly skilled at managing funds, and my wealth was only increasing. And now, with Canalis-san, who could outright ignore the concept of costs, joining in, the rate at which my money grew had skyrocketed even further.","......Well, for now, let’s just be glad I managed to buy a great present.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Equipment costs...... just create them. Labor costs...... just create them. Material costs and everything else...... just create them...... Canalis is way too much of a cheat for business development.]","? ? ? : [Rather than a cheat, it's like that because she's a literal God.]"]},{"number":2186,"title":"Chapter 2186: A Small Celebration 7","paragraphs":["I bought a present at Alice’s general store, and now that the preparations for Aoi-chan’s birthday celebration are complete, I head back home. The plan is to hold the celebration after dinner in my room.","And so, as a preliminary check, Hina-chan came straight to my room upon our return home.","[Should we do some decorations...... guess not huh?]","[If we go that far, it might be a bit too much. I did buy some candles, so I think that should be enough.]","[That’s true. We decided to keep it simple with just a cake and a present, so that should be plenty.]","[Well, I can adjust the room’s lighting quite a bit though......]","Since we’ve decided to keep this a simple celebration, we won’t be doing any decorations. However, it seems like my room’s lighting can be adjusted in various ways, so I might be able to create a nice atmosphere.","To test it out, I knocked on the wall in a specific rhythm, causing a section of the wall to slide open, revealing the magic tool that controls the lighting.","[......Kaito-senpai? Why did your wall just slide open to reveal some weird device? Is this actually some sort of secret base?]","[I mean, I’d also like to know exactly how many hidden functions this room has, but whenever I ask Alice, she just brushes me off...... This is one of the few she actually told me about. It’s my room, yet there are so many things I don’t even know about it.]","[I- I see......?]","Hina-chan looks bewildered, but to be honest, I don’t know much about the hidden functions of my room either. At the very least, it seems like there’s a feature that connects to some kind of hidden space. Even though it’s my own room, it’s full of mysteries.","Alice did tell me about some features, like sliding the wall to reveal storage shelves and certain magic tools. Some of them can be activated by knocking in a specific rhythm or repeatedly turning my magic power on and off while touching the wall.","[Well, knowing Alice, I don’t think she would install anything I’d truly dislike...... You wouldn't, right?]","[Look into these ultra-beautiful eyes of Alice-chan. They’re so pure and clear, right? There’s no way I’d ever think of something devious......]","[......It’s fine for now, but if I ever get the sense that you added some weird prank features...... I’ll have Canalis-san clear everything out.]","[......Isn’t siccing a literal god kinda cheating......?]","Well, I do trust Alice, so I don’t think she’d install anything I’d really dislike. That being said, I can definitely see her pulling pranks or messing around, so I made sure to warn her.","If I actually asked Canalis-san, she’d probably be able to completely uncover all the room’s functions.","(......I could do that too, you know? You do know I could also do that, right?)","......Alright, if it ever comes to that, I’ll ask Shiro-san.","I could feel this distinct, no, an obvious sense of dissatisfaction from her...... exactly like when I turned to Eden-san for help with Dr. Vier, so I made sure to let Shiro-san know that if the time ever comes, I’ll ask her.","Anyway, we got a little sidetracked, but for now, the simple planning is done.","[......There’s still some time before dinner. What should we do?]","[Ah! In that case, I’d like to play a game with you, Kaito-senpai!]","[A game?]","[Yes! You played with Aoi-senpai before, right? But it’s not fair if only Aoi-senpai gets to play. I want to play games with you too, Kaito-senpai!]","[Fumu......]","Playing a game itself wasn’t a problem. Setting it up would be quick, and playing with Hina-chan sounded fun. The real issue was deciding which game to play.","First and foremost, online games weren’t really Hina-chan’s thing. Rather, she seemed to view games as a casual activity, something to enjoy with family and friends in a lively atmosphere. So, it was safe to assume that she wanted to play a party game together.","[......Then, how about we play a classic board game, like a sugoroku-style one?]","[That sounds great! But, I feel like Kaito-senpai would be ridiculously strong at those kinds of games.]","[Well, I made sure that Shiro-san’s Blessing doesn’t affect this kind of game, and it’s not really about winning or losing, so let’s just have fun.]","[Okay!]","And so, until dinner, Hina-chan and I played a game that was a staple in our original world, a board game set across all of Japan, where players compete to amass the greatest wealth.","Partway through, Aoi-chan returned home and joined in, making it a lively game for the three of us...... In the end, though, I won by a landslide.","T/N: Sugoroku-style games are like, any board game where you advance spaces based on rolling dice. Think Game of Life, Snakes and Ladders, Monopoly, etc.","<Afterword>","Bugged Luck Stat : [No worries! I can read the mood, so I’ll make sure it’s a close competition while still ensuring Master wins by a landslide in the end!]"]},{"number":2187,"title":"Chapter 2187: A Small Celebration 8","paragraphs":["I played games with Aoi-chan and Hina-chan, then after dinner, I called Aoi-chan to my room again. Fortunately, since we had been playing games together just a while ago, it felt natural to invite her by saying \"Since we're here, let's play another game together as the three of us.\"","Since Aoi-chan is sharp, I was worried she might catch on to the surprise. But more than that, the game we played earlier had been a pretty close match for a while, but I ended up winning by a landslide. That must have triggered her competitive side, because she was all fired up, saying \"I won't lose next time!\", so she didn't seem to suspect anything.","[What should we play next? If it's a sugoroku game, Kaito-san is really strong, so maybe something with action elements......]","[Aoi-chan, that sounds good but...... before that, there's something I want you to see.]","[Eh? Something you want me to see?]","[Yes! And that is...... this!!!]","[ ! ? ]","At the exact moment I called out to Aoi-chan and she turned toward me, Hina-chan swiftly pulled a cake out of her magic box and placed it on the table.","Using the magic box to its fullest potential, we had pre-lit the candles and stored it, so the moment it was taken out, it was already perfectly prepared.","Aoi-chan was clearly caught off guard, her expression showed pure surprise. Taking advantage of that moment, I adjusted the lighting and dimmed the room.","[It's a little early, but consider this a small celebration from me and Hina-chan...... Happy birthday, Aoi-chan.]","[I heard you're planning to still be considered 17 this year, but for now, happy birthday, Aoi-senpai!]","[......Ah, eh? T- Thank you...... Y- You went out of your way to prepare a cake for me......?]","Aoi-chan seemed a bit overwhelmed, as if her thoughts couldn't keep up, but I could see a faint shimmer of tears in her eyes, and the emotions I felt through Sympathy Magic suggested she was deeply moved.","[To put things simply, Hina-chan and I wanted to do something to celebrate, so we put this together.]","[Yeah! Well, Aoi-senpai...... for now, go ahead and blow out the candles.]","[Ah, u- unn.]","Encouraged by Hina-chan, Aoi-chan blew out the candles. As soon as they went out, I turned the lights back on, and Hina-chan and I clapped together.","Aoi-chan, finally catching up with her emotions, let out a smile filled with a mix of happiness and slight embarrassment.","[Alright, Aoi-chan, take a seat so we can cut and eat the cake.]","[Ah, yes...... Kaito-san, thank you. Really, this makes me so happy. This is the first time I've ever had my birthday celebrated like this...... My heart feels so full.]","[Eh? Really!? Aoi-senpai, not even back home......?]","[They did throw something like a party, but it was just in name only———- It's more like a formal event marking my birth anniversary. In reality, it was full of political dealings and ulterior motives. Everyone was either blatantly flattering me or had obvious ulterior motives...... This is the first time I've ever been able to just feel purely happy.]","Aoi-chan spoke with open disdain toward her family, making it clear that she truly despised her home.","Well, considering she’s planning to cut ties with them the moment she becomes an adult with Makina-san’s help, it’s not surprising...... I can only imagine how terrible her environment must have been.","That’s exactly why, on a day like this, I want her to forget those painful memories and just enjoy herself.","As I thought that, I cut the cake and placed it in front of Aoi-chan, along with a chocolate plate that had \"Happy Birthday\" written on it. Her eyes sparkled with delight.","[Cakes like this, the kind that just scream \"birthday cake\", are so fun to look at. It almost feels like a waste to eat it.]","[Ahaha, hearing that makes all the effort worth it. But don’t hold back, there’ll be another celebration next year, and the year after that, so there’s no need to hesitate. Eat as much as you like. If there’s any left over, we can just store it in the magic box......]","[Okay!]","Seeing Aoi-chan nod with a beaming smile, both Hina-chan and I couldn’t help but smile as well. After all, while we had planned this as a surprise, we never expected her to be this happy.","[I’m glad Aoi-senpai is enjoying herself so much, but at the same time, it makes me wonder just how many gray, joyless birthdays she’s had until now. My family always made sure to celebrate mine, at least......]","[......I hate that house.]","[That was a serious tone...... W- Well, let’s not think about that and just have fun! After the cake, Kaito-senpai and I have presents for you too!]","[Really? I can’t wait...... Hina-chan too, thank you for everything.]","This turned out even better than expected. Now, I'm looking forward to giving her our birthday presents.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Hina’s family, well, she says they’re strict, but they seem to have a good relationship...... They’re probably just careful not to spoil her too much while still showing real love and care. Aoi’s family, on the other hand...... they seriously give off the vibe that they see her as nothing more than a component———– just the \"daughter of the head\", nothing else.]"]},{"number":2188,"title":"Chapter 2188: A Small Celebration 9","paragraphs":["After finishing the cake, it was finally time for presents. Well, Aoi-chan seriously was even happier than I had expected, and from the way she looked, she was eagerly anticipating her birthday present.","[Alright, since we've finished the cake, it's time for the birthday presents...... I’ve already promised to go shopping with you later, but I also prepared a separate present for today so———-]","[Hold it right there!!! Please wait! Kaito-senpai!!!]","[Unn? Hina-chan?]","Just as I was about to hand Aoi-chan her present, Hina-chan suddenly interrupted. Not understanding her intentions, Aoi-chan and I tilted our heads in confusion......","[If you give her your present first, mine is going to look ridiculously lame in comparison......! I should go first! Kaito-senpai’s super high-end gift can come later!]","[......Eh? Super high-end gift?]","[......Aoi-senpai, Kaito-senpai’s present is ridiculously expensive. Anyway, let me give mine first.]","[U- Unn. Now I’m starting to feel nervous all of a sudden......]","Well, to be fair, my present is indeed an ultra-luxurious gift, one that cost 100 white gold coins. But honestly, for me, money accumulates far faster than I can spend it, so I'm actually grateful that Alice regularly encourages me to make big purchases like this.","I don’t have any particularly expensive hobbies, nor do I have a taste for luxury, so without Alice’s shop, I’d hardly ever get the chance to spend money on the level of white gold coins.","[I got you a small storage box! It has a really cute design, and it's just the right size for pens and other small items, so I thought it might be useful to keep on your desk.]","[Thank you. The design really is adorable. I don’t usually buy items with this kind of aesthetic for myself, so it feels fresh, and I’m looking forward to using it on my desk.]","[Ehehe, as long as you like it, that’s all that matters...... Now then, are you ready? Next up is Kaito-senpai's turn!]","[......Well, I didn’t really have time to mentally prepare for this, but I guess I'm feeling a mix of excitement and anxiety......]","With the order of presents settled, since it was just between Hina-chan and me, it was only a matter of going first or second, my turn came up right away. I reached into my magic box and pulled out a pair of gauntlets...... and Aoi-chan looked as if she'd just been hit by a bolt from the blue.","Well, that’s understandable. Hina-chan had just given her a cute, girly storage box, and right after that, I presented her with gauntlets, her brain probably couldn’t keep up.","[......Eh? Um, these are...... gauntlets, right? Ah, no, I do appreciate something practical, but wouldn’t these be more suited for Hina-chan?]","[It’s natural for you to think that, but these were bought from Alice’s miscellaneous goods store, and they’re actually made just for you, Aoi-chan. Well, let me explain their functions in detail.]","Since Aoi-chan is a full-fledged rear guard, it made sense for her to assume that gauntlets would be more suited for Hina-chan, who fights with her fists. I had thought the same thing at first, but once I learned about their functions, it was clear they were a perfect match for Aoi-chan.","Thinking how this had turned into a rather odd situation, I started explaining the gauntlets’ features...... and as I spoke, Aoi-chan’s expression visibly transformed, her eyes sparkling with excitement.","[T- That means, by using this gauntlet, I can carry around high-performance Golems that I made in advance, right?! T- That's amazing!! I've been studying from books written by Kuromu-sama and have gotten to the point where I can use fairly advanced Golem Magic, but creating high-performance Golems takes a lot of time, so I’ve been using simple ones that are practical for combat. I- Is there a size limit? Can it store large Golems? What about swarm-type Golems that combine into one entity? Once deployed, can they be stored again?]","[Wait, Aoi-chan, calm down......]","[Ah, s- sorry...... I just got too excited......]","Aoi-chan, who had initially looked dumbfounded, was now unable to hide her excitement, making me chuckle.","[Errr, I have a manual from Alice that explains everything, so you can check it for answers to your questions. Anyway, happy birthday.]","[Thank you very much! I'm really happy!!! I can't believe such an amazing magic tool exists, this must be really expensive...... expensive...... expen...... Hina-chan? You said earlier that Kaito-san's gift was super high-end, right? How much...... does this cost?]","[100 white gold coins.]","[One hun...... Ehhhhh?! One hundred!? W- W- Wait, Kaito-san!? That’s way too much for a birthday gift......]","[No, it's really fine. In fact, I have more money than I know what to do with, so I’m glad I had a chance to spend it. Besides, Alice originally made this for you but figured it would be difficult for you to afford, so she kept it. This was the perfect opportunity for it to get into your hands. So, don’t hesitate, just accept it......]","Hearing my words, Aoi-chan looked apologetic but also happy...... She tightly hugged the gauntlet against her chest, as if it were a treasure, and nodded.","[Uuu, o- okay. I’ll definitely repay you...... When your birthday comes, Kaito-san, I’ll make sure to give you something you’ll love......]","[......Arehh? Kaito-senpai’s birthday...... Isn't it coming up soon?]","[........................Oh, now that you mention it......]","I had completely forgotten, but my birthday is on July 2nd, only about 10 days after Aoi-chan’s.","Well, technically, her birthday is still a little ahead, so mine is about half a month away, but yeah, it’s coming up soon.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [So he finally remembered his own birthday...... But thanks to the tricks that Shiro and Makina pulled, he probably hasn't realized the possibility of a large-scale birthday party being planned huh? One thing's for sure though, at this point, Aoi and Hina haven’t been informed about the party yet, right?]","Makina : [Nope, I've already notified everyone connected to my beloved child. But not just with those two, I've made it so that \"none of them will remember it when they're around my beloved child\". It's an application of the technique I used before to prevent my beloved child from recalling our conversations in dreams. So, actually, Aoi and Hina have already bought birthday presents and stored them in their magic box. Once they leave my beloved child's room for a while, they'll remember.]","Serious-senpai : [You guys sure have gone to extreme lengths to make sure the surprise doesn’t get spoiled......]"]},{"number":2189,"title":"Chapter 2189: Intermission: The Berserker Driven Mad by Jealousy","paragraphs":["Floating in a certain empty space, arms crossed in contemplation was a World Creator, known as the Virtual God, Electrone. At this moment, she was pondering what to give Kaito as a birthday present, having successfully earned the right to do so.","Naturally, she had heard various restrictions regarding the present from figures like Shallow Vernal, Makina, and Canalis. Within those limitations, she was trying to come up with a gift that would leave an impression on Kaito and make him happy.","Just then, Canalis suddenly appeared before Electrone.","[Hey there, Electrone, do you have a moment?]","『I don’t mind. However, if you are here to rush me about the preparations, an immediate response will be difficult...... Outputting status...... <If you're here to ask about Kaito-sama's present, I'm still thinking about it, so please wait~~>...... End of output.』","[Ah, no, it's not about rushing the present...... Well, I guess you could say it’s related......]","Electrone tilted her head at Canalis’ hesitant words. Canalis’ expression remained as rigid as ever, but her voice carried a hint of sympathy.","[Well, you see. ∇∮◆£ wants to meet and talk with you...... Uh, she was saying something about how she's definitely not trying to discuss Kaito-sama’s birthday present or anything like that.]","『Absolutely not...... Outputting sentiments...... <Are you kidding me? This is definitely because I said I was chosen by Kaito-sama, unlike ∇∮◆£ who unfairly got a head-start! No way!>...... I have no interest in walking into a danger zone.』","[W- Well, she is a good person, you know? ∇∮◆£ is kind and takes care of people. When I asked her to manage the world I recreated, she readily agreed. Tahaa~~ But, well, right now, she's kinda burning with jealousy......]","『I acknowledge that but still, outputting resistance...... <I know! If it were any other time, I’d have just brought some sweets and gone to see her!!! ∇∮◆£ is kind and laid-back, but when that switch of hers gets flipped, she's more barbaric than a wild monkey on an uncharted planet!! She'll definitely hit me!!>...... Therefore, I resolutely refuse to meet her.』","As soon as Canalis mentioned it, Electrone outright rejected the idea. Seeing this reaction, Canalis thought \"Yeah, I get you\", but still pressed on.","[W- Well, if that happens, you can just run away, right......?]","『Proposing an impossible action is not constructive. Counterargument output...... <Right back at you! Why don’t you run away before ∇∮◆£ beats you up, Canalis?>...... End of response.』","[Tahaa~ If I could, I wouldn’t be troubled like this...... I mean, ∇∮◆£...... she's too strong.]","『Agreeing while reinforcing resistance...... <Exactly! She's crazy strong!!! Leaving aside exceptions like Nebula-sama and Shallow Vernal, she's possibly the strongest, isn't she?! And she always brute-forces her way through everything! Physical defense, conceptual defense, spatial warping, dimensional isolation, anti-omnipotence defenses...... none of it matters! She'll just break through everything and punch you!!!>...... I recognize that, aside from Nebula-sama and Shallow Vernal, Bipolar God is the strongest. Therefore, escape is impossible.』","Yes, the one they were referring to, ∇∮◆£, known as Bipolar God...... was so powerful that even Omniscient and Omnipotent beings acknowledged her ridiculous strength.","If the topic of the strongest among the World Creators came up, excluding the obvious exceptions of Nebula and Shallow Vernal, ∇∮◆£ was always one of the top candidates.","『Continuing sentiment output...... <Anyway, I’m not going to meet a berserk gorilla consumed by jealousy, no matter what!!>...... End of statement. This unit has no intention of going to see the Bipolar God.』","[......Well...... about that...... \"She's already here\", actually......]","『.....................』","As Canalis spoke in an awkward tone, the sound of a bell rang. Electrone, moving like a broken tin toy, turned around hesitantly.","There, standing with an almost serene smile, was a girl with bells tied to the ends of her hair...... Bipolar God, ∇∮◆£.","『......I would like to request time for an explanation. This unit has by no means insulted Bipolar God. I apologize for slightly misjudging the output of sentiments.』","[No, there's no need to apologize. I think you're right, Electrone. You won your turn and the right to the gift fair and square, so it would be completely unreasonable for me to complain. Honestly, I'm just losing my mind with jealousy and taking it out on you, there's nothing logical about my actions at all. I feel absolutely awful about it...... unn...... But, I'm sorry. I just can't, I really can't suppress this jealousy...... I think I'll calm down if I just land one punch...... Just once, let me hit you, ‘kay?]","『......You should not resort to such a rash action. We are rational beings. I propose that we first seek a solution through dialogue.』","[Unn. You're right, Electrone. I'm sorry...... and thank you. Now, I'm going to hit you.]","『This unit implores someone to teach this barbarian the value of language and dialogue......』","After those words, tinged with resignation and a certain sorrow, the berserker, consumed by the flames of jealousy, lunged at Electrone.","<Afterword>","Bipolar God ∇∮◆£","An irrational berserk gorilla.","Normally, she has an extremely mild-mannered and gentle personality, and she is also quite caring. She readily agreed when Canalis asked her to manage her recreated world, and she often listens to the complaints of other World Creators, making her someone people frequently rely on. As a result, she has a vast network of acquaintances.","However, once her switch had been flipped, all her thoughts reach the same conclusion: \"punch it\". She turns into a berserker, and in this state, reasoning with her is nearly impossible.","As a side note, she came to be known as Bipolar God due to an incident involving a large-scale faction conflict among World Creators unrelated to Nebula. When hostilities between the factions escalated into an all-out war, the collateral damage from their clash affected ∇∮◆£'s world to a considerable extent. Enraged, she entered berserker mode and single-handedly beat down 8 Omniscient and Omnipotent beings, 67 Omnipotent beings, and 213 Quasi-Omnipotent beings, effectively wiping out every World Creator involved in the conflict. Her drastic transformation from her normally gentle demeanor to an unstoppable berserker was the reason she was named Bipolar God."]},{"number":2190,"title":"Chapter 2190: And Thus, the Birthday Celebration Begins 1","paragraphs":["After the commotion had settled, Canalis spoke up.","[Well~~ I have to say, I'm amazed at Electrone's incredible luck. Winning through all those rounds of rock-paper-scissors to get the number two spot was already impressive, but then also being chosen as one of the five slots in Kaito-sama's lottery? You can't help but feel like destiny is at play here.]","[Yeah, totally. Now that I think about it, Electrone has always been lucky in these kinds of raffles. Honestly, I'm really jealous.]","『......Outputting complaint...... <Before we talk calmly, shouldn't someone point out how this Virtual Angel's face is dented like a gag manga character!? It hurts, and it takes way too long to fix!!> ......Deeply unsatisfactory.』","[Oh, uh, yeah, I'm really sorry about that...... I just completely lost control...... Really, I'm so sorry.]","Electrone, still looking dissatisfied, received a sincere bow of apology from ∇∮◆£. Though ∇∮◆£ had goes berserk when her switch was flipped, her usual demeanor was extremely gentle and kind-hearted.","After throwing a punch, ∇∮◆£ regained composure, reflected on her impulsive actions, and repeatedly apologized to Electrone. If only she could reach that conclusion before striking in the first place...... But once her berserker mode was activated, all thoughts inevitably funneled toward \"punching\", making it a sort of uncontrollable rampage.","『......This unit also has points to reflect on. Outputting sentiments...... <When you apologize so honestly, it's hard to stay mad. And, well, it was kind of my fault for provoking you in the first place, so I guess we both have things to reflect on.> ......This unit lacked consideration for Bipolar God's emotions.』","[Well, I do understand ∇∮◆£'s feelings. Even though you're technically first in line, you still haven't met Nebula-san or Kaito-sama yet, so the anticipation must be unbearable. And then, right before you, Electrone wins the right to present a gift to Kaito-sama, of course you'd feel a bit jealous. Tahaa~~ But I have great news for you, ∇∮◆£!]","[......Great news?]","Electrone, who had initially made provocative remarks upon winning the lottery, acknowledged her own fault and shared a sheepish smile with ∇∮◆£. Any lingering resentment between them seemed to have dissipated, as they appeared to have reconciled.","Then, upon hearing the next words, both ∇∮◆£ and Electrone tilted their heads in curiosity.","[Well, as expected, Nebula-san seemed to understand that ∇∮◆£ was feeling frustrated, so she negotiated with Shallow Vernal. So, while the meeting with Kaito-sama will still be in the predetermined order...... since Nebula-san is unable to leave her World Tree during Kaito-sama's birthday party, she was feeling a bit bored and asked if ∇∮◆£ could come to keep her company...... And as a result, permission has been granted for ∇∮◆£ to temporarily visit Shallow Vernal's world!]","[ ! ? ! ! ? Eh!? S- Seriously!? Then, that means, I get to meet Nebula-sama!!? Y- YESSSSSS!!!]","Yes, Nebula had indeed taken ∇∮◆£'s feelings into consideration and negotiated with Shallow Vernal under the pretext of needing something to pass the time while skipping the birthday party. As a result, under the condition that Nebula would provide advice on the tea Shallow Vernal was preparing as a gift for Kaito, permission was granted for ∇∮◆£ to temporarily visit Nebula during the duration of Kaito's birthday party.","Hit with an overwhelming wave of joy, ∇∮◆£ jumped up and down in sheer delight. Watching this, Canalis, though her expression remained unchanged, gave a pleasant smile.","However, at that moment, a hand was quietly placed on Canalis' shoulder.","『......Outputting anger...... <Canalis? I need you to answer this while I'm still calm...... If you had said this earlier, I wouldn't have gotten punched by ∇∮◆£, right?>......Awaiting an immediate response.』","[Ah, well, yeah...... I completely forgot...... Tahaa~~ clumsy me, my bad!]","『......Outputting additional anger...... <You did that on purpose, didn't you? You're still holding a grudge from when I hit you before, and you stayed quiet as payback, didn't you? You've got some nerve.> ......Battle Mode, activated.』","[..........................Ah, ahh~~ looks like I need to head out soon...... Well then, see you both later......]","『Commencing purge.』","As Electrone shifted into battle mode, Canalis immediately fled...... thus, in a way, round two of the battle had begun.","∇∮◆£, who had been basking in joy just moments before, now watched the sudden quarrel unfold with a flustered expression.","[Y- You two, calm down! Fighting is bad! If you both go all out, it could have serious effects on the surrounding worlds, actually, Electrone's world could...... L- Look, even space itself is screaming......! A- Anyway, calm down...... E- Errr, what should I do......? This is bad...... W- Well, I guess if things start causing serious damage to the world, I'll step in.]","∇∮◆£ attempted to intervene, but unfortunately, her words didn't reach Canalis or Electrone. With a resigned sigh, she decided to watch and see how things played out, keeping an eye on their scuffle.","Their abilities were evenly matched, making for a proper fight.","......That said, the outcome was inevitable...... It went without saying, but both Canalis and Electrone ended up getting punched by ∇∮◆£.","<Afterword>","Strength Rankings (Limited to Quasi-Omnipotent and Above, as of the Current Story):","Shallow Vernal (Exception)","Nebula > > > An insurmountable wall > > > Bipolar God, ∇∮◆£ > > > > > Machine God, Makina > Vicissitude God, Canalis = Virtual God, Electrone > Underworld King, Kuromueina = Shallow Vernal (if Epilogue is not part of the equation) > Phantasmal King, Alice > Earth's God, Eden > God of Fate, Fate > > > > > Isis, who is gradually awakening to Authority-level power after accepting the magic power of death (※She's still not Quasi-Omnipotent)."]},{"number":2191,"title":"Chapter 2191: And Thus, the Birthday Celebration Begins 2","paragraphs":["That day was one with a crystal-clear blue sky. From the moment I woke up and opened the curtains, I felt that today was going to be a beautiful day...... And yet, for some reason, I didn’t feel particularly refreshed.","Why was that? I had no concrete reason, but this inexplicable sense of unease seemed to well up from deep inside me.","[Good morning, Kaito-san! This Transcendental Beauty Alice-chan has arrived! Well~~ you must be delighted to be greeted first thing in the morning by Alice-chan’s transcendentally beautiful face!]","[......Why do I suddenly feel even more anxious? I mean, clearly, you’re here for a reason, aren’t you? And also...... the heck is with that pity on your face!?]","[I do feel bad for you. But, well...... you also bear some responsibility for not giving any warnings in advance, Kaito-san.]","[Eh? What......? What’s going on......?]","The very fact that Alice had shown up and started talking to me so early in the morning was unusual. Of course, since she was usually around me anyway, she’d sometimes strike up a conversation on a whim if I had free time or if she felt like it.","But for her to appear the moment I woke up, it was obvious that this wasn’t just idle chatter. She had something important to tell me right at the start of the day.","And the way she looked at me with this vague sense of pity only added to my unease. My gut feeling was growing stronger, warning me that something was very, very wrong.","Then, Alice took out something, what looked like an elegant letter, and held it out to me.","[And so, Kaito-san...... Happy birthday! Here, this is an invitation to your birthday party.]","[Eh? Oh...... Oh, right...... Today’s my birthday, isn’t it? An invitation? A party? Ah, I see, so you guys are throwing a party for me again, like last year. That’s nice and all, but...... errr...... where’s it going to be? A party hall somewhere? Or, like last year, maybe in the Sky Castle......?]","[.....................]","[Could you stop giving me that smile full of pity? It’s making my bad feeling about this even worse. You just said earlier that I was at fault for not giving any warnings in advance...... This means it’s not going to be on the same scale as last year...... doesn’t it?]","I had completely forgotten that today was my birthday, but of course, it made me happy that my friends wanted to celebrate it. That is, as long as the celebration was within reasonable bounds.","Even last year, they had built an entirely new Sky Castle above the Royal Capital just for the party, an event of mind-boggling scale. It had already given me a bit of a stomachache back then, but this time...... it felt worse. How should I say this...... It was like my instincts were screaming at me to brace myself.","[......Well, you see, last year, we only had a few hours to prepare, and it still turned out like that. But this time, the Gods, who can literally do anything if they put their minds to it, had more than enough time to prepare.]","[......I can’t stop sweating...... Alice...... Where is the venue?]","[......World Creators had joined forces just to celebrate Kaito-san’s birthday and made a brand-new world for the occasion. That’s your party venue.]","[......Oof.]","Hearing Alice’s words, I couldn’t help but look up at the sky. I see...... So they actually created a world...... just for a birthday party...... That’s the kind of idea only an idiot would come up with! Why the heck did they go and make an entire world just for a party!? Even last year, the Sky Castle was already way too big, wouldn’t a slightly larger-than-usual hall have been more than enough!?","And knowing them, there’s no way they just built a venue and called it a day...... Last year’s Sky Castle had all sorts of weird fountains and trees that had nothing to do with my birthday...... If Shiro-san or Makina-san got involved and went all out...... I don’t even want to imagine what they’ve done this time.","[Ahh~~ by the way, Kaito-san, all of your acquaintances, or rather, all the party attendees have already arrived at the venue. Well, don’t worry, since time flows differently over there, you can take your time getting ready. Just like last year, I’ll be guiding you to the venue......]","[U- Unn...... But still...... I really should have said something earlier, like \"Next time, a normal-sized party is fine\". I mean, even if I didn’t, when I was talking with Aoi-chan and Hina-chan, my birthday came up in conversation...... If I had realized it then......]","[Yeah, sorry, but that was impossible unless you thought of this last year. Early on in the planning phase, Shallow Vernal-sama-sama and Makina set things up so that you wouldn’t be reminded of anything about birthday parties. Plus, they put a restriction on the other attendees so that whenever they were around you, they’d forget about the party until they left.]","[......They went way too hard on this surprise.]","Their level of preparation was honestly ridiculous...... They were completely serious about this. At this point, I was beyond terrified to find out what kind of place they had prepared.","For once, I could completely understand Lilia-san’s constant complaints about her stomachaches.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [You’d think you were the one causing stomachaches, but between the Six Kings Festival and the Founding Festival, there are also times when you’re on the receiving end huh, Kaito......]"]},{"number":2192,"title":"Chapter 2192: And Thus, the Birthday Celebration Begins 3","paragraphs":["It was indeed a shocking development, but even though the flow of time was different, I felt guilty about keeping everyone waiting, so I quickly washed my face and returned to my room to get ready.","There, I found Nebula.","[Milord, I have brought your change of clothes.]","[Eh? Nebula, you brought them for me?]","[Yes. Currently, nearly all the staff from both Milord's home and Lilia-san's mansion have gone to the venue for Milord's birthday party, so they are absent. Since I cannot stray too far from the World Tree, I am unable to attend and have been entrusted with watching over things in their absence.]","[I see, but wouldn't that mean you'll be alone while everyone else is at the party......]","Nebula had a restriction preventing her from leaving a certain distance from the World Tree, meaning she couldn't attend the birthday party in another world.","Since time flowed differently, it might only feel like an instant for her, but even so, I still felt bad about leaving her alone.","[Ah, no need to worry. While I will indeed be staying behind, an old acquaintance of mine is planning to visit, so I won’t be bored. Please, Milord, enjoy yourself without concern.]","[Oh, really? By an old acquaintance, do you mean someone like Canalis-san?]","[Yes. Their circumstances are similar, and they are also a World Creator who is close with Canalis-san. I will introduce her to Milord someday.]","At the very least, it seemed Nebula wouldn’t be lonely, which was a relief. I then proceeded to change into the clothes she had prepared for me...... but they were ones I had never seen before.","They felt a bit more formal than the ones I had worn for the Six Kings Festival but weren’t as rigid as the ceremonial outfit I had worn at Seigi-kun's wedding.","[......Nebula, these clothes are?]","[They were tailored by those skilled in sewing at Lilia-san's mansion, under the lead of Illness-sama.]","Hearing Nebula’s words, I could think of several people among Lilia-san’s maids who fit that description. Since I had stayed at Lilia-san’s mansion for quite some time, I was familiar with most of the maids and guards there. If Nebula’s words were true, then all of them had likely been invited and were already at the venue.","......And if I included those with whom I wasn’t particularly close but still exchanged greetings and small talk, like members of Kuro’s household, the number of attendees would be quite large.","Of course, having so many people celebrate my birthday was a wonderful thing...... but as I thought about the sheer scale this party's gonna be, my anxiety only kept growing.","After finishing changing, I bid farewell to Nebula and, together with Alice, used the gate-shaped magic tool in the room to transport us. Come to think of it, this thing can even transport people to other worlds huh.","[And here we are.]","[......Wait, Alice...... isn't this place way too big?]","[It's big, yeah. As a world, it's considered small, but apparently, it's about the size of the Divine Realm......]","[Even if it's small for a world, it's way too huge for my birthday party venue!]","The first thing that caught my eye upon arrival was the crystal-clear blue sky, a majestic mountain range in the distance, and what looked like an enormous castle alongside a massive city...... If I didn’t already know the context, I would have thought this was just a normal world where people had built a civilization over time, but considering its purpose and the fact that this world was newly created......","[......Alice, what's that city?]","[All sorts of things. Most of the party guests arrived the day before, so there are lodging facilities there and such......]","[And also...... it has a really unique atmosphere, doesn't it? The roads leading toward the city feel structured, and while it has a medieval European vibe, there's also a hint of modernity...... like a mix of both?]","[That’s what happens when you let a bunch of people do whatever they want.]","[And that ridiculously huge castle......]","[That's the venue for your birthday party. Its name is Miyama Kaito Castle. By the way, please be prepared, there are a ton of statues of you all over the city......]","[......Is this world created for the sole purpose of publicly humiliating me......]","I was already completely overwhelmed with the urge to turn around and go home, you know!? Ah, I get it now...... this must be what Noin-san feels about Friendship City Hikari.","[......Alright, let's get moving with this......]","[Wait, Alice...... what the heck is this giant vehicle...... It looks like something straight out of a theme park parade!?]","[Ahh, right, I forgot to mention———— since we're heading to the castle through the city's main road, it's going to be in parade format. So, Kaito-san, you’ll be riding up there.]","[......My stomach hurts.]","Before me was an overly extravagant, glittering parade float, and apparently, I was supposed to ride this all the way to the city...... Someone, please spare me from this.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [W- Well, I mean, even royalty have parades for their birthdays so......]"]},{"number":2193,"title":"Chapter 2193: And Thus, the Birthday Celebration Begins 4","paragraphs":["I did feel like looking away from the reality of the parade car sitting solemnly before me with all my might, but escaping from reality here wouldn’t benefit me in any way.","[......Alice, please, I beg you, ride with me. You can have one of your clones drive it or whatever, right? Since this thing has already been prepared, I’ve given up on resisting moving to the venue in it, but at least stay by my side......]","[Well, I guess I don’t have much choice huh?]","Even if I had noticed earlier, everything was already set up, and everyone was waiting at the venue. There was no point in whining about it now.","I had resigned myself to riding in the parade car, but the thought of being up there alone was just too much, so I asked Alice to stay with me.","Alice gave a wry smile but agreed immediately. The two of us climbed onto the cart, and one of Alice’s clones started operating the parade car.","[......By the way, why a parade?]","[As I recall, it all started when Blossom-san said \"Since Master is the main star, shouldn’t we hold otherworld civilization's rumored Daimyo Procession?\" Of course, her proposal was based on incomplete knowledge of otherworld customs, but surprisingly, others agreed with her. And then Makina, who has considerable influence, said \"Well, maybe not a daimyo procession, but if we’re welcoming my beloved child, a parade is the least we could do\", and that’s how things escalated.]","[Oh......]","Since there was still some distance to the city, I asked Alice about the circumstances during the ride. Apparently, top figures like Shiro-san and Makina-san had roughly discussed the idea first, and then they had gathered opinions from other acquaintances to plan everything.","[Well, in this case, Kaito-san, you were just unlucky. Most of your acquaintances know that you hate standing out or being revered by ordinary people...... but since this is another world, and there’s no risk of being seen by random civilians, many figured it wouldn’t be a problem.]","[......W- Well, I mean, yeah, if this were happening in a capital city in Trinia, I’d have run away without question...... But since there are no complete strangers around, I guess it does make it a little easier on my nerves? Though it’s still incredibly embarrassing......]","[There were some people who properly understood your issue. For example, Kuro-san wasn’t too keen on the idea. But...... well, she kind of went overboard pushing for baby castellas to be included in the catering, so she couldn’t really argue too strongly about this......]","Of course, they couldn’t just accept everyone’s suggestions, so they must have had discussions about which opinions to incorporate and which to discard.","And as for Kuro, since she had aggressively lobbied for baby castella earlier, she ended up in a position where she couldn’t strongly oppose other ideas...... Yeah, that certainly sounds like Kuro......","[By the way, Alice, what’s that huge building a little ways from the city? It’s as big as a castle......]","[Ahh, that...... That’s the \"cursed mansion\" named <Beloved Child Museum>.]","[Just hearing the name tells me exactly who built it.]","[It’s a terrifying place. That building contains a detailed record of every day of your life so far, complete with photos and videos...... and if you were to walk through it at a normal pace, it would take at least 500 years to get through everything.]","[......Why does it take longer to go through the records of my life than the time I’ve actually been alive......]","Since Space and Time Magic could easily deal with size constraints, the inside was probably far larger than its external appearance suggested. Given that Makina had built it, that much was understandable...... Still, even if my entire life had been recorded down to the second in photos and videos, needing 500 years to view it all was absurd.","[......Well, you see, it’s not just photos and videos———- Makina also wrote detailed commentary throughout the entire thing.]","[That...... somehow makes too much sense...... and I dread its existence......]","[It’s quite the dread show. Even after walking a kilometer inside, you’d still be reading the explanation of the first minute of your birth, along with Makina’s terrifyingly obsessive love notes...... I’d say that any normal person who enters is guaranteed to have a mental breakdown. Lasting even a few days would be a remarkable feat. As you know, Makina’s love is nothing short of insanity, and she’s put that into words to an extreme degree.]","[......Please don’t turn buildings related to me into sanity-shattering facilities......]","[Well, I mean, she was completely serious about making it. And while she was busy working on it, she at least stayed relatively calm, so everyone else just chose to look the other way. Well, after she finished it, she did say \"Since this is something everyone connected to my beloved child must see, we should make it mandatory for all birthday party attendees!\". She was about to commit mass murder there, so we had to stop her.]","I honestly wish they had stopped her before the building even got constructed...... But for some reason, when I think about the fact that Makina built it, I just accept it as \"Oh, just the usual rampage huh\" and move on.","[By the way, a few people actually went inside to take a look. Kuro-san said \"Just reading this is giving me a headache\" while Shallow Vernal-sama complained \"Earth God’s commentary is annoying. Please just keep it to Kaito’s photos and videos\".]","[I can practically picture that happening...... Well, I get it now. It’s a terrifying facility, one that only Makina can truly comprehend.]","[......Ah, well, actually...... there was one person. One person who \"read everything, including the commentary, and fully understood it\".]","[......Eh? Who?]","Reading through Makina’s 500-year-long descent into madness and going through the entire museum...... That’s on a whole other level of endurance. Who the heck could have......","[Canalis-san.]","[Eh? Canalis-san!?]","[Yep. And when she finished, she casually said \"Tahaa~~ There were some interpretations that didn’t align with my own, but seeing Kaito-sama from another’s perspective was refreshing, and there were quite a few insightful points as well.\" Honestly, this is just Alice-chan's personal guess but...... While it’s not as obvious because she’s fundamentally rational, I think Canalis-san might have feelings for Kaito-san that are just as overwhelmingly massive as Makina’s.]","[......Seriously?]","[Yeah. But unlike Makina, she’s fundamentally rational, so she won’t act out in strange ways. So at least there’s no need to worry about that.]","Hmmm...... I never really got that impression from Canalis-san, so this is kind of surprising...... But as Alice pointed out, Canalis-san is an incredibly reasonable person. Unlike Makina-san, she doesn’t lose control and go on wild rampages, so there’s probably no need to be overly concerned.","<Afterword>","Makina : [Exactly! Canalis is someone who really understands me!!! I mean, we’re not completely identical, like she said, we had some differences in interpretation. I have strong maternal feelings toward my beloved child, so I focus mostly on his cuteness. But Canalis sees my beloved child as an admirable hero and pays more attention to his coolness. So yeah, there’s a bit of a difference in how we see things, but in the end, both his cute and cool sides are part of what makes my beloved child who he is. It’s just a matter of which aspect we prioritize more. That’s why we actually have a lot in common, and we’ve had so many deep discussions about my beloved child!]","Serious-senpai : [......Even though you called her Vicissitude God before, you’re now calling her by name. Guess that means you two have gotten close...... Now that I think about it, Canalis has been punched by other Gods multiple times...... So maybe, just like during that conversation with Electrone, no matter how many times she gets hit, she still goes on about Nebula and Kaito in front of the other Gods, completely lovestruck......]"]},{"number":2194,"title":"Chapter 2194: And Thus, the Birthday Celebration Begins 5","paragraphs":["As I was talking with Alice, we finally arrived in front of the gate...... and it was huge. Even from a distance, I could tell this was a large city, but with a gate this size, I wouldn't be surprised if someone told me it was a fortress city.","[......By the way, Alice, just a simple question......]","[What's up?]","[You said all the participants have already entered the venue, right?]","[I did say that.]","[......Then...... who's supposed to be watching this parade?]","[You've noticed huh...... The party participants are indeed not here.]","Yeah, since everyone had already entered the venue, that meant there was no one between this gate and the castle where the event was being held. That would mean...... it would turn into this weird composition of a parade taking place in an empty space.","[Instead, there are plenty of extras.]","[......No, this isn't a movie shoot. Why would there be extras......?]","[Can't be helped. The ones organizing this can create whatever they need for the occasion, so it'll feel like we're moving through a huge crowd...... Well, technically, these extras exist solely to hype up the parade. They're more like illusions, so just think of them as potatoes or something.]","[......O- Ou.]","[Oh, and the parade is being broadcasted.]","[......Right......]","With a somewhat indescribable feeling in my heart, I looked up at the sky, which was annoyingly clear and blue.","Well, no point in complaining. Deciding to head straight to the castle, Alice snapped her fingers, and the massive gate slowly opened...... revealing an overwhelming sea of people that completely filled my vision.","......Wait, are these all supposed to be illusions? The realism is insane———- if anything, my embarrassment isn't reduced at all, it's just skyrocketing......","The parade car moved forward, and the crowd erupted into applause and cheers. The realism was so intense that, if I hadn't been told in advance, I would have assumed they brought real people here.","No, wait a minute......? Given what Shiro-san and Makina-san are capable of, if they wanted to, they could probably create new life forms just to cheer for the parade. Of course, that kind of disposable life creation would be a huge ethical issue, so I doubt they actually did it. Someone would have stopped them even if they tried...... But thinking about it again, these people really can do anything.","My unease about the upcoming party only grew stronger.","[Ah, Kaito-san, if you wave, they'll react. Apparently, a bunch of people kept adding random features they wanted...... so now there are all sorts of unnecessary effects.]","[......Like this?]","At Alice’s suggestion, I waved my hand. The cheers grew louder.","[How dreamy!]","[Look this way!]","[Give us a glance!]","[Fan service is the best! Love, love, Merori~~!]","......Oi, wait a second there. Did I just hear something that sounded like an idol fan chant? Was that just my imagination?","[......Kaito-san, Kaito-san, look. Fireworks are going off.]","[They're going all out with the effects......]","[Oh, and now there's a formation flight performance over the castle, leaving behind colorful smoke.]","[......Please, for the love of consistency, pick a theme...... Why are fighter jets flying in formation over a castle......?]","One thing was certain, it was flashy and lively. But just as Alice had mentioned earlier, it felt like they crammed in everything they wanted, resulting in what could only be described as pure chaos.","A rainbow appeared in the sky, a massive number of balloons floated up, and with every step forward, more and more effects were added...... If I were watching from a completely unrelated location, I'd probably think it looked fun and festive.","But being at the center of it, seeing the humongous \"Happy Birthday\" written in the sky alongside an overly stylized caricature of my face, what I felt first was the pain in my stomach.","At the very least, I could tell, with painful clarity, both figuratively and literally, that Shiro-san and the others were taking this very seriously...... And the scariest part? We hadn't even arrived at the venue yet...... The real event was still ahead of us.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [The parade is being broadcasted. (To the venue...... and to the World Creator's fan club.)]","Serious-senpai: [......That last cheer there was definitely from those Gods who actively cheer for their oshi......]"]},{"number":2195,"title":"Chapter 2195: And Thus, the Birthday Celebration Begins 6","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I don't have much time, so today's chapter is a bit short.","Arriving in front of the castle, I savor the kind of public humiliation that one would never experience in an ordinary life———– being cheered on by a massive crowd while standing atop a parade car.","[Alright, let's get off here and head to the grand hall. I doubt you want to ride this thing inside, right?]","[For that matter, I never wanted to ride this thing in the first place...... Also, seeing it up close, this castle is really huge.]","[Well, it's just a venue prepared for your birthday party, Kaito-san. The grand hall is enough, so most of the space is meaningless. Some people just had too much free time and spent it decorating. Kuro-san even made a completely insane room with baby castella-patterned wallpaper, baby castella-patterned carpets, and baby castella-shaped ornaments.]","[......What the heck are you doing, Kuro......]","[According to Kuro-san...... \"Well, I can't exactly turn my usual room into a full-blown hobby space, so I figured I’d take advantage of this opportunity.\"]","[I guess it's at least good that she normally holds back.]","Apparently, she couldn't bring herself to turn her personal quarters in the castle, where her whole family also lives, into a baby castella haven, so she used this opportunity to go all out.","Well, since it was just an unused room being repurposed in someone's spare time, it doesn't really affect me, so it's not a problem.","[By the way, a side note, Makina said \"Come to think of it, birthdays aren't just about the person born, but also about their parents who gave birth to them. Shouldn't we congratulate Akari and Kazuya together with my beloved child?\" But both of them flatly refused and insisted that the celebration should be solely for Kaito-san.]","[......If I were in their shoes, I would definitely refuse too.]","It's true that birthdays are also a time to express gratitude to one's parents. However, from my mother and father's perspective, being thrust into the spotlight at an event with this outrageous lineup of attendees would be something they'd want to avoid at all costs.","Especially since many of the people gathered here are my acquaintances, but they've never met my parents before...... Given that, it's a perfectly reasonable decision, and I don't blame them at all for backing out.","[Oh, we've arrived. Beyond this door is the party venue.]","[That’s...... quite the massive door. I can’t help but feel a little anxious about what kind of place this is going to be......]","[Well, it's just a birthday party venue, so it’s nothing too eccentric. Ah, but hold on a second...... Kuro-saaaaan, we’re about to enter, so could you take care of those idiot Gods over there who are holding cannon-sized party poppers? ......Alright, all set now.]","At the very least, I could gather that people like Shiro-san and Makina-san had conjured up ridiculously oversized party poppers.","Then, as Alice threw open the doors with a dramatic flourish, a deafening burst of party poppers went off.","[O- Oh......]","[A full choir would be too noisy, so we'll save the congratulations for when each person gives their gift...... Now then, Kaito-san, you see that throne-like chair over there?]","[......I’d like to pretend I don’t, but I do.]","[That’s your seat.]","[...................]","No, I get it. It’s a big party, in a huge hall, and I’m the guest of honor...... So naturally, my seat should be somewhere that’s easy for everyone to see......","Especially this time, with many of Lilia-san’s mansion staff and Kuro’s family members participating, the guest count is even larger than last time. It makes sense that my seat is in a noticeable spot.","But sitting in that extravagantly luxurious, throne-like seat...... I really feel reluctant, and I’d rather avoid it if I could...... Well, at this point, there’s nothing I can do, so I have no choice but to sit down...... Seriously, why didn’t I just say \"Next time, a normal-sized party is fine\" after my last birthday party......?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [So, the party is finally about to start, but what I’m really curious about is whether there’s going to be something like the last karaoke tournament. If there is, then with even more people and on a larger scale than before...... just how is that going to play out......?]"]},{"number":2196,"title":"Chapter 2196: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 1","paragraphs":["Although I don’t really feel like sitting, nothing will start unless I do, so I give in and take a seat in the throne-like chair. The situation is somewhat similar to last time, but this time, the chair is truly extravagant.","Speaking of which, this chair is incredibly comfortable...... It’s fluffy, yet firm enough to sit properly. The balance is just perfect.","\"Well then, now that the guest of honor has arrived, it's finally time to begin Kaito-san’s birthday party. As with the last birthday party, Fate-san and I will be hosting the event.\"","\"Shall-tan, this isn’t good. If we handled the hosting last time and are doing it again this time, that means we’ll end up being the default hosts for all future events too, right? That sounds like such a hassle to me. Plus, with Shallow Vernal-sama here, I can’t even slack off...... And last time, Underworld King helped out a little, but now we’re handling everything from the start?\"","\"Well, just accept it. The best team for hosting happens to be Fate-san and me. Also, Kuro-san has the role of smacking down any foolish Gods if they get out of control......\"","\"......Mhmm, Well, this is Kai-chan’s birthday, so I guess it can’t be helped...... But a little bit of privilege should be allowed, right? Kai-chaaaan! It’s me! Happy birthday~~!!!\"","\"Ah, so that’s how it’s going to be. Well, I suppose a little early celebration is fine as a reward for being the host.\"","It looks like Alice and Fate-san will be handling the hosting. They’ve somehow already set up what looks like a commentator’s seat and are using a Loudspeaker Magic Tool to put on a comedy-like exchange.","And while it was mentioned earlier that people would give their birthday wishes when handing over gifts, Fate-san has taken the liberty of celebrating first as part of her hosting privilege. She waves at me, so I give her a wry smile and wave back.","\"Well then, at its core, this is still a party. The main focus is on chatting, drinking, and eating. Of course, we’ve also prepared a few performances.\"","\"But what I’m curious about is how Kai-chan’s birthday gifts will be handed over. There are way more people compared to last time, so how’s that going to work?\"","\"We’ll handle it as we go along during the party. Like Fate-san said, there are a lot more gifts than before, so if we set a dedicated time for it and had people line up, it would take forever. Since there’s no rule that everyone has to watch each gift being given, we’ll do it gradually while enjoying the party.\"","\"Fumu fumu. So how will the order be decided?\"","Fate-san asks, and Alice explains, making it easy to follow. It looks like everyone will enjoy the party while I receive gifts one by one. Then, when performances or events happen, I’ll focus on those......","\"As for the order, Kaito-san will draw lots. We’ve got a garapon lottery machine set up next to him, so he’ll spin it, and whoever comes up will give their gift. Since Kaito-san is the one drawing, no one can complain, and with Kaito-san’s luck, the order will probably turn out nicely.\"","\"I see...... But if that’s the case, doesn’t that mean Kai-chan will have to stay in one spot and won’t be able to eat or drink?\"","\"He can just eat and drink in between. Kaito-san can decide the timing of each draw, so during those gaps...... As for food and drinks...... well, let’s leave that to Ein-san as the representative of the maids. She’ll provide what Kaito-san wants at the right timing.\"","True, if I’m the one drawing lots, I can pace myself and take breaks when needed.","And with Ein-san handling the food and drinks, I won’t have to move around...... Back when I had barbeque with them, Ein-san’s timing for serving food was perfect, so I’ll probably get exactly what I want when I want it but...... will Ein-san be okay with this?","Just as I have that thought, I hear the sound of clapping. When I turn my gaze, Ein-san is applauding.","\"As expected of the leader of the world’s largest faction, perfectly assigning roles based on people's strengths. Truly admirable. Yes, please leave Kaito-sama’s service to me, a maid above all else!\"","\"You seem obviously happy. You must’ve been frustrated when you were banned from helping during the last ship party. Well, in any case, we’ll be counting on you.\"","It looks like there’s absolutely no issue at all. In fact, Ein-san seems genuinely happy about it. Well, that works out great for me too......","\"Alright, we’ll have Kaito-san lead the first toast...... but before that, let’s spin the lottery once to decide who will give the first present. That person would then hand over their gift to Kaito-san right after the toast.\"","\"Ah, got it———- whoa!? Ah, so I just spin this thing......\"","As soon as I nodded in response to Alice’s words, a table and a garapon lottery machine appeared right beside me, which I figured I would spin. The moment a ball came out, it disappeared, and glowing text appeared in the air.","<SHALLOW VERNAL>","Ahh, so it displays names like this. And the first one is Shiro-san...... Whoa, she’s acting super smug. After glancing over at Kuro and Makina-san, she even conjured glowing golden letters behind her that say \"DOYA!\"","Kuro just looks exasperated, but it seems to have gotten to Makina-san, who is forcing a strained smile.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ah, I’m guessing Shiro got picked first because, unlike the other lovers, she’d obviously be the happiest about being first? I mean, she’s literally showing off right now......]"]},{"number":2197,"title":"Chapter 2197: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 2","paragraphs":["For the toast, I was told that it could be something really simple, so I kept it safe by expressing my gratitude for the party held in my honor. Since I was on the receiving end of the surprise and didn’t know the details, I just mentioned that I hoped everyone would enjoy themselves before leading the toast.","As the party started, the first person scheduled to give a present, Shiro-san, appeared in front of me.","[Kaito-san, happy birthday.]","[Thank you. Everything is a bit overwhelming, but I’m really happy that Shiro-san and everyone else went to such lengths for me.]","[I'm glad to hear that. By the way, Kaito-san, what number am I?]","[Eh? You're the first one.","[I see, so I'm the first huh?]","[......Yes, that's right.]","She nodded in great satisfaction. Shiro-san seems to have a particular attachment to being the very first in these situations. It was the same when she gave me a handmade accessory—she was delighted when she got to go first.","Looking at it that way, making her the first was probably the perfect choice. That said, I wonder what kind of gift she would give me?","Last year, she gave me a gaming console that I still use regularly, so I wasn’t worried about getting something strange, but given that she can prepare practically anything, I had no idea what to expect.","[Then, once again...... Kaito-san, happy birthday.]","[Thank you.]","[As my gift to you, I have prepared this black tea tree.]","[......Black tea tree? Not tea tree?]","[Yes. The leaves for black tea grow directly on it, and when harvested, they dry automatically, so you can brew black tea immediately.]","[I- I see......]","This was definitely beyond the realm of common sense, something that wouldn’t normally exist. But...... well, since it’s Shiro-san we're talking about here, she can do anything.","The idea of a black tea tree caught me off guard, but thinking about it, Shiro-san often drinks black tea. Plus, there’s the Glorious Tea in God Realm, so in a way, it wasn’t all that surprising.","[Ever since Kaito-san started your tea brand, I had been wanting to gift you something like this. I went through a lot of trial and error, seeking advice from various people. Just recently, I even asked Nebula, who produces the tea leaves for your brand, and after some adjustments, I was able to complete it to my satisfaction.]","She got advice from Nebula? When did that happen......? And from the way she phrased it, it sounds like she consulted others as well.","Maybe she also consulted someone like Kuro or Makina-san? Either way, knowing that Shiro-san put so much thought into this gift makes me happy.","[Thank you. I’m really looking forward to trying it. Ah, and...... if you don’t mind, would you like to drink the first cup together with me?]","[That’s a wonderful suggestion. I’d love to.]","When I thanked her, Shiro-san gave me a gentle smile. Since she went through all the effort to create this special black tea, I have no doubt it will be delicious, and I’m genuinely excited to try it.","Also, I'm not sure if it's just my imagination...... no, it's definitely not my imagination, but I can feel some intense stares from Ein-san and Jutia-san. I should probably share some with them later.","\"......That’s actually a surprisingly well-thought-out gift. Since he can keep drinking from it, and with the tree as the source, Kaito-san can easily share it with others. Its efficiency might be a little beyond normal, but it's not at an absurd level that would cause him stress. In that sense, it’s quite the ideal gift.\"","\"As expected of Shallow Vernal-sama, a truly fitting gift for someone at the top. Now then, I wonder who will be next?\"","There were still plenty of participants left, so Shiro-san didn’t stay too long and returned to her original spot. With that, I spun the garapon lottery machine once again.","<EDEN (Considered as Same Entity as Makina)>","The next person drawn was Eden-san...... Makina-san. Up until just moments ago, she had been twitching in frustration, but now her face lit up like a shining beacon.","[My chiiiiiiild!? Of course! A mother and her beloved child share an unbreakable bond!!! Naturally, you’d draw my name early on!!!]","She’s definitely someone who brings a lot of uncertainty when it comes to presents, but considering that Shiro-san had provoked her earlier, leaving her frustrated, maybe it was actually a good thing that she got picked this soon.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Now then, we have here the problem child who, last time, pulled the whole \"The present is me\" stunt.]","? ? ? : [Well, we’re on high alert this time, and I made sure to give a firm warning in advance, so I think it should be fine.]"]},{"number":2198,"title":"Chapter 2198: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 3","paragraphs":["The second person I drew was Makina-san...... Now, among the anxiety-inducing factors in this party, she reigns near the top. During the last birthday party, she suddenly kissed me, outrageously presenting herself as the present, and ended up getting seriously attacked by Kuro and the others.","[As expected, my beloved child has great luck with draws! To pull your mother here, it must mean my beloved child was looking forward to my birthday present! And getting it early must make you happy, right?]","[......Y-Yeah, I guess.]","Rather, she was the first person that came to mind as a cause for concern, so I did want to know what her present was as soon as possible. In that sense, I might have actually wanted an earlier turn.","\"\"Ah~~ I'll say this just in case, but if you try anything ridiculous like last time, we'll beat you up before you can even act. Canalis-san, I'll be counting on your cooperation too.\"","Well, fortunately, it's not just me———- Alice, Kuro, and the others are also on high alert when it comes to Makina-san's antics. We're not as careless as last time, so there's a high chance we'll stop her before she does anything.","And as Alice pointed out, this time Canalis-san is here as well, so the safety level should be even higher.","[Of course, I'll help when the time comes. Also, it just so happens that a ridiculously strong friend of mine is nearby, so if anything happens, I'm sure she'll lend a hand.]","[......Stop that. That God has like an 8:2 or 9:1 advantage over me...... No, even if I go all out, I'd probably lose nine times out of ten...... I've prepared an actual present this time, so please don't call in that ultimate-evolution form of \"punch-first, ask-later\" incarnate.]","[The fact that you even have a 10% chance of winning against that person just shows that you're among the strongest World Creators, Makina-san. Tahaa~~ well, in any case, please make sure your present stays within reasonable limits.]","I don’t really get what's going on, but Makina-san looked genuinely troubled, so it seems like an incredibly powerful God is nearby. That means the safety level just went up even more.","As I was thinking about that, as if shifting gears, Makina-san cleared her throat and pulled out a book.","[......Once again, my beloved child, happy birthday!!! Here’s a gift from Mother, packed with all my love!!!]","[T- Thank you...... But, um, a book?]","[Fufufu, this is a photo album! A collection of carefully selected photos of my beloved child from childhood to the present! This was really tough to put together!!! My beloved child is ultimately and supremely adorable at every moment, so narrowing it down to 200 pages was an incredibly difficult task...... After much deliberation, I finally completed the ultimate album! Though, well, I did have to build a museum to release my pent-up frustration......]","So that's how that cursed mansion came to be!? In other words, as she was choosing the photos to fit within 200 pages, some sort of madness gauge overflowed, and with an overwhelming love too heavy to contain, she ended up making a full-scale museum, one that destroys the sanity of whoever enters.","I mean, I kind of get it. And honestly, I’m pretty happy with this present. When I was taken in by my relatives, a lot of the belongings from the house where I lived with Mom and Dad were disposed of. Things were hectic back then, so albums and old photos weren’t really preserved.","Maybe my uncle or aunt kept some and would tell me if I asked...... but regardless, having an album that lets me reminisce about the past is something I'm genuinely happy about.","[This is nice. There are a lot of things I've forgotten about my childhood, and I never had a photo album to look back on like this...... Seeing it really brings back memories...... brings back memo......]","When I casually flipped through a few pages to take a look, I saw a picture of me when I was about five years old. In the photo, there was my young Mom and Dad...... and for some reason, \"there was also Makina-san\". T- This is, errr...... Hmmm, h- how am I supposed to react to this......","It wasn't edited or anything, it was a perfectly natural-looking photo of Makina-san carrying the younger me in her arms. Feeling a strange mix of emotions, I glanced over at her...... and found her beaming at me with the brightest, most satisfied smile.","What do I do? My childhood memories are being rewritten———– no, fabricated right in front of me...... This photo album...... Hey, anyone finding the humidity and insanity levels quite high now, or is it just me?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [What's truly terrifying is that the person who handed this over could probably rewrite the past for real if she wanted to.]"]},{"number":2199,"title":"Chapter 2199: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 4","paragraphs":["First, let's organize the situation. The photo album that Makina-san handed me contains pictures of me, Mom, and Dad, with Makina-san naturally included among us. If someone who knew nothing about the situation were to look at it, they might even mistake her for an older sister due to how naturally she fits in.","Well, for Makina-san, creating such photos would be easy, but I still question whether this can truly be called a photo album.","That said, aside from Makina-san being in the pictures, nothing seems out of place. The photo I’m looking at now is from a time when I visited what seems to be a ranch as a child. My memories of it are vague, but seeing the picture does bring back some recollections, even if just a little......","————Look, my beloved child, there’s a cow!","————Do you want ice cream? Hmmm, let’s share it with Mother so your stomach doesn’t get upset, okay?","————Oh dear, my beloved child is getting sleepy, aren’t you? It’s okay, I’ll carry you, so you can sleep.","......Huh? That’s strange. Memories that shouldn’t exist are surfacing in my mind with incredible clarity...... It’s so vivid that I could almost believe I’m watching a video replaying in my head. I can even recall my conversations with Makina-san perfectly.","[......Uh, Makina-san? Memories that shouldn’t exist are coming back to me...... What’s going on here?]","[Oh, looks like you’ve noticed! Ah, don’t worry. I haven’t altered your past or manipulated your memories or anything like that. Of course, if I wanted to, I could actually go back in time and become part of your memories. But all of my beloved child’s memories are equally precious, so I wouldn’t tamper with them. Besides, if I tried, Shallow Vernal and the others would probably stop me...... And in reality, you’re able to recognize that these memories you’re recalling aren’t real, right?]","[N- Now that you mention it, yes. They appear incredibly vivid, but I do understand that they shouldn’t actually exist.]","For now, I’m relieved to know that my past hasn’t actually been altered and my memories haven’t been tampered with.","But if that’s the case, what exactly are these memories of Makina-san?","[Fufufu, that’s the effect of this album! When you hold it and recall the episode behind a photo, you can vividly reminded a world where I was there with you! In other words, all 200 pages of this photo album contain photos of you and Mother in a kind of \"what-if\" world. As long as you’re holding the photo album, you can see those possibilities. Think of it as a way to always recall happy memories with Mother...... That’s my present to my beloved child!]","[......I- I see.]","......Is this some kind of brainwashing tool? But for now, I understand. Essentially, as long as I have this photo album, I can see a vision of a world where \"Makina-san and I have known each other since the past\".","This doesn’t manipulate my actions within those imagined memories, right? Because when I recall that ranch episode again, all I see are moments where I seem completely attached to Makina-san...... Hmmm. But then again, as long as she isn’t consumed by insane love or going out of control, Makina-san is a kind and friendly person. If this version of her doesn’t go off the rails, I guess it’s not too strange that my younger self would be fond of her.","\"......Shall-tan, what do you think about that?\"","\"......She really aimed for the fine line of gray. Technically, she hasn’t interfered with Kaito-san’s memories or altered the past...... It’s more like a fabricated video playback device. And since Kaito-san is aware that it’s fabricated...... I’d say it just barely passes as acceptable.\"","Alice muttered with a rather complicated expression, and while it’s true that this is an incredibly sentimental and overwhelming creation...... the fact remains that these possible-world visions only appear when I consciously hold the photo album and recall them. In other words, I have full control over whether I see them or not, nothing is being forced upon me.","As I was contemplating this, Shiro-san gave a small nod and then spoke in a low voice.","[......I see. With this method, one can insert themselves into Kaito-san’s past without actually altering it...... So, she’s not just piggybacking on my ideas after all.\"","[Fufu, you shouldn’t underestimate me.]","How should I say this...... Shiro-san had a look of admiration, as if she wanted to say \"Oh no, I didn’t think of that!\". Meanwhile, Makina-san wore a smugly proud expression on her face, as if basking in her own cleverness.","......Unn. Well...... This birthday present certainly is just like Makina-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [So basically, isn't that entire photo album, including the photos, completely fabricated......?]"]},{"number":2200,"title":"Chapter 2200: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 5","paragraphs":["Shiro-san and Makina-san's presents were done, and in a way, since the supernatural beings who could be considered anxiety-inducing factors were concentrated at the beginning, I felt a bit more at ease.","\"Well, everyone seems to be focused on the presents, but if it's not your turn, feel free to chat and relax. I mean, it's understandable to be curious since a bunch of anxiety-inducing folks showed up early on, but let's take it easy from here on out.\"","Hearing Alice say that, I decided to relax a little. Just as I was about to do so, Ein-san handed me a drink, which I used to quench my thirst before spinning the garapon lottery machine for the third time.","Now then, who will it be next...... A strange display appeared.","<EX3>","......EX3? What’s that? It’s clearly not a person's name, and even if it were, I don’t know anyone by that name.","As I tilted my head in confusion, Alice’s explanation followed.","\"Oh, looks like we hit a special one here. This one's a bit unique...... think of it as a present from an external source. For this, Canalis-san is in charge, so I’ll let her explain.\"","\"Alright, I’ll take the mic for a bit and explain. To put it very simply, Kaito-sama has a lot of fans even in other worlds. In particular, he’s super popular among World Creators, to the point where he's even got a fan club. Tahaa~~ but that’s all because of Kaito-sama’s charm! So cool! I really respect you~~...... Ahem. Anyway, those World Creator fans really wanted to give Kaito-sama a birthday present.\"","......Uh, I suddenly heard something ridiculously grand in scale...... Errr, I have heard from Canalis-san that I’ve caught the attention of various Gods from different worlds, but a fan club? That’s the first time I heard that...... Wait, something like that actually exists!?","\"We totally understand the desire to give Kaito-sama a present, but if we allowed everyone without restrictions, things would get out of hand. So, we set up various conditions and allowed only 5 people, selected through a lottery, to send presents. Tahaa~~ That lottery Kaito-sama spun a while back? That was actually selecting those 5 people. Their presents have already been entrusted to us, which have been assigned as EX1 to EX5.\"","I see, I more or less get the gist of things. But if everything she just said is true, that’s kind of terrifying...... I think the lottery showed a number like 170 billion at that time...... Just how big is this fan club......?","W- Well, anyway, it looks like those tagged with EX refers to presents from World Creators of other worlds.","\"Errr, EX3 is...... this one. I’ll transfer it to Kaito-sama’s hands.\"","\"......A crystal ball? Is it an interior decoration?\"","Along with Canalis-san’s words, a crystal ball mounted on a pedestal appeared in my hands. The pedestal and the crystal ball seemed to be attached.","At first glance, it looked like a tabletop decoration, but what exactly is this?","\"Alright then, I'll now relay the message from the sender as it is:","<Happy birthday. I sincerely celebrate another year of healthy growth for Miyama Kaito-san. It may be bewildering to receive a gift from someone you've never met, but please accept this as a humble token from someone who holds you in high regard. Now, regarding the present I have prepared, by touching and focusing on the interior decoration, you can project a chosen scenery around you, temporarily overwriting the designated space so that you can experience the environment as if you were truly there. If I were to express it in terms familiar to your world, it would be akin to VR or a hologram. The projected sceneries are selected from my own created world, consisting of various beautiful locations. I designed this so that you could relax in your room and enjoy the feeling of traveling to another world. I hope you find joy in using it. May your days continue to be filled with happiness.>","......Message end. Incidentally, the World Creator who sent this is a member of the fan club that watches over the growth of Kaito-sama, who is quite young when compared to us, with a gentle gaze.\"","......Fumu, in other words, this decoration allows me to experience the scenery of a completely different world, neither from my original one nor Trinia...... That actually sounds really fun, and honestly, it’s a fantastic gift.","Hearing World Creator made me feel a bit wary at first, but this is an even better present than I expected. I’m really looking forward to trying it out.","[Thank you. I’m excited to use it. Errr, please pass my gratitude to the one who gifted it as well.]","\"Please leave it to me...... Alright, I’ll return the mic to Alice-san.\"","\"Got it. Well then, that concludes this one...... But wow, we’ve had three Gods in a row at the start. Wouldn’t this put a lot of pressure on the people who have to give their presents after this?\"","\"Shallow Vernal-sama, God of Earth-sama, and a World Creator of a different world...... Yeah, I can see how the fourth person might feel a bit intimidated.\"","As I listened to Alice and Fate-san’s conversation, I had to agree. The fact that such incredible figures had gone first meant that the following participants were under quite a bit of pressure. With that thought in mind, I spun the garapon lottery machine once again.","<LILIA ALBERT>","......Yeah, how should I say this...... unn...... I can already tell that Lilia-san’s soul just left her body.","\"......Why does this always happen to Lili-tan?\"","\"......It’s unfortunate, but somehow, thinking it's Lilia-san we're talking about here, it kinda makes sense.\"","Fate-san and Alice’s reactions were difficult to describe, but yeah, I kinda get it...... It’s rude to say, and I know it must be tough for Lilia-san herself, but the fact that she ended up in such an unlucky spot again...... really feels like the kind of thing that would happen to Lilia-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Well, I mean, not just Kaito, but I'm sure the same goes for the readers too...... The moment the thought \"the next person is probably in trouble\" popped out, I bet a lot of you guys thought of Lilia.]"]}]);
